am. Centuera believes in our highly efficient blended learning method, which prepares learners with the necessary knowledge and confidence to successfully pass the CSPO exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSPO exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue a complimentary exam retake voucher (terms and conditions apply). If you still do not succeed on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '<p>No questions asked refund</p><p>At Centuera, we hold the trust of our customers in the highest regard. However, if you believe that a course does not fulfill your expectations, we provide a 7-day money-back guarantee. Simply send us a refund request via email within 7 days of your purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment.</p><p>Centuera is confident in our highly effective blended learning method, designed to equip learners with the knowledge and confidence needed to pass the CSPO exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSPO exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue you a complimentary exam retake voucher (Terms and Conditions Apply). If you still do not pass on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '[\"4\",\"3\",\"2\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-08 02:19:03', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', NULL),
(6, 'Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training', 'Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Course', '1757517633_curr.png', '<p>Achieve Efficiency and Enhance Quality through Six Sigma methodologies</p>', '<p>Acquire comprehensive understanding of Six Sigma methodologies, tools, and techniques</p><p>Develop the skills necessary to effectively lead process improvement initiatives</p><p>Participate in exclusive masterclasses focused on generative AI for quality management</p><p>4 simulation assessments | 4 live projects | 35 PDUs</p><p>Exam Pass Guarantee Study Plan | Complimentary practice test &amp; bonus course</p>', '2160', '7', 'lean-six-sigma-green-belt-certification-training', '1757703419_image.png', '1757278652_cover.png', '<p>This Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Course is crafted to meet the top Green Belt standard established by the internationally acknowledged accreditation organization - IASSC. It provides a thorough introduction to Six Sigma, the DMAIC methodology, techniques for measuring organizational performance, identifying problems, and proposing solutions through practical examples.</p>', '<p>This Lean Six Sigma Green Belt certification is ideal for Quality system managers, Quality analysts and managers, Quality auditors, Quality engineers, Quality supervisors, and anyone else aiming to enhance their organization.</p>', '<p>Learners need to possess an undergraduate degree or a high school diploma.</p>', '1757278652_cert.png', '1757278652_curr.pdf', '<p>Lean Six Sigma equips you with the necessary tools to handle risks, establish benchmarks, and guide projects while strategically analyzing data.<br>Sectors that highly value this Green Belt certification encompass manufacturing, technology, and logistics.</p>', 'Elevate your project management capabilities with Lean Six Sigma Green Belt certification. Designed to enhance your team\'s efficiency and effectiveness, Lean Six Sigma Green Belt offers a robust framework that can be tailored to any project, 