k.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '12500', '[{\"image\":\"1757278871_IASSC-Certification-Badge-Green-Belt-250x250 (1).png\",\"text\":\"IASSC ATO\"}]', '4.8', '5445', '<p>Our training course comes with a 100% exam pass guarantee. Centuera believes in our highly effective blended learning methodology and its ability to provide learners with the knowledge and confidence to pass the Lean Six Sigma Green Belt exam on the first attempt. If you do not clear the Lean Six Sigma Green Belt exam on the first attempt, we will refund the course fee to you.</p>', '<p>100% money-back guarantee*</p><p>No questions asked refund*<br>At Centuera, we value the trust of our patrons immensely. But, if you feel that a course does not meet your expectations, we offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. Just send us a refund request via email within 7 days of purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment, no questions asked!</p>', '[\"9\",\"8\",\"7\",\"5\",\"4\",\"3\",\"2\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-08 03:08:41', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', NULL),
(7, 'Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training Course', 'Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Course', '1757517565_curr.png', '<p>Mastering Process Enhancement Techniques</p>', '<p>Cultivate leadership and project management abilities to facilitate organizational transformation</p><p>Enhance your data analysis expertise for process enhancement</p><p>Specialized masterclasses in generative AI for quality control</p><p>4 simulation assessments | 2 live projects | 35 PDUs</p><p>Exam Pass Guarantee Study Plan | Complimentary practice test &amp; additional course</p>', '2160', '7', 'lean-six-sigma-black-belt-certification-training-course', '1757703464_image.png', '1757281901_cover.png', '<p>This Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification will provide participants with advanced skills and knowledge in methodologies for process improvement.</p><p>Building on the foundation established in Green Belt training, this course offers comprehensive training in statistical analysis, project management, leadership, and strategic alignment.</p>', '<p>This Six Sigma Black Belt Certification is ideal for team leaders, software experts, senior management personnel, project managers, quality assurance engineers, and any other management professionals aiming to enhance their careers.</p>', '<p>Individuals must hold either an undergraduate degree or a high school diploma. For success in the exam, it is advisable to undergo formal Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Training from a certified Lean Six Sigma instructor or corporate program. Additionally, it is suggested that candidates have some practical experience in Lean Six Sigma before taking the exam.</p>', '1757281901_cert.png', '1757281901_curr.pdf', '<p>Lean management is a widely acknowledged certification in quality management, offering best practices for enhancing end-to-end business processes across product development, manufacturing, operations, service, customer relations, and various other enterprise functions.</p>', 'Any quality management professional who wants to advance in their career and obtain their Six Sigma Black Belt Certification should enroll in the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training program. This Lean Six Sigma Black Belt training has been designed to be in line with the IASSC test, so you can be confident that you can handle challenging projects and use Six Sigma techniques with ease.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>4 Days Classroom Training<\\\\\\/p><p>IASSC Exam Voucher Included In The Fees<\\\\\\/p><p>We Guarantee Best Price In Training Industry<\\\\\\/p><p>Flexible Weekend and Weekday Schedules<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>&nbsp;36 Hours of Live Online Training<\\\\\\/p><p>Get FREE Exam Voucher From IASSC<\\\\\\/p><p>Best Price Guaranteed in the Training Industry<\\\\\\/p><p>Flexible Weekend and Weekday Schedules<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Blended learning delivery model (self-paced eLearning and\\\\\\/or instructor-led options)<\\\\\\/p><p>Flexible pricing options<\\\\\\/p><p>Enterprise-grade Learning Management System (LMS)<\\\\\\/p><p>Enterprise dashboards for individuals and teams<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '12520', '[{\"image\":\"1757282000_IASSC-Certification-Badge-250x250.png\",\"text\":\"IASSC ATO\"}]', '4.8', '5545', '<p>Our training course comes with a 100% exam pass guarantee. Centuera believes in our highly effective blended learning methodology and its ability to provide learners with the knowledge and confidence to pass the Lean Six Sigma Green Belt exam on the first attempt. If you do not clear the Lean Six Sigma Green Belt exam on the first attempt, we will refund the course fee to you.</p>', '<p>100% money-back guarantee*</p><p>No questions asked refund*<br>At Centuera, we value the trust of our patrons immensely. But, if you feel that a course does not meet your expectations, we offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. Just send us a refund request via email within 7 days of purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment, no questions asked!</p>', '[\"9\",\"8\",\"7\",\"6\",\"5\",\"4\",\"3\",\"2\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-08 04:08:43', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', NULL),
(8, 'PMI-ACP Certification Training Course', 'PMI-ACP Course', '1757516597_curr.png', '<p>Become an Agile Certified Practitioner with Authorized Training Partner</p>', '<p>PMI-ACP® Exam Pass Guaranteed On 1st Attempt</p><p>Exclusive Masterclasses in Generative AI for Project Management</p><p>Earn 35 PDUs | 12 Simulation Assessments | 500+ Premium Questions</p><p>1000 Questions Bank | Cheat Sheet | Guaranteed Exam Pass Study Plan</p><p>Guaranteed to Run 30+ Live Cohorts in the Next 90 Days</p>', '2160', '2', 'pmi-acp-certification-training-course', '1757703383_image.png', '1757284779_cover.png', '<p>This PMI-ACP® course provides an introduction to the fundamentals of PMI-ACP, equipping you to become a proficient agile professional with an understanding of different agile methodologies. Alongside the foundational agile methodologies and techniques, this program incorporates concepts from the most recent edition of the Agile Practice Guide to help you get ready for the examination.</p>', '<p>PMI Agile certification is a professional requirement throughout the IT and tech industries for all project management roles globally. This PMI-ACP Certification course is best suited for project managers, agile team members, associate managers, team leads, managers, project executives, software developers, and any professionals aspiring to become project managers.</p>', '<p>To apply for the PMI Agile Certified Practitioner certification PMI, it is mandatory to have a secondary degree or higher, 2000 hours of general project management experience in the last five years, and at least 1500 hours of experience working on agile project teams during the last three years.</p>', '1757284779_cert.jpg', '1757284779_curr.pdf', '<p>Agile Certified Practitioners frequently earn above $100,000 USD annually, making them more wealthy than their non-certified peers.</p>', 'Elevate your project management capabilities with PMI-ACP® certification. Designed to enhance your team\'s efficiency and effectiveness, PMI-ACP® offers a robust framework that can be tailored to any project, regardless of size or complexity. By equipping your teams with PMI-ACP® skills, you ensure that projects are delivered on time, within budget, and to the highest standards of quality.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>3 Days Classroom Training<\\\\\\/p><p>102 end-of-chapter quizzes &amp; 4 simulation exams<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn 28 Contact Hours Upon Completion<\\\\\\/p><p>Best Price Guaranteed in the Training Industry<\\\\\\/p><p>Trainers With Over 20 Years of Experience<\\\\\\/p><p>Application Assistance &amp; 1 Year Support<\\\\\\/p><p>Engage in Real-World Simulation Activities<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>28 Hours of Instructor-Led PMI-ACP Training<\\\\\\/p><p>102 end-of-chapter quizzes &amp; 4 simulation exams<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn 28 Contact Hours Upon Completion<\\\\\\/p><p>Best Price Guaranteed in the Training Industry<\\\\\\/p><p>Trainers With Over 20 Years of Experience<\\\\\\/p><p>Application Assistance &amp; 1 Year Support<\\\\\\/p><p>Engage in Real-World Simulation Activities<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>PMI-ACP training course improves project delivery speed and efficiency.<\\\\\\/p><p>Enhance transparency in collaboration and communication within team members.<\\\\\\/p><p>Improve product deliverables and increase customer satisfaction.<\\\\\\/p><p>Improved project success rates and faster delivery times.<\\\\\\/p><p>Help to understand and align with customer needs and expectations.<\\\\\\/p><p>Certification boosts overall organizational agility and responsiveness.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '5600', '[{\"image\":\"1757307584_PMI REP LOGO.png\",\"text\":\"Project Management Institute\"}]', '4.5', '5622', '<p>Our training course comes with a 100% exam pass guarantee. Centuera believes in our highly effective blended learning methodology and its ability to provide learners with the knowledge and confidence to pass the PMI-ACP® exam in the first attempt. If you do not clear the PMI-ACP® exam on the first attempt, we will refund the course fee to you.</p>', '<p>100% money-back guarantee*</p><p>No questions asked refund*<br>At Centuera, we value the trust of our patrons immensely. But, if you feel that a course does not meet your expectations, we offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. Just send us a refund request via email within 7 days of purchase and we will refund 100% of your payment, no questions asked!</p>', '[\"7\",\"6\",\"5\",\"4\",\"3\",\"2\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-08 05:34:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', NULL),
(9, 'ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training', 'ITIL® 4 Foundation Course', '1757515701_curr.png', '<p>ITIL Certification: The Essential Component for Effective IT Management</p>', '<p>Guaranteed to pass the ITIL Certification Exam on your first try</p><p>Acquire 22 PDUs | Over 30 quizzes | 4 mock tests | 6 simulation assessments</p><p>More than 100 premium exam questions | Cheat sheet | Study plan for exam success</p><p>Includes PeopleCert training materials, exam fee, and e-book</p><p>A thorough learning experience featuring real-life case studies, quizzes, and more</p>', '960', '4', 'itil-4-foundation-certification-training', '1757703336_image.jpg', '1757349396_cover.png', '<p>Prepare yourself for the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification through our blended learning methodology.<br>Develop crucial IT service competencies, enhance team collaboration, and create value.<br>Participate in a combination of live sessions and self-directed learning materials, which include assessments and practical case studies.<br>This ITIL certification equips you for the examination and reinforces teamwork within IT.</p>', '<p>This ITIL® 4 certification training program is ideally designed for IT executives, IT architects, operations managers, IT audit managers, IT planners and consultants, database administrators, ITSM trainers, service delivery professionals, quality analysts, application management and development teams, as well as IT managers. Achieving the ITIL® 4 Foundation certification proves advantageous for both experienced IT professionals and newcomers embarking on their IT careers.</p>', '<p>The ITIL 4 Foundation certification is intended for a broad audience seeking to acquire a comprehensive understanding of ITIL and the principles of IT service management.</p><ul><li>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in this ITIL certification course.</li><li>It is open to individuals of all backgrounds and levels of experience.</li><li>This certification offers a crucial foundation for various career trajectories and aspirations, making it essential for anyone looking to advance their career.</li></ul>', '1757349396_cert.jpg', '1757349396_curr.pdf', '<p>The ITIL certification is essential for individuals seeking to grasp the principles of ITIL frameworks and improve the quality of IT Service Management. Professionals who hold ITIL certification can potentially earn up to 40% more than their counterparts without certification.</p>', 'The ITIL® certification is designed to provide you with the knowledge and skills necessary to lead and manage projects effectively. Whether you\'re an experienced project manager or aspiring to become one, obtaining a ITIL® certification can transform your career and significantly benefit your organization.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2 Days of Classroom Training<\\\\\\/p><p>ITIL V4 Exam Voucher and E-Book Included<\\\\\\/p><p>We Ensure the Best Price in the Training Industry<\\\\\\/p><p>Options Available for Flexible Weekday or Weekend Sessions<\\\\\\/p><p>24\\\\\\/7 Learner Assistance and Support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>16 Contact Hours with Live Training<\\\\\\/p><p>Receive a FREE ITIL Exam Voucher and E-Book<\\\\\\/p><p>Best Price Guaranteed in the Training Sector<\\\\\\/p><p>Flexible Scheduling for Weekends and Weekdays<\\\\\\/p><p>Learner Support and Assistance Available Around the Clock<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Flexible Pricing and Billing Options<\\\\\\/p><p>Private Cohorts Offered<\\\\\\/p><p>Training Progress Dashboards<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills Assessment and Benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Platform Integration Capabilities<\\\\\\/p><p>Dedicated Customer Success Manager<\\\\\\/p><p>24\\\\\\/7 Learner Assistance and Support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '12656', '[{\"image\":\"1757515701_peoplecert logo.png\",\"text\":null}]', '4.8', '125225', '<p>Our training course comes with a 100% exam pass guarantee. Centuera believes in our highly effective blended learning methodology and its ability to provide learners with the knowledge and confidence to pass the ITIL® exam in the first attempt. If you do not clear the ITIL® exam on the first attempt, we will refund the course fee to you.</p>', '<p>100% money-back guarantee*</p><p>No questions asked refund*<br>At Centuera, we value the trust of our patrons immensely. But, if you feel that a course does not meet your expectations, we offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. Just send us a refund request via email within 7 days of purchase and we will refund 100% of your payment, no questions asked!</p>', '[\"8\",\"7\",\"6\",\"5\",\"4\",\"3\",\"2\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-08 22:59:23', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `courses` (`id`, `title`, `short_title`, `logo`, `short_description`, `description`, `duration`, `category`, `slug`, `image`, `cover_image`, `overview`, `eligibility`, `prerequisites`, `certification_image`, `upload_curriculum`, `benefits`, `business_with_skilled`, `video_url`, `training_course`, `learner_field`, `authorized_training_partner`, `rating`, `number_of_user_rating`, `exam_pass_guarantee`, `money_back_guarantee`, `related_courses`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`) VALUES
(10, 'Certified Scrum Developer® (CSD) Certification Training', 'CSD Course', '1757533410_logo.png', '<p>Acquire Agile Engineering Skills for Assured Career Advancement in Scrum and Agile.</p>', '<p>Guaranteed to Conduct Over 20 Hours of Interactive Training Sessions.</p><p>16 Hours of Practical Coding Sessions Led by CSD Trainers.</p><p>Obtain 16 SEUs and 16 PDUs through CSD Certification Training.</p><p>Enjoy a 2-Year Membership with the Scrum Alliance.</p><p>Attain Scrum Developer Certification from Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2160', '2', 'certified-scrum-developer-csd-certification-training', '1757533410_image.png', '1757533410_cover.png', '<p>The CSD certification course is designed for software developers and engineers eager to improve their Agile engineering skills and knowledge in Scrum. The CSD certification training provided by Centuera allows you to develop practical and hands-on coding abilities that are essential for effective product delivery in an Agile setting. Participants will learn in real-world environments where conditions and requirements are in constant flux.&nbsp;</p><p>The CSD course integrates with other Agile methodologies such as Scrum, Kanban, and DevOps, ensuring that professionals acquire a thorough understanding of Agile principles. With this certification, you can pursue various career opportunities related to Scrum that enhance your professional trajectory.</p><p>The CSD certification course offers the chance to earn a globally acknowledged certification that demonstrates your proficiency in Scrum methodologies. Consequently, the CSD certification paves the way for numerous in-demand Scrum positions and supports your career growth.</p>', '<p>To participate in Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) training, there are no official prerequisites; however, having a background in software development, an understanding of Agile principles, and familiarity with the Scrum framework is strongly advised. This training is available to a range of IT professionals, such as software developers, testers, and project managers, who aim to enhance their abilities in software development within a Scrum context.</p>', '<p>Both beginners and experienced project managers aiming to advance their careers in project management and enhance their understanding of Scrum are invited to register for the Scrum Developer Certification course. There are no specific prerequisites required to enroll in the course.</p>', '1757533410_cert.jfif', NULL, '<p>Certified Scrum Developer® demonstrates their expertise in fundamental Scrum principles to prospective employers and are highly valued across different industries because of their proven abilities. CSM professionals enjoy unique access to local groups, networks, and resources that are exclusively available to Scrum Alliance members.</p>', 'Certified Scrum Developer® (CSD) certification training enhances a developer\'s career by building expertise in Scrum and agile engineering practices. It improves the ability to collaborate within a Scrum team, delivers high-quality software, reduces technical debt through techniques like refactoring, and increases marketability for agile-focused roles. The certification also provides international recognition and a community for continuous improvement.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>&nbsp;2 days of classroom training<\\\\\\/p><p>CSD exam fee included<\\\\\\/p><p>Two-year membership with Scrum Alliance\\\\u00ae included<\\\\\\/p><p>Delivered by globally acclaimed CSTs<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn PDUs and SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2 days of online virtual training<\\\\\\/p><p>CSD exam fee included<\\\\\\/p><p>Two-year membership with Scrum Alliance\\\\u00ae included<\\\\\\/p><p>Delivered by globally acclaimed CSTs<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn PDUs and SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Instructor-led delivery model<\\\\\\/p><p>Flexible pricing options<\\\\\\/p><p>Enterprise grade Learning Management System (LMS)<\\\\\\/p><p>Enterprise dashboards for individuals and teams<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '5255', '[]', '4.5', '55541', '<p>Our training program offers a complete guarantee of passing the exam. Centuera believes in our highly efficient blended learning method, which prepares learners with the necessary knowledge and confidence to successfully pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue a complimentary exam retake voucher (terms and conditions apply). If you still do not succeed on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '<p>No questions asked refund</p><p>At Centuera, we hold the trust of our customers in the highest regard. However, if you believe that a course does not fulfill your expectations, we provide a 7-day money-back guarantee. Simply send us a refund request via email within 7 days of your purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment.</p><p>Centuera is confident in our highly effective blended learning method, designed to equip learners with the knowledge and confidence needed to pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue you a complimentary exam retake voucher (Terms and Conditions Apply). If you still do not pass on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '[\"8\",\"5\",\"4\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-11 02:05:12', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', NULL),
(11, 'Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification', 'Leading SAFe® 6.0 Course', '1757537390_logo.png', '<p>Enhance Your Agile Leadership Capabilities with SAFe Certification</p>', '<p>Acquire 16 SEUs &amp; PDUs | Train alongside SAFe Practice Consultants | Exam fee included</p><p>The Leading SAFe® certification emphasizes lean enterprise and portfolio management</p><p>Cultivate strategic skills necessary for managing large projects via SAFe Agile Certification</p><p>Understand the SAFe implementation roadmap and the development of business solutions</p><p>Engage in interactive sessions featuring real-world simulations and case studies</p>', '960', '2', 'leading-safe-60-training-with-safe-agile-certification', '1757537390_image.png', '1757537390_cover.png', '<p>This SAFe Agile certification training provides knowledge of Lean-Agile principles and practices associated with SAFe®. The course spans two days and focuses on grasping the Lean-Agile mindset, implementing Agile Release Trains, developing an Agile Portfolio, and leading Lean-Agile transformations in organizations.</p>', '<p>This SAFe® Agile certification training course is appropriate for:</p><ul><li>Executives</li><li>Senior Managers</li><li>Quality Analysts</li><li>Directors and VPs</li><li>Program and Project Managers</li><li>Product Managers and Portfolio Managers</li><li>Process and Enterprise Architects</li><li>Solution Architects</li></ul><p>Anyone interested in supporting their organization in the implementation of a Lean-Agile framework</p>', '<p>Participants must hold an undergraduate degree or a high school diploma.<br>It is also advisable to have a minimum of five years of experience in software development, testing, business analysis, or project management. Furthermore, it is recommended that individuals enrolling in this course possess a fundamental understanding of Scrum.</p>', '1757537390_cert.png', '1757761259_curr.pdf', '<p>This Leading SAFe Agilist certification enables you to become a key stakeholder in the success of your organization. This certification not only empowers you to implement and deliver value through Agile Release Trains but also to spearhead a Lean-Agile transformation, which is why it is highly esteemed across various industry sectors.</p>', 'The Leading SAFe® 6.0 certification training offers organizations a consistent and scalable framework for adopting Lean-Agile principles. This approach enhances collaboration, elevates product quality, and accelerates the delivery of value to customers. Notable advantages encompass facilitating large-scale Agile transformations, enhancing organizational resilience, shortening time-to-market, and increasing employee engagement and productivity, which collectively contribute to business growth.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2 Days of Classroom training session<\\\\\\/p><p>SAFe\\\\u00ae Agilist exam fee included<\\\\\\/p><p>One year certified membership as a SAFe\\\\u00ae Agilist<\\\\\\/p><p>Participate in interactive sessions featuring real-world simulations and case studies<\\\\\\/p><p>Conducted by SAFe\\\\u00ae Practice Consultants (SPCs)<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2 Days of virtual training session<\\\\\\/p><p>SAFe\\\\u00ae Agilist exam fee included<\\\\\\/p><p>One year certified membership as a SAFe\\\\u00ae Agilist<\\\\\\/p><p>Participate in interactive sessions featuring real-world simulations and case studies<\\\\\\/p><p>Conducted by SAFe\\\\u00ae Practice Consultants (SPCs)<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 learner assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Flexible pricing &amp; billing options<\\\\\\/p><p>Private cohorts available<\\\\\\/p><p>Training progress dashboards<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills assessment &amp; benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Platform integration capabilities<\\\\\\/p><p>Dedicated customer success manager<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '25000', '[{\"image\":null,\"text\":null}]', '4.5', '12000', '<p>Our training program offers a complete guarantee of passing the exam. Centuera believes in our highly efficient blended learning method, which prepares learners with the necessary knowledge and confidence to successfully pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue a complimentary exam retake voucher (terms and conditions apply). If you still do not succeed on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '<p>No questions asked refund</p><p>At Centuera, we hold the trust of our customers in the highest regard. However, if you believe that a course does not fulfill your expectations, we provide a 7-day money-back guarantee. Simply send us a refund request via email within 7 days of your purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment.</p><p>Centuera is confident in our highly effective blended learning method, designed to equip learners with the knowledge and confidence needed to pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue you a complimentary exam retake voucher (Terms and Conditions Apply). If you still do not pass on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '[\"10\",\"8\",\"5\",\"4\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-11 02:49:04', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', NULL),
(12, 'SAFe® 6 Scrum Master (SSM) Certification Training', 'SSM Certification Course', '1757546165_logo.png', '<p>Foster Innovation and Efficiency as an experienced Scrum Master</p>', '<p>Act as a change agent to facilitate smooth Agile transformations</p><p>Acquire expertise in the wider enterprise context with SSM certification</p><p>Achieve higher customer satisfaction with SAFe SSM</p><p>Obtain 16 SEUs through SAFe Scrum Master certification</p><p>Enjoy a one-year membership to the SAFe Community Platform</p><p>Conducted by SAFe® Practice Consultants | Exam fee included</p>', '960', '2', 'safe-6-scrum-master-ssm-certification-training', '1757546165_image.png', '1757546165_cover.png', '<p>The SAFe Scrum Master Certification course introduces you to the fundamentals of a Scaled Agile framework enterprise and assists you in the planning and execution of the Program Increment. Learn to plan and execute the Program Increment, excel in agile development at scale, engage in iteration planning, and cultivate high-performing teams.</p>', '<p>This SAFe Scrum Master Certification course is ideally designed for:</p><ul><li>Scrum Masters</li><li>Program/Project Managers</li><li>Team Leads</li><li>Agile Coaches</li><li>Release Train Engineers</li><li>Developers</li><li>Product Owners</li></ul>', '<p>Participants must hold an undergraduate degree or a high school diploma.<br>A fundamental understanding of Agile concepts and principles is beneficial, along with some knowledge of Scrum, Kanban, and eXtreme Programming (XP).<br>Previous experience in a Lean-Agile environment is necessary to be eligible for the exam.</p>', NULL, '1757761623_curr.pdf', '<p>Recent surveys conducted by payscale.com indicate that the demand for SSM professionals is on the rise, with Fortune 500 companies consistently seeking certified Scrum Masters.</p>', 'The SAFe® 6.0 Scrum Master (SSM) certification prepares individuals to coach and support Agile teams within the Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe) to achieve business value.  This is a 16-hour training program that imparts Scrum Master skills tailored for a scaled enterprise, addressing servant leadership, facilitating SAFe events, PI planning, and promoting continuous improvement for high-performing teams.  The certification confirms a professional\'s capability to lead Agile transformations and enhance organizational success.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2\\\\\\/3 days of classroom training sessions<\\\\\\/p><p>One-year access to the SAFe Community Platform<\\\\\\/p><p>Exam fees are included<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn 16 SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>24\\\\\\/7 teaching assistance and support<\\\\\\/p><p>Achieve exam success with extensive exam support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2\\\\\\/3 days of classroom training sessions<\\\\\\/p><p>One-year access to the SAFe Community Platform<\\\\\\/p><p>Exam fees are included<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn 16 SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>24\\\\\\/7 teaching assistance and support<\\\\\\/p><p>Achieve exam success with extensive exam support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Adaptive pricing and billing solutions<\\\\\\/p><p>Exclusive cohorts offered<\\\\\\/p><p>Progress tracking dashboards for training<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills evaluation and benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Integration capabilities with the platform<\\\\\\/p><p>Assigned customer success manager<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '25655', '[{\"image\":\"1757546165_images (1).png\",\"text\":\"Scaled Agile Gold SPCT Partner\"}]', '4.8', '55521', '<p>Our training program offers a complete guarantee of passing the exam. Centuera believes in our highly efficient blended learning method, which prepares learners with the necessary knowledge and confidence to successfully pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue a complimentary exam retake voucher (terms and conditions apply). If you still do not succeed on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '<p>No questions asked refund</p><p>At Centuera, we hold the trust of our customers in the highest regard. However, if you believe that a course does not fulfill your expectations, we provide a 7-day money-back guarantee. Simply send us a refund request via email within 7 days of your purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment.</p><p>Centuera is confident in our highly effective blended learning method, designed to equip learners with the knowledge and confidence needed to pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue you a complimentary exam retake voucher (Terms and Conditions Apply). If you still do not pass on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '[\"11\",\"10\",\"8\",\"5\",\"4\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-11 05:34:23', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', NULL),
(13, 'SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager (POPM) Certification Training', 'SAFe POPM Certification Course', '1757548291_logo.png', '<p>Attain Product Leadership through the mastery of Agile Product techniques</p>', '<p>Receive training as a ScrumMaster® within a SAFe Enterprise through an extensive course</p><p>Obtain SAFe POPM Certification to become a lucrative Product Manager/Owner</p><p>Participate in hands-on learning, real-world simulations, and case studies</p><p>Acquire 16 SEUs | Provided by SAFe® Practice Consultants | Exam fee included</p>', '960', '2', 'safe-product-ownerproduct-manager-popm-certification-training', '1757707371_image.png', '1757548291_cover.png', '<p>The SAFe Product Owner Product Manager (POPM) certification includes a range of processes, mechanics, and tools that are crucial for effective program management and the management of product backlogs. By participating in this training, you will become an essential contributor to the product development process and gain expertise in driving business goals through Scaled Agile Frameworks.</p>', '<p>The SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager certification course is ideally designed for:</p><ul><li>Product Managers</li><li>Product Owners</li><li>Business Owners</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Solution Managers</li><li>Portfolio Managers</li><li>Program Managers</li><li>Enterprise and System Architects</li><li>Agile coaches</li></ul>', '<p>No prerequisites are required to enroll in this course; however, participants should hold either an undergraduate degree or a high school diploma.</p><p>It is advisable for applicants to have experience in a SAFe environment or familiarity with Lean, Agile, or other pertinent methodologies.</p>', '1757548291_cert.jpg', '1757761540_curr.pdf', '<p>The POPM training encompasses various processes, mechanics, and tools used for program management and backlog resolution. It aims to make you a vital contributor to the product development process.</p>', 'The SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager (POPM) certification supports organizations by enhancing their product development processes and delivering value more efficiently.  It provides individuals with the necessary skills to collect and apply customer insights, prioritize features, work collaboratively with stakeholders, and comprehend the Agile Release Train (ART) within the Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe).  As a result, this leads to quicker delivery of valuable software, improved product quality, faster responses to market fluctuations, and a stronger alignment of strategy with execution throughout the enterprise.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2\\\\\\/3 Days of Classroom training session<\\\\\\/p><p>One-year membership to the SAFe\\\\u00ae Community Platform<\\\\\\/p><p>16 SEUs offered<\\\\\\/p><p>Exam cost included<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 teaching assistance and support<\\\\\\/p><p>Get exam success with comprehensive exam support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2\\\\\\/3 Days of virtual training session<\\\\\\/p><p>One-year membership to the SAFe\\\\u00ae Community Platform<\\\\\\/p><p>16 SEUs offered<\\\\\\/p><p>Exam cost included<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 teaching assistance and support<\\\\\\/p><p>Get exam success with comprehensive exam support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Flexible pricing &amp; billing options<\\\\\\/p><p>Private cohorts available<\\\\\\/p><p>Training progress dashboards<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills assessment &amp; benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Platform integration capabilities<\\\\\\/p><p>Dedicated customer success manager<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '12200', '[{\"image\":\"1757548291_images (1).png\",\"text\":\"Scaled Agile Gold SPCT Partner\"}]', '4.8', '12500', '<p>Our training program offers a complete guarantee of passing the exam. Centuera believes in our highly efficient blended learning method, which prepares learners with the necessary knowledge and confidence to successfully pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue a complimentary exam retake voucher (terms and conditions apply). If you still do not succeed on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '<p>No questions asked refund</p><p>At Centuera, we hold the trust of our customers in the highest regard. However, if you believe that a course does not fulfill your expectations, we provide a 7-day money-back guarantee. Simply send us a refund request via email within 7 days of your purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment.</p><p>Centuera is confident in our highly effective blended learning method, designed to equip learners with the knowledge and confidence needed to pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue you a complimentary exam retake voucher (Terms and Conditions Apply). If you still do not pass on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '[\"12\",\"11\",\"10\",\"8\",\"5\",\"4\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-11 06:19:04', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', NULL),
(14, 'Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) Certification Training', 'A-CSM Course', '1757601074_logo.png', '<p>Discover new avenues for professional advancement</p>', '<p>Collaborate with a variety of stakeholders to enhance operational efficiency</p><p>Amplify your organizational influence by utilizing Scrum and Agile methodologies</p><p>Receive top-tier mentorship from esteemed Certified Scrum Trainers (CSTs)</p><p>Demonstrate your commitment to ongoing education and development</p>', '960', '2', 'advanced-certified-scrummaster-a-csm-certification-training', '1757706139_image.png', '1757601074_cover.png', '<p>The Advanced Scrum Master Certification training program highlights the significance of Scrum and Agile methodologies to stakeholders. It provides guidance on applying Scrum within Agile and Lean project management, covering aspects such as facilitation, coaching, service delivery, and overseeing the Scrum lifecycle.</p>', '<p>This A-CSM training course is designed for:</p><ul><li>Product Owners</li><li>Scrum Masters</li><li>Developers</li><li>Agile Coaches</li><li>Team Leads</li></ul>', '<p>There are no prerequisites for attending the course; however, participants should possess either an undergraduate degree or a high school diploma.<br>To be eligible for the A-CSM credential, you must have a current CSM certification and at least 12 months of Scrum Master experience recorded in your Scrum Alliance profile within the last five years.</p>', '1757601074_cert.png', '1757761450_curr.pdf', '<p>The Advanced Certified ScrumMaster (A-CSM) certification showcases essential Scrum expertise to employers and is highly regarded across various industries due to the verifiable skills it represents. A-CSM professionals benefit from access to local groups, networks, and resources that are exclusive to Scrum Alliance members.</p>', 'The Advanced Certified ScrumMaster (A-CSM) course improves project outcomes via advanced agile practices, scaled methodologies, better team involvement, and conflict resolution skills. A-CSM certified professionals can drive innovative strategies, coach teams, manage organizational complexities, and customize Agile methods to enhance productivity and success.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2\\\\\\/3 Days Classroom Training Session<\\\\\\/p><p>Sessions conducted by esteemed Certified Scrum Trainers (CSTs)<\\\\\\/p><p>Receive a Scrum Alliance certificate along with a two-year membership<\\\\\\/p><p>Accumulate 16 SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>24\\\\\\/7 learner support and assistance<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2\\\\\\/3 Days Virtual Training Session<\\\\\\/p><p>Sessions conducted by esteemed Certified Scrum Trainers (CSTs)<\\\\\\/p><p>Receive a Scrum Alliance certificate along with a two-year membership<\\\\\\/p><p>Accumulate 16 SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>24\\\\\\/7 learner support and assistance<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Private cohorts available<\\\\\\/p><p>Training progress dashboards<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills assessment &amp; benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Platform integration capabilities<\\\\\\/p><p>Dedicated customer success manager<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '23000', '[{\"image\":\"1757604118_sa-rea-600.png\",\"text\":\"Global REA of Scrum Alliance\"}]', '4.8', '25000', '<p>Our training program offers a complete guarantee of passing the exam. Centuera believes in our highly efficient blended learning method, which prepares learners with the necessary knowledge and confidence to successfully pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue a complimentary exam retake voucher (terms and conditions apply). If you still do not succeed on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '<p>No questions asked refund</p><p>At Centuera, we hold the trust of our customers in the highest regard. However, if you believe that a course does not fulfill your expectations, we provide a 7-day money-back guarantee. Simply send us a refund request via email within 7 days of your purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment.</p><p>Centuera is confident in our highly effective blended learning method, designed to equip learners with the knowledge and confidence needed to pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue you a complimentary exam retake voucher (Terms and Conditions Apply). If you still do not pass on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '[\"14\",\"13\",\"12\",\"11\",\"5\",\"4\",\"3\"]', '2025-09-11 21:18:47', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', NULL),
(15, 'Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner® (A-CSPO®) Certification Training', 'A-CSPO Course', '1757615865_logo.png', '<p>Master Agile Leadership: Enhance Your Product Ownership Skills</p>', '<p>Master Agile Leadership: Enhance your Product Ownership skills</p><p>Establish yourself as a recognized authority in Product Ownership</p><p>Engage in practical simulations and hands-on learning</p><p>A-CSPO Certification Training provided by accredited Certified Scrum Trainers</p><p>Includes a two-year membership with Scrum Alliance®</p>', '960', '2', 'advanced-certified-scrum-product-owner-a-cspo-certification-training', '1757705002_image.png', '1757615865_cover.png', '<p>Designed for experienced Product Owners with a CSPO certification, this program delves deep into Agile product ownership. Explore advanced topics like product strategy, stakeholder collaboration, backlog refinement, and scaling Agile. Join us to elevate your capabilities in Agile product management through interactive sessions.</p>', '<p>Taking the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training and earning the A-CSPO certification can be especially beneficial for:</p><ul><li>Certified Scrum Product Owners (CSPOs)</li><li>Product Managers</li><li>Scrum Masters</li><li>Managers</li><li>Agile Team Members</li><li>Executives</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Product Analysts</li><li>Product Owners</li><li>Project Managers</li><li>CXOs</li><li>Marketing Managers</li><li>Program Managers</li></ul>', '<p>To achieve A-CSPO certification, you must hold a valid CSPO® certification from Scrum Alliance® and possess at least one year of pertinent work experience as a Product Owner.</p>', '1757615865_cert.png', '1757761347_curr.pdf', '<p>The responsibilities of the product manager are broadening as a result of the rising significance of data in decision-making, a heightened emphasis on customer and design considerations, and the advancement of software development methodologies.</p>', 'An A-CSPO certification equips Product Owners with skills in product visioning, roadmapping, and backlog management, enabling businesses to deliver higher-quality, customer-centric products efficiently, improve communication, foster continuous improvement, align goals with strategy, enhance risk management, accelerate time-to-market, and boost ROI.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2 Days Virtual Training<\\\\\\/p><p>A-CSPO\\\\u00ae Certification fee included<\\\\\\/p><p>2 Years Membership of Scrum Alliance<\\\\\\/p><p>Delivered by globally renowed CST\\\\u00ae<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 teaching assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2 Days Virtual Training<\\\\\\/p><p>A-CSPO\\\\u00ae Certification fee included<\\\\\\/p><p>2 Years Membership of Scrum Alliance<\\\\\\/p><p>Delivered by globally renowed CST\\\\u00ae<\\\\\\/p><p>24x7 teaching assistance and support<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Flexible pricing &amp; billing options<\\\\\\/p><p>Private cohorts available<\\\\\\/p><p>Training progress dashboards<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills assessment &amp; benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Platform integration capabilities<\\\\\\/p><p>Dedicated customer success manager<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '25102', '[{\"image\":\"1757615865_sa-rea-600.png\",\"text\":\"PeopleCert ATO\"}]', '4.8', '25005', '<p>Our training program offers a complete guarantee of passing the exam. Centuera believes in our highly efficient blended learning method, which prepares learners with the necessary knowledge and confidence to successfully pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue a complimentary exam retake voucher (terms and conditions apply). If you still do not succeed on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '<p>No questions asked refund</p><p>At Centuera, we hold the trust of our customers in the highest regard. However, if you believe that a course does not fulfill your expectations, we provide a 7-day money-back guarantee. Simply send us a refund request via email within 7 days of your purchase, and we will refund 100% of your payment.</p><p>Centuera is confident in our highly effective blended learning method, designed to equip learners with the knowledge and confidence needed to pass the CSM exam on their first try. Should you not pass the CSM exam on your first attempt, Centuera will issue you a complimentary exam retake voucher (Terms and Conditions Apply). If you still do not pass on your second attempt, we will refund your course fee.</p>', '[\"14\",\"13\",\"12\",\"11\",\"10\",\"8\",\"4\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-12 00:30:51', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', NULL),
(16, 'Certified Business Analysis Professional (CBAP®) Certification Training', 'CBAP® Course', '1757619894_logo.png', '<p>Global IIBA Endorsed Education Provider | Live CBAP Certification Online</p>', '<p>CBAP® Course Content aligned with BABOK® Guide - Version 3</p><p>Grasp the fundamental concepts, principles, and techniques of business analysis</p><p>Acquire 35 CDUs | Includes 7 Simulation Assessments | 900+ Practice Questions</p><p>Get ready for the CBAP® exam with a course accredited by IIBA®</p>', '2160', '6', 'certified-business-analysis-professional-cbap-certification-training', '1757706040_image.png', '1757619894_cover.png', '<p>This CBAP certification training is perfect for professionals who wish to obtain a globally acknowledged Certified Business Analysis Professional certification. The program is in accordance with the BABOK® Guide v3 and enables you to excel in business analysis skills such as documentation, planning, and solution design.</p>', '<p>The IIBA® CBAP® Training is perfect for individuals looking to fast-track their careers in business analysis.Finishing this program fulfills the criteria for ECBA®, CCBA®, and CBAP® certifications.</p>', '<p>No previous knowledge or experience is necessary to participate in Centuera’s CBAP® Training. To be eligible for the CBAP® exam, you must possess a high school diploma or an undergraduate degree, have 7,500 hours of business analysis experience within the last decade, including 900 hours in four of the six BABOK® v3 Knowledge Areas, and complete 35 hours of professional development in the last four years.</p>', '1757619894_cert.jpg', '1757761097_curr.pdf', '<p>Achieving a CBAP certification confirms your expertise in business analysis while also improving your leadership abilities, job prospects, market appeal, and income potential. As reported by IIBA®, individuals with CBAP certification earn 13 percent more than their non-certified counterparts.</p>', 'A CBAP certification enhances a business\'s analysis team by improving skills, validating expertise, and boosting project outcomes, leading to better decision-making and increased productivity. Certified professionals bring advanced knowledge in strategy analysis and solution evaluation, and the certification\'s global recognition aids in attracting and retaining top talent.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>4 Days Classroom Training<\\\\\\/p><p>Get IIBA BABOK\\\\u00ae Hard Copy Guide<\\\\\\/p><p>Pass your CBAP Exam in First Attempt<\\\\\\/p><p>Best Price Guaranteed in the Training Industry<\\\\\\/p><p>Learner Support and Assistance Available 24\\\\\\/7<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>36 Hours of Live Online Training<\\\\\\/p><p>Get IIBA BABOK Soft Copy Guide Access<\\\\\\/p><p>Pass your CBAP Exam in First Attempt<\\\\\\/p><p>Best Price Guaranteed in the Training Industry<\\\\\\/p><p>Learner Support and Assistance Available 24\\\\\\/7<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Adaptive pricing and billing solutions<\\\\\\/p><p>Exclusive cohorts offered<\\\\\\/p><p>Progress tracking dashboards for training<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills evaluation and benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Integration capabilities with the platform<\\\\\\/p><p>Assigned customer success manager<\\\\\\/p><p>24\\\\\\/7 learner support and assistance available<\\\\\\/p><p>CBAP Course Curriculum<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '10002', '[{\"image\":\"1757619980_Logo_IIBA.png\",\"text\":\"Endorsed Training Provider\"}]', '4.8', '10020', '<p>Our training course comes with a 100% exam pass guarantee. Centuera believes in our highly effective blended learning methodology and its ability to provide learners with the knowledge and confidence to pass the CBAP exam in the first attempt. If you do not clear the CBAP exam on the first attempt, we will refund the course fee to you.</p>', '<p>100% money-back guarantee*</p><p>No questions asked refund*</p><p>At Centuera, we value the trust of our patrons immensely. But, if you feel that a course does not meet your expectations, we offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. Just send us a refund request via email within 7 days of purchase and we will refund 100% of your payment, no questions asked!</p>', '[\"12\",\"5\",\"4\",\"3\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-12 01:45:32', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', NULL),
(17, 'SAFe® 6.0 DevOps (SDP) Certification Training', 'SAFe® 6.0 DevOps (SDP)', '1758189712_curr.png', '<p>Leverage our SAFe DevOps course to increase your worth as a DevOps Practitioner</p>', '<p>16-Hour Live Online SAFe® DevOps Certification Training</p><p>SAFe DevOps Practitioner Exam Fee Included with Course Enrollment</p><p>Earn 16 PDUs &amp; SEUs upon completion</p><p>Acquire hands-on experience for Value Stream Mapping Sessions</p><p>Become part of a Global SAFe® Certified Community</p>', '960', '2', 'safe-60-devops-sdp-certification-training', '1757788395_image.jpg', '1757788395_cover.png', '<p>The SAFe® DevOps certification offers significant advantages for those looking to advance their careers in both development and IT operations. The Centuera SAFe® DevOps course is structured to equip you with a skill set that delivers rapid and impactful results by optimizing processes and improving the flow of value from strategy to execution through the continuous delivery pipeline.</p><p>Throughout the SAFe® DevOps training, you will learn about Continuous Exploration, Continuous Integration, Continuous Deployment, Continuous Testing, Release-on-Demand, Continuous Protection, and fostering a Culture of Shared Responsibility. Additionally, you will delve into SAFe®’s CALMR (Culture, Automation, Lean, Measure, Recover) framework for DevOps, which promotes a culture of shared responsibility in providing a diverse range of solutions.</p><p>Upon completing the SAFe® DevOps Certification, you will be equipped to align people, processes, and technology within your organization to enhance efficiency and productivity while significantly reducing costs. This SAFe certification will distinguish you from your colleagues, as you will possess greater competence in managing various tasks from development to delivery. Furthermore, you will gain access to the SAFe® community platform, providing resources to further your knowledge in DevOps.</p>', '<p>This certification preparation course is intended for candidates who may be:</p><ol><li>DevOps engineers</li><li>DevOps architects</li><li>Operations engineers</li><li>System administrators</li><li>Developers</li></ol>', '<p>Grasping these eligibility criteria is essential for your success in the Training. It will enable you to participate in the course with confidence and achieve certification.</p><p>There are no specific prerequisites for attending the SAFe DevOps Certification course. Whether you are a seasoned professional or just starting out, we always encourage participation. This course is tailored to accommodate individuals from various backgrounds and experience levels. Participants are urged to engage actively in discussions and share their insights during the training.</p><p>However, although there are no rigid prerequisites, having prior experience in a Development or Operations setting can be advantageous for the certification exam. A solid understanding of the software development lifecycle and operational practices will enhance your comprehension and boost your chances of passing the exam on your first try.<br>Therefore, in addition to these eligibility criteria, obtaining the SAFe DevOps Practitioner Certification is necessary to successfully complete the SAFe DevOps Practitioner exam, which requires a passing score of 73%, as established by the accrediting organization Scaled Agile Inc.</p>', '1757788395_cert.jpg', '1757788395_curr.pdf', '<p>The SAFe® DevOps certification enables individuals to enhance their skill sets and fosters self-motivation to engage in any project.</p><p>This certification is globally recognized, providing a significant advantage to your professional profile.</p><p>Pursuing this certification can elevate your earnings and improve your salary.</p><p>The SAFe DevOps certification will set you apart from others during interviews, enhance your career prospects, and increase your likelihood of securing better job opportunities.</p>', 'The SAFe® 6.0 DevOps (SDP) course supports organizations in speeding up the delivery of top-notch software, enhancing the overall development value stream, and promoting a culture of ongoing improvement and teamwork. This results in faster releases, minimized risk, accelerated innovation, and ultimately, increased business value for the company.', '<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1MOeqUA5DkE?si=hb8TSV89ffxkTHuc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>', '\"{\\\"classroom\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Classroom Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>2 Days Classroom Training sessions<\\\\\\/p><p>Exam preparation with Mock Test<\\\\\\/p><p>Trained by experienced SAFe Consultant&nbsp;<\\\\\\/p><p>Hands on practical experience<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn 16 PDUs &amp; 16 SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>SAFe DevOps exam Fees Included in training fee<\\\\\\/p><p>Course Material &amp; SAFe Studio Access<\\\\\\/p><p>Comprehensive Exam Support<\\\\\\/p><p>Access to SAFe Community Portal<\\\\\\/p><p>Get trained by the Gold SPCT Partner of Scaled Agile<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"online_bootcamp\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Online Bootcamp\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>16 hours of online live interactive sessions<\\\\\\/p><p>Exam preparation with Mock Test<\\\\\\/p><p>Trained by experienced SAFe Consultant&nbsp;<\\\\\\/p><p>Hands on practical experience<\\\\\\/p><p>Earn 16 PDUs &amp; 16 SEUs<\\\\\\/p><p>SAFe DevOps exam Fees Included in training fee<\\\\\\/p><p>Course Material &amp; SAFe Studio Access<\\\\\\/p><p>Comprehensive Exam Support<\\\\\\/p><p>Access to SAFe Community Portal<\\\\\\/p><p>Get trained by the Gold SPCT Partner of Scaled Agile<\\\\\\/p>\\\"},\\\"corporate\\\":{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"level_name\\\":\\\"Corporate Training\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Flexible pricing &amp; billing options<\\\\\\/p><p>Private cohorts available<\\\\\\/p><p>Training progress dashboards<\\\\\\/p><p>Skills assessment &amp; benchmarking<\\\\\\/p><p>Platform integration capabilities<\\\\\\/p><p>Dedicated customer success manager<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}}\"', '12325', '[{\"image\":\"1758189712_ATP-badge-1x1.png\",\"text\":\"Project Management Institute\"}]', '4.8', '41545', '<p>Our training course comes with a 100% exam pass guarantee. Centuera believes in our highly effective blended learning methodology and its ability to provide learners with the knowledge and confidence to pass the PMP exam in the first attempt. If you do not clear the PMP exam on the first attempt, we will refund the course fee to you.</p>', '<p>100% money-back guarantee*</p><p>No questions asked refund*<br>At Centuera, we value the trust of our patrons immensely. But, if you feel that a course does not meet your expectations, we offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. Just send us a refund request via email within 7 days of purchase and we will refund 100% of your payment, no questions asked!</p>', '[\"16\",\"13\",\"12\",\"11\",\"10\",\"8\",\"5\",\"4\",\"1\"]', '2025-09-13 22:38:50', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', NULL);
INSERT INTO `courses_certifications` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1471, '3', 'What is PRINCE2?', '<p>PRINCE2 (an acronym for Projects IN Controlled Environments) is a de facto process-based method for effective project management. PRINCE2® is widely recognized and used in the private and public sectors. The credential is offered by an international project management association called Axelos in collaboration with various training partners. The PRINCE2® method is in the public domain and offers non-proprietary best practice guidance on project management.</p><p>An extension of the methodologies of PRINCE2, the PRINCE2 Agile concerns agile practices and agile project delivery. PRINCE2 Agile follows the same controlled approach of project management as focused by PRINCE2, but the only addition is more flexibility and adaptability in agile practices.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1472, '3', 'What are the benefits of having a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>Prince2&nbsp;Certification is a highly recognized and reputed qualification. Being a certified project management associate not only gives you a strong skill set to add to your resume but also considerably increases your talent for managing successful projects in a corporate environment. The skills you gain are industry-agnostic, helpful in managing different project environments, and have global appeal.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1473, '3', 'Are there any prerequisites for a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>No, there are no prerequisites; however, you must have cleared the PRINCE2® Foundation Exam. For detailed information on the application filing process, refer to the information on the&nbsp;PRINCE2 Certification Journey page.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1474, '3', 'What are the Job roles available after getting Prince2 certification?', '<p>Following certification and the successful completion of the Practitioner test, a qualified project manager can work in these lucrative positions:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Designation</th><th>Annual Salary:USA</th><th>Annual Salary:India</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Project Support Officer</td><td>$62,509</td><td>4.6 Lakhs</td></tr><tr><td>Senior Project Manager</td><td>$115,258</td><td>20.5 Lakhs</td></tr><tr><td>Certified Projects Director</td><td>$98,529</td><td>35.0 Lakhs</td></tr><tr><td>Program Manager</td><td>$118,977</td><td>18.7 Lakhs</td></tr><tr><td>Associate Project Manager</td><td>$68,083</td><td>10.6 Lakhs</td></tr><tr><td>Service Delivery Manager</td><td>$1,21,642</td><td>15.2 Lakhs</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1475, '3', 'What are the benefits of having a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>Prince2&nbsp;Certification is a highly recognized and reputed qualification. Being a certified project management associate not only gives you a strong skill set to add to your resume but also considerably increases your talent for managing successful projects in a corporate environment. The skills you gain are industry-agnostic, helpful in managing different project environments, and have global appeal.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1476, '3', 'What is PRINCE2?', '<p>PRINCE2 (an acronym for Projects IN Controlled Environments) is a de facto process-based method for effective project management. PRINCE2® is widely recognized and used in the private and public sectors. The credential is offered by an international project management association called Axelos in collaboration with various training partners. The PRINCE2® method is in the public domain and offers non-proprietary best practice guidance on project management.</p><p>An extension of the methodologies of PRINCE2, the PRINCE2 Agile concerns agile practices and agile project delivery. PRINCE2 Agile follows the same controlled approach of project management as focused by PRINCE2, but the only addition is more flexibility and adaptability in agile practices.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1584, '10', 'How can one achieve Scrum Developer® Certification?', '<p>The process for obtaining the CSD certification includes the following steps:</p><p><strong>Step one:</strong> understand the Scrum lifecycle and framework.</p><p><strong>Step two: </strong>participate in a two-day CSD training course conducted by a certified instructor.</p><p><strong>Step three: </strong>successfully complete the online exam for CSD certification provided by the Scrum Alliance.</p><p>To pass the exam, you need to answer 37 out of 50 questions correctly within the 60-minute time limit.</p><p>Once you pass the exam, you will need to complete a membership profile and submit a license agreement for the Scrum Alliance\'s approval.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(1585, '10', 'What is the price of CSD certification?', '<p>The cost of obtaining the Scrum Developer certification can fluctuate based on various factors, such as the certification level, the training provider, and the costs associated with the exam and renewal. You can get a rough estimate of the Scrum Developer certification costs for 2024 by referring to the table below:<br>The typical expense for CSD certification and training, which includes the CSD exam fee, ranges from $500 to $2,000. Several factors may influence the total cost of the CSD certification exam. Additionally, individuals are required to recertify every two years, with the recertification exam costing $100.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Type of Scrum Developer Certification</strong></th><th><strong>Scrum Developer Certification Exam Cost</strong></th><th><strong>Scrum Developer Certification Renewal Cost</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CSM</td><td><ul><li>Upto 2 attempts included in the course cost</li><li>Additional Retake Cost: $25</li></ul></td><td>$100 every 2 years</td></tr><tr><td>A-CSM</td><td><ul><li>Up to 2 attempts included in the course cost</li><li>Additional Retake Cost: $25</li></ul></td><td>$175 every 2 years</td></tr><tr><td>CSP-SM</td><td><ul><li>Up to 2 attempts included in the course cost</li><li>Additional Retake Cost: $25</li></ul></td><td>$250 every 2 years</td></tr><tr><td>DASM</td><td><ul><li>Up to 1 attempt included in the course cost</li><li>2 additional retakes: $150 per attempt</li></ul></td><td><p>$20 (PMI members)</p><p>$50 (non PMI members)</p></td></tr><tr><td>DASSM</td><td><ul><li>Up to 1 attempt included in the course cost</li><li>2 additional retakes: $150 per attempt</li></ul></td><td>$50 annually</td></tr><tr><td>PSM I</td><td><ul><li>Exam cost: $150</li><li>Unlimited attempts: $150 per attempt</li></ul></td><td>No renewal fee</td></tr><tr><td>PSM II</td><td><ul><li>Exam cost: $250</li><li>Unlimited attempts: $250 per attempt</li></ul></td><td>No renewal fee</td></tr><tr><td>PSM III</td><td><ul><li>Exam cost: $500</li><li>Unlimited attempts: $500 per attempt</li></ul></td><td>No renewal fee</td></tr><tr><td>RSM</td><td><ul><li>Upto 2 attempts included in the course cost</li><li>Additional Retake Cost: $25</li></ul></td><td>$50 annually</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(1586, '10', 'What are the prerequisites for obtaining the Certified Scrum Developer certification?', '<p>There are no specific prerequisites for taking the Certified Scrum Developer exam; however, candidates are required to complete a two-day CSD course and possess a basic understanding of agile principles and the Scrum framework.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(1587, '10', 'How can I become a Scrum Developer?', '<p>To achieve your Scrum Developer® certification, you need to complete the two-day CSD® certification course and successfully pass the CSM® exam. This course aims to enhance your comprehension of Scrum methodologies and their practical applications.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(2046, '9', 'What is ITIL®?', '<p>ITIL®, which stands for Information Technology Infrastructure Library, serves as a management framework designed for the delivery of IT services. It assists organizations in managing risks, planning effectively, optimizing incident management practices and digital strategies, and establishing a scalable IT environment that fosters business growth.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(2047, '9', 'What is ITIL certification?', '<p>ITIL certification serves to validate your qualifications for a position in IT. It highlights your knowledge and expertise in the best practices, processes, terminologies, and techniques associated with IT service management that are prevalent in contemporary IT.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(2048, '9', 'What is the ITIL 4 Foundation exam?', '<p>The ITIL 4 Foundation certification exam is an entry-level assessment and represents an excellent starting point for individuals seeking to test their skills within the ITIL framework for IT service management. This certification exam will evaluate your comprehension of the fundamental ITIL 4 principles, which encompass Lean, Agile, and DevOps concepts. The exam is accessible online, allowing you to take it at your convenience, which is particularly beneficial for busy IT professionals.<br>Our ITIL® 4 Certification Training course is specifically designed to assist you in understanding how to manage modern IT-enabled services. It encompasses essential concepts and common practices throughout the service lifecycle, equipping you with the knowledge and confidence necessary to successfully pass the ITIL certification exam on your first attempt.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(2049, '9', 'What advantages does ITIL certification offer?', '<p>Securing an ITIL certification can significantly enhance your career prospects. Some key benefits of the ITIL Foundation certification include:</p><ul><li>Improved Earnings: By acquiring new methodologies and skills, you will become more knowledgeable and valuable to an organization, thereby increasing your earning potential.</li><li>Enhanced Efficiency &amp; Effectiveness: ITIL frameworks are recognized for optimizing performance, which leads to improved competence and productivity.</li><li>Superior Risk Management: An ITIL certification equips you to effectively identify and manage risks. This includes controlling and mitigating risks while implementing cost-effective risk management strategies.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(2050, '9', 'Are ITIL certifications a worthwhile investment?', '<p>If you are aiming for mid to senior-level management roles, pursuing an ITIL certification is advisable. ITIL certifications significantly enhance your profile, increasing your earning potential and validating your skill set, making them a valuable investment in your career.&nbsp;<br>Our ITIL Certification Training course is designed to prepare you for the ITIL exam, paving the way for better career development opportunities.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(2051, '8', 'What are the requirements for the PMI Agile Certified Practitioner exam?', '<p>To be eligible for the PMI Agile Certified Practitioner Certification, you need to have:</p><ul><li>A secondary degree or higher</li><li>2000 hours of general project management experience within the last five years</li><li>A minimum of 1,500 hours of experience on agile project teams in the past three years</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2052, '8', 'Do you provide any practice tests as part of this course?', '<p>Yes, we offer one practice test within our course to help you prepare for the certification exam, ensuring you can succeed on your first try. Additionally, you can take this complimentary PMI-ACP® Exam Practice Test to get acquainted with the types of assessments included in the course curriculum and to prepare for the agile experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2053, '8', 'What are the steps to achieve PMI-ACP certification?', '<p>We have developed this step-by-step guide to assist you in obtaining PMI-ACP certification and enhancing your job prospects. Get Trained To achieve PMI-ACP certification, proper training is essential. There are numerous online and offline PMI-ACP training courses available for enrollment. Centuera\'s PMI-ACP Certification Training Course is among the best and most advanced options, perfect for beginners and novice agile trainers. Take The Exam After completing the training course and mastering the necessary concepts and skills, you must take the PMI-ACP exam. You need to submit your application to PMI.org to register for the PMI-ACP exam. Be sure to provide your contact information, educational background, and work experience. If you pass the PMI-ACP certification exam, you will receive the PMI-ACP certification to enhance your career. A score of approximately 70% is required to pass this exam. Once you successfully complete the Agile Certified Practitioner, PMI-ACP exam, you will be awarded the official PMI-ACP certification, which remains valid for three years.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2054, '8', 'Who should pursue the PMI-ACP certification?', '<p>Embracing an agile mindset allows teams to swiftly adjust to evolving situations and consistently enhance their processes. Therefore, anyone interested in gaining agile expertise and working as a disciplined agile scrum master can achieve the PMI-ACP certification. Here are some professionals who will greatly benefit from obtaining a PMI-ACP certification:</p><ul><li>Software Engineers</li><li>Product Managers</li><li>Team Leaders</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Development Team Members</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2055, '8', 'What knowledge and skills can you expect to acquire after completing the PMI-ACP course?', '<p>By applying agile methodologies, organizations can boost their adaptability, foster better team collaboration, and execute projects more effectively. Upon completing the PMI-ACP certification, you will acquire knowledge on various subjects, including the evolution of agile, best practices in agile, agile project management, agile principles, methodologies, frameworks, and processes. Additionally, you will learn about the three pillars of scrum, various agile approaches, the scrum framework, its functionality, and much more.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2056, '8', 'What career opportunities are available with a PMI-ACP certification?', '<p>Holding a PMI-ACP certification opens doors to a variety of career paths, such as:</p><ul><li>Agile Project Manager</li><li>Agile Coach</li><li>Software Project Manager</li><li>Certified ScrumMaster</li><li>Business Analyst</li><li>Kanban Coach</li><li>Product Developer</li><li>Software Engineer</li><li>Quality Assurance Tester</li><li>Agile Team Lead</li><li>IT Manager</li><li>Product Owner</li><li>Project Director</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2057, '8', 'What advantages does PMI-ACP certification offer?', '<p>There are several advantages to obtaining your PMI-ACP certification, which are outlined below:&nbsp;</p><ol><li>PMI-ACP certification is an internationally recognized credential that opens up employment opportunities with global companies.</li><li>The need for professionals holding PMI-ACP certification is quite significant, as numerous organizations are implementing agile practices and methodologies.</li><li>You will acquire comprehensive knowledge of agile principles along with various agile project management skills.</li><li>Holding a PMI-ACP certification will enhance your professional portfolio and help you differentiate yourself from other applicants.</li><li>Individuals with PMI Agile Certified Practitioner (ACP) certification tend to receive higher salary packages compared to those without this certification.</li><li>The PMI-ACP Agile Certified credential will provide job opportunities and enhance job security.</li><li>Experience in agile projects will equip you with essential skills in adaptability, teamwork, and delivering high-quality outcomes in fast-paced environments.</li></ol>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2058, '6', 'What certification will I receive after completing the Six Sigma Green Belt training?', '<p>After finishing this Six Sigma green belt training, you will receive a certificate from IASSC recognizing your professional achievement in Lean Six Sigma Green Belt. Additionally, Centuera will issue you a letter of attendance, as approved by IASSC.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2059, '6', 'How do I register for the online Lean Six Sigma green belt certification exam?', '<p>Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training Course aims to equip you with the knowledge and skills necessary to successfully pass the certification exam. To register for the exam, please follow these steps:</p><ol><li>Acquire your exam voucher from the official IASSC website. The voucher will be sent to your email.</li><li>Adhere to the instructions provided in the voucher to register for the testing environment. You will also have the option to select a date and time for your exam.</li><li>Access the testing environment 15 minutes prior to your scheduled exam.</li></ol>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2060, '6', 'How long does it take to receive my Six Sigma green belt certification?', '<p>After finishing the exam, you will receive your results through email within 1-2 days of completing the exam. Individuals who pass the certification exam will obtain certification from the International Association for Six Sigma Certification (IASSC).</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2061, '6', 'How many attempts do I have to pass the Lean Six Sigma Green Belt certification exam?', '<p>You cannot take the IASSC exams more than once in a two-week timeframe or more than three times in a three-month span. Each IASSC exam voucher is intended for single use only. If you do not pass the exam, you will need to purchase a new exam voucher by paying the re-examination fee to attempt the test again.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2062, '6', 'Do you provide any practice tests as part of this course?', '<p>Indeed, we offer one practice test included in our course to assist you in preparing for the real certification exam. You can take this Free Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Exam Practice Test to familiarize yourself with the kinds of tests included in the course curriculum.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2063, '6', 'How Long Does Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Last?', '<p>A Six Sigma Green Belt Certification remains valid for three years. While these certifications do not have an expiration date, they must be renewed every three years. To renew their certification, Six Sigma Green Belts are required to pay a nominal recertification fee of $235.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2064, '6', 'Are there any prerequisites for taking the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Green Belt exam?', '<p>There are no prerequisites necessary to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Green Belt exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2065, '6', 'What is the eligibility criteria to avail Centuera 100% Money back guarantee?', '<p>This money-back guarantee is exclusively applicable to Centuera’s instructor-led LSSGB training. It does not extend to Centuera’s Self-Paced Learning LSSGB courses. The guarantee is valid solely for participants who have paid the full enrollment fee.<br>The guarantee will be rendered void if:</p><ol><li>Participants are not permitted to take the IASSC-LSSGB examination until 45 days have passed since the certificate was unlocked.<br>1. Participants must achieve 100% attendance in at least one session of the 36-Hour Live Online Classroom Training.</li><li>Participants are required to finish the e-learning content, as a full online study (100% completion) is necessary to grasp the course materials.</li><li>Participants must score a minimum of 80% in any three of the seven online LSSGB simulation exams available at Centuera.com.</li><li>Participants are expected to adhere to the trainer\'s instructions and complete the exercises assigned during the online classroom training.</li><li>Participants must provide the necessary documents to Centuera.</li><li>Participants are required to request a refund within 15 days of receiving their results.</li></ol>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2066, '6', 'How To Get Certified In Six Sigma Green Belt?', '<p>To achieve Six Sigma Green Belt certification, you generally must finish a training program, pass an examination, and show your ability to apply Six Sigma methodologies. Numerous organizations provide certification courses, available both online and in-person, equipping you with the essential knowledge and skills for certification. Furthermore, acquiring hands-on experience through participation in Six Sigma projects can significantly improve your likelihood of successfully obtaining certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2067, '6', 'What certification will I receive after completing the Six Sigma Green Belt training?', '<p>After finishing this Six Sigma green belt training, you will receive a certificate from IASSC recognizing your professional achievement in Lean Six Sigma Green Belt. Additionally, Centuera will issue you a letter of attendance, as approved by IASSC.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2068, '6', 'How To Get Certified In Six Sigma Green Belt?', '<p>To achieve Six Sigma Green Belt certification, you generally must finish a training program, pass an examination, and show your ability to apply Six Sigma methodologies. Numerous organizations provide certification courses, available both online and in-person, equipping you with the essential knowledge and skills for certification. Furthermore, acquiring hands-on experience through participation in Six Sigma projects can significantly improve your likelihood of successfully obtaining certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2069, '7', 'How will I become a certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt professional?', '<p>To be eligible for the IASSC Lean Six Sigma Black Belt (LSSBB) Certification from Centuera, you must fulfill one of the following requirements:<br>Achieve 85% in Self-Learning</p><ul><li>Attend 80% of the classes in your chosen batch<br>Additionally, you need to complete all of the following:</li><li>Finish 1 Project</li><li>Pass 1 Simulation Test with a score of at least 60%<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2070, '7', 'Does the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification fee include examination fees as well?', '<p>The examination fee is not part of the course fee. For further information, please contact your course advisor.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2071, '7', 'What is the validity of my Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam voucher?', '<p>Exam vouchers remain valid for a period of one year from the date of purchase. If you fail to schedule the exam within one year of acquiring the voucher, you will be required to purchase the voucher again at the full price.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2072, '7', 'Can I ask for a refund of the exam voucher cost once it is issued to me?', '<p>The cost of the exam voucher is non-refundable once it has been issued, as it is obtained from external third-party organizations. Centuera does not control the policies or pricing associated with the vouchers.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2073, '7', 'Do you provide any practice tests as part of this Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course?', '<p>Yes, we offer one practice test included in our course to assist you in preparing for the real certification exam. You can take this complimentary Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam Practice Test to familiarize yourself with the types of assessments included in the course curriculum.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2074, '7', 'Are there any prerequisites for taking the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam?', '<p>No prerequisites are necessary to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam.<br>While it is advisable to complete Green Belt training, it is not a requirement.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2075, '7', 'What is the eligibility criteria to avail Centuera 100% Money back guarantee?', '<p>This money-back guarantee is exclusively applicable to Centuera’s Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt instructor-led Training. It does not extend to Centuera’s Self-Paced Learning Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt courses. The guarantee is only valid for those participants who have paid the full enrollment fee.<br>The guarantee will be rendered void if:</p><ol><li>Participants do not take the IASSC-LSSBB examination within 45 days after unlocking the certificate.</li><li>Participants do not maintain 100% attendance in at least one session of the 48 hours of Live Online Classroom Training.</li><li>Participants do not complete the e-learning content. Full online study (100% completion) is necessary to grasp the course materials.</li><li>Participants do not achieve a minimum score of 80% in any three of the available online LSSBB simulation exams on Centuera.com during their first attempt.</li><li>Participants do not schedule their exam within 6 months from their enrollment date.</li><li>Participants fail to adhere to the trainer\'s instructions and do not finish the exercises assigned during the online classroom training.</li><li>Participants do not provide the necessary documents to Centuera.</li><li>Participants do not request a refund within 15 days of receiving their results.</li></ol>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2076, '7', 'How long is the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification valid?', '<p>The IASSC Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification remains valid indefinitely. Nonetheless, it is advisable to engage in ongoing education and keep abreast of current industry practices.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2077, '7', 'What is the format of the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam?', '<p>The IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt examination is a closed-book test comprising 150 multiple-choice and true/false questions. The total time allotted for the exam is four hours.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2078, '7', 'What is the passing score for the IASSC Black Belt exam?', '<p>In order to successfully pass the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam, a minimum score of 70% is required.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2079, '7', 'How will I become a certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt professional?', '<p>To be eligible for the IASSC Lean Six Sigma Black Belt (LSSBB) Certification from Centuera, you must fulfill one of the following requirements:<br>Achieve 85% in Self-Learning</p><ul><li>Attend 80% of the classes in your chosen batch<br>Additionally, you need to complete all of the following:</li><li>Finish 1 Project</li><li>Pass 1 Simulation Test with a score of at least 60%<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2080, '7', 'Does the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification fee include examination fees as well?', '<p>The examination fee is not part of the course fee. For further information, please contact your course advisor.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2081, '7', 'What is the validity of my Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam voucher?', '<p>Exam vouchers remain valid for a period of one year from the date of purchase. If you fail to schedule the exam within one year of acquiring the voucher, you will be required to purchase the voucher again at the full price.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2082, '7', 'Can I ask for a refund of the exam voucher cost once it is issued to me?', '<p>The cost of the exam voucher is non-refundable once it has been issued, as it is obtained from external third-party organizations. Centuera does not control the policies or pricing associated with the vouchers.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2083, '7', 'Do you provide any practice tests as part of this Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course?', '<p>Yes, we offer one practice test included in our course to assist you in preparing for the real certification exam. You can take this complimentary Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam Practice Test to familiarize yourself with the types of assessments included in the course curriculum.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2084, '7', 'Are there any prerequisites for taking the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam?', '<p>No prerequisites are necessary to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam.<br>While it is advisable to complete Green Belt training, it is not a requirement.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2085, '7', 'What is the eligibility criteria to avail Centuera 100% Money back guarantee?', '<p>This money-back guarantee is exclusively applicable to Centuera’s Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt instructor-led Training. It does not extend to Centuera’s Self-Paced Learning Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt courses. The guarantee is only valid for those participants who have paid the full enrollment fee.<br>The guarantee will be rendered void if:</p><ol><li>Participants do not take the IASSC-LSSBB examination within 45 days after unlocking the certificate.</li><li>Participants do not maintain 100% attendance in at least one session of the 48 hours of Live Online Classroom Training.</li><li>Participants do not complete the e-learning content. Full online study (100% completion) is necessary to grasp the course materials.</li><li>Participants do not achieve a minimum score of 80% in any three of the available online LSSBB simulation exams on Centuera.com during their first attempt.</li><li>Participants do not schedule their exam within 6 months from their enrollment date.</li><li>Participants fail to adhere to the trainer\'s instructions and do not finish the exercises assigned during the online classroom training.</li><li>Participants do not provide the necessary documents to Centuera.</li><li>Participants do not request a refund within 15 days of receiving their results.</li></ol>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2086, '7', 'How long is the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification valid?', '<p>The IASSC Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification remains valid indefinitely. Nonetheless, it is advisable to engage in ongoing education and keep abreast of current industry practices.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2087, '7', 'What is the format of the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam?', '<p>The IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt examination is a closed-book test comprising 150 multiple-choice and true/false questions. The total time allotted for the exam is four hours.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2088, '7', 'What is the passing score for the IASSC Black Belt exam?', '<p>In order to successfully pass the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt exam, a minimum score of 70% is required.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(2126, '2', 'How to become CAPM®-certified?', '<p>To earn the CAPM® certification, you need to meet the basic requirements and follow a few key steps:</p><ul><li><strong>Meet the eligibility criteria</strong>: You’ll need a secondary degree along with 23 hours of project management training</li><li><strong>Apply for and take the exam</strong>: Submit your application through the PMI® website, then schedule and pass the CAPM exam</li><li><strong>Renew your certification</strong>: Every three years, complete the renewal process through PMI’s CCR program</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2127, '2', 'How long is CAPM certification valid?', '<p>The CAPM certification is valid for three years from the date you pass the exam. To maintain your certification, you must either retake the CAPM exam before it expires or fulfill PMI’s Continuing Certification Requirements (CCR) program. The CCR program involves earning Professional Development Units (PDUs) by participating in activities like training, workshops, or volunteering to stay current with the latest project management practices and skills.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2128, '2', 'Do you provide practice tests for CAPM course?', '<p>Yes, we provide two full-length mock tests as part of our CAPM certification course. These practice exams are closely aligned to the latest PMI-CAPM exam and based on the PMBOK® 7th Edition. They help you evaluate your readiness, spot areas for improvement, and build confidence before the exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2129, '2', 'How to apply for CAPM exam?', '<p>To apply for the CAPM exam, first create an account on the PMI website. Complete and submit the online application, providing your education and training details. After your application is approved, pay the exam fee and schedule your exam either online or at a testing center.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2130, '2', 'What is the eligibility criteria to avail Centuera 100% Money back guarantee?', '<ul><li>Participants should&nbsp;take the CAPM&nbsp;examination within 45 days of unlocking the certificate</li><li>Participants should&nbsp;maintain 100% attendance in at least one batch of the 24-Hour Live Online Classroom Training sessions.</li><li>Participants should&nbsp;score at least 80% in any of the 3&nbsp;available&nbsp;CAPM® mock&nbsp;practice tests present in your LMS.</li><li>Participants should&nbsp;follow the instructions of the trainer and should&nbsp;complete the exercises given in the online classroom training.</li><li>Participants should&nbsp;submit the required documents to Centuera</li><li>Participants should&nbsp;request a refund within 15 days of receiving their results</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2131, '2', 'How do you become a CAPM® certified professional?', '<p>To become a CAPM®-certified professional, you must undergo formal training from a registered, accredited organization like Centuera and pass the CAPM® exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2132, '2', 'What are the prerequisites for the CAPM® certification?', '<p>The prerequisites for the CAPM® certification are as follows:</p><ul><li>A secondary degree (high school diploma, associate’s degree, or the global equivalent)</li><li>23&nbsp;hours of project management training or 1,500 hours of professional project experience.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2133, '2', 'Do you provide practice tests for this CAPM® Certification Training Course?', '<p>Yes, we provide two mock test papers as part of our course to help you prepare for the actual certification exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2134, '2', 'What’s the validity period of the CAPM® certification?', '<p>CAPM® certification is valid for three years. To maintain your CAPM® certification status, you must renew your certification every three years. This entails completing 15 professional development units in each three-year period. The renewal fee is $60 for PMI® members and $150 for nonmembers.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2135, '2', 'How do I apply for the CAPM® certification after completing the course?', '<p>Upon completing the course, follow these steps to apply for the CAPM® certification:</p><ul><li>Register and log in to PMI®’s online system or use the printable CAPM® application form.</li><li>Verify you meet the eligibility criteria and prepare your application information.</li><li>Apply for PMI® membership before applying for the credential to benefit from member rates.</li><li>Submit your application and ensure your membership is confirmed to avoid additional fees.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(2150, '5', 'What are the prerequisites for the CSPO® certification?', '<p>There are no specific eligibility criteria for the CSPO certification. Any professional who wishes to obtain this Scrum certification is welcome to register for the CSPO training course.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2151, '5', 'Who provides the CSPO certification?', '<p>Scrum Alliance®, a non-profit membership organization dedicated to promoting the adoption and effective implementation of Scrum, provides CSPO certification. For further information, you can visit the Scrum Alliance website.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2152, '5', 'What is the process for becoming a CSPO?', '<p>Upon the successful completion of a two-day (16 hours) CSPO course led by a Certified Scrum Trainer® (CST®), you will be awarded a certificate from Scrum Alliance, officially recognizing you as a Certified Scrum Product Owner. Centuera is a Registered Education Ally (REA) of Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2153, '5', 'What are the responsibilities of a CSPO?', '<p>Here are some of the most common responsibilities of CSPOs:</p><ul><li>Identifying product characteristics through market analysis, customer needs, and business goals</li><li>Creating a flexible product development roadmap that effectively converts the product vision into specific tasks</li><li>Overseeing the product backlog while conveying requirements to the development team and accommodating any changes in priorities or features</li><li>Guaranteeing that product delivery occurs on schedule and stays within the designated budget</li><li>Serving as the intermediary between stakeholders and the development team</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2154, '5', 'What is the process for becoming a CSPO?', '<p>Upon the successful completion of a two-day (16 hours) CSPO course led by a Certified Scrum Trainer® (CST®), you will be awarded a certificate from Scrum Alliance, officially recognizing you as a Certified Scrum Product Owner. Centuera is a Registered Education Ally (REA) of Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2155, '5', 'Is there a Certified Scrum Product Owner exam?', '<p>There is no official exam for CSPO certification. You must complete the training course and get hands-on experience by working on real-world Scrum scenarios.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2156, '5', 'What career benefits does a CSPO certification provide?', '<p>A CSPO certification is highly sought-after worldwide. It testifies to a professional’s ability to lead an agile product development team in creating successful, customer-centric products and services. A CSPO certification opens many high-paying job opportunities to candidates.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2157, '5', 'What is the average Certified Scrum Product Owner salary?', '<p>A Certified Scrum Product Owner\'s salary will vary based on your company, professional work experience, location, etc. Here are some examples of CSPO salaries (including base pay and additional compensation):&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CSPO salary (India)&nbsp;</td><td>CSPO salary (US)</td><td>CSPO salary (UK)</td></tr><tr><td>₹12L - ₹18L</td><td>$127K - $202K</td><td>£46K - £76K</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(2192, '4', 'What is CSM Certification?', '<p>The Certified ScrumMaster (CSM®) certification is a designation given by Scrum Alliance® to entry-level Scrum practitioners who have completed a CSM course and passed the official exam. It testifies to a professional’s knowledge of Scrum terminologies, principles, and methods, and ability to apply them to real-world projects. Scrum Masters lead project team members in iterative processes to achieve the best results.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2193, '4', 'How long is a CSM certification valid for?', '<p>The CSM certification is valid for two years. After this period, certification holders must pay a renewal fee and earn Scrum Education Units (SEUs) through continuing education and professional development activities. These requirements ensure that certified Scrum Masters stay updated with the latest practices and principles of the methodology. Centuera is an official Registered Education Ally (REA) of the Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2194, '4', 'How to become a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Becoming a certified Scrum Master involves a combination of education, experience, and skills.&nbsp;Here\'s a brief explanation of the steps involved:</p><p><strong>Step one</strong>: Understand the Scrum framework, Agile principles, concepts, and lifecycles.</p><p><strong>Step two:</strong> Attend the two-day CSM training course by a certified Scrum Alliance training partner like Centuera.</p><p><strong>Step three: </strong>Pass the CSM certification online test conducted by the Scrum Alliance.</p><p>To pass the Scrum Master certification test, correctly answer at least 37 of the 50 questions within 60 minutes.&nbsp;Please ensure to check the pass criteria with your training provider during enrollment.&nbsp;Once you pass the Scrum Master certification exam, you must submit a license agreement to the Scrum Alliance and complete your membership profile to receive your Scrum certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2195, '4', 'What are the prerequisites for the Scrum Master certification?', '<p>To pursue the CSM certification, candidates must understand Scrum and Agile methodologies.&nbsp;While no specific prerequisites are required, having some experience working in a project management role or within a Scrum team can be beneficial and is often recommended.&nbsp;That being said, candidates must complete a Certified ScrumMaster® course conducted by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and pass the CSM® exam administered by the Scrum Alliance to earn the Scrum certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2196, '4', 'How many questions are there in the CSM certification exam?', '<p>The Scrum Master certification exam is based on the Scrum framework and has 50 multiple-choice questions. The passing score is 74%, or 37 correct answers.</p><p>The CSM certification, like the Agile and Scrum certification, enables professionals to enhance their proficiency in Agile and Scrum practices and allows them to be a Scrum Alliance Certified ScrumMaster for two years.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2197, '4', 'How many attempts do I have to pass the CSM certification exam?', '<p>You will have two chances to pass the Scrum certification exam within a 90-day period starting from when you receive your initial welcome email. If you fail the first CSM certification exam, the system will automatically activate your eligibility for the second attempt.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2198, '4', 'What are the benefits of earning a Certified ScrumMaster credential?', '<ul><li>Set yourself apart from the competition and increase your earning potential as a CSM</li><li>The Scrum Master certification is a significant professional milestone and helps ensure ongoing market relevance and demand</li><li>Gain a comprehensive knowledge of Scrum values and methodologies and proficiency in managing Scrum teams</li><li>Become an expert at prioritizing tasks and deliverables with the ability to assess and manage risks to drive project success</li><li>Acquire diverse skill sets through the Scrum Master certification, including enhanced communication skills for effective collaboration</li><li>Adopt a transformational Agile mindset and thrive as a Servant Leader in an Agile environment</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2199, '4', 'Why should I opt for Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera\'s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training provides course materials and exercises that allow you to propel your career to newer heights.</p><p>Here are some compelling reasons to select Centuera for your CSM certification journey:</p><ul><li>Get 16 hours of online training from Certified Scrum Trainers (CSTs)</li><li>Earn 16 SEUs and 20 PDUs toward your CSM certification training requirements</li><li>Engage in hands-on learning via exam simulations, role-plays, games, etc.</li><li>Avail the CSM fee, which is included in the course price</li><li>Get a two-year membership to the Scrum Alliance, and more</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2200, '4', 'What does a Certified ScrumMaster do?', '<p>A Certified ScrumMaster facilitates Agile project management within a team by guiding and coaching team members to understand the theory, rules, practices, and values in the Scrum framework.&nbsp;Such professionals help ensure the team follows Scrum practices and principles, removing any obstacles hindering progress.</p><p>Certified ScrumMasters organize and lead daily stand-ups, sprint planning meetings, and any additional retrospectives. They also act as mediators between the team and external stakeholders, protecting the team from outside interruptions and helping to maintain a productive work environment.&nbsp;Scrum certification validates their expertise in these critical roles within Agile project management.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2201, '4', 'What is covered under the 24/7 Support promise?', '<p>Centuera provides 24/7 support via email, chat, and phone for all your queries related to Scrum certification.&nbsp;Additionally, you will receive on-demand assistance through our dedicated team and community forum.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(2225, '16', 'Why Opt for Our CBAP® Course?', '<p><strong>Internationally Recognized Certification:</strong> Obtain CBAP® certification endorsed by IIBA®&nbsp;</p><p><strong>BABOK® Guide-Centric Curriculum:</strong> Learn from the latest BABOK® course syllabus</p><p><strong>Interactive Expert-Led Sessions: </strong>Gain insights directly from seasoned industry experts</p><p><strong>Hands-On Learning Methodology: </strong>Acquire practical skills through simulation tests and real-life case studies</p><p><strong>Adaptable Learning Formats:</strong> Crafted to accommodate working professionals for a more flexible educational experience</p><p>Take the next step towards becoming a sought-after business analyst</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2226, '16', 'What Will You Gain from the CBAP® Course?', '<p>The Certified Business Analysis Professional certification program provides a comprehensive guide to mastering advanced analytical skills. It is specifically designed for Indian professionals aiming to achieve a professional business analysis certification that addresses real-world business issues.</p><p>Our CBAP course syllabus is in line with the BABOK® Guide v3, encompassing:</p><ul><li>Planning and overseeing business analysis activities</li><li>Gathering, analyzing, and managing requirements</li><li>Overseeing the complete project lifecycle</li><li>Performing strategic analysis for business solutions</li><li>Assessing and enhancing solutions</li></ul><p>With live sessions, practical projects, and simulation tests, this CBAP certification training equips you with the knowledge needed to successfully pass the CBAP® exam on your first try.</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2227, '16', 'Why is the CBAP® Course Essential for Professionals?', '<p>With the increasing need for data-driven decision-making in various sectors, there is a high demand for certified business analysts. This CBAP certification enables seasoned professionals to validate their skills, distinguish themselves in competitive job markets, and secure higher-paying positions.</p><p>Benefits of Enrolling in the CBAP® Course</p><p><strong>Global Recognition: </strong>Obtain a credential that is respected worldwide, giving you an edge in the job market</p><p><strong>Industry-Relevant Skills:</strong> Acquire tools such as Power BI, Tableau, and Advanced Excel to enhance your analytical skills</p><p><strong>Career Advancement: </strong>Attain positions like Business Analyst Manager, Product Owner, and Project Manager in top companies</p><p>Advance your career with our CBAP® course and transform your professional path!</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2228, '16', 'What steps are involved in becoming a CBAP® certified professional?', '<p>The process to become a certified business analysis professional is straightforward:</p><p><strong>0. Enroll in a CBAP certification training program endorsed by IIBA®, such as Centuera</strong></p><p><strong>1. Join IIBA and submit your application for the CBAP exam</strong></p><p><strong>2. Pass the exam to receive your CBAP certification</strong></p><p>Excelling in business analysis planning and monitoring is vital for exam success and long-term career development.<br>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17');
INSERT INTO `courses_certifications` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(2229, '16', 'Is CBAP certification valuable?', '<p>Absolutely. Obtaining a CBAP certification confirms your expertise in business analysis, your leadership skills, and enhances your employability. According to IIBA, certified individuals earn an average of 13% more. This CBAP training enables you to refine your skills and differentiate yourself in competitive job market.</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2230, '16', 'What are the requirements for the CBAP Certification?', '<p>The CBAP course has the following prerequisites:</p><p>A minimum of 7,500 hours of work experience within the last 10 years</p><ul><li><strong>At least 3,600 hours in four of the six Business Analyst Body of Knowledge (BABOK) domains, with no less than 900 hours in each</strong></li><li><strong>A minimum of 35 hours of professional development in the last four years</strong></li><li><strong>Two references from a career manager, client, or CBA professional</strong></li><li><strong>A signed Code of Conduct</strong></li></ul><p>To find out more about CBAP Certification, please click here.</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2231, '16', 'Do you offer any practice tests as part of this CBAP certification course?', '<p>Yes, we include one practice test in our CBAP course to assist you in preparing for the certification exam. You can take this free CBAP Exam Prep Practice Test to familiarize yourself with the types of assessments included in the course curriculum. The practice test encompasses various subjects, such as \'requirements analysis and design definition\' and \'solution evaluation,\' to aid candidates in their exam preparation.</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2232, '16', 'How long is CBAP certification valid?', '<p>The CBAP certification remains valid for a period of three years from the date of the exam. To maintain its active status, you are required to re-validate your certification. Participating in continuous professional development is essential as part of the renewal process, ensuring that certified individuals stay informed about the latest trends and advancements in business analysis.</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2233, '16', 'What is the passing score for a CBAP certification?', '<p>The International Institute of Business Analysis (IIBA) does not reveal the passing score for the CBAP certification exam. Nevertheless, you should strive to achieve at least 75 percent across all modules. The exam is graded on a scale, and candidates must obtain a minimum number of correct answers to pass. The required passing score may fluctuate based on the exam\'s difficulty.</p>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2234, '11', 'What will I receive in the SAFe Certification Kit?', '<p>When a learner enrolls in an online SAFe Certification course with Centuera, the kit encompasses all the educational resources essential for successful completion. Learners who successfully pass the certification exam will obtain:</p><ul><li>SAFe Agilist Certificate</li><li>A digital badge for SAFe 4 Agilist to showcase your achievement.</li><li>A one-year certified membership as a SAFe Agilist, which grants access to the SA Community of Practice.</li><li>A guide for using the SAFe Agilist certification along with SA certification marks.</li><li>Access to a range of educational resources to assist you throughout your SAFe journey.</li><li>Remote-Learning Access</li><li>Virtual Classrooms</li><li>Mock Tests</li><li>24/7 Guidance and Support</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2235, '11', 'Will my certification expire?', '<p>Certifications are valid for one year from the date of issuance. To renew the certificate, an annual renewal fee of approximately USD 100 must be paid.<br>Certification can only be renewed within 90 days prior to the expiration date or after the expiration date.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2236, '11', 'What are the steps to obtain a Leading SAFe Agile Certification?', '<p>To achieve the SAFe® Agilist (Scaled Agile Framework® Agilist) designation, individuals must follow a series of steps to acquire the necessary education, training, and practical experience. Below is a detailed outline of the process to become a SAFe® Agilist:</p><ul><li>Register on Centuera</li><li>Enroll in the Leading SAFe® Course</li><li>Receive information regarding the exam and passing criteria</li><li>Take the SAFe® Agilist Exam</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2237, '11', 'What is the Exam Pattern for the SAFe certification exam? How many attempts will I have to pass the exam?', '<p>There are a total of 45 multiple-choice questions that must be completed within 1.5 hours. The SAFe Agilist exam can only be taken once. For each additional attempt, an exam fee of approximately $50 is required.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2238, '11', 'Why should you pursue SAFe certification?', '<p>The Scaled Agile Framework, or SAFe certification, is intended to provide individuals with the necessary knowledge and skills, such as lean agile transformation, lean agile mindset, and agile development, that are essential for implementing and leading agile practices in large organizations.<br>A SAFe certification can aid in the successful execution of lean enterprise strategies by equipping professionals with the expertise to enhance processes and promote a culture of continuous improvement.<br>Here are several reasons that support the decision to obtain SAFe certification:</p><ul><li>Demonstrating expertise</li><li>Career advancement</li><li>Increased salary potential</li><li>Networking opportunities within various SAFe community platforms</li><li>Enhanced organizational performance</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2239, '11', 'What are the eligibility criteria for SAFe® Agilist Certification?', '<p>There are specific prerequisites that must be met before pursuing a SAFe Agilist Certification. Some of these prerequisites include:</p><ul><li>The candidate must possess at least a diploma or an undergraduate degree from an accredited institution.</li><li>A minimum of five years of professional experience in roles related to software development and testing, project management, product management, business analysis, and other relevant fields.</li><li>Candidates should have a fundamental understanding of Agile Scrum and possess some experience in Agile practices.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2240, '11', 'Who provides the SAFe Agilist certification?', '<p>Scaled Agile, Inc. is the organization that offers SAFe, which is one of the most recognized frameworks for enterprise agility. It is the foremost provider of SAFe courses aimed at implementing Agile practices at the enterprise level.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2241, '15', 'What is the procedure to obtain the A-CSPO certification?', '<p><strong>Step 1: </strong>Register for the 16-Hour live training course offered by Centuera and participate in the informative sessions led by Scrum Alliance certified trainers.</p><p><strong>Step 2: </strong>After successfully finishing the course, accept a license agreement from Scrum Alliance.</p><p><strong>Step 3: </strong>Once you accept the license agreement, you can download your A-CSPO certificate. You are now officially a certified A-CSPO!</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2242, '15', 'Who is responsible for providing the A-CSPO certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is provided by Scrum Alliance, a globally recognized organization committed to assisting professionals, leaders, and organizations in adopting agile methodologies by comprehending its principles, processes, and values.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2243, '15', 'Is there an exam required for ACSPO Certification?', '<p>No examination is required for the ACSPO certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2244, '15', 'What are the requirements to enroll in the ACSPO course?', '<p>To qualify for the Advanced CSPO, you must possess an active CSPO® certification from Scrum Alliance®, along with demonstrating a minimum of one year of work experience relevant to the role of Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2245, '15', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to finish the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2246, '15', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner® (A-CSPO®) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera consistently garners positive feedback from its alumni regarding its Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner® (A-CSPO®) Certification Training. Participants commend its practical, hands-on methodology, curriculum aligned with industry standards, and knowledgeable instructors. Numerous users emphasize the significance of the internationally recognized certificates and the adaptable learning options available for working professionals. For a deeper insight into Centuera’s Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner® (A-CSPO®) Certification Training, you can visit the Centuera alumni review page.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2247, '15', 'What are the eligibility requirements to enroll in this Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner® (A-CSPO®) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera’s Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner® (A-CSPO®) Certification Training is ideally designed for both beginners and seasoned professionals. To qualify for enrollment in this course, candidates should possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. While a fundamental understanding of Scrum is advantageous, it is not a prerequisite. Previous work experience is not required.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2248, '14', 'What are the requirements for obtaining the Advanced Certified ScrumMaster certification?', '<p>To achieve an Advanced CSM, you need to have:</p><ol><li>A current CSM certification from Scrum Alliance®</li><li>At least one year of relevant work experience as a ScrumMaster (within the last 5 years).</li></ol>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2249, '14', 'What steps are involved in obtaining the Advanced Certified ScrumMaster certification?', '<p>Step 1: Complete training Enroll in the 2-day A-CSM training course offered by a Global Registered Education Provider of Scrum Alliance, such as Centuera. Upon successful completion of the course, you will receive a welcome email from Scrum Alliance. Step 2. Confirm experience Log into Scrum Alliance, fill out your profile, and agree to the License Agreement. Confirm a minimum of 12 months of Scrum Master experience (within the last five years). Step 3. Achieve Advanced-Certified Scrum Master status! Once your Scrum Master experience is validated, you can immediately download your A-CSM® certification! Congratulations, you are now an Advanced Certified Scrum Master!</p>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2250, '14', 'Is there an exam for the ACSM certification?', '<p>No examination is required for the ACSM certification. You only need to complete the 2-day training program and fulfill the eligibility requirements to obtain the certificate.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2251, '14', 'How can I renew my ACSM certification?', '<p>You must renew your A-CSM certification every two years. The renewal fee is $175, which will extend your credential for an additional two years from the expiration date. Additionally, you are required to obtain 30 Scrum Educational Units (SEUs) within the last two years, alongside the $175 renewal fee. You can acquire the necessary SEUs by participating in educational training or other learning opportunities. Renewing your ACSM certification will also automatically renew all your other Scrum Alliance certifications. To renew your ScrumMaster certification, you need to log in to the Scrum Alliance website. Visit this link for more details on the renewal process.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2252, '13', 'What are the prerequisites for this course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for this course, regardless of prior experience. However, the following recommendations are strongly advised for those planning to take the SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager certification exam:</p><ul><li>Attend a Leading SAFe course</li><li>Have experience working in a SAFe environment</li><li>Possess experience with Lean, Agile, or other relevant methodologies</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2253, '13', 'What will I receive in the SAFe Certification Kit?', '<p>Learners who successfully pass the SAFe® Product Owner/Product Manager certification exam will receive:</p><ul><li>A SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager certificate</li><li>A digital badge for online profiles as a SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager</li><li>A one-year certified membership as a SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager, which includes access to the POPM Community of Practice</li><li>A certification usage guide for SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager with POPM certification marks</li><li>Learning resources to assist you throughout your SAFe journey</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2254, '13', 'How many attempts do I have to pass the SAFe exam?', '<p>With this SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager certification course, you will have one attempt to pass the exam. The fee for the first exam is included in your course registration fee, provided it is taken within 30 days of completing the course.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2255, '13', 'How long is SAFE POPM valid for?', '<p>The SAFe POPM Certification is valid for one year from the date of certification. After this period, professionals must renew their certification to continue reaping its benefits, such as being recognized across industries as a certified SAFe Product Owner or Product Manager.&nbsp;<br>To renew the certification\'s validity, you can choose annual renewal fees that vary by country. There is no requirement to retake the SAFe POPM examination for certification renewal. The renewal costs differ, and here are the detailed prices:&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Country</td><td>Price of Certification Renewal</td></tr><tr><td>India</td><td>INR 16,500</td></tr><tr><td>USA</td><td>$195</td></tr><tr><td>UK</td><td>£160</td></tr><tr><td>Australia</td><td>AUD 310</td></tr><tr><td>Canada</td><td>CAD 270</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2256, '13', 'How challenging is the Safe POPM exam?', '<p>The level of difficulty for the SAFe POPM exam varies based on the candidate\'s knowledge and experience. While it is generally regarded as a moderate-level exam, it features knowledge-based questions designed to assess your understanding of the Scaled Agile Framework, Agile principles, and the SAFe environment.<br>Professionals and candidates who are well-versed in SAFe concepts and Lean Agile practices, and who have practical experience in Agile and SAFe environments, may find the POPM exam significantly easier. The exam consists of a total of 45 marks, and a score of 35, which equates to 77%, is required to pass and earn the certification.<br>Therefore, gaining professional experience that exposes you to real-world SAFe and Agile scenarios prior to taking the exam will facilitate the certification process. Conversely, for those with minimal or no familiarity with Agile and SAFe methodologies, the POPM exam can prove to be quite challenging.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2257, '12', 'What are the prerequisites for this course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for this course, regardless of prior experience. However, the following recommendations are strongly advised for those planning to take the SAFe Scrum Master (SSM) certification exam:</p><ul><li>Familiarity with Agile concepts and principles</li><li>Comprehension of Scrum, Kanban, and eXtreme Programming (XP)</li><li>Basic understanding of software and hardware development processes</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2258, '12', 'What will I receive as part of the SAFe Certification Kit?', '<p>Individuals who successfully pass the SAFe Scrum Master (SSM) certification exam will obtain:</p><ul><li>A SAFe Scrum Master certificate</li><li>A digital badge for online profiles as a SAFe Scrum Master</li><li>A one-year certified membership as a SAFe Scrum Master, which includes access to the SSM Community of Practice</li><li>A guide for using the SAFe Scrum Master certification with SSM certification marks</li><li>Educational resources to assist you throughout your SAFe journey</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2259, '12', 'How many attempts do I have to pass the SAFe exam?', '<p>With this SAFe Scrum Master certification course, you are allowed one attempt to pass the exam. The fee for the first exam is included in your course registration, provided it is taken within 30 days of completing the course.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2260, '12', 'If I fail the SAFe Scrum Master exam, how soon can I retake it?', '<p>If you do not pass the SAFe Scrum Master exam on your first attempt, you can take the second attempt (first retake) immediately. The third attempt requires a waiting period of 10 days, while the fourth attempt necessitates a 30-day wait. The cost of the first exam is included in the course registration fee if taken within 30 days of course completion. Each subsequent retake attempt incurs a fee of $50.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2261, '12', 'How do I get certified as a SAFe Scrum Master?', '<p>The certification process for becoming a SAFe Scrum Master involves three steps:</p><ul><li>Step One: Attend the Leading SAFe course.</li><li>Step Two: Take the SAFe Scrum Master online test provided by Scaled Agile.</li><li>Step Three: Achieve a passing score by correctly answering at least 33 out of 45 questions (73-percent passing score).</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2262, '12', 'How long is the SAFe Scrum Master Certification valid for?', '<p>The SAFe Scrum Master Certification remains valid for one year following the successful completion of your exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2263, '12', 'Who provides the certification?', '<p>The certification is offered by the esteemed organization, Scaled Agile.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2264, '12', 'What is the SAFe Scrum Master exam pattern and passing score?', '<p>The Certified SAFe Scrum Master (SSM) exam is conducted online and has a duration of 90 minutes. It consists of 45 multiple-choice questions, with each question worth one point. To pass the exam, you must score at least 33 out of 45, which equates to 73%.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2265, '12', 'What is the difficulty level of the SAFe Scrum Master exam?', '<p>The difficulty level of the Certified SAFe Scrum Master exam is categorized as intermediate to difficult. The questions are designed to assess your understanding of the SAFe framework and the responsibilities of a Scrum Master. If you have completed the SSM training course and adequately prepared for the exam, it should not pose a significant challenge.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2266, '12', 'How much does SAFe Scrum Master certification cost?', '<p>The registration fee for the Certified SAFe Scrum Master (SSM) certification course is USD 295. After the fourth attempt, a fee of USD 50 is required for each retake. To renew your SAFe Scrum Master certification, a renewal fee of USD 100 applies.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2397, '1', 'How do I get a PMP® certification ?', '<p>&nbsp;To get a PMP certification in India, you must :&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Meet the eligibility criteria set by PMI®<ul><li>Complete 35 hours of mandatory PMP training.&nbsp;</li><li>Apply for the PMP exam through the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.pmi.org/certifications/project-management-pmp\">official PMI website</a></li><li>Schedule the exam after application approval, and pass the exam</li></ul></li></ul>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2398, '1', 'Structure and format of the PMP exam', '<p>The PMP exam is conducted online as a computer-based test. It includes:</p><ul><li>Three exam domains: People (42%), Process (50%), and Business Environment (8%)</li><li>180 questions to be completed in 230 minutes, with a mix of multiple-choice, multiple-response, matching, hotspot, and limited fill-in-the-blank formats</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2399, '1', 'How do I apply for the PMP course online?', '<p>The enrollment process for the PMP course is easy and can be done in the following steps:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Those interested should apply through the online application form</li><li>The admission panel will shortlist candidates based on their application</li><li>Once confirmed, an admission offer is made, which can be accepted by paying the program fee.</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2400, '1', 'How to schedule PMP certification exam after training?', '<p>To schedule your PMP exam after training, first complete and get your application approved on the PMI® website. After approval, pay the exam fee, then schedule your exam through&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.pearsonvue.com/us/en/pmi.html\">Pearson VUE</a>, PMI’s official exam partner. You can choose between an in-person test center or an online proctored exam.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2401, '1', 'What is the PMI audit process for PMP candidates?', '<p>The PMI audit process is a random verification process to ensure the accuracy of information provided in the application. If selected, you must submit documents verifying your education, experience, and training within 90 days to complete the audit before the PMP exam approval.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2402, '1', 'Can I attend live online PMP certification classes?', '<p>Yes, we offer live online classes for the PMP certificate. The sessions are conducted by expert instructors and have flexible timings, making them an ideal choice for working professionals.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2403, '1', 'What tools and materials are in the PMP course?', '<p>In PMP Certification course:</p><ul><li>Tools: 12 full-length simulations, 500+ PMI-exclusive questions, and a question bank with over 1,500 questions</li><li>Study Materials: Video lessons, downloadable guides, and comprehensive content covering essential project management skills</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2404, '1', 'Are there prerequisites for the PMP certification exam?', '<p>Yes, candidates must have a secondary degree with 60 months of project management experience or a four-year degree with 36 months of experience. Additionally, 35 hours of formal project management training are required before applying for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2405, '1', 'Is the PMP training aligned with the latest PMBOK® Guide?', '<p>Yes, the project management professional training follows the latest PMBOK® Guide 7th edition. It covers the updated processes and best practices to prepare you for the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2406, '1', 'What are the PMP certification requirements?', '<p>You must meet specific education and experience requirements to qualify for the PMP certification. You can fulfill&nbsp;one of&nbsp;two sets of criteria:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>A four-year degree with at least 36 months of project management experience</li><li>35 hours of project management education</li></ul><p>Or</p><ul><li>A high school diploma with 60 months of project management experience</li><li>35 hours of project management education to become a project management professional.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Completing a PMP certification course can help you fulfill the educational requirement.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2407, '1', 'How long is the PMP certification valid for?', '<p>A PMP certification is valid for three years. After that, you can maintain your certification by earning the required professional development units (PDUs) to ensure your skills are up-to-date with current industry standards. You can earn your PDUs through continuing education from authorized training partners like Centuera and using examples of successful projects. This PMP training course will help you gain up to 35 of the 60 PDUs you need to maintain your certification.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2408, '1', 'What does the Centuera 100% money-back guarantee mean?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP® training course comes with a 100% money-back guarantee. It’s designed to provide learners with the knowledge and skills to pass the PMI-PMP exam on the first attempt. If you don’t pass the PMP exam, we will refund the course fee if you meet the following criteria:</p><ol><li>Participants should take the PMP examination within 45 days of unlocking the certificate</li><li>Participants should maintain 100% attendance in at least one batch of the 36-Hour Live Online Classroom Training sessions.</li><li>Participants should score at least 80% in any three of the available online PMP® simulation practice tests available at&nbsp;centuera.com.</li><li>Participants should follow the instructions of the trainer and should complete the exercises given in the online classroom training</li><li>Participants should submit the required documents to Centuera</li><li>Participants should request a refund within 15 days of receiving their results</li></ol>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2409, '1', 'How to schedule your examination after completing PMP certification training?', '<p>After completing your PMP certification training with Centuera and meeting the PMI eligibility requirements, you can schedule an exam appointment with PMI through your myPMI account. After you submit your request, you will get an email with instructions on testing centers and appointment choices. If you miss the email, log in to the myPMI portal to find the link.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2410, '1', 'Do you provide any practice tests as part of the PMP certification course?', '<p>Centuera provides 12 PMP test simulations in the PMP certification course to help you prepare for the official PMI exam. You’ll also get access to cheat sheets, over 500 PMI-related questions, study plans, and expert support for your exam application.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2411, '1', 'What’s the structure of the PMP certification examination?', '<p>The PMP certification exam consists of 200 multiple-choice questions, 25 of which are pretest questions that do not affect the final score and are used to test the validity of future examination questions.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2412, '1', 'How to schedule your examination after completing PMP certification training?', '<p>After completing your PMP certification training with Centuera and meeting the PMI eligibility requirements, you can schedule an exam appointment with PMI through your myPMI account. After you submit your request, you will get an email with instructions on testing centers and appointment choices. If you miss the email, log in to the myPMI portal to find the link.</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2413, '17', 'What is meant by SAFe DevOps?', '<p>According to the Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe), DevOps encompasses a collection of technical capabilities that enhance the delivery process. It facilitates organizational automation, integration, and communication while fostering a culture of shared accountability.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2414, '17', 'What is the format of the SAFe® DevOps Certification exam?', '<p>The exam consists of multiple-choice questions (with one or more correct answers). It includes 45 questions and has a duration of 90 minutes (one and a half hours). Candidates must achieve a score of 73%, which equates to answering 33 out of 45 questions correctly.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2415, '17', 'What is the retake policy if a candidate does not pass on the first attempt?', '<p>If a candidate fails the exam on their first attempt, the following retake policy applies:</p><p><strong>First retake - </strong>This can be taken immediately following the first unsuccessful attempt.</p><p><strong>Second retake - </strong>The first retake can be scheduled after a waiting period of ten days.</p><p><strong>Third retake - </strong>The second retake can be attempted after a 30-day interval.</p><p>However, candidates are required to pay a retake fee of $50.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2416, '17', 'What is the validity period of the DevOps certification?', '<p>The certification is valid for one year.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2417, '17', 'What is the cost for renewing the SAFe DevOps Certificate?', '<p>Each year, candidates must pay $195 to renew their SAFe DevOps certification.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2418, '17', 'Is obtaining a SAFe DevOps certification beneficial?', '<p>A SAFe® DevOps certification can enhance your resume, increase your earning potential, validate your understanding of development cycles, and prepare you for future career opportunities.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2419, '17', 'What skills are included in the SAFe® DevOps Certification Training?', '<ul><li>Developing DevOps knowledge from the ground up</li><li>Understanding the culture of teamwork and shared responsibility among team members</li><li>Identifying user needs and establishing a Continuous Delivery Pipeline</li><li>Improving the quality of deliverables through continuous testing</li><li>Ensuring security by conducting timely vulnerability assessments</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2420, '17', 'What is the main objective of the SAFe DevOps Certificate?', '<p>The main objective of SAFe DevOps within an organization is to identify business needs and provide value as required. It is crucial to ensure that all information security measures are implemented to facilitate continuous delivery.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2421, '17', 'Will I obtain any SAFe community membership with the training?', '<p>In line with the updated Scaled Agile guidelines, only those participants enrolling in their first SAFe course or the SPC course will be granted a one-year membership. Participants who have completed additional courses will receive a 60-day membership, irrespective of the status of their existing membership.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2422, '17', 'Is it possible to take the SAFe® 6 DevOps Practitioner (SDP) certification exam from any location?', '<p>Yes, the SAFe® 6 DevOps Practitioner certification exam can be taken online from any location. Upon finishing an accredited and reputable training course—such as one provided by Centuera—you will be given a link to access the exam via the SAFe® Community Platform. The exam is web-based, timed, and can be taken from the convenience of your home or office.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2423, '17', 'What career paths are available after obtaining SAFe DevOps Certification?', '<p>A SAFe® DevOps Certification enables professionals to explore various roles such as DevOps Engineer, Release Train Engineer, Agile Coach, Continuous Delivery Architect, or Site Reliability Engineer (SRE). Your expertise enhances the value flow throughout the software delivery processes, making you a vital team member for Agile transformations in large-scale organizations.</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52');
INSERT INTO `course_curriculums` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1286, '3', 'PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner 7th Edition', '<p>Introduction</p><ul><li>About PRINCE2®</li><li>About Projects</li><li>The PRINCE2® integrated environment</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1287, '3', 'PRINCE2 principles', '<p>Analyze the application of PRINCE2 principles</p>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1288, '3', 'Apply and tailor relevant aspects of PRINCE2 themes', '<ul><li>Business case theme</li><li>Organization theme</li><li>Quality theme</li><li>Plans theme</li><li>Risk theme</li><li>Change theme</li><li>Controlling progress</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1289, '3', 'Apply (and tailor) relevant aspects of PRINCE2 processes', '<ul><li>Starting up a project</li><li>Directing a project</li><li>Initiating a project</li><li>Controlling a stage</li><li>Managing product delivery</li><li>Managing a stage boundary</li><li>Closing a project</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(1344, '10', 'Course Content', '<p><strong>Module 1: Lean, Agile &amp; Scrum</strong></p><ul><li>Utilize Sprinting Backlog</li><li>Incremental value</li><li>Everyday Scrum</li><li>PBI attributes</li><li>Refinement of Product backlog</li><li>Measuring progress</li></ul><p><strong>Module 2: Team Collaboration and Dynamics</strong></p><ul><li>Working in Groups vs Teams</li><li>Effective teams</li><li>User interaction benefits</li><li>Collaborating with stakeholders</li></ul><p><strong>Module 3: Design and Architecture</strong></p><ul><li>Technical excellence</li><li>Design practice</li><li>Architecture</li></ul><p><strong>Module 4: Refactoring</strong></p><ul><li>Benefits</li><li>Definition</li></ul><p><strong>Module 5: Development Driven by Test</strong></p><ul><li>First-test approach</li><li>Agile VS Traditional</li><li>Refactor TDD cycle</li><li>Agile Test Approach</li></ul><p><strong>Module 6: Continuous Integration</strong></p><ul><li>Continuous Integration</li><li>CI and Scrum</li><li>Automat Test, Build, and Measure Pipelines</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(2388, '9', 'ITIL® 4 Foundation', '<p>Lesson 01 - Course Introduction</p><ul><li>1.01 Course Introduction</li></ul><p>Lesson 02 - Key Concepts of Service Management</p><p>Lesson 03 - Four Dimensions of Service Management</p><p>Lesson 04 - The ITIL Service Value System</p><p>Lesson 05 - The Service Value Chain</p><p>Lesson 06 - ITIL Management Practices</p><p>Lesson 07: Online Video Lectures</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(2389, '8', 'Lesson 1: Course Introduction', '<p>0.1 Course Introduction<br>0.2 Eligibility Requirements<br>0.3 Certification Fees and Renewal<br>0.4 About Our Course</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(2390, '6', 'Section 01: Course Introduction', '<p>Lesson 01: Course Introduction</p><ul><li>1.01 Course Introduction</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2391, '6', 'Section 02: Six Sigma and Organizational Goals', '<ul><li>Lesson 01 - Introduction to Six Sigma and Organizational Goals</li><li>Lesson 02: Six Sigma and Organizational Goals</li><li>Lesson 03: Lean Principles in the Organization</li><li>Lesson 04: Design for Six Sigma (DFSS) Methodologies</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2392, '6', 'Section 03: Define Phase', '<ul><li>Lesson 01 - Introduction to Define Phase</li><li>Lesson 02: Project Identification</li><li>Lesson 03: Voice of the Customer</li><li>Lesson 04: Project Management Basics</li><li>Lesson 05: Management and Planning Tools</li><li>Lesson 06: Business Results for Projects</li><li>Lesson 07: Team Dynamics and Performance</li><li>Lesson 09: Case Study</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2393, '6', 'Section 04: Measure Phase', '<ul><li>Lesson 01: Measure Phase</li><li>Lesson 02: Process Analysis and Documentation</li><li>Lesson 03: Probability and Statistics</li><li>Lesson 04: Collecting and Summarizing Data</li><li>Lesson 05: Statistical Distributions</li><li>Lesson 06: Measurement System Analysis</li><li>Lesson 07 Process and Performance Capability</li><li>Lesson 09: Case Study</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2394, '6', 'Section 05: Analyze Phase', '<ul><li>Lesson 01: Introduction to Analyze Phase</li><li>Lesson 02: Hypothesis Testing</li><li>Lesson 03: Exploratory Data Analysis</li><li>Lesson 05: Case Study</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2395, '6', 'Section 06: Improve Phase', '<ul><li>Lesson 01: Introduction to Improve Phase</li><li>Lesson 02: Design of Experiments</li><li>Lesson 03: Root Cause Analysis</li><li>Lesson 04: Lean Tools</li><li>Lesson 05: Selecting a Solution</li><li>Lesson 07: Case Study</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2396, '6', 'Section 07: Control Phase', '<ul><li>Lesson 01: Introduction to Control Phase</li><li>Lesson 02: Statistical Process Control (SPC)</li><li>Lesson 03: Control Plan</li><li>Lesson 04: Lean Tools for Process Control</li><li>Lesson 06: Case Study</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2397, '6', 'Section 08: Tips and Tricks', '<ul><li>Tips and Tricks</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2398, '6', 'Section 09: Practice Projects', '<ul><li>Practice Projects</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(2399, '7', 'Section 02: Define Phase', '<p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Lesson 01: The Basics of Six Sigma</p><ul><li>1.01 Introduction to Define Phase</li><li>1.02 Learning Objectives</li><li>1.03 Six Sigma</li><li>1.04 Lean</li><li>1.05 Sigma Shift</li><li>1.06 Yield</li><li>1.07 Continuous Improvement Process Evolution</li><li>1.08 Six Sigma Deliverables</li><li>1.09 Problem Solving Strategy</li><li>1.10 VOC Campaign</li><li>1.11 VOC Tools</li><li>1.12 VOB</li><li>1.13 VOE</li><li>1.14 KANO Analysis</li><li>1.15 Six Sigma Roles and Responsibilities</li><li>1.16 Project Champion and Master Black Belt</li><li>1.17 Black Belt and Yellow Belt</li><li>1.18 Drivers of Six Sigma</li><li><p>1.19 Key Takeaways</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Lesson 02: The Fundamentals of Six Sigma</p></li><li>2.01 Learning Objectives</li><li>2.02 Process</li><li>2.03 Project Charter</li><li>2.04 Critical to Quality (CTQ)</li><li>2.05 Cost of Poor Quality (COPQ)</li><li>2.06 Calculating COPQ</li><li>2.07 Pareto Analysis (80-20 rule)</li><li>2.08 Basic Six Sigma Metrics</li><li><p>2.09 Key Takeaways</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Lesson 03: Lean Six Sigma Projects</p></li><li>3.01 Learning Objectives</li><li>3.02 Selecting Lean Six Sigma Projects</li><li>3.03 Project Selection Roadmap</li><li>3.04 Project Charter: Elements</li><li>3.05 Project Charter: Business Case</li><li>3.06 Project Charter: Problem Statement</li><li>3.07 Project Charter: Goal Statement</li><li>3.08 Project Charter: Scope</li><li>3.09 Project Charter: Key Milestones</li><li>3.10 Project Charter: Team Selection</li><li>3.11 Tuckmans Stages of Team Formation</li><li>3.12 The RACI and RASIC Matrix</li><li>3.13 Expected Financial Benefits</li><li>3.14 Developing Project Metrics</li><li>3.15 Key Performance Indicator KPI</li><li>3.16 Financial Evaluation and Benefits Capture</li><li>3.17 Net Present Value NPV</li><li><p>3.18 Key Takeaways</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Lesson 04: The Lean Enterprise</p></li><li>4.01 Learning Objectives</li><li>4.02 Lean</li><li>4.03 Principles of Lean</li><li>4.04 Lean Methodology</li><li>4.05 Lean and Six Sigma</li><li>4.06 3Ms of Lean</li><li>4.07 Categories of Waste TIMWOODS</li><li>4.08 Category of Waste DOWNTIME</li><li>4.09 5S</li><li>4.10 Steps in 5S: Part One</li><li>4.11 Steps in 5S: Part Two</li><li>4.12 Key Takeaways</li><li>4.13 Activity</li><li>4.14 Solution</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
