(2527, '16', 'Lesson 03 - Planning and Monitoring in Business Analysis', '<ul><li>3.1 Overview of Planning and Monitoring in Business Analysis</li><li>3.2 Stakeholder Engagement Planning</li><li>3.3 Governance in Business Analysis Planning</li><li>3.4 Information Management in Business Analysis Planning</li><li>3.5 Identifying Business Analysis Needs</li><li>3.6 Assessment</li><li>3.7 Main Points</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
