(2531, '16', 'Lesson 07 - Requirements Analysis and Design Definition', '<ul><li>7.1 Overview of Requirements Analysis and Design Definition</li><li>7.2 Requirement Specification and Modeling</li><li>7.3 Requirement Verification</li><li>7.4 Requirement Validation</li><li>7.5 Requirements Architecture Definition</li><li>7.6 Design Options Definition</li><li>7.7 Value Analysis and Solution Recommendation</li><li>7.8 Assessment Quiz</li><li>7.9 Summary of Key Points</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2532, '16', 'Lesson 08 - Solution Evaluation', '<ul><li>8.1 Overview of Solution Evaluation</li><li>8.2 Solution Performance Measurement</li><li>8.3 Performance Measure Analysis</li><li>8.4 Evaluation of Solution Limitations</li><li>8.5 Evaluation of Enterprise Limitations</li><li>8.6 Recommendations for Enhancing Solution Value</li><li>8.7 Assessment Quiz</li><li>8.8 Summary of Key Points</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2533, '16', 'Lesson 09 - Agile Perspective', '<ul><li>9.1 Overview of Agile Perspective</li><li>9.2 Scope Modification</li><li>9.3 Business Analysis Scope</li><li>9.4 Techniques and Approaches</li><li>9.5 Planning and Monitoring in Business Analysis</li><li>9.6 Elicitation and Collaboration Techniques</li><li>9.7 Management of Requirements Life Cycle</li><li>9.8 Strategy Analysis</li><li>9.9 Requirements Analysis and Design Definition</li><li>9.10 Solution Evaluation</li><li>9.11 Assessment Quiz</li><li>9.12 Summary of Key Points</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2534, '16', 'Lesson 10 - Business Intelligence Perspective', '<ul><li>10.1 Overview of Business Intelligence Perspective</li><li>10.2 Scope Modification</li><li>10.3 Business Analysis Scope</li><li>10.4 Methodologies and Approaches</li><li>10.5 Core Competencies</li><li>10.6 Influence on Knowledge Areas</li><li>10.7 Assessment Quiz</li><li>10.8 Summary of Key Points</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2535, '16', 'Lesson 11 - Information Technology Perspective', '<ul><li>11.1 Overview of Information Technology Perspective</li><li>11.2 Scope Modification</li><li>11.3 Business Analysis Scope</li><li>11.4 Methodologies</li><li>11.5 Core Competencies</li><li>11.6 Influence on Knowledge Areas</li><li>11.7 Assessment Quiz</li><li>11.8 Summary of Key Points</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2536, '16', 'Lesson 12 - Business Architecture Perspective', '<ul><li>12.1 Overview of Business Architecture Perspective</li><li>12.2 Scope of Change</li><li>12.3 Scope of Business Analysis</li><li>12.4 Reference Models for Business Architecture</li><li>12.5 Essential Competencies</li><li>12.6 Effects on Knowledge Areas</li><li>12.7 Assessment</li><li>12.8 Key Insights</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2537, '16', 'Lesson 13 - Business Process Management Perspective', '<ul><li>13.1 Overview of Business Process Management Perspective</li><li>13.2 Scope of Change</li><li>13.3 Scope of Business Analysis</li><li>13.4 Frameworks, Methodologies, and Techniques</li><li>13.5 Essential Competencies</li><li>13.6 Effects on Knowledge Areas</li><li>13.7 Assessment</li><li>13.8 Key Insights</li><li>Case Study</li><li>Case Study Activity</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(2538, '11', 'Course Content', '<p>Lesson 01: An Introduction to the Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe)<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Thriving in the Digital Era<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SAFe as a Framework for Business Agility<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Seven Essential Competencies of Business Agility</p><p>Lesson 02: Adopting a Lean-Agile Mindset &amp; Comprehending SAFe Principles<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Lean-Agile Mindset<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Core Values of SAFe<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Lean-Agile Principles of SAFe</p><p>Lesson 03: Developing High-Performing Teams and Programs<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Establishing Cross-Functional Agile Teams<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Inherent Quality<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Structuring Agile Release Trains around Value Flow</p><p>Lesson 04: Engaging in Planning Interval (PI) Planning<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Elements of the Planning Interval</p><p>Lesson 05: Investigating, Implementing, and Delivering Value<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Customer Centricity and Design Thinking<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Prioritizing the Program Backlog<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PI Planning<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Developing on a Cadence; Releasing on Demand<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Creating a Continuous Delivery Pipeline with DevOps</p><p>Lesson 06: Guiding the Lean-Agile Enterprise<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Lean-Agile Principles</p><p>Lesson 07: Enabling a Lean Portfolio<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Defining a SAFe Portfolio<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Linking the Portfolio to Enterprise Strategy<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sustaining the Portfolio Vision<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Achieving the Portfolio Vision through Epics<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Setting Lean Budgets and Guardrails<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Creating Portfolio Flow</p><p>Lesson 08: Constructing Large Solutions &amp; Driving Change<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Leading by Example<br>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Driving the Change</p>', '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(2539, '15', 'Lesson 01: Exploring the Accountabilities and Responsibilities of a Product Owner', '<ul><li>Examine the significance of Product Ownership</li><li>Contemplate the mindset and behaviors of an effective Product Owner</li><li>Discuss a minimum of three potential effects on their stakeholder relationships and/or product that could arise if their Scrum Team embraced the latest definition of Scrum<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2540, '15', 'Lesson 02: Collaborating with Stakeholders', '<ul><li>Showcase at least three methods for engaging with stakeholders across multiple Sprints.</li><li>Provide two instances when the Product Owner should refrain from acting as the facilitator for the stakeholders.</li><li>Exhibit at least three techniques for facilitative listening.</li><li>Illustrate the use of at least two alternatives to open discussion.</li><li>Outline at least three strategies to assist stakeholders in reaching a final decision.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2541, '15', 'Lesson 03: Collaborating with Developers', '<ul><li>Clarify why the Product Owner must be wary of accumulating technical debt.</li><li>Enumerate at least three development practices that could enable their Scrum Team to produce a high-quality Increment and minimize technical debt each Sprint</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2542, '15', 'Lesson 04: Product Ownership Across Multiple Teams', '<ul><li>Identify at least two strategies for scaling Scrum</li><li>Recognize at least two methods for visualizing, managing, or mitigating dependencies</li><li>Discuss at least three advantages and disadvantages of feature teams versus component teams</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2543, '15', 'Lesson 05: Crafting Practical Product Strategies', '<ul><li>Analyze a real-world case of how product strategy is implemented and evolves over time within an agile organization.</li><li>Practice at least two methods to determine purpose or define strategy.<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2544, '15', 'Lesson 06: Advanced Product Planning and Forecasting', '<ul><li>Identify two cognitive biases that could affect the Product Owner’s ability to deliver business value effectively.</li><li>Evaluate the effectiveness of a Sprint Review in inspecting and adapting according to the Sprint Goal and the Increment(s) completed during the Sprint.</li><li>Try at least one method to integrate assumption validation into the Scrum framework.</li><li>Formulate at least two hypotheses regarding a target customer.</li><li>Design a strategy to test at least one hypothesis.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2545, '15', 'Lesson 07: Advanced Product Backlog Management', '<ul><li>Employ at least two techniques to model value and at least two methods to measure value.</li><li>Utilize a minimum of three techniques to prioritize a Product Backlog in alignment with a Product Goal.</li><li>Explain how the Product Owner can ensure that sufficient Product Backlog items are “ready” for the next Sprint.</li><li>Incorporate feedback from at least three different sources to create and refine Product Backlog items.</li><li>Experiment with at least two methods to enhance their Product Backlog refinement.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2546, '15', 'Lesson 08: Understanding Customers and Users', '<ul><li>Implement one technique to connect developers directly with customers and users.</li><li>Engage in at least two product discovery techniques.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2547, '15', 'Lesson 09: Advanced Validation of Product Assumptions', '<ul><li>Identify two cognitive biases that may hinder the Product Owner’s ability to effectively deliver business value.</li><li>Assess how effectively a Sprint Review was utilized to inspect and adapt based on the Sprint Goal and the Increment(s) completed during the Sprint.</li><li>Experiment with at least one method to incorporate assumption validation into the Scrum framework.</li><li>Formulate at least two hypotheses for a target customer.</li><li>Develop a plan to test at least one hypothesis.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2548, '15', 'Lesson 10: Managing the Product Backlog', '<ul><li>Employ a minimum of two methods to model value and at least two methods to assess value.</li><li>Utilize at least three strategies to prioritize a Product Backlog in alignment with a Product Goal.</li><li>Explain how the Product Owner can guarantee that a sufficient number of Product Backlog items are prepared for the next Sprint.</li><li>Incorporate feedback from at least three different sources to create and enhance Product Backlog items.</li><li>Test at least two approaches to enhance the refinement of their Product Backlog.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(2549, '14', 'Lesson 01: History of Agile', '<ul><li>4 Values and 12 Principles of Agile Manifesto</li><li>Scrum Alignment with Agile Values and Principles.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2550, '14', 'Lesson 02: Scrum Anti Patterns', '<ul><li>Description of Scrum Anti-patterns</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2551, '14', 'Lesson 03: Extreme Programming (XP)', '<ul><li>XP Overview</li><li>XP Framework</li><li>XP Feedback loops</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2552, '14', 'Lesson 04: Lean-Agile', '<ul><li>Definition and Explanation of Lean in Agile Environment</li><li>Lean Principles.</li><li>Lean Waste</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2553, '14', 'Lesson 05: Value Stream Map', '<p>Steps in Value stream Mapping</p>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2554, '14', 'Lesson 06: Kanban', '<p>Definition and Explanation of Kanban</p><p>Differences between Scrum and Kanban</p>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2555, '14', 'Lesson 07: Agile Facilitation', '<ul><li>Decision making through Facilitation</li><li>Frame of reference in Decision making</li><li>Definition of Frame of Reference</li><li>Facilitative Listening Skills</li><li>Decision Making Techniques</li><li>Dot Voting</li><li>Numbered Voting</li><li>Fist of Five</li><li>Roman Voting</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2556, '14', 'Lesson 08: Coaching', '<ul><li>ICF Coaching competencies</li><li>Coaching Focus Areas</li><li>Powerful questions</li><li>Goals</li><li>Actions</li><li>Commitment and Accountability</li><li>Reviewing Progress and Refocusing</li><li>Wrapping up Coaching</li><li>Grow coaching model</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2557, '14', 'Lesson 09: Training', '<ul><li>Qualities of Good Trainer</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2558, '14', 'Lesson 10: Services to the Scrum Team', '<p>Team Maturity Levels (Tuckman Ladder)</p><p>Team types vs. Authority levels</p><p>Self-Managing Teams</p><p>Difference between a “Team” and a “Group”</p><p>Assessing the Cross-functionality of the Developers</p><p>Dysfunctions of a team.</p><p>How to improve Team Performance</p><p>Conflict management</p><p>Conflict resolution techniques</p>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2559, '14', 'Lesson 11: Definition of Done', '<ul><li>Analysis of Definition of Done</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2560, '14', 'Lesson 12: Services to the Product Owner', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2561, '14', 'Lesson 13: Services to the Organization', '<ul><li>Impediments Management</li><li>Dependency Management</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2562, '14', 'Lesson 14: Scrum Mastery', '<ul><li>Build your Own Growth Plan</li><li>Beware of Myths vs. Facts</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(2563, '13', 'Lesson 01: Transitioning to a Product Owner/Product Manager within the SAFe framework', '<ul><li>SAFe for Lean Enterprises</li><li>Value Streams</li><li>The Lean-Agile Mindset</li><li>Duties of Product Owners and Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2564, '13', 'Lesson 02: Getting Ready for PI Planning', '<ul><li>PI Planning</li><li>The Product/Solution Vision</li><li>Solution and PI Roadmaps</li><li>Epics, Features, and Stories</li><li>The Definition of Done</li><li>Program Backlog and Kanban</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2565, '13', 'Lesson 03: Directing PI Planning', '<ul><li>Communicate the Vision</li><li>Set PI Objectives</li><li>Handle Dependencies</li><li>Manage Risks</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2566, '13', 'Lesson 04: Implementing Iterations', '<ul><li>User Stories and Story Maps</li><li>Iteration Planning</li><li>The Team Kanban</li><li>Backlog Refinement</li><li>Iteration Review and Iteration Retrospective</li><li>DevOps and Release on Demand</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2567, '13', 'Lesson 05: Carrying Out the Planning Interval', '<ul><li>The Product Owner (PO) Sync</li><li>The System Demo</li><li>The Innovation and Planning Iteration</li><li>Inspect and Adapt</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(2568, '12', 'Lesson 01: Introducing Scrum in SAFe', '<ul><li>Basic Agile Development Concepts</li><li>Scrum Basics</li><li>The Agile Team in a SAFe Enterprise</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2569, '12', 'Lesson 02: Characterizing the role of the Scrum Master', '<ul><li>Responsibilities of the Scrum Master</li><li>Characteristics of an Effective Scrum Master</li><li>High-performing Teams</li><li>Team Events</li><li>Coach the Agile Team Using Powerful Questions</li><li>Collaborate with Other Teams</li><li>Resolve Team Conflicts</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2570, '12', 'Lesson 03: Experiencing PI planning', '<ul><li>PI Planning Basics</li><li>Draft PI Plans</li><li>Final Plans and Business Value</li><li>Final Plan Review and PI Objectives</li><li>Facilitating PI Planning</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2571, '12', 'Lesson 04: Facilitating Iteration execution', '<ul><li>Plan the Iteration</li><li>Track the Iteration Progress</li><li>Refine the Backlog</li><li>Facilitate the Iteration Review</li><li>Facilitate Relentless improvement</li><li>Support DevOps and Release on Demand</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2572, '12', 'Lesson 05: Finishing the Planning Interval (PI)', '<ul><li>Coach the IP Iteration</li><li>Prepare the Team for the Inspect and Adapt Event</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2573, '12', 'Lesson 06: Coaching the Agile team', '<p>Techniques for Coaching the Agile Teams</p>', '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(2744, '1', 'Section 01: Course Introduction', '<p>Lesson 01: Course Introduction</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2745, '1', 'Section 02: Business Environment', '<p>Lesson 01: Foundation</p><p>Lesson 02: Strategic Alignment</p><p>Lesson 03: Project Benefits and Value</p><p>Lesson 04: Organizational Culture and Change Management</p><p>Lesson 05: Project Governance</p><p>Lesson 06: Project Compliance</p><p>Lesson 07: Case Study</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2746, '1', 'Section 03: Start the Project', '<p>Lesson 01: Identify and Engage Stakeholders</p><p>Lesson 02: Form the Team</p><p>Lesson 03: Build Shared Understanding</p><p>Lesson 04: Determine Project Approach</p><p>Lesson 05: Case Study</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2747, '1', 'Section 04: Plan the Project', '<p>Lesson 01: Planning Projects</p><p>Lesson 02: Scope</p><p>Lesson 03: Schedule</p><p>Lesson 04: Resources</p><p>Lesson 05: Budget</p><p>Lesson 06: Risks</p><p>Lesson 07: Quality</p><p>Lesson 08: Integrate Plans</p><p>Lesson 09: Case Study</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2748, '1', 'Section 05: Lead the Project', '<p>Lesson 01: Craft Your Leadership Skills</p><p>Lesson 02: Create a Collaborative Project Team Environment</p><p>Lesson 03: Empower the Team</p><p>Lesson 04: Support Team Member Performance</p><p>Lesson 05: Communicate and Collaborate with Stakeholders</p><p>Lesson 06: Training Coaching and Mentoring</p><p>Lesson 07: Manage Conflict</p><p>Lesson 08: Case Study</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2749, '1', 'Section 06: Support Project Team Performance', '<p>Lesson 01: Implement Ongoing Improvements</p><p>Lesson 02: Support Team Performance</p><p>Lesson 03: Evaluate Project Progress</p><p>Lesson 04: Manage Project Issues and Impediments</p><p>Lesson 05: Manage Project Changes</p><p>Lesson 06: Case Study</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2750, '1', 'Section 07: Close the Project Phase', '<p>Lesson 01: Project or Phase Closure</p><p>Lesson 02: Benefits Realization</p><p>Lesson 03: Knowledge Transfer</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2751, '1', 'Section 08: PMP Application Assistance', '<p>Lesson 01: PMP Application Assistance</p>', '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(2752, '17', 'Lesson 1: Introduction to DevOps', '<p>Identify the issue that needs resolution</p><p>Describe DevOps and its advantages</p><p>Discuss continuous security and testing</p><p>Outline the SAFe CALMR framework for DevOps</p>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2753, '17', 'Lesson 2: Value Stream Mapping', '<ul><li>Clarify the objective of mapping a Value Stream</li><li>Evaluate the condition of your development value stream</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2754, '17', 'Lesson 3: Continuous Exploration', '<ul><li>Formulate Solution hypotheses</li><li>Recap how to collaborate and investigate Customer requirements</li><li>Define the architecture of the Solution for continuous delivery</li><li>Illustrate how to consolidate Solution concepts into ART Backlog Features</li><li>Apply WSJF to prioritize a DevOps backlog</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2755, '17', 'Lesson 4: Continuous Integration', '<ul><li>Describe the process of developing the Solution</li><li>Recap the importance of continuous building</li><li>Strategize on how to conduct end-to-end testing</li><li>Summarize the staging process for Solution deployment</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2756, '17', 'Lesson 5: Continuous Deployment', '<ul><li>Recap the steps to deploy to production</li><li>Describe the verification process for the Solution</li><li>Plan for monitoring the Solution\'s health</li><li>Explain the approach to respond and recover</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(2757, '17', 'Lesson 6: Release on Demand', '<ul><li>Describe how to deliver value to Customers</li><li>Summarize the process of stabilizing the Solution</li><li>Explain how to assess business value</li><li>Recap the importance of learning from feedback and continuously improving</li></ul>', '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52');
