(32, '1', 'Can I retake the PMP exam if I fail on the first attempt?', '<p>Yes, you are permitted to retake the PMP exam if you do not succeed on your initial attempt. PMI allows a one-year eligibility window during which you can attempt the exam up to three times, with a fee applicable for each retake.</p>', '2025-09-06 21:57:50', '2025-09-06 21:56:49', '2025-09-06 21:57:50'),
