(67, '1', 'What is the validity and renewal process for the PMP certificate?', '<p>The PMP certificate remains valid for three years. To renew it, certified individuals must accumulate 60 Professional Development Units (PDUs) during this timeframe through activities such as training, webinars, and volunteering related to project management.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 21:59:49', '2025-09-06 22:00:52'),
(68, '1', 'Can I pursue this PMP training without prior PM experience?', '<p>Yes, you are able to enroll in the PMP training without any prior project management experience. However, to be eligible for the PMP exam, you must fulfill PMI’s eligibility criteria.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 21:59:49', '2025-09-06 22:00:52'),
(69, '1', 'How long will it take to finish this project management professional course?', '<p>The PMP course generally requires approximately 4 to 6 weeks for completion, contingent upon your learning speed and work commitments.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 21:59:49', '2025-09-06 22:00:52'),
