(74, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(75, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(76, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(77, '1', 'Can I retake the PMP exam if I fail on the first attempt?', '<p>Yes, you are permitted to retake the PMP exam if you do not succeed on your initial attempt. PMI allows a one-year eligibility window during which you can attempt the exam up to three times, with a fee applicable for each retake.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(78, '1', 'Is the PMP certification exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the fee for the PMP certification exam is not included in the course fee. You are required to pay it separately to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® when you apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(79, '1', 'Is this PMP course suitable for beginners or only for experienced professionals?', '<p>Yes, the Project Management Professional course is open to both beginners and seasoned professionals. However, it is essential to meet PMI’s experience and eligibility requirements to apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(80, '1', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training for PMP?', '<p>Yes, Centuera Learning Hub+ offers corporate training for PMP certification in India. Our programs are designed for teams or entire organizations, featuring flexible formats and customized content to assist professionals in enhancing their project management skills.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(81, '1', 'What is the validity and renewal process for the PMP certificate?', '<p>The PMP certificate remains valid for three years. To renew it, certified individuals must accumulate 60 Professional Development Units (PDUs) during this timeframe through activities such as training, webinars, and volunteering related to project management.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(82, '1', 'Can I pursue this PMP training without prior PM experience?', '<p>Yes, you are able to enroll in the PMP training without any prior project management experience. However, to be eligible for the PMP exam, you must fulfill PMI’s eligibility criteria.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(83, '1', 'How long will it take to finish this project management professional course?', '<p>The PMP course generally requires approximately 4 to 6 weeks for completion, contingent upon your learning speed and work commitments.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(84, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(85, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(86, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', NULL, '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:00:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51'),
(87, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(88, '1', 'What is included in this PMP certification training course?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP certification course comprises:</p><ul><li>Instruction delivered by PMI-authorized trainers</li><li>A curriculum that is in alignment with PMBOK® 7th Edition</li><li>More than 12 simulation examinations</li><li>Study aids and planning resources</li><li>Access to official digital materials from PMI</li><li>Specialized support for exam applications</li></ul><p>Masterclasses concentrating on the utilization of GenAI in project management</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(89, '1', 'What career opportunities exist after earning a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can seek employment across various industries such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Common roles include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(90, '1', 'What are the key learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will develop the competencies to plan, execute, and complete projects efficiently using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course will enhance your skills in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, preparing you to lead projects confidently and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(91, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(92, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(93, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
