(101, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(102, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(103, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', '<p>The PMP certification delivers extensive knowledge of project management principles, empowering professionals with the insights, techniques, and tools needed to address real-world project challenges. Globally recognized, PMP is regarded as the gold standard for career advancement in project management. Earning a Project Management Professional certification unlocks new opportunities and career progression across various industries.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(104, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(105, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:01:51', '2025-09-06 22:02:52'),
(106, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-06 22:04:50', '2025-09-06 22:02:52', '2025-09-06 22:04:50'),
