(690, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-06 23:12:12', '2025-09-08 20:12:27'),
(691, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-06 23:12:12', '2025-09-08 20:12:27'),
(692, '1', 'Is the PMP® exam fee included in the PMP certification fee?', '<p>No, the PMP certification exam fees are not encompassed within our PMP certification course. You are required to pay the exam fee directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® in order to take the exam. Should you require any assistance in completing the application form, please feel free to contact us via phone or chat.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-06 23:12:12', '2025-09-08 20:12:27'),
(693, '1', 'How can I obtain the PMP certification?', '<p>Upon successfully passing the PMP certification exam, you will receive your certificate package within a timeframe of six to eight weeks. Additionally, you will be issued a digital badge through Credly, which you can share on social media to celebrate your accomplishment.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-06 23:12:12', '2025-09-08 20:12:27'),
(694, '2', 'What is CAPM certification, and who should pursue?', '<p>The CAPM certification is a globally recognized credential offered by the Project Management Institute (PMI). In India, it is ideal for recent graduates, junior project managers, or professionals seeking structured CAPM training to advance in roles that require project coordination and planning.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:38:14', '2025-09-07 23:37:15', '2025-09-07 23:38:14'),
(695, '2', 'What is CAPM certification, and who should pursue?', '<p>The CAPM certification is a globally recognized credential offered by the Project Management Institute (PMI). In India, it is ideal for recent graduates, junior project managers, or professionals seeking structured CAPM training to advance in roles that require project coordination and planning.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:39:14', '2025-09-07 23:38:14', '2025-09-07 23:39:14'),
(696, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for, and how is it relevant in project management?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. It is an entry-level credential offered by PMI that helps professionals gain foundational project management knowledge. It is ideal for those new to the field and looking to build a career in project-based roles.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:39:14', '2025-09-07 23:38:14', '2025-09-07 23:39:14'),
(697, '2', 'What are the benefits of enrolling in a CAPM course for Indian professionals?', '<p>Enrolling in a CAPM course helps Indian professionals build a solid foundation in project management, improve job prospects, and earn global recognition from PMI. It also increases earning potential and prepares candidates for advanced certifications like PMP®.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:39:14', '2025-09-07 23:38:14', '2025-09-07 23:39:14');
