(711, '2', 'What is the average salary of a Certified Associate in Project Management?', '<p>Professionals who earn the Certified Associate in Project Management (CAPM) certification in India can expect competitive salaries based on their experience and role. Typical annual salary ranges include:</p><ul><li>Entry-level: ₹3,00,000 to ₹6,00,000&nbsp;</li><li>Mid-level (1–5 years): ₹6,00,000 to ₹10,00,000</li></ul><p>Senior roles: ₹15,00,000 or more<br>Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=Certified_Associate_in_Project_Management_(CAPM)/Salary\">Payscale</a></p>', '2025-09-07 23:47:16', '2025-09-07 23:42:14', '2025-09-07 23:47:16'),
