(716, '2', 'What is the average salary of a Certified Associate in Project Management?', '<p>Professionals who earn the Certified Associate in Project Management (CAPM) certification in India can expect competitive salaries based on their experience and role. Typical annual salary ranges include:</p><ul><li>Entry-level: $25,000 to $50,000</li><li>Mid-level (1–5 years): $35,000 to $80,000</li></ul><p>Senior roles: $10,00,000 or more<br>Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=Certified_Associate_in_Project_Management_(CAPM)/Salary\">Payscale</a></p>', '2025-09-07 23:48:16', '2025-09-07 23:47:16', '2025-09-07 23:48:16'),
(717, '2', 'What job roles or designations are available after earning the CAPM certification?', '<p>After earning the CAPM certification in India, professionals can apply for roles such as:</p><ul><li>Project Coordinator</li><li>Project Associate</li><li>Junior Project Manager</li><li>PMO Analyst</li><li>Operations Associate</li><li>Business Analyst (Entry-level)</li><li>Project Scheduler</li></ul>', '2025-09-07 23:48:16', '2025-09-07 23:47:16', '2025-09-07 23:48:16'),
