(743, '2', 'What is the duration and question format of the CAPM certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM certification exam lasts three hours and includes 150 multiple-choice questions with no negative marking, designed to assess both theoretical knowledge and practical understanding.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:50:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15'),
(744, '2', 'Are there CAPM online courses available for working professionals?', '<p>Yes, many online CAPM courses are designed for working professionals. These courses offer flexible schedules, including self-paced learning and live weekend or evening sessions. They follow PMI guidelines and provide the required 23 hours of project management education, helping learners balance work and study.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:50:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15'),
(745, '2', 'What’s next after completing the CAPM certification course — should I go for PMP?', NULL, '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:50:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15'),
(746, '2', 'What is CAPM certification, and who should pursue?', '<p>The CAPM certification is a globally recognized credential offered by the Project Management Institute (PMI). In India, it is ideal for recent graduates, junior project managers, or professionals seeking structured CAPM training to advance in roles that require project coordination and planning.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(747, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for, and how is it relevant in project management?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. It is an entry-level credential offered by PMI that helps professionals gain foundational project management knowledge. It is ideal for those new to the field and looking to build a career in project-based roles.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(748, '2', 'What are the benefits of enrolling in a CAPM course professionals?', '<p>Enrolling in a CAPM course helps Indian professionals build a solid foundation in project management, improve job prospects, and earn global recognition from PMI. It also increases earning potential and prepares candidates for advanced certifications like PMP®.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(749, '2', 'How does the CAPM certification differ from the PMP in terms of scope and eligibility?', '<p>To understand which certification fits best, here’s a breakdown of CAPM and PMP in terms of scope and eligibility:<br><strong>CAPM</strong>:</p><ul><li>Scope: Basic project management knowledge for beginners.</li><li>Eligibility: Secondary degree and 23 hours of project management training.</li></ul><p><strong>PMP:</strong></p><ul><li>Scope: Advanced project management skills for experienced professionals.</li><li>Eligibility: Four-year degree with 3+ years of experience and 35 hours of training, or secondary degree with 5+ years of experience and 35 hours of training.</li></ul>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(750, '2', 'What is the average salary of a Certified Associate in Project Management?', '<p>Professionals who earn the Certified Associate in Project Management (CAPM) certification in India can expect competitive salaries based on their experience and role. Typical annual salary ranges include:</p><ul><li>Entry-level: $25,000 to $50,000</li><li>Mid-level (1–5 years): $35,000 to $80,000</li></ul><p>Senior roles: $10,00,000 or more<br>Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=Certified_Associate_in_Project_Management_(CAPM)/Salary\">Payscale</a></p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(751, '2', 'What job roles or designations are available after earning the CAPM certification?', '<p>After earning the CAPM certification in India, professionals can apply for roles such as:</p><ul><li>Project Coordinator</li><li>Project Associate</li><li>Junior Project Manager</li><li>PMO Analyst</li><li>Operations Associate</li><li>Business Analyst (Entry-level)</li><li>Project Scheduler</li></ul>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(752, '2', 'Is the CAPM course suitable for freshers or only for professionals with experience?', '<p>The CAPM course is ideal for freshers and those new to project management. It does not require prior work experience and helps build foundational knowledge, making it a good starting point for:</p><ul><li>Recent graduates seeking a project management career</li><li>Entry-level professionals aiming to boost their qualifications</li><li>Individuals looking to transition into project-related roles</li></ul>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(753, '2', 'Is the CAPM certification worth it for entry-level project management professionals?', '<p>Yes, completing the CAPM course and earning a certification is valuable for beginners. It enhances your resume, helps you qualify for entry-level project roles, and prepares you for advanced certifications, such as PMP.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(754, '2', 'What is the duration and question format of the CAPM certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM certification exam lasts three hours and includes 150 multiple-choice questions with no negative marking, designed to assess both theoretical knowledge and practical understanding.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(755, '2', 'Are there CAPM online courses available for working professionals?', '<p>Yes, many online CAPM courses are designed for working professionals. These courses offer flexible schedules, including self-paced learning and live weekend or evening sessions. They follow PMI guidelines and provide the required 23 hours of project management education, helping learners balance work and study.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(756, '2', 'What’s next after completing the CAPM certification course — should I go for PMP?', '<p>After completing the CAPM certification course, pursuing the PMP certification is recommended once you gain the required project management experience. PMP is suited for professionals managing more complex projects and offers advanced knowledge and better career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(757, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. In project management, CAPM validates foundational knowledge and skills in project management practices and methodologies.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
(758, '2', 'What is the difference between CAPM® & PMP®?', NULL, '2025-09-07 23:52:14', '2025-09-07 23:51:15', '2025-09-07 23:52:14'),
