(790, '2', 'Is the CAPM® course difficult to learn?', '<p>The CAPM® course can be challenging, especially if you\'re new to project management concepts, as it covers a broad range of topics like processes, terminology, and frameworks from the PMBOK® guide. Centuera has selected industry experts who have rich teaching experience as instructors for this CAPM® course. They have a background in project management and offer a structured learning approach. They are aware of the varying learning needs of students and explain the concepts in an easy-to-understand way. So, you will not find the course difficult to follow.</p>', '2025-09-07 23:54:15', '2025-09-07 23:53:15', '2025-09-07 23:54:15'),
