(1072, '2', 'Are there CAPM online courses available for working professionals?', '<p>Yes, many online CAPM courses are designed for working professionals. These courses offer flexible schedules, including self-paced learning and live weekend or evening sessions. They follow PMI guidelines and provide the required 23 hours of project management education, helping learners balance work and study.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:51:31', '2025-09-08 00:12:26', '2025-09-10 21:51:31'),
(1073, '2', 'What’s next after completing the CAPM certification course — should I go for PMP?', '<p>After completing the CAPM certification course, pursuing the PMP certification is recommended once you gain the required project management experience. PMP is suited for professionals managing more complex projects and offers advanced knowledge and better career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:51:31', '2025-09-08 00:12:26', '2025-09-10 21:51:31'),
(1074, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. In project management, CAPM validates foundational knowledge and skills in project management practices and methodologies.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:51:31', '2025-09-08 00:12:26', '2025-09-10 21:51:31'),
(1075, '2', 'What is the difference between CAPM® & PMP®?', '<p>The main difference between CAPM® (Certified Associate in Project Management) and PMP® (Project Management Professional) lies in their target audience and level of expertise. CAPM® is designed for entry-level project managers or those with limited experience, focusing on basic project management concepts. PMP®, offered by&nbsp;the Project Management Institute,&nbsp;on the other hand, is for experienced professionals, requiring a deeper understanding of advanced project management techniques and leadership skills. PMP® certification generally holds more value in the industry due to its higher level of difficulty and experience prerequisites.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:51:31', '2025-09-08 00:12:26', '2025-09-10 21:51:31'),
(1076, '2', 'How many questions are there in the CAPM® certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM® certification exam&nbsp;covers 150 questions, out of which 15 questions are considered as pre-test questions used for future tests and are not scored. You will not be communicated about these questions; they are randomly chosen. Therefore, you should answer all 150 questions with the same seriousness.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:51:31', '2025-09-08 00:12:26', '2025-09-10 21:51:31'),
(1077, '2', 'What\'s next after CAPM® Certification?', '<p>After completing the CAPM®&nbsp;certification&nbsp;training&nbsp;program, you can take the PMP® certification training, Digital Project Manager, or PMP® Plus program. At the next level, you have Prince2® certification training, MSP® Foundation and Practitioner, Prince2® Agile Foundation and Practitioner and best of all, you can get the Project Management Certification (PGP in Project Management) program.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:51:31', '2025-09-08 00:12:26', '2025-09-10 21:51:31'),
(1078, '2', 'Is the CAPM® course difficult to learn?', '<p>The CAPM® course can be challenging, especially if you\'re new to project management concepts, as it covers a broad range of topics like processes, terminology, and frameworks from the PMBOK® guide. Centuera has selected industry experts who have rich teaching experience as instructors for this CAPM® course. They have a background in project management and offer a structured learning approach. They are aware of the varying learning needs of students and explain the concepts in an easy-to-understand way. So, you will not find the course difficult to follow.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:51:31', '2025-09-08 00:12:26', '2025-09-10 21:51:31'),
(1079, '3', 'How do I get a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>To obtain the PRINCE2 certification, you need to follow these steps:</p><ul><li>Firstly, you must pass the&nbsp; PRINCE2 foundation-level exam, which is a 1-hour online exam with objective questions. The level of this exam is pretty basic, and anyone can take it.</li><li>Then, you must pass the PRINCE2 practitioner-level exam, which is 2.5 hours long and has objective questions. Since it is an advanced-level exam, you will be required to have at least some basic knowledge of project management.</li><li>Upon passing the respective exams, the PRINCE2 certificate is issued by AXELOS.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 00:33:23', '2025-09-08 00:32:23', '2025-09-08 00:33:23'),
(1080, '3', 'How do I get a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>To obtain the PRINCE2 certification, you need to follow these steps:</p><ul><li>Firstly, you must pass the&nbsp; PRINCE2 foundation-level exam, which is a 1-hour online exam with objective questions. The level of this exam is pretty basic, and anyone can take it.</li><li>Then, you must pass the PRINCE2 practitioner-level exam, which is 2.5 hours long and has objective questions. Since it is an advanced-level exam, you will be required to have at least some basic knowledge of project management.</li><li>Upon passing the respective exams, the PRINCE2 certificate is issued by AXELOS.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:33:23', '2025-09-08 00:34:22'),
(1081, '3', 'How many questions are there in the PRINCE2 Foundation and Practitioner Certification Exams, respectively?', '<p>The PRINCE2 Foundation Exam has a total of 60 questions that must be answered in 60 minutes.</p><p>The PRINCE2 Practitioner Exam has a total of 70 questions that must be answered in 150 minutes.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:33:23', '2025-09-08 00:34:22'),
(1082, '3', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment if necessary. We will refund the Prince2 course price after deducting an administration fee. To learn more, please read our&nbsp;Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:33:23', '2025-09-08 00:34:22'),
(1083, '3', 'What is included in the Prince2 training?', '<p>In Prince2 training, you’ll get access to our e-learning content, practice simulation tests, and tips and tricks videos that help you tackle the toughest exam questions. You will also get an online participant handbook that cross-references the e-learning material to reinforce your learning.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:33:23', '2025-09-08 00:34:22'),
(1084, '3', 'How do I get a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>To obtain the PRINCE2 certification, you need to follow these steps:</p><ul><li>Firstly, you must pass the&nbsp; PRINCE2 foundation-level exam, which is a 1-hour online exam with objective questions. The level of this exam is pretty basic, and anyone can take it.</li><li>Then, you must pass the PRINCE2 practitioner-level exam, which is 2.5 hours long and has objective questions. Since it is an advanced-level exam, you will be required to have at least some basic knowledge of project management.</li><li>Upon passing the respective exams, the PRINCE2 certificate is issued by AXELOS.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
(1085, '3', 'How many questions are there in the PRINCE2 Foundation and Practitioner Certification Exams, respectively?', '<p>The PRINCE2 Foundation Exam has a total of 60 questions that must be answered in 60 minutes.</p><p>The PRINCE2 Practitioner Exam has a total of 70 questions that must be answered in 150 minutes.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
(1086, '3', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment if necessary. We will refund the Prince2 course price after deducting an administration fee. To learn more, please read our&nbsp;Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
(1087, '3', 'What is included in the Prince2 training?', '<p>In Prince2 training, you’ll get access to our e-learning content, practice simulation tests, and tips and tricks videos that help you tackle the toughest exam questions. You will also get an online participant handbook that cross-references the e-learning material to reinforce your learning.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
(1088, '3', 'I’d like to learn more about this Prince2 training program. Who should I contact?', '<p>Contact us using the form on the right of any page on the Centuera website or select the Live Chat link. Our customer service representatives can provide you with more details about the Prince2 training program.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
(1089, '3', 'What industries use PRINCE2 Methodology most?', '<p>As PRINCE2 is a project management framework, it is not linked to a particular sector or company. You can use them in any company, sector, or form of project. PRINCE2® can help you gain a rewarding career in IT, manufacturing, finance, health care, and other fascinating industries.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1090, '3', 'Which companies hire PRINCE2 Certified Project Managers?', '<p>Companies such as Shell, BP, Transpower, IBM, HP, Aquasoft, Getronics, and Siemens, which have adopted PRINCE2 and PRINCE2® qualified professionals, are entitled to an average annual compensation of $97,915. Build your project management expertise with our PRINCE2® certification and take advantage of the high demand across industries.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
(1091, '3', 'What is the pay scale of PRINCE2 Professionals across the world?', '<p>According to the project management salary survey, the professional certification provides a 20 percent premium in typical earnings. The PRINCE2 qualification can improve your career and, above all, your earning potential. Let\'s see the average annual salary of PRINCE2 professionals across the world according to the<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=PRINCE2_(Projects_In_Controlled_Environments)/Salary\">&nbsp;PayScale</a>&nbsp;report:</p><ul><li>India: 2m</li><li>US: $99k</li><li>UK: £45k</li><li>Japan: ¥8m</li><li>Singapore: S$96K</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
(1092, '3', 'What is the Projects in Controlled Environments (PRINCE2) Certification?', NULL, '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:34:22', '2025-09-08 00:35:22'),
