(1100, '3', 'What is the pay scale of PRINCE2 Professionals across the world?', '<p>According to the project management salary survey, the professional certification provides a 20 percent premium in typical earnings. The PRINCE2 qualification can improve your career and, above all, your earning potential. Let\'s see the average annual salary of PRINCE2 professionals across the world according to the<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=PRINCE2_(Projects_In_Controlled_Environments)/Salary\">&nbsp;PayScale</a>&nbsp;report:</p><ul><li>India: 2m</li><li>US: $99k</li><li>UK: £45k</li><li>Japan: ¥8m</li><li>Singapore: S$96K</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 00:37:23', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:37:23'),
(1101, '3', 'What is the Projects in Controlled Environments (PRINCE2) Certification?', '<p>The PRINCE2, or ‘Projects IN Controlled Environments\' certification, is a process-based project management method that offers a systematic approach to delivering a successful project with clear templates, processes, and steps. The certification is both process and project-focused.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:37:23', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:37:23'),
(1102, '3', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not affect your ability to complete the course. With our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can watch the recorded session of any missed class at your convenience. This allows you to stay up-to-date with the course content and meet the necessary requirements to progress and earn your certificate. Simply visit the Centuera learning platform, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance marked.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:37:23', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:37:23'),
(1103, '3', 'What do people think about Centuera’s PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner?', '<p>Centuera is highly regarded for offering valuable, career-boosting education. The&nbsp;PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner&nbsp;offers a well-structured and industry-relevant curriculum.<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Centuera testimonials&nbsp;and alumni reviews talk highly about the comprehensive course content, practical learning approach, and experienced instructors. The flexibility of the programs allows professionals to upskill while balancing work and personal commitments.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:37:23', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:37:23'),
(1104, '3', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner?', '<p>Centuera’s<strong>&nbsp;</strong>PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner<strong>&nbsp;</strong>is best suited for newcomers and experienced professionals. To be eligible to enroll in this course, applicants must have<strong>&nbsp;</strong>a bachelor\'s degree in any relevant field.<strong>&nbsp;</strong>A basic understanding of Project management&nbsp;is preferred but is not mandatory. Prior working experience is not compulsory.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:37:23', '2025-09-08 00:35:22', '2025-09-08 00:37:23'),
(1105, '3', 'How do I get a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>To obtain the PRINCE2 certification, you need to follow these steps:</p><ul><li>Firstly, you must pass the&nbsp; PRINCE2 foundation-level exam, which is a 1-hour online exam with objective questions. The level of this exam is pretty basic, and anyone can take it.</li><li>Then, you must pass the PRINCE2 practitioner-level exam, which is 2.5 hours long and has objective questions. Since it is an advanced-level exam, you will be required to have at least some basic knowledge of project management.</li><li>Upon passing the respective exams, the PRINCE2 certificate is issued by AXELOS.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 00:38:22', '2025-09-08 00:37:23', '2025-09-08 00:38:22'),
(1106, '3', 'How many questions are there in the PRINCE2 Foundation and Practitioner Certification Exams, respectively?', '<p>The PRINCE2 Foundation Exam has a total of 60 questions that must be answered in 60 minutes.</p><p>The PRINCE2 Practitioner Exam has a total of 70 questions that must be answered in 150 minutes.</p>', '2025-09-08 00:38:22', '2025-09-08 00:37:23', '2025-09-08 00:38:22'),
