(1326, '3', 'What industries use PRINCE2 Methodology most?', '<p>As PRINCE2 is a project management framework, it is not linked to a particular sector or company. You can use them in any company, sector, or form of project. PRINCE2® can help you gain a rewarding career in IT, manufacturing, finance, health care, and other fascinating industries.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:36:37', '2025-09-08 01:01:00', '2025-09-08 22:36:37'),
