(1328, '3', 'What is the pay scale of PRINCE2 Professionals across the world?', '<p>According to the project management salary survey, the professional certification provides a 20 percent premium in typical earnings. The PRINCE2 qualification can improve your career and, above all, your earning potential. Let\'s see the average annual salary of PRINCE2 professionals across the world according to the<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=PRINCE2_(Projects_In_Controlled_Environments)/Salary\">&nbsp;PayScale</a>&nbsp;report:</p><ul><li>India: 2m</li><li>US: $99k</li><li>UK: £45k</li><li>Japan: ¥8m</li><li>Singapore: S$96K</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 22:36:37', '2025-09-08 01:01:00', '2025-09-08 22:36:37'),
(1329, '3', 'What is the Projects in Controlled Environments (PRINCE2) Certification?', '<p>The PRINCE2, or ‘Projects IN Controlled Environments\' certification, is a process-based project management method that offers a systematic approach to delivering a successful project with clear templates, processes, and steps. The certification is both process and project-focused.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:36:37', '2025-09-08 01:01:00', '2025-09-08 22:36:37'),
(1330, '3', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not affect your ability to complete the course. With our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can watch the recorded session of any missed class at your convenience. This allows you to stay up-to-date with the course content and meet the necessary requirements to progress and earn your certificate. Simply visit the Centuera learning platform, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance marked.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:36:37', '2025-09-08 01:01:00', '2025-09-08 22:36:37'),
(1331, '3', 'What do people think about Centuera’s PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner?', '<p>Centuera is highly regarded for offering valuable, career-boosting education. The&nbsp;PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner&nbsp;offers a well-structured and industry-relevant curriculum.<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Centuera testimonials&nbsp;and alumni reviews talk highly about the comprehensive course content, practical learning approach, and experienced instructors. The flexibility of the programs allows professionals to upskill while balancing work and personal commitments.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:36:37', '2025-09-08 01:01:00', '2025-09-08 22:36:37'),
(1332, '3', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner?', '<p>Centuera’s<strong>&nbsp;</strong>PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner<strong>&nbsp;</strong>is best suited for newcomers and experienced professionals. To be eligible to enroll in this course, applicants must have<strong>&nbsp;</strong>a bachelor\'s degree in any relevant field.<strong>&nbsp;</strong>A basic understanding of Project management&nbsp;is preferred but is not mandatory. Prior working experience is not compulsory.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:36:37', '2025-09-08 01:01:00', '2025-09-08 22:36:37'),
(1333, '4', 'How do I enroll for this CSM certification training?', '<p>You can enroll for this CSM certification training on our website and make an online payment using any of the following options:&nbsp;</p><p>Visa Credit or Debit Card</p><p>MasterCard</p><p>American Express</p><p>Diner’s Club</p><p>PayPal&nbsp;</p><p>Once payment is received, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access information about the scrum master certification exam via email.</p>', '2025-09-08 01:32:51', '2025-09-08 01:31:50', '2025-09-08 01:32:51'),
