(1335, '4', 'Is the CSM certification fee included in my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The scrum master certification and evaluation fees, are included in the cost of this course, along with the costs of course materials and learning aids.</p>', '2025-09-08 01:33:51', '2025-09-08 01:32:51', '2025-09-08 01:33:51'),
