(1535, '4', 'What is Global Teaching Assistance?', '<p>Our teaching assistants are a dedicated team of subject matter experts here to help you get certified as a data analyst on your first attempt. They engage students proactively to ensure the course path is followed and help you enrich your learning experience, from class onboarding to project mentoring and job assistance. Teaching Assistance is available during business hours.</p>', '2025-09-08 01:51:51', '2025-09-08 01:51:16', '2025-09-08 01:51:51'),
