(1554, '4', 'What is the review of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera continually receives positive reviews from its alumni for its Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training. Learners praise its practical, hands-on approach, industry-aligned curriculum, and expert instructors. Many users highlight the value of the globally recognized certificates and the flexible learning options that suit working professionals. You can check out the Centuera alumni review page to get a better understanding of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training.</p>', '2025-09-08 01:53:02', '2025-09-08 01:51:51', '2025-09-08 01:53:02'),
