(1691, '4', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)?', '<p>To be eligible for this&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), applicants should have a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant field. Centuera’s&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)&nbsp;can be taken up by newcomers and experienced professionals. Though prior knowledge of&nbsp;ScrumMaster&nbsp;is helpful, it is not compulsory. Additionally, there is no requirement for previous work experience.</p>', '2025-09-08 18:49:47', '2025-09-08 02:13:59', '2025-09-08 18:49:47'),
(1692, '5', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:40:10', '2025-09-08 02:39:05', '2025-09-08 02:40:10'),
(1693, '5', 'What are the job opportunities/roles available after getting a CSPO certification?', '<p>Organizations are actively seeking skilled Agile professionals to manage their projects, indicating a strong demand for CSPO experts. Additionally, anyone can register for the CSPO certification program to become an agile professional. However, it is particularly beneficial for individuals in the following roles: Product Analyst, Release Engineer, Scrum or Agile Coach, Software Development Manager, Senior Software Project Manager, and Technical Program Manager. With adequate experience, one may also qualify for a C-level executive position.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:40:10', '2025-09-08 02:39:05', '2025-09-08 02:40:10'),
(1694, '5', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:40:10', '2025-09-08 02:41:11'),
(1695, '5', 'What are the job opportunities/roles available after getting a CSPO certification?', '<p>Organizations are actively seeking skilled Agile professionals to manage their projects, indicating a strong demand for CSPO experts. Additionally, anyone can register for the CSPO certification program to become an agile professional. However, it is particularly beneficial for individuals in the following roles: Product Analyst, Release Engineer, Scrum or Agile Coach, Software Development Manager, Senior Software Project Manager, and Technical Program Manager. With adequate experience, one may also qualify for a C-level executive position.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:40:10', '2025-09-08 02:41:11'),
(1696, '5', 'Who are the instructors for this Certified Scrum Product Owner training course, and how were they selected?', '<p>The trainers for this CSPO course are certified Scrum trainers who possess extensive professional and teaching experience.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:40:10', '2025-09-08 02:41:11'),
(1697, '5', 'What is covered under the 24/7 support promise?', '<p>Our dedicated team is ready to support you via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums.<br>On-demand assistance is provided to help you navigate the CSPO certification course, ensuring an optimal experience during your educational journey.<br>After completing the CSPO certification training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:40:10', '2025-09-08 02:41:11'),
(1698, '5', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:42:12', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:42:12'),
(1699, '5', 'What are the job opportunities/roles available after getting a CSPO certification?', '<p>Organizations are actively seeking skilled Agile professionals to manage their projects, indicating a strong demand for CSPO experts. Additionally, anyone can register for the CSPO certification program to become an agile professional. However, it is particularly beneficial for individuals in the following roles: Product Analyst, Release Engineer, Scrum or Agile Coach, Software Development Manager, Senior Software Project Manager, and Technical Program Manager. With adequate experience, one may also qualify for a C-level executive position.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:42:12', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:42:12'),
(1700, '5', 'Who are the instructors for this Certified Scrum Product Owner training course, and how were they selected?', '<p>The trainers for this CSPO course are certified Scrum trainers who possess extensive professional and teaching experience.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:42:12', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:42:12'),
(1701, '5', 'What is covered under the 24/7 support promise?', '<p>Our dedicated team is ready to support you via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums.<br>On-demand assistance is provided to help you navigate the CSPO certification course, ensuring an optimal experience during your educational journey.<br>After completing the CSPO certification training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:42:12', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:42:12'),
(1702, '5', 'Which companies hire CSPO professionals?', '<p>Organizations are always on the lookout for Certified Scrum Product Owners to manage their Scrum and Agile initiatives. Notable companies such as Google, Apple, Facebook, Yahoo, Spotify, Adobe, Amazon, HSBC, Salesforce, Netflix, Lego, IBM, Deloitte, and Siemens actively recruit CSPO experts.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:42:12', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:42:12'),
(1703, '5', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at a time that suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:42:12', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:42:12'),
(1704, '5', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-08 02:42:12', '2025-09-08 02:41:11', '2025-09-08 02:42:12'),
