(1855, '5', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at a time that suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:20:41', '2025-09-08 03:00:00', '2025-09-08 22:20:41'),
(1856, '5', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:20:41', '2025-09-08 03:00:00', '2025-09-08 22:20:41'),
(1857, '5', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a related discipline. Centuera\'s Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training is available for both beginners and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of scrum is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for prior work experience.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:20:41', '2025-09-08 03:00:00', '2025-09-08 22:20:41'),
(1858, '6', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee?', '<p>Yes. We provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.<br>Refund Process: If you do not pass the exam on your first attempt, Centuera will refund the entire course fee to you. To obtain a refund, you need to request it via the Help and Support Online. You must include a copy of your scorecard along with the date you completed your online classroom training. Centuera will issue the refund within 30 days of receiving all necessary documentation. The refund will be processed using the same payment method you used for the course.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:28:56', '2025-09-08 03:27:57', '2025-09-08 03:28:56'),
(1859, '6', 'Do you offer Minitab training?', '<p>Yes. We provide Minitab online training as a separate package.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-08 03:28:56', '2025-09-08 03:27:57', '2025-09-08 03:28:56'),
