(1862, '6', 'What tools do I need to attend the training sessions?', '<p>To participate in six sigma green belt training, you will require the following tools:</p><ul><li>Windows: Windows XP SP3 or a later version</li><li>Mac: OSX 10.6 or a later version</li><li>Internet speed: Ideally 512 Kbps or faster</li><li>Headset, speakers, and microphone: It is essential to have headphones or speakers for clear audio instructions, along with a microphone for communication. You may opt for a headset that includes a microphone or use separate speakers and a microphone.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 03:29:55', '2025-09-08 03:28:56', '2025-09-08 03:29:55'),
