(1866, '6', 'If I cancel my enrollment, will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:30:58', '2025-09-08 03:29:55', '2025-09-08 03:30:58'),
