(1882, '6', 'What is the pay scale of Six Sigma Professional across the world?', '<p>The significance of Six Sigma levels is increasing across various industries. Consequently, our Six Sigma certification provides you with a competitive advantage in the market. Salaries for Six Sigma professionals vary globally based on factors such as location, industry, experience, and certifications. The average earnings of Six Sigma specialists around the world are:</p><ul><li>US: $107,500 (according to Salary.com)</li><li>India: 949k (according to PayScale.com)</li><li>Canada: $126,055 (according to Glassdoor)</li><li>UK: £42k (according to PayScale.com)</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 03:33:55', '2025-09-08 03:33:07', '2025-09-08 03:33:55'),
