(1891, '6', 'Can I use the PDUs (Professional Development Units) earned from this course for other certifications?', '<p>Indeed, the 35 PDUs obtained from this course can contribute to the maintenance of other professional certifications, including the PMP.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:35:08', '2025-09-08 03:33:55', '2025-09-08 03:35:08'),
(1892, '6', 'Does Centuera have corporate training solutions?', '<p>Indeed, Centuera for Business provides educational solutions focused on the latest AI technologies and other digital competencies, including industry-recognized certifications. For talent development strategies, we collaborate with Fortune 500 companies as well as mid-sized enterprises, offering concise skill-based certification training and tailored role-specific learning paths. Additionally, we present a comprehensive learning library featuring unlimited live and interactive resources—Centuera Learning Hub+, which is available to your entire workforce. Our team of curriculum consultants partners with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that most effectively address their teams\' needs.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:35:08', '2025-09-08 03:33:55', '2025-09-08 03:35:08'),
