(1905, '6', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee?', '<p>Yes. We provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.<br>Refund Process: If you do not pass the exam on your first attempt, Centuera will refund the entire course fee to you. To obtain a refund, you need to request it via the Help and Support Online. You must include a copy of your scorecard along with the date you completed your online classroom training. Centuera will issue the refund within 30 days of receiving all necessary documentation. The refund will be processed using the same payment method you used for the course.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
