(1907, '6', 'What tools do I need to attend the training sessions?', '<p>To participate in six sigma green belt training, you will require the following tools:</p><ul><li>Windows: Windows XP SP3 or a later version</li><li>Mac: OSX 10.6 or a later version</li><li>Internet speed: Ideally 512 Kbps or faster</li><li>Headset, speakers, and microphone: It is essential to have headphones or speakers for clear audio instructions, along with a microphone for communication. You may opt for a headset that includes a microphone or use separate speakers and a microphone.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1908, '6', 'If I cancel my enrollment, will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1909, '6', 'What is the recommended learning path after completing Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification?', '<p>To enhance your career prospects, you might want to pursue a Post Graduate Program in Lean Six Sigma, which will help you become an expert in this area.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1910, '6', 'What are the job roles available after getting a Six Sigma certification?', '<p>An increasing number of organizations, regardless of their size, are employing Six Sigma professionals as either full-time staff or consultants. Upon obtaining our Six Sigma Certification, there are numerous lucrative career paths to explore. The specific job titles associated with Six Sigma vary based on the needs of the organization. Some potential positions include:</p><ul><li>Six Sigma Analyst</li><li>Business Process Manager</li><li>Six Sigma Consultant</li><li>Lead Analyst/Project Manager</li><li>Director of Operational Excellence</li><li>Senior Project Manager</li><li>Functional Project Lead</li><li>Six Sigma Projects Manager</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1911, '6', 'Which companies hire Six Sigma Experts?', '<p>Centuera\'s Six Sigma certification offers candidates an enhanced professional perspective. It\'s important to be inquisitive about the types of companies seeking Six Sigma professionals. Below is a curated list of the leading recruiters for Six Sigma in India and internationally:</p><ul><li>TCS</li><li>Accenture</li><li>UnitedHealth Group</li><li>HCL</li><li>McKesson Corporation</li><li>Genpact</li><li>Honeywell</li><li>IBM</li><li>Volkswagen</li><li>EMC Corporation</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1912, '6', 'What is the pay scale of Six Sigma Professional across the world?', '<p>The significance of Six Sigma levels is increasing across various industries. Consequently, our Six Sigma certification provides you with a competitive advantage in the market. Salaries for Six Sigma professionals vary globally based on factors such as location, industry, experience, and certifications. The average earnings of Six Sigma specialists around the world are:</p><ul><li>US: $107,500 (according to Salary.com)</li><li>India: 949k (according to PayScale.com)</li><li>Canada: $126,055 (according to Glassdoor)</li><li>UK: £42k (according to PayScale.com)</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1913, '6', 'Can I use the PDUs (Professional Development Units) earned from this course for other certifications?', '<p>Indeed, the 35 PDUs obtained from this course can contribute to the maintenance of other professional certifications, including the PMP.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1914, '6', 'Does Centuera have corporate training solutions?', '<p>Indeed, Centuera for Business provides educational solutions focused on the latest AI technologies and other digital competencies, including industry-recognized certifications. For talent development strategies, we collaborate with Fortune 500 companies as well as mid-sized enterprises, offering concise skill-based certification training and tailored role-specific learning paths. Additionally, we present a comprehensive learning library featuring unlimited live and interactive resources—Centuera Learning Hub+, which is available to your entire workforce. Our team of curriculum consultants partners with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that most effectively address their teams\' needs.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1915, '6', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed whenever it suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1916, '6', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from Centuera and reviews from alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:35:52', '2025-09-08 03:36:57'),
(1917, '6', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee?', '<p>Yes. We provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.<br>Refund Process: If you do not pass the exam on your first attempt, Centuera will refund the entire course fee to you. To obtain a refund, you need to request it via the Help and Support Online. You must include a copy of your scorecard along with the date you completed your online classroom training. Centuera will issue the refund within 30 days of receiving all necessary documentation. The refund will be processed using the same payment method you used for the course.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:39:53', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:39:53'),
(1918, '6', 'Do you offer Minitab training?', '<p>Yes. We provide Minitab online training as a separate package.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-08 03:39:53', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:39:53'),
(1919, '6', 'What tools do I need to attend the training sessions?', '<p>To participate in six sigma green belt training, you will require the following tools:</p><ul><li>Windows: Windows XP SP3 or a later version</li><li>Mac: OSX 10.6 or a later version</li><li>Internet speed: Ideally 512 Kbps or faster</li><li>Headset, speakers, and microphone: It is essential to have headphones or speakers for clear audio instructions, along with a microphone for communication. You may opt for a headset that includes a microphone or use separate speakers and a microphone.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 03:39:53', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:39:53'),
(1920, '6', 'If I cancel my enrollment, will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:39:53', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:39:53'),
(1921, '6', 'What is the recommended learning path after completing Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification?', '<p>To enhance your career prospects, you might want to pursue a Post Graduate Program in Lean Six Sigma, which will help you become an expert in this area.</p>', '2025-09-08 03:39:53', '2025-09-08 03:36:57', '2025-09-08 03:39:53'),
