(2154, '6', 'Does Centuera have corporate training solutions?', '<p>Indeed, Centuera for Business provides educational solutions focused on the latest AI technologies and other digital competencies, including industry-recognized certifications. For talent development strategies, we collaborate with Fortune 500 companies as well as mid-sized enterprises, offering concise skill-based certification training and tailored role-specific learning paths. Additionally, we present a comprehensive learning library featuring unlimited live and interactive resources—Centuera Learning Hub+, which is available to your entire workforce. Our team of curriculum consultants partners with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that most effectively address their teams\' needs.</p>', '2025-09-08 21:12:14', '2025-09-08 04:01:11', '2025-09-08 21:12:14'),
(2155, '6', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed whenever it suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-08 21:12:14', '2025-09-08 04:01:11', '2025-09-08 21:12:14'),
(2156, '6', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from Centuera and reviews from alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-08 21:12:14', '2025-09-08 04:01:11', '2025-09-08 21:12:14'),
(2157, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', NULL, '2025-09-08 04:32:56', '2025-09-08 04:32:11', '2025-09-08 04:32:56'),
(2158, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for the LSSBB program. Please refer to our Refund Policy to review the eligibility criteria and submit refund requests (if eligible) through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:32:56', '2025-09-08 04:33:52'),
(2159, '7', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. For further details, please consult our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:32:56', '2025-09-08 04:33:52'),
(2160, '7', 'How long will it take for me to finish the LSSBB course?', '<p>The five-day training module for LSSBB will cover the essential concepts. By the conclusion of the five days, you will be equipped to apply these concepts and tools in real-life situations. Six Sigma emphasizes continuous learning and practical application.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:32:56', '2025-09-08 04:33:52'),
(2161, '7', 'What are the prerequisites for enrolling in the LSSBB course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam. However, it is advisable, though not mandatory, to have completed Lean Six Sigma training from a recognized institution, trainer, or corporate program. Additionally, while not required, it is beneficial for candidates to possess some level of real-world Lean Six Sigma experience and project application knowledge.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:32:56', '2025-09-08 04:33:52'),
(2162, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for the LSSBB program. Please refer to our Refund Policy to review the eligibility criteria and submit refund requests (if eligible) through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:34:54'),
(2163, '7', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. For further details, please consult our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:34:54'),
(2164, '7', 'How long will it take for me to finish the LSSBB course?', '<p>The five-day training module for LSSBB will cover the essential concepts. By the conclusion of the five days, you will be equipped to apply these concepts and tools in real-life situations. Six Sigma emphasizes continuous learning and practical application.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:34:54'),
(2165, '7', 'What are the prerequisites for enrolling in the LSSBB course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam. However, it is advisable, though not mandatory, to have completed Lean Six Sigma training from a recognized institution, trainer, or corporate program. Additionally, while not required, it is beneficial for candidates to possess some level of real-world Lean Six Sigma experience and project application knowledge.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:34:54'),
(2166, '7', 'Why should I select Centuera for LSSBB instead of other courses?', '<p>Centuera is a leader in online training and certification, providing a blended delivery model that merges live online classroom instruction with self-paced e-learning. We have successfully trained over 12,000 professionals in 115 countries and offer a wide range of professional courses tailored to meet diverse needs. Our instructors are certified green belts and black belts with extensive knowledge of the Lean Six Sigma Methodology.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:34:54'),
(2167, '7', 'What is the purpose of the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt?', '<p>The Lean Six Sigma certification is beneficial for team leaders to assess, analyze, enhance, and manage critical processes that influence customer satisfaction and productivity improvement by adhering to the six sigma principles.<br>Individuals with Six Sigma training can also serve as internal consultants, working with various teams at the same time. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt training equips individuals with the essential skills and certification, which signifies their ability to apply these skills in a business setting for comprehensive process excellence responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:33:52', '2025-09-08 04:34:54'),
(2168, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for the LSSBB program. Please refer to our Refund Policy to review the eligibility criteria and submit refund requests (if eligible) through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:36:01', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:36:01'),
