(2174, '7', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification?', '<p>After successfully achieving the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification, you can explore various job roles such as Operations Manager, Senior IT Project Manager, IT Project Lead, Business Process Analyst, Performance Excellence Analyst, Quality Analyst, Operations Head, Service &amp; Manufacturing Operations Head, Lean Six Sigma Consultant, Quality Auditor, Lead Manufacturing Engineer, Process Development Specialist, Compliance Structure Expert, and Quality Engineer.</p>', '2025-09-08 04:36:01', '2025-09-08 04:34:54', '2025-09-08 04:36:01'),
