(2401, '4', 'What is the review of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera continually receives positive reviews from its alumni for its Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training. Learners praise its practical, hands-on approach, industry-aligned curriculum, and expert instructors. Many users highlight the value of the globally recognized certificates and the flexible learning options that suit working professionals. You can check out the Centuera alumni review page to get a better understanding of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training.</p>', '2025-09-08 21:07:37', '2025-09-08 18:49:47', '2025-09-08 21:07:37'),
(2402, '4', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)?', '<p>To be eligible for this&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), applicants should have a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant field. Centuera’s&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)&nbsp;can be taken up by newcomers and experienced professionals. Though prior knowledge of&nbsp;ScrumMaster&nbsp;is helpful, it is not compulsory. Additionally, there is no requirement for previous work experience.</p>', '2025-09-08 21:07:37', '2025-09-08 18:49:47', '2025-09-08 21:07:37'),
(2403, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the PMI-ACP exam fee is not part of the course fee. You are required to pay it directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI) for both the application and the examination.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2404, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the PMI-ACP exam fee is not part of the course fee. You are required to pay it directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI) for both the application and the examination.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2405, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the PMI-ACP exam fee is not part of the course fee. You are required to pay it directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI) for both the application and the examination.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2406, '8', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment. We will issue a refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2407, '8', 'What is the certification process?', '<p>Centuera has a clearly defined certification process designed to help you tackle the challenges of the IT industry.&nbsp;</p><p>To qualify for the certificate, you must meet the following criteria:<br>You need to complete at least 95% of the course or attend an entire batch.<br>You must finish your course with the minimum passing score if it includes simulation exams.<br>You are required to submit a project and obtain approval from our panel of subject matter experts.<br>If your project is not approved, our subject matter experts will provide the necessary assistance to help you succeed in your next attempt.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2408, '8', 'What is PMI-ACP used for?', '<p>The PMI-ACP is a widely recognized certification that showcases your comprehension of agile principles and your knowledge of agile techniques for leading agile projects. It enables Agile professionals to enhance their adaptability by incorporating various agile methodologies, including Lean, Scrum, extreme programming, Kanban, and test-driven development. Our PMI-ACP course is designed to prepare you for obtaining this esteemed credential.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2409, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP certification worth it?', '<p>Hiring professionals with PMI-ACP certification can enhance performance and provide companies with a competitive advantage. This certification is particularly beneficial for Agile practitioners looking to progress in their project management careers. Additionally, the PMI-ACP training helps newcomers acquire knowledge of contemporary project management methodologies, team dynamics, leadership skills, and the ability to allocate tasks, roles, and responsibilities among team members.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2410, '8', 'Which industries predominantly utilize agile project management?', '<p>Agile project management is prevalent in numerous sectors, such as healthcare, aviation, services, finance, engineering, construction, and supply chain management. Our PMI-ACP course can assist you in entering any of these domains.</p>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2411, '8', 'What literature would you suggest for studying the PMI-ACP?', '<p>In addition to our PMI-ACP course, the following books are highly recommended to enhance, develop, and refine your agile skills:</p><ul><li>Agile Estimating and Planning by Mike Cohn</li><li>Agile Practice Guide by Project Management Institute, Inc.</li><li>Agile Project Management: Creating Innovative Products by Jim Highsmith</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2412, '8', 'What is the salary range for agile project managers globally?', '<p>Based on PayScale data, project managers holding a PMI-ACP certification earn an average annual salary across different countries of&nbsp;</p><ul><li>India - INR 15 lakhs</li><li>US - $93K</li><li>UK - £43K</li><li>Singapore - S$98K</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 22:24:24', '2025-09-08 19:36:07', '2025-09-08 22:24:24'),
(2413, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2414, '1', 'What is included in this PMP certification training course?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP certification course comprises:</p><ul><li>Instruction delivered by PMI-authorized trainers</li><li>A curriculum that is in alignment with PMBOK® 7th Edition</li><li>More than 12 simulation examinations</li><li>Study aids and planning resources</li><li>Access to official digital materials from PMI</li><li>Specialized support for exam applications</li></ul><p>Masterclasses concentrating on the utilization of GenAI in project management</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2415, '1', 'What career opportunities exist after earning a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can seek employment across various industries such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Common roles include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2416, '1', 'What are the key learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will develop the competencies to plan, execute, and complete projects efficiently using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course will enhance your skills in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, preparing you to lead projects confidently and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2417, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2418, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2419, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2420, '1', 'Can I retake the PMP exam if I fail on the first attempt?', '<p>Yes, you are permitted to retake the PMP exam if you do not succeed on your initial attempt. PMI allows a one-year eligibility window during which you can attempt the exam up to three times, with a fee applicable for each retake.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2421, '1', 'Is the PMP certification exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the fee for the PMP certification exam is not included in the course fee. You are required to pay it separately to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® when you apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2422, '1', 'Is this PMP course suitable for beginners or only for experienced professionals?', '<p>Yes, the Project Management Professional course is open to both beginners and seasoned professionals. However, it is essential to meet PMI’s experience and eligibility requirements to apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2423, '1', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training for PMP?', '<p>Yes, Centuera Learning Hub+ offers corporate training for PMP certification in India. Our programs are designed for teams or entire organizations, featuring flexible formats and customized content to assist professionals in enhancing their project management skills.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2424, '1', 'What is the validity and renewal process for the PMP certificate?', '<p>The PMP certificate remains valid for three years. To renew it, certified individuals must accumulate 60 Professional Development Units (PDUs) during this timeframe through activities such as training, webinars, and volunteering related to project management.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2425, '1', 'Can I pursue this PMP training without prior PM experience?', '<p>Yes, you are able to enroll in the PMP training without any prior project management experience. However, to be eligible for the PMP exam, you must fulfill PMI’s eligibility criteria.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2426, '1', 'How long will it take to finish this project management professional course?', '<p>The PMP course generally requires approximately 4 to 6 weeks for completion, contingent upon your learning speed and work commitments.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2427, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2428, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2429, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', '<p>The PMP certification delivers extensive knowledge of project management principles, empowering professionals with the insights, techniques, and tools needed to address real-world project challenges. Globally recognized, PMP is regarded as the gold standard for career advancement in project management. Earning a Project Management Professional certification unlocks new opportunities and career progression across various industries.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2430, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2431, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2432, '1', 'Is the PMP® exam fee included in the PMP certification fee?', '<p>No, the PMP certification exam fees are not encompassed within our PMP certification course. You are required to pay the exam fee directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® in order to take the exam. Should you require any assistance in completing the application form, please feel free to contact us via phone or chat.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2433, '1', 'How can I obtain the PMP certification?', '<p>Upon successfully passing the PMP certification exam, you will receive your certificate package within a timeframe of six to eight weeks. Additionally, you will be issued a digital badge through Credly, which you can share on social media to celebrate your accomplishment.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2434, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2435, '1', 'What is included in this PMP certification training course?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP certification course comprises:</p><ul><li>Instruction delivered by PMI-authorized trainers</li><li>A curriculum that is in alignment with PMBOK® 7th Edition</li><li>More than 12 simulation examinations</li><li>Study aids and planning resources</li><li>Access to official digital materials from PMI</li><li>Specialized support for exam applications</li></ul><p>Masterclasses concentrating on the utilization of GenAI in project management</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2436, '1', 'What career opportunities exist after earning a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can seek employment across various industries such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Common roles include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2437, '1', 'What are the key learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will develop the competencies to plan, execute, and complete projects efficiently using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course will enhance your skills in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, preparing you to lead projects confidently and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2438, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2439, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
(2440, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-08 20:27:44', '2025-09-08 20:12:27', '2025-09-08 20:27:44'),
