(2895, '9', 'You provide an exam pass guarantee for ITIL certification training. What is the process?', '<p>This exam pass guarantee is applicable solely to Centuera’s ITIL 4 Foundation instructor-led training and does not extend to self-paced learning formats. It is specifically designated for trainees who have completed their payments for the entire course.<br>The guarantee becomes void if:</p><ul><li>The exam is not attempted within 45 days following the completion of the course.</li><li>100% attendance is not maintained during the live online sessions.</li><li>The e-learning content is not entirely completed.</li><li>A minimum score of 80% is not attained in both online practice exams.</li><li>A request for a retake is not submitted within 15 days of receiving the ITIL certification results.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:25:43', '2025-09-08 23:24:35', '2025-09-08 23:25:43'),
