(2909, '9', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Through Centuera for Business, we partner with Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies to offer digital skills training as part of their talent development initiatives. Our corporate training solutions feature short skill-based certification programs, role-specific learning paths, and Centuera Learning Hub+, a comprehensive learning library with unlimited live and interactive resources available organization-wide.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:25:43', '2025-09-08 23:26:49'),
(2910, '9', 'Will my ability to complete this course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete this course will not be impacted by missing a live class. At Centuera, we provide a \'Flexi-Learn\' feature that enables you to view the recording of the missed session at your convenience. This feature is designed to assist working professionals like yourself in staying current with the course material and fulfilling the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply access the portal, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:25:43', '2025-09-08 23:26:49'),
(2911, '9', 'What is the general perception of Centuera’s ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', NULL, '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:25:43', '2025-09-08 23:26:49'),
(2912, '9', 'Why should you choose Centuera’s ITIL certification course?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals looking to enhance their IT organization\'s services. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training course provides numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus includes key ITIL 4 concepts*, offering you a comprehensive understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be taught by seasoned instructors who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your knowledge.</li><li>You will have access to high-quality self-paced materials, enabling you to learn at your own pace and according to your preferred learning style.</li><li>The ITIL certification course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your chances of passing on your first try.</li><li>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2913, '9', 'What is the required passing score for the ITIL certification exam?', '<p>The required passing score for the ITIL certification exam is 65%.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2914, '9', 'How can I renew my ITIL certification?', '<p>As of January 1, 2023, an ITIL certification is valid for three years unless renewed. If you wish to renew your ITIL certification, you can choose from the following options:</p><ul><li>Retake the ITIL certification exam before the expiration date.</li><li>Obtain new certifications before the renewal date to automatically extend the renewal date for all ITIL certifications within the certification suite.</li><li>Accumulate and record professional development points through the MyAxelos membership platform. You can earn 20 CDP (continuous professional development) points each year across various CDP categories for three consecutive years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2915, '9', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the ITIL certification training? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, we offer a 7-day cancellation period for this ITIL certification course. If you apply within that timeframe, we will refund the course fee after deducting an administrative charge. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2916, '9', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of ITIL professionals?', '<p>ITIL professionals are tasked with the following responsibilities in their roles:</p><ol><li>Oversee the complete IT lifecycle</li><li>Establish strategies, policies, and standards</li><li>Ensure the quality of services provided meets the highest possible standards</li><li>Track key performance indicators</li><li>Ensure ongoing improvement in services</li></ol>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2917, '9', 'Where can I get practice questions for ITIL certifications?', '<p>Centuera offers a complimentary ITIL 4 Foundation practice test that includes questions pertinent to the ITIL certification exam to assist you in your preparation.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2918, '9', 'What are the ITIL certification paths according to the ITIL framework?', '<p>The ITIL® 4 framework provides practitioners with three distinct paths for professional growth, which include Managing Professional (MP), Strategic Leader (SL), and Practice Manager (PM). The initial step is to obtain the ITIL 4 Foundation certification. Your objectives will guide your choice of career path, whether you pursue hands-on experience through Practice Manager or develop comprehensive service expertise via Managing Professional and strategic leadership as a Strategic Leader. Individuals aiming for the ITIL Master certification must complete both the MP and SL certifications and have a minimum of five years of experience in IT service management.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2919, '9', 'What are the ITIL 4 Foundation certification requirements?', '<p>Candidates are required to complete the ITIL 4 Foundation training prior to taking the certification exam. To obtain the certification, they must successfully pass the one-hour ITIL 4 Foundation Certification exam with a score of at least 65% of the total marks. Results are typically available within 15 days of completing the exam. If you are registering for training courses, ensure that they are provided by accredited training organizations.<br>Likewise, for additional ITIL certifications, it is necessary to hold the ITIL 4 Foundation certification and pass the corresponding certification exams after completing the training courses.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2920, '9', 'Who are the instructors for this ITIL foundation certification, and what criteria were used for their selection?', '<p>Our ITIL foundation certification course employs instructors who adhere to the highest standards of qualification. At Centuera, we exclusively engage trainers who have received outstanding evaluations from their previous students. The evaluation process for instructional partnerships includes profile screening, technical assessments, and demonstration sessions of training.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2921, '9', 'How can I enroll in the ITIL 4 Foundation certification?', '<p>The enrollment procedure for this ITIL certification course involves three straightforward steps:</p><ul><li>All prospective candidates must submit an application via the online application form.</li><li>An admission panel will review and shortlist candidates based on their applications.</li><li>Candidates who are selected will receive an admission offer, which they can accept by remitting the course fee.</li><li>Upon confirmation of payment, candidates will receive a payment receipt along with information regarding LMS access.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2922, '9', 'You provide an exam pass guarantee for ITIL certification training. What is the process?', '<p>This exam pass guarantee is applicable solely to Centuera’s ITIL 4 Foundation instructor-led training and does not extend to self-paced learning formats. It is specifically designated for trainees who have completed their payments for the entire course.<br>The guarantee becomes void if:</p><ul><li>The exam is not attempted within 45 days following the completion of the course.</li><li>100% attendance is not maintained during the live online sessions.</li><li>The e-learning content is not entirely completed.</li><li>A minimum score of 80% is not attained in both online practice exams.</li><li>A request for a retake is not submitted within 15 days of receiving the ITIL certification results.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2923, '9', 'Why should I choose Centuera ITIL certification?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals aiming to enhance their IT organization\'s service quality. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training offers numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus encompasses vital ITIL 4 concepts*, providing you with a thorough understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be instructed by seasoned professionals who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your comprehension.</li><li><p>The course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your likelihood of passing on your first try.</p><p>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.<br>&nbsp;</p></li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2924, '9', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Through Centuera for Business, we partner with Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies to offer digital skills training as part of their talent development initiatives. Our corporate training solutions feature short skill-based certification programs, role-specific learning paths, and Centuera Learning Hub+, a comprehensive learning library with unlimited live and interactive resources available organization-wide.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2925, '9', 'Will my ability to complete this course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete this course will not be impacted by missing a live class. At Centuera, we provide a \'Flexi-Learn\' feature that enables you to view the recording of the missed session at your convenience. This feature is designed to assist working professionals like yourself in staying current with the course material and fulfilling the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply access the portal, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2926, '9', 'What is the general perception of Centuera’s ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for delivering valuable education that enhances career prospects. The flexibility of our program allows professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities. The ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from learners and reviews from alumni commend the thorough course content, practical learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2927, '9', 'What are the requirements for enrolling in the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course, you should possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. This course is accessible to both newcomers and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of ITIL is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for work experience.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:26:49', '2025-09-08 23:28:02'),
(2928, '9', 'Why should you choose Centuera’s ITIL certification course?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals looking to enhance their IT organization\'s services. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training course provides numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus includes key ITIL 4 concepts*, offering you a comprehensive understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be taught by seasoned instructors who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your knowledge.</li><li>You will have access to high-quality self-paced materials, enabling you to learn at your own pace and according to your preferred learning style.</li><li>The ITIL certification course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your chances of passing on your first try.</li><li>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:28:43', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:28:43'),
(2929, '9', 'What is the required passing score for the ITIL certification exam?', '<p>The required passing score for the ITIL certification exam is 65%.</p>', '2025-09-08 23:28:43', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:28:43'),
(2930, '9', 'How can I renew my ITIL certification?', '<p>As of January 1, 2023, an ITIL certification is valid for three years unless renewed. If you wish to renew your ITIL certification, you can choose from the following options:</p><ul><li>Retake the ITIL certification exam before the expiration date.</li><li>Obtain new certifications before the renewal date to automatically extend the renewal date for all ITIL certifications within the certification suite.</li><li>Accumulate and record professional development points through the MyAxelos membership platform. You can earn 20 CDP (continuous professional development) points each year across various CDP categories for three consecutive years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-08 23:28:43', '2025-09-08 23:28:02', '2025-09-08 23:28:43');
