(3150, '9', 'What is the general perception of Centuera’s ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for delivering valuable education that enhances career prospects. The flexibility of our program allows professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities. The ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from learners and reviews from alumni commend the thorough course content, practical learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 01:53:45', '2025-09-09 01:57:14'),
(3151, '9', 'What are the requirements for enrolling in the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course, you should possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. This course is accessible to both newcomers and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of ITIL is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for work experience.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 01:53:45', '2025-09-09 01:57:14'),
(3152, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the PMI-ACP exam fee is not part of the course fee. You are required to pay it directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI) for both the application and the examination.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3153, '8', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment. We will issue a refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3154, '8', 'What is the certification process?', '<p>Centuera has a clearly defined certification process designed to help you tackle the challenges of the IT industry.&nbsp;</p><p>To qualify for the certificate, you must meet the following criteria:<br>You need to complete at least 95% of the course or attend an entire batch.<br>You must finish your course with the minimum passing score if it includes simulation exams.<br>You are required to submit a project and obtain approval from our panel of subject matter experts.<br>If your project is not approved, our subject matter experts will provide the necessary assistance to help you succeed in your next attempt.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3155, '8', 'What is PMI-ACP used for?', '<p>The PMI-ACP is a widely recognized certification that showcases your comprehension of agile principles and your knowledge of agile techniques for leading agile projects. It enables Agile professionals to enhance their adaptability by incorporating various agile methodologies, including Lean, Scrum, extreme programming, Kanban, and test-driven development. Our PMI-ACP course is designed to prepare you for obtaining this esteemed credential.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3156, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP certification worth it?', '<p>Hiring professionals with PMI-ACP certification can enhance performance and provide companies with a competitive advantage. This certification is particularly beneficial for Agile practitioners looking to progress in their project management careers. Additionally, the PMI-ACP training helps newcomers acquire knowledge of contemporary project management methodologies, team dynamics, leadership skills, and the ability to allocate tasks, roles, and responsibilities among team members.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3157, '8', 'Which industries predominantly utilize agile project management?', '<p>Agile project management is prevalent in numerous sectors, such as healthcare, aviation, services, finance, engineering, construction, and supply chain management. Our PMI-ACP course can assist you in entering any of these domains.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3158, '8', 'What literature would you suggest for studying the PMI-ACP?', '<p>In addition to our PMI-ACP course, the following books are highly recommended to enhance, develop, and refine your agile skills:</p><ul><li>Agile Estimating and Planning by Mike Cohn</li><li>Agile Practice Guide by Project Management Institute, Inc.</li><li>Agile Project Management: Creating Innovative Products by Jim Highsmith</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3159, '8', 'What is the salary range for agile project managers globally?', '<p>Based on PayScale data, project managers holding a PMI-ACP certification earn an average annual salary across different countries of&nbsp;</p><ul><li>India - INR 15 lakhs</li><li>US - $93K</li><li>UK - £43K</li><li>Singapore - S$98K</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-09 01:54:19', '2025-09-10 22:03:17'),
(3160, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for the LSSBB program. Please refer to our Refund Policy to review the eligibility criteria and submit refund requests (if eligible) through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3161, '7', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. For further details, please consult our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3162, '7', 'How long will it take for me to finish the LSSBB course?', '<p>The five-day training module for LSSBB will cover the essential concepts. By the conclusion of the five days, you will be equipped to apply these concepts and tools in real-life situations. Six Sigma emphasizes continuous learning and practical application.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3163, '7', 'What are the prerequisites for enrolling in the LSSBB course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam. However, it is advisable, though not mandatory, to have completed Lean Six Sigma training from a recognized institution, trainer, or corporate program. Additionally, while not required, it is beneficial for candidates to possess some level of real-world Lean Six Sigma experience and project application knowledge.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3164, '7', 'Why should I select Centuera for LSSBB instead of other courses?', '<p>Centuera is a leader in online training and certification, providing a blended delivery model that merges live online classroom instruction with self-paced e-learning. We have successfully trained over 12,000 professionals in 115 countries and offer a wide range of professional courses tailored to meet diverse needs. Our instructors are certified green belts and black belts with extensive knowledge of the Lean Six Sigma Methodology.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3165, '7', 'What is the purpose of the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt?', '<p>The Lean Six Sigma certification is beneficial for team leaders to assess, analyze, enhance, and manage critical processes that influence customer satisfaction and productivity improvement by adhering to the six sigma principles.</p><p>Individuals with Six Sigma training can also serve as internal consultants, working with various teams at the same time. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt training equips individuals with the essential skills and certification, which signifies their ability to apply these skills in a business setting for comprehensive process excellence responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3166, '7', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification?', '<p>After successfully achieving the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification, you can explore various job roles such as Operations Manager, Senior IT Project Manager, IT Project Lead, Business Process Analyst, Performance Excellence Analyst, Quality Analyst, Operations Head, Service &amp; Manufacturing Operations Head, Lean Six Sigma Consultant, Quality Auditor, Lead Manufacturing Engineer, Process Development Specialist, Compliance Structure Expert, and Quality Engineer.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3167, '7', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete the course will not be impacted by missing a live class. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your own convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3168, '7', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni speak highly of the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The flexibility of the programs enables professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-09 01:55:01', '2025-09-09 01:57:58'),
(3169, '6', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee?', '<p>Yes. We provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.<br>Refund Process: If you do not pass the exam on your first attempt, Centuera will refund the entire course fee to you. To obtain a refund, you need to request it via the Help and Support Online. You must include a copy of your scorecard along with the date you completed your online classroom training. Centuera will issue the refund within 30 days of receiving all necessary documentation. The refund will be processed using the same payment method you used for the course.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3170, '6', 'Do you offer Minitab training?', '<p>Yes. We provide Minitab online training as a separate package.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3171, '6', 'What tools do I need to attend the training sessions?', '<p>To participate in six sigma green belt training, you will require the following tools:</p><ul><li>Windows: Windows XP SP3 or a later version</li><li>Mac: OSX 10.6 or a later version</li><li>Internet speed: Ideally 512 Kbps or faster</li><li>Headset, speakers, and microphone: It is essential to have headphones or speakers for clear audio instructions, along with a microphone for communication. You may opt for a headset that includes a microphone or use separate speakers and a microphone.</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3172, '6', 'If I cancel my enrollment, will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3173, '6', 'What is the recommended learning path after completing Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification?', '<p>To enhance your career prospects, you might want to pursue a Post Graduate Program in Lean Six Sigma, which will help you become an expert in this area.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3174, '6', 'What are the job roles available after getting a Six Sigma certification?', '<p>An increasing number of organizations, regardless of their size, are employing Six Sigma professionals as either full-time staff or consultants. Upon obtaining our Six Sigma Certification, there are numerous lucrative career paths to explore. The specific job titles associated with Six Sigma vary based on the needs of the organization. Some potential positions include:</p><ul><li>Six Sigma Analyst</li><li>Business Process Manager</li><li>Six Sigma Consultant</li><li>Lead Analyst/Project Manager</li><li>Director of Operational Excellence</li><li>Senior Project Manager</li><li>Functional Project Lead</li><li>Six Sigma Projects Manager</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3175, '6', 'Which companies hire Six Sigma Experts?', '<p>Centuera\'s Six Sigma certification offers candidates an enhanced professional perspective. It\'s important to be inquisitive about the types of companies seeking Six Sigma professionals. Below is a curated list of the leading recruiters for Six Sigma in India and internationally:</p><ul><li>TCS</li><li>Accenture</li><li>UnitedHealth Group</li><li>HCL</li><li>McKesson Corporation</li><li>Genpact</li><li>Honeywell</li><li>IBM</li><li>Volkswagen</li><li>EMC Corporation</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3176, '6', 'What is the pay scale of Six Sigma Professional across the world?', '<p>The significance of Six Sigma levels is increasing across various industries. Consequently, our Six Sigma certification provides you with a competitive advantage in the market. Salaries for Six Sigma professionals vary globally based on factors such as location, industry, experience, and certifications. The average earnings of Six Sigma specialists around the world are:</p><ul><li>US: $107,500 (according to Salary.com)</li><li>India: 949k (according to PayScale.com)</li><li>Canada: $126,055 (according to Glassdoor)</li><li>UK: £42k (according to PayScale.com)</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3177, '6', 'Can I use the PDUs (Professional Development Units) earned from this course for other certifications?', '<p>Indeed, the 35 PDUs obtained from this course can contribute to the maintenance of other professional certifications, including the PMP.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3178, '6', 'Does Centuera have corporate training solutions?', '<p>Indeed, Centuera for Business provides educational solutions focused on the latest AI technologies and other digital competencies, including industry-recognized certifications. For talent development strategies, we collaborate with Fortune 500 companies as well as mid-sized enterprises, offering concise skill-based certification training and tailored role-specific learning paths. Additionally, we present a comprehensive learning library featuring unlimited live and interactive resources—Centuera Learning Hub+, which is available to your entire workforce. Our team of curriculum consultants partners with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that most effectively address their teams\' needs.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3179, '6', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed whenever it suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3180, '6', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from Centuera and reviews from alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-09 01:55:43', '2025-09-10 22:20:33'),
(3181, '9', 'Why should you choose Centuera’s ITIL certification course?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals looking to enhance their IT organization\'s services. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training course provides numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus includes key ITIL 4 concepts*, offering you a comprehensive understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be taught by seasoned instructors who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your knowledge.</li><li>You will have access to high-quality self-paced materials, enabling you to learn at your own pace and according to your preferred learning style.</li><li>The ITIL certification course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your chances of passing on your first try.</li><li>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.</li></ul>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3182, '9', 'What is the required passing score for the ITIL certification exam?', '<p>The required passing score for the ITIL certification exam is 65%.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3183, '9', 'How can I renew my ITIL certification?', '<p>As of January 1, 2023, an ITIL certification is valid for three years unless renewed. If you wish to renew your ITIL certification, you can choose from the following options:</p><ul><li>Retake the ITIL certification exam before the expiration date.</li><li>Obtain new certifications before the renewal date to automatically extend the renewal date for all ITIL certifications within the certification suite.</li><li>Accumulate and record professional development points through the MyAxelos membership platform. You can earn 20 CDP (continuous professional development) points each year across various CDP categories for three consecutive years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3184, '9', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the ITIL certification training? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, we offer a 7-day cancellation period for this ITIL certification course. If you apply within that timeframe, we will refund the course fee after deducting an administrative charge. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3185, '9', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of ITIL professionals?', '<p>ITIL professionals are tasked with the following responsibilities in their roles:</p><ol><li>Oversee the complete IT lifecycle</li><li>Establish strategies, policies, and standards</li><li>Ensure the quality of services provided meets the highest possible standards</li><li>Track key performance indicators</li><li>Ensure ongoing improvement in services</li></ol>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3186, '9', 'Where can I get practice questions for ITIL certifications?', '<p>Centuera offers a complimentary ITIL 4 Foundation practice test that includes questions pertinent to the ITIL certification exam to assist you in your preparation.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3187, '9', 'What are the ITIL certification paths according to the ITIL framework?', '<p>The ITIL® 4 framework provides practitioners with three distinct paths for professional growth, which include Managing Professional (MP), Strategic Leader (SL), and Practice Manager (PM). The initial step is to obtain the ITIL 4 Foundation certification. Your objectives will guide your choice of career path, whether you pursue hands-on experience through Practice Manager or develop comprehensive service expertise via Managing Professional and strategic leadership as a Strategic Leader. Individuals aiming for the ITIL Master certification must complete both the MP and SL certifications and have a minimum of five years of experience in IT service management.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3188, '9', 'What are the ITIL 4 Foundation certification requirements?', '<p>Candidates are required to complete the ITIL 4 Foundation training prior to taking the certification exam. To obtain the certification, they must successfully pass the one-hour ITIL 4 Foundation Certification exam with a score of at least 65% of the total marks. Results are typically available within 15 days of completing the exam. If you are registering for training courses, ensure that they are provided by accredited training organizations.<br>Likewise, for additional ITIL certifications, it is necessary to hold the ITIL 4 Foundation certification and pass the corresponding certification exams after completing the training courses.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3189, '9', 'Who are the instructors for this ITIL foundation certification, and what criteria were used for their selection?', '<p>Our ITIL foundation certification course employs instructors who adhere to the highest standards of qualification. At Centuera, we exclusively engage trainers who have received outstanding evaluations from their previous students. The evaluation process for instructional partnerships includes profile screening, technical assessments, and demonstration sessions of training.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3190, '9', 'How can I enroll in the ITIL 4 Foundation certification?', '<p>The enrollment procedure for this ITIL certification course involves three straightforward steps:</p><ul><li>All prospective candidates must submit an application via the online application form.</li><li>An admission panel will review and shortlist candidates based on their applications.</li><li>Candidates who are selected will receive an admission offer, which they can accept by remitting the course fee.</li><li>Upon confirmation of payment, candidates will receive a payment receipt along with information regarding LMS access.</li></ul>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3191, '9', 'You provide an exam pass guarantee for ITIL certification training. What is the process?', '<p>This exam pass guarantee is applicable solely to Centuera’s ITIL 4 Foundation instructor-led training and does not extend to self-paced learning formats. It is specifically designated for trainees who have completed their payments for the entire course.<br>The guarantee becomes void if:</p><ul><li>The exam is not attempted within 45 days following the completion of the course.</li><li>100% attendance is not maintained during the live online sessions.</li><li>The e-learning content is not entirely completed.</li><li>A minimum score of 80% is not attained in both online practice exams.</li><li>A request for a retake is not submitted within 15 days of receiving the ITIL certification results.</li></ul>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3192, '9', 'Why should I choose Centuera ITIL certification?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals aiming to enhance their IT organization\'s service quality. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training offers numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus encompasses vital ITIL 4 concepts*, providing you with a thorough understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be instructed by seasoned professionals who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your comprehension.</li><li><p>The course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your likelihood of passing on your first try.</p><p>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.<br>&nbsp;</p></li></ul>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3193, '9', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Through Centuera for Business, we partner with Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies to offer digital skills training as part of their talent development initiatives. Our corporate training solutions feature short skill-based certification programs, role-specific learning paths, and Centuera Learning Hub+, a comprehensive learning library with unlimited live and interactive resources available organization-wide.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3194, '9', 'Will my ability to complete this course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete this course will not be impacted by missing a live class. At Centuera, we provide a \'Flexi-Learn\' feature that enables you to view the recording of the missed session at your convenience. This feature is designed to assist working professionals like yourself in staying current with the course material and fulfilling the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply access the portal, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3195, '9', 'What is the general perception of Centuera’s ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for delivering valuable education that enhances career prospects. The flexibility of our program allows professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities. The ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from learners and reviews from alumni commend the thorough course content, practical learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3196, '9', 'What are the requirements for enrolling in the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course, you should possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. This course is accessible to both newcomers and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of ITIL is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for work experience.</p>', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-09 01:57:14', '2025-09-09 18:59:22'),
(3197, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for the LSSBB program. Please refer to our Refund Policy to review the eligibility criteria and submit refund requests (if eligible) through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3198, '7', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. For further details, please consult our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3199, '7', 'How long will it take for me to finish the LSSBB course?', '<p>The five-day training module for LSSBB will cover the essential concepts. By the conclusion of the five days, you will be equipped to apply these concepts and tools in real-life situations. Six Sigma emphasizes continuous learning and practical application.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3200, '7', 'What are the prerequisites for enrolling in the LSSBB course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam. However, it is advisable, though not mandatory, to have completed Lean Six Sigma training from a recognized institution, trainer, or corporate program. Additionally, while not required, it is beneficial for candidates to possess some level of real-world Lean Six Sigma experience and project application knowledge.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3201, '7', 'Why should I select Centuera for LSSBB instead of other courses?', '<p>Centuera is a leader in online training and certification, providing a blended delivery model that merges live online classroom instruction with self-paced e-learning. We have successfully trained over 12,000 professionals in 115 countries and offer a wide range of professional courses tailored to meet diverse needs. Our instructors are certified green belts and black belts with extensive knowledge of the Lean Six Sigma Methodology.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3202, '7', 'What is the purpose of the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt?', '<p>The Lean Six Sigma certification is beneficial for team leaders to assess, analyze, enhance, and manage critical processes that influence customer satisfaction and productivity improvement by adhering to the six sigma principles.</p><p>Individuals with Six Sigma training can also serve as internal consultants, working with various teams at the same time. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt training equips individuals with the essential skills and certification, which signifies their ability to apply these skills in a business setting for comprehensive process excellence responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3203, '7', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification?', '<p>After successfully achieving the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification, you can explore various job roles such as Operations Manager, Senior IT Project Manager, IT Project Lead, Business Process Analyst, Performance Excellence Analyst, Quality Analyst, Operations Head, Service &amp; Manufacturing Operations Head, Lean Six Sigma Consultant, Quality Auditor, Lead Manufacturing Engineer, Process Development Specialist, Compliance Structure Expert, and Quality Engineer.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3204, '7', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete the course will not be impacted by missing a live class. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your own convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3205, '7', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni speak highly of the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The flexibility of the programs enables professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-09 01:57:58', '2025-09-10 22:19:25'),
(3206, '9', 'Why should you choose Centuera’s ITIL certification course?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals looking to enhance their IT organization\'s services. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training course provides numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus includes key ITIL 4 concepts*, offering you a comprehensive understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be taught by seasoned instructors who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your knowledge.</li><li>You will have access to high-quality self-paced materials, enabling you to learn at your own pace and according to your preferred learning style.</li><li>The ITIL certification course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your chances of passing on your first try.</li><li>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3207, '9', 'What is the required passing score for the ITIL certification exam?', '<p>The required passing score for the ITIL certification exam is 65%.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3208, '9', 'How can I renew my ITIL certification?', '<p>As of January 1, 2023, an ITIL certification is valid for three years unless renewed. If you wish to renew your ITIL certification, you can choose from the following options:</p><ul><li>Retake the ITIL certification exam before the expiration date.</li><li>Obtain new certifications before the renewal date to automatically extend the renewal date for all ITIL certifications within the certification suite.</li><li>Accumulate and record professional development points through the MyAxelos membership platform. You can earn 20 CDP (continuous professional development) points each year across various CDP categories for three consecutive years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3209, '9', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the ITIL certification training? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, we offer a 7-day cancellation period for this ITIL certification course. If you apply within that timeframe, we will refund the course fee after deducting an administrative charge. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3210, '9', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of ITIL professionals?', '<p>ITIL professionals are tasked with the following responsibilities in their roles:</p><ol><li>Oversee the complete IT lifecycle</li><li>Establish strategies, policies, and standards</li><li>Ensure the quality of services provided meets the highest possible standards</li><li>Track key performance indicators</li><li>Ensure ongoing improvement in services</li></ol>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3211, '9', 'Where can I get practice questions for ITIL certifications?', '<p>Centuera offers a complimentary ITIL 4 Foundation practice test that includes questions pertinent to the ITIL certification exam to assist you in your preparation.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3212, '9', 'What are the ITIL certification paths according to the ITIL framework?', '<p>The ITIL® 4 framework provides practitioners with three distinct paths for professional growth, which include Managing Professional (MP), Strategic Leader (SL), and Practice Manager (PM). The initial step is to obtain the ITIL 4 Foundation certification. Your objectives will guide your choice of career path, whether you pursue hands-on experience through Practice Manager or develop comprehensive service expertise via Managing Professional and strategic leadership as a Strategic Leader. Individuals aiming for the ITIL Master certification must complete both the MP and SL certifications and have a minimum of five years of experience in IT service management.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3213, '9', 'What are the ITIL 4 Foundation certification requirements?', '<p>Candidates are required to complete the ITIL 4 Foundation training prior to taking the certification exam. To obtain the certification, they must successfully pass the one-hour ITIL 4 Foundation Certification exam with a score of at least 65% of the total marks. Results are typically available within 15 days of completing the exam. If you are registering for training courses, ensure that they are provided by accredited training organizations.<br>Likewise, for additional ITIL certifications, it is necessary to hold the ITIL 4 Foundation certification and pass the corresponding certification exams after completing the training courses.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3214, '9', 'Who are the instructors for this ITIL foundation certification, and what criteria were used for their selection?', '<p>Our ITIL foundation certification course employs instructors who adhere to the highest standards of qualification. At Centuera, we exclusively engage trainers who have received outstanding evaluations from their previous students. The evaluation process for instructional partnerships includes profile screening, technical assessments, and demonstration sessions of training.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3215, '9', 'How can I enroll in the ITIL 4 Foundation certification?', '<p>The enrollment procedure for this ITIL certification course involves three straightforward steps:</p><ul><li>All prospective candidates must submit an application via the online application form.</li><li>An admission panel will review and shortlist candidates based on their applications.</li><li>Candidates who are selected will receive an admission offer, which they can accept by remitting the course fee.</li><li>Upon confirmation of payment, candidates will receive a payment receipt along with information regarding LMS access.</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3216, '9', 'You provide an exam pass guarantee for ITIL certification training. What is the process?', '<p>This exam pass guarantee is applicable solely to Centuera’s ITIL 4 Foundation instructor-led training and does not extend to self-paced learning formats. It is specifically designated for trainees who have completed their payments for the entire course.<br>The guarantee becomes void if:</p><ul><li>The exam is not attempted within 45 days following the completion of the course.</li><li>100% attendance is not maintained during the live online sessions.</li><li>The e-learning content is not entirely completed.</li><li>A minimum score of 80% is not attained in both online practice exams.</li><li>A request for a retake is not submitted within 15 days of receiving the ITIL certification results.</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3217, '9', 'Why should I choose Centuera ITIL certification?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals aiming to enhance their IT organization\'s service quality. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training offers numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus encompasses vital ITIL 4 concepts*, providing you with a thorough understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be instructed by seasoned professionals who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your comprehension.</li><li><p>The course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your likelihood of passing on your first try.</p><p>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.<br>&nbsp;</p></li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3218, '9', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Through Centuera for Business, we partner with Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies to offer digital skills training as part of their talent development initiatives. Our corporate training solutions feature short skill-based certification programs, role-specific learning paths, and Centuera Learning Hub+, a comprehensive learning library with unlimited live and interactive resources available organization-wide.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3219, '9', 'Will my ability to complete this course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete this course will not be impacted by missing a live class. At Centuera, we provide a \'Flexi-Learn\' feature that enables you to view the recording of the missed session at your convenience. This feature is designed to assist working professionals like yourself in staying current with the course material and fulfilling the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply access the portal, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3220, '9', 'What is the general perception of Centuera’s ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for delivering valuable education that enhances career prospects. The flexibility of our program allows professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities. The ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from learners and reviews from alumni commend the thorough course content, practical learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3221, '9', 'What are the requirements for enrolling in the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course, you should possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. This course is accessible to both newcomers and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of ITIL is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for work experience.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-09 18:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:48:21'),
(3222, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3223, '1', 'What is included in this PMP certification training course?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP certification course comprises:</p><ul><li>Instruction delivered by PMI-authorized trainers</li><li>A curriculum that is in alignment with PMBOK® 7th Edition</li><li>More than 12 simulation examinations</li><li>Study aids and planning resources</li><li>Access to official digital materials from PMI</li><li>Specialized support for exam applications</li></ul><p>Masterclasses concentrating on the utilization of GenAI in project management</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3224, '1', 'What career opportunities exist after earning a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can seek employment across various industries such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Common roles include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3225, '1', 'What are the key learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will develop the competencies to plan, execute, and complete projects efficiently using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course will enhance your skills in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, preparing you to lead projects confidently and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3226, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3227, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3228, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3229, '1', 'Can I retake the PMP exam if I fail on the first attempt?', '<p>Yes, you are permitted to retake the PMP exam if you do not succeed on your initial attempt. PMI allows a one-year eligibility window during which you can attempt the exam up to three times, with a fee applicable for each retake.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3230, '1', 'Is the PMP certification exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the fee for the PMP certification exam is not included in the course fee. You are required to pay it separately to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® when you apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3231, '1', 'Is this PMP course suitable for beginners or only for experienced professionals?', '<p>Yes, the Project Management Professional course is open to both beginners and seasoned professionals. However, it is essential to meet PMI’s experience and eligibility requirements to apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3232, '1', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training for PMP?', '<p>Yes, Centuera Learning Hub+ offers corporate training for PMP certification in India. Our programs are designed for teams or entire organizations, featuring flexible formats and customized content to assist professionals in enhancing their project management skills.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3233, '1', 'What is the validity and renewal process for the PMP certificate?', '<p>The PMP certificate remains valid for three years. To renew it, certified individuals must accumulate 60 Professional Development Units (PDUs) during this timeframe through activities such as training, webinars, and volunteering related to project management.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3234, '1', 'Can I pursue this PMP training without prior PM experience?', '<p>Yes, you are able to enroll in the PMP training without any prior project management experience. However, to be eligible for the PMP exam, you must fulfill PMI’s eligibility criteria.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3235, '1', 'How long will it take to finish this project management professional course?', '<p>The PMP course generally requires approximately 4 to 6 weeks for completion, contingent upon your learning speed and work commitments.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3236, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3237, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3238, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', '<p>The PMP certification delivers extensive knowledge of project management principles, empowering professionals with the insights, techniques, and tools needed to address real-world project challenges. Globally recognized, PMP is regarded as the gold standard for career advancement in project management. Earning a Project Management Professional certification unlocks new opportunities and career progression across various industries.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3239, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3240, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3241, '1', 'Is the PMP® exam fee included in the PMP certification fee?', '<p>No, the PMP certification exam fees are not encompassed within our PMP certification course. You are required to pay the exam fee directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® in order to take the exam. Should you require any assistance in completing the application form, please feel free to contact us via phone or chat.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3242, '1', 'How can I obtain the PMP certification?', '<p>Upon successfully passing the PMP certification exam, you will receive your certificate package within a timeframe of six to eight weeks. Additionally, you will be issued a digital badge through Credly, which you can share on social media to celebrate your accomplishment.</p>', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 20:07:55', '2025-09-10 21:46:16'),
(3243, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3244, '1', 'What is included in this PMP certification training course?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP certification course comprises:</p><ul><li>Instruction delivered by PMI-authorized trainers</li><li>A curriculum that is in alignment with PMBOK® 7th Edition</li><li>More than 12 simulation examinations</li><li>Study aids and planning resources</li><li>Access to official digital materials from PMI</li><li>Specialized support for exam applications</li></ul><p>Masterclasses concentrating on the utilization of GenAI in project management</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3245, '1', 'What career opportunities exist after earning a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can seek employment across various industries such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Common roles include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3246, '1', 'What are the key learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will develop the competencies to plan, execute, and complete projects efficiently using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course will enhance your skills in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, preparing you to lead projects confidently and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3247, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3248, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3249, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3250, '1', 'Can I retake the PMP exam if I fail on the first attempt?', '<p>Yes, you are permitted to retake the PMP exam if you do not succeed on your initial attempt. PMI allows a one-year eligibility window during which you can attempt the exam up to three times, with a fee applicable for each retake.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3251, '1', 'Is the PMP certification exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the fee for the PMP certification exam is not included in the course fee. You are required to pay it separately to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® when you apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3252, '1', 'Is this PMP course suitable for beginners or only for experienced professionals?', '<p>Yes, the Project Management Professional course is open to both beginners and seasoned professionals. However, it is essential to meet PMI’s experience and eligibility requirements to apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3253, '1', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training for PMP?', '<p>Yes, Centuera Learning Hub+ offers corporate training for PMP certification in India. Our programs are designed for teams or entire organizations, featuring flexible formats and customized content to assist professionals in enhancing their project management skills.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3254, '1', 'What is the validity and renewal process for the PMP certificate?', '<p>The PMP certificate remains valid for three years. To renew it, certified individuals must accumulate 60 Professional Development Units (PDUs) during this timeframe through activities such as training, webinars, and volunteering related to project management.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3255, '1', 'Can I pursue this PMP training without prior PM experience?', '<p>Yes, you are able to enroll in the PMP training without any prior project management experience. However, to be eligible for the PMP exam, you must fulfill PMI’s eligibility criteria.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3256, '1', 'How long will it take to finish this project management professional course?', '<p>The PMP course generally requires approximately 4 to 6 weeks for completion, contingent upon your learning speed and work commitments.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3257, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3258, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3259, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', '<p>The PMP certification delivers extensive knowledge of project management principles, empowering professionals with the insights, techniques, and tools needed to address real-world project challenges. Globally recognized, PMP is regarded as the gold standard for career advancement in project management. Earning a Project Management Professional certification unlocks new opportunities and career progression across various industries.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3260, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3261, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3262, '1', 'Is the PMP® exam fee included in the PMP certification fee?', '<p>No, the PMP certification exam fees are not encompassed within our PMP certification course. You are required to pay the exam fee directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® in order to take the exam. Should you require any assistance in completing the application form, please feel free to contact us via phone or chat.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3263, '1', 'How can I obtain the PMP certification?', '<p>Upon successfully passing the PMP certification exam, you will receive your certificate package within a timeframe of six to eight weeks. Additionally, you will be issued a digital badge through Credly, which you can share on social media to celebrate your accomplishment.</p>', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-10 21:46:16', '2025-09-10 23:49:03'),
(3264, '9', 'Why should you choose Centuera’s ITIL certification course?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals looking to enhance their IT organization\'s services. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training course provides numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus includes key ITIL 4 concepts*, offering you a comprehensive understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be taught by seasoned instructors who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your knowledge.</li><li>You will have access to high-quality self-paced materials, enabling you to learn at your own pace and according to your preferred learning style.</li><li>The ITIL certification course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your chances of passing on your first try.</li><li>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3265, '9', 'What is the required passing score for the ITIL certification exam?', '<p>The required passing score for the ITIL certification exam is 65%.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3266, '9', 'How can I renew my ITIL certification?', '<p>As of January 1, 2023, an ITIL certification is valid for three years unless renewed. If you wish to renew your ITIL certification, you can choose from the following options:</p><ul><li>Retake the ITIL certification exam before the expiration date.</li><li>Obtain new certifications before the renewal date to automatically extend the renewal date for all ITIL certifications within the certification suite.</li><li>Accumulate and record professional development points through the MyAxelos membership platform. You can earn 20 CDP (continuous professional development) points each year across various CDP categories for three consecutive years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3267, '9', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the ITIL certification training? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, we offer a 7-day cancellation period for this ITIL certification course. If you apply within that timeframe, we will refund the course fee after deducting an administrative charge. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3268, '9', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of ITIL professionals?', '<p>ITIL professionals are tasked with the following responsibilities in their roles:</p><ol><li>Oversee the complete IT lifecycle</li><li>Establish strategies, policies, and standards</li><li>Ensure the quality of services provided meets the highest possible standards</li><li>Track key performance indicators</li><li>Ensure ongoing improvement in services</li></ol>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3269, '9', 'Where can I get practice questions for ITIL certifications?', '<p>Centuera offers a complimentary ITIL 4 Foundation practice test that includes questions pertinent to the ITIL certification exam to assist you in your preparation.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3270, '9', 'What are the ITIL certification paths according to the ITIL framework?', '<p>The ITIL® 4 framework provides practitioners with three distinct paths for professional growth, which include Managing Professional (MP), Strategic Leader (SL), and Practice Manager (PM). The initial step is to obtain the ITIL 4 Foundation certification. Your objectives will guide your choice of career path, whether you pursue hands-on experience through Practice Manager or develop comprehensive service expertise via Managing Professional and strategic leadership as a Strategic Leader. Individuals aiming for the ITIL Master certification must complete both the MP and SL certifications and have a minimum of five years of experience in IT service management.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3271, '9', 'What are the ITIL 4 Foundation certification requirements?', '<p>Candidates are required to complete the ITIL 4 Foundation training prior to taking the certification exam. To obtain the certification, they must successfully pass the one-hour ITIL 4 Foundation Certification exam with a score of at least 65% of the total marks. Results are typically available within 15 days of completing the exam. If you are registering for training courses, ensure that they are provided by accredited training organizations.<br>Likewise, for additional ITIL certifications, it is necessary to hold the ITIL 4 Foundation certification and pass the corresponding certification exams after completing the training courses.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3272, '9', 'Who are the instructors for this ITIL foundation certification, and what criteria were used for their selection?', '<p>Our ITIL foundation certification course employs instructors who adhere to the highest standards of qualification. At Centuera, we exclusively engage trainers who have received outstanding evaluations from their previous students. The evaluation process for instructional partnerships includes profile screening, technical assessments, and demonstration sessions of training.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3273, '9', 'How can I enroll in the ITIL 4 Foundation certification?', '<p>The enrollment procedure for this ITIL certification course involves three straightforward steps:</p><ul><li>All prospective candidates must submit an application via the online application form.</li><li>An admission panel will review and shortlist candidates based on their applications.</li><li>Candidates who are selected will receive an admission offer, which they can accept by remitting the course fee.</li><li>Upon confirmation of payment, candidates will receive a payment receipt along with information regarding LMS access.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3274, '9', 'You provide an exam pass guarantee for ITIL certification training. What is the process?', '<p>This exam pass guarantee is applicable solely to Centuera’s ITIL 4 Foundation instructor-led training and does not extend to self-paced learning formats. It is specifically designated for trainees who have completed their payments for the entire course.<br>The guarantee becomes void if:</p><ul><li>The exam is not attempted within 45 days following the completion of the course.</li><li>100% attendance is not maintained during the live online sessions.</li><li>The e-learning content is not entirely completed.</li><li>A minimum score of 80% is not attained in both online practice exams.</li><li>A request for a retake is not submitted within 15 days of receiving the ITIL certification results.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3275, '9', 'Why should I choose Centuera ITIL certification?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals aiming to enhance their IT organization\'s service quality. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training offers numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus encompasses vital ITIL 4 concepts*, providing you with a thorough understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be instructed by seasoned professionals who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your comprehension.</li><li><p>The course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your likelihood of passing on your first try.</p><p>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.<br>&nbsp;</p></li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3276, '9', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Through Centuera for Business, we partner with Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies to offer digital skills training as part of their talent development initiatives. Our corporate training solutions feature short skill-based certification programs, role-specific learning paths, and Centuera Learning Hub+, a comprehensive learning library with unlimited live and interactive resources available organization-wide.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3277, '9', 'Will my ability to complete this course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete this course will not be impacted by missing a live class. At Centuera, we provide a \'Flexi-Learn\' feature that enables you to view the recording of the missed session at your convenience. This feature is designed to assist working professionals like yourself in staying current with the course material and fulfilling the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply access the portal, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3278, '9', 'What is the general perception of Centuera’s ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for delivering valuable education that enhances career prospects. The flexibility of our program allows professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities. The ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from learners and reviews from alumni commend the thorough course content, practical learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3279, '9', 'What are the requirements for enrolling in the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course, you should possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. This course is accessible to both newcomers and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of ITIL is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for work experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-10 21:48:21', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(3280, '2', 'What is CAPM certification, and who should pursue?', '<p>The CAPM certification is a globally recognized credential offered by the Project Management Institute (PMI). In India, it is ideal for recent graduates, junior project managers, or professionals seeking structured CAPM training to advance in roles that require project coordination and planning.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3281, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for, and how is it relevant in project management?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. It is an entry-level credential offered by PMI that helps professionals gain foundational project management knowledge. It is ideal for those new to the field and looking to build a career in project-based roles.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3282, '2', 'What are the benefits of enrolling in a CAPM course professionals?', '<p>Enrolling in a CAPM course helps Indian professionals build a solid foundation in project management, improve job prospects, and earn global recognition from PMI. It also increases earning potential and prepares candidates for advanced certifications like PMP®.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3283, '2', 'How does the CAPM certification differ from the PMP in terms of scope and eligibility?', '<p>To understand which certification fits best, here’s a breakdown of CAPM and PMP in terms of scope and eligibility:<br><strong>CAPM</strong>:</p><ul><li>Scope: Basic project management knowledge for beginners.</li><li>Eligibility: Secondary degree and 23 hours of project management training.</li></ul><p><strong>PMP:</strong></p><ul><li>Scope: Advanced project management skills for experienced professionals.</li><li>Eligibility: Four-year degree with 3+ years of experience and 35 hours of training, or secondary degree with 5+ years of experience and 35 hours of training.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3284, '2', 'What is the average salary of a Certified Associate in Project Management?', '<p>Professionals who earn the Certified Associate in Project Management (CAPM) certification in India can expect competitive salaries based on their experience and role. Typical annual salary ranges include:</p><ul><li>Entry-level: $25,000 to $50,000</li><li>Mid-level (1–5 years): $35,000 to $80,000</li></ul><p>Senior roles: $10,00,000 or more<br>Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=Certified_Associate_in_Project_Management_(CAPM)/Salary\">Payscale</a></p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3285, '2', 'What job roles or designations are available after earning the CAPM certification?', '<p>After earning the CAPM certification in India, professionals can apply for roles such as:</p><ul><li>Project Coordinator</li><li>Project Associate</li><li>Junior Project Manager</li><li>PMO Analyst</li><li>Operations Associate</li><li>Business Analyst (Entry-level)</li><li>Project Scheduler</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3286, '2', 'Is the CAPM course suitable for freshers or only for professionals with experience?', '<p>The CAPM course is ideal for freshers and those new to project management. It does not require prior work experience and helps build foundational knowledge, making it a good starting point for:</p><ul><li>Recent graduates seeking a project management career</li><li>Entry-level professionals aiming to boost their qualifications</li><li>Individuals looking to transition into project-related roles</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3287, '2', 'Is the CAPM certification worth it for entry-level project management professionals?', '<p>Yes, completing the CAPM course and earning a certification is valuable for beginners. It enhances your resume, helps you qualify for entry-level project roles, and prepares you for advanced certifications, such as PMP.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3288, '2', 'What is the duration and question format of the CAPM certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM certification exam lasts three hours and includes 150 multiple-choice questions with no negative marking, designed to assess both theoretical knowledge and practical understanding.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3289, '2', 'Are there CAPM online courses available for working professionals?', '<p>Yes, many online CAPM courses are designed for working professionals. These courses offer flexible schedules, including self-paced learning and live weekend or evening sessions. They follow PMI guidelines and provide the required 23 hours of project management education, helping learners balance work and study.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3290, '2', 'What’s next after completing the CAPM certification course — should I go for PMP?', '<p>After completing the CAPM certification course, pursuing the PMP certification is recommended once you gain the required project management experience. PMP is suited for professionals managing more complex projects and offers advanced knowledge and better career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3291, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. In project management, CAPM validates foundational knowledge and skills in project management practices and methodologies.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3292, '2', 'What is the difference between CAPM® & PMP®?', '<p>The main difference between CAPM® (Certified Associate in Project Management) and PMP® (Project Management Professional) lies in their target audience and level of expertise. CAPM® is designed for entry-level project managers or those with limited experience, focusing on basic project management concepts. PMP®, offered by&nbsp;the Project Management Institute,&nbsp;on the other hand, is for experienced professionals, requiring a deeper understanding of advanced project management techniques and leadership skills. PMP® certification generally holds more value in the industry due to its higher level of difficulty and experience prerequisites.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3293, '2', 'How many questions are there in the CAPM® certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM® certification exam&nbsp;covers 150 questions, out of which 15 questions are considered as pre-test questions used for future tests and are not scored. You will not be communicated about these questions; they are randomly chosen. Therefore, you should answer all 150 questions with the same seriousness.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3294, '2', 'What\'s next after CAPM® Certification?', '<p>After completing the CAPM®&nbsp;certification&nbsp;training&nbsp;program, you can take the PMP® certification training, Digital Project Manager, or PMP® Plus program. At the next level, you have Prince2® certification training, MSP® Foundation and Practitioner, Prince2® Agile Foundation and Practitioner and best of all, you can get the Project Management Certification (PGP in Project Management) program.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3295, '2', 'Is the CAPM® course difficult to learn?', '<p>The CAPM® course can be challenging, especially if you\'re new to project management concepts, as it covers a broad range of topics like processes, terminology, and frameworks from the PMBOK® guide. Centuera has selected industry experts who have rich teaching experience as instructors for this CAPM® course. They have a background in project management and offer a structured learning approach. They are aware of the varying learning needs of students and explain the concepts in an easy-to-understand way. So, you will not find the course difficult to follow.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-10 21:51:32', '2025-09-13 02:01:11'),
(3296, '3', 'How do I get a PRINCE2 certification?', '<p>To obtain the PRINCE2 certification, you need to follow these steps:</p><ul><li>Firstly, you must pass the&nbsp; PRINCE2 foundation-level exam, which is a 1-hour online exam with objective questions. The level of this exam is pretty basic, and anyone can take it.</li><li>Then, you must pass the PRINCE2 practitioner-level exam, which is 2.5 hours long and has objective questions. Since it is an advanced-level exam, you will be required to have at least some basic knowledge of project management.</li><li>Upon passing the respective exams, the PRINCE2 certificate is issued by AXELOS.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3297, '3', 'How many questions are there in the PRINCE2 Foundation and Practitioner Certification Exams, respectively?', '<p>The PRINCE2 Foundation Exam has a total of 60 questions that must be answered in 60 minutes.</p><p>The PRINCE2 Practitioner Exam has a total of 70 questions that must be answered in 150 minutes.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3298, '3', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment if necessary. We will refund the Prince2 course price after deducting an administration fee. To learn more, please read our&nbsp;Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3299, '3', 'What is included in the Prince2 training?', '<p>In Prince2 training, you’ll get access to our e-learning content, practice simulation tests, and tips and tricks videos that help you tackle the toughest exam questions. You will also get an online participant handbook that cross-references the e-learning material to reinforce your learning.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3300, '3', 'I’d like to learn more about this Prince2 training program. Who should I contact?', '<p>Contact us using the form on the right of any page on the Centuera website or select the Live Chat link. Our customer service representatives can provide you with more details about the Prince2 training program.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3301, '3', 'What industries use PRINCE2 Methodology most?', '<p>As PRINCE2 is a project management framework, it is not linked to a particular sector or company. You can use them in any company, sector, or form of project. PRINCE2® can help you gain a rewarding career in IT, manufacturing, finance, health care, and other fascinating industries.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3302, '3', 'Which companies hire PRINCE2 Certified Project Managers?', '<p>Companies such as Shell, BP, Transpower, IBM, HP, Aquasoft, Getronics, and Siemens, which have adopted PRINCE2 and PRINCE2® qualified professionals, are entitled to an average annual compensation of $97,915. Build your project management expertise with our PRINCE2® certification and take advantage of the high demand across industries.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3303, '3', 'What is the pay scale of PRINCE2 Professionals across the world?', '<p>According to the project management salary survey, the professional certification provides a 20 percent premium in typical earnings. The PRINCE2 qualification can improve your career and, above all, your earning potential. Let\'s see the average annual salary of PRINCE2 professionals across the world according to the<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=PRINCE2_(Projects_In_Controlled_Environments)/Salary\">&nbsp;PayScale</a>&nbsp;report:</p><ul><li>India: 2m</li><li>US: $99k</li><li>UK: £45k</li><li>Japan: ¥8m</li><li>Singapore: S$96K</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3304, '3', 'What is the Projects in Controlled Environments (PRINCE2) Certification?', '<p>The PRINCE2, or ‘Projects IN Controlled Environments\' certification, is a process-based project management method that offers a systematic approach to delivering a successful project with clear templates, processes, and steps. The certification is both process and project-focused.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3305, '3', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not affect your ability to complete the course. With our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can watch the recorded session of any missed class at your convenience. This allows you to stay up-to-date with the course content and meet the necessary requirements to progress and earn your certificate. Simply visit the Centuera learning platform, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance marked.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3306, '3', 'What do people think about Centuera’s PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner?', '<p>Centuera is highly regarded for offering valuable, career-boosting education. The&nbsp;PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner&nbsp;offers a well-structured and industry-relevant curriculum.<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Centuera testimonials&nbsp;and alumni reviews talk highly about the comprehensive course content, practical learning approach, and experienced instructors. The flexibility of the programs allows professionals to upskill while balancing work and personal commitments.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3307, '3', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner?', '<p>Centuera’s<strong>&nbsp;</strong>PRINCE2® Foundation and Practitioner<strong>&nbsp;</strong>is best suited for newcomers and experienced professionals. To be eligible to enroll in this course, applicants must have<strong>&nbsp;</strong>a bachelor\'s degree in any relevant field.<strong>&nbsp;</strong>A basic understanding of Project management&nbsp;is preferred but is not mandatory. Prior working experience is not compulsory.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-10 21:59:22', '2025-09-10 21:59:22'),
(3308, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the PMI-ACP exam fee is not part of the course fee. You are required to pay it directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI) for both the application and the examination.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3309, '8', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment. We will issue a refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3310, '8', 'What is the certification process?', '<p>Centuera has a clearly defined certification process designed to help you tackle the challenges of the IT industry.&nbsp;</p><p>To qualify for the certificate, you must meet the following criteria:<br>You need to complete at least 95% of the course or attend an entire batch.<br>You must finish your course with the minimum passing score if it includes simulation exams.<br>You are required to submit a project and obtain approval from our panel of subject matter experts.<br>If your project is not approved, our subject matter experts will provide the necessary assistance to help you succeed in your next attempt.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3311, '8', 'What is PMI-ACP used for?', '<p>The PMI-ACP is a widely recognized certification that showcases your comprehension of agile principles and your knowledge of agile techniques for leading agile projects. It enables Agile professionals to enhance their adaptability by incorporating various agile methodologies, including Lean, Scrum, extreme programming, Kanban, and test-driven development. Our PMI-ACP course is designed to prepare you for obtaining this esteemed credential.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3312, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP certification worth it?', '<p>Hiring professionals with PMI-ACP certification can enhance performance and provide companies with a competitive advantage. This certification is particularly beneficial for Agile practitioners looking to progress in their project management careers. Additionally, the PMI-ACP training helps newcomers acquire knowledge of contemporary project management methodologies, team dynamics, leadership skills, and the ability to allocate tasks, roles, and responsibilities among team members.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3313, '8', 'Which industries predominantly utilize agile project management?', '<p>Agile project management is prevalent in numerous sectors, such as healthcare, aviation, services, finance, engineering, construction, and supply chain management. Our PMI-ACP course can assist you in entering any of these domains.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3314, '8', 'What literature would you suggest for studying the PMI-ACP?', '<p>In addition to our PMI-ACP course, the following books are highly recommended to enhance, develop, and refine your agile skills:</p><ul><li>Agile Estimating and Planning by Mike Cohn</li><li>Agile Practice Guide by Project Management Institute, Inc.</li><li>Agile Project Management: Creating Innovative Products by Jim Highsmith</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3315, '8', 'What is the salary range for agile project managers globally?', '<p>Based on PayScale data, project managers holding a PMI-ACP certification earn an average annual salary across different countries of&nbsp;</p><ul><li>India - INR 15 lakhs</li><li>US - $93K</li><li>UK - £43K</li><li>Singapore - S$98K</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-10 22:03:17', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(3316, '4', 'How do I enroll for this CSM certification training?', '<p>You can enroll for this CSM certification training on our website and make an online payment using any of the following options:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>Diner’s Club</li><li>PayPal&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Once payment is received, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access information about the scrum master certification exam via email.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3317, '4', 'Is the CSM certification fee included in my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The scrum master certification and evaluation fees are included in the cost of this course, along with the costs of course materials and learning aids.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3318, '4', 'Do you provide a CSM course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we offer a CSM course completion certificate after you successfully complete the training program to help you become a Scrum Alliance Certified CSM.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3319, '4', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment in our certified scrum master training course. We provide a complete refund after deducting an administration fee. To learn more,&nbsp;please review our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://demo.centuera.com/refund-policy\">Refund Policy.</a></p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3320, '4', 'What qualification does a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) hold?', '<p>A Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) is a senior scrum master within the Scrum Alliance community who has attained Certified Scrum Trainer status through the Scrum Alliance. Stringent certification requirements are imposed on a scrum master earning his or her CSTs; all must be active contributors in the Scrum alliance community, typically having co-trained with multiple other CSTs for knowledge transfer and demonstrating a keen understanding of Scrum through multiple years of successful application in professional environments. Centuera trainers go one step further; all of our Scrum Alliance Certified Scrum Masters have both technical and business backgrounds and derive successful training expertise from hundreds of client-site coaching engagements.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3321, '4', 'How do I complete the ScrumMaster evaluation and receive my certificate?', '<p>Applicants of the Scrum master certification will receive an email from the Scrum Alliance within five business days of the course. After logging in to the Scrum Alliance website:</p><p>A Professional Scrum Master aspirant will need to complete a free, non-graded, online evaluation based on scrum concepts and agile principles to become a certified scrum developer.</p><p>Once this has been submitted and the terms &amp; conditions have been agreed to, students may download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p><p>Product owner students will need to accept the terms &amp; conditions. Scrum master certification aspirants may then download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3322, '4', 'What are the objectives of this CSM Certification Training?', '<p>This CSM certification training is designed to help you get a clear understanding of the Scrum framework and manage agile teams. In this Scrum master course, you’ll learn about Scrum roles, artifacts, sprint planning, sprint backlog, burndown charts, product backlog, retrospectives, and more.</p><p>This CSM Scrum Master Certification Course covers what it takes to become a Certified ScrumMaster and how to apply the Scrum Framework to various project complexities and scales.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3323, '4', 'Who Should do this CSM certification training?', '<p>Professionals who wish to start their Agile career and aim to become a CSM and manage a scrum team can take up this Certified Scrum Master Certification training.<br>This scrum master course can also be taken up by professionals who wish to effect organizational changes using their scrum mastery and fulfill the business goals of managers, product owners, senior executives, and the like as certified scrum professionals.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3324, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3325, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3326, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3327, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3328, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3329, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3330, '4', 'What are the benefits of the \"2-year membership with Scrum Alliance\"?', '<p>Being a scrum master with a 2-year membership with Scrum Alliance means that you get access to local user groups, online social networks, and additional member-only resources.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3331, '4', 'What is the pay scale of CSM professionals across the world?', '<p>According to report, a scrum master with CSM certification earns an average salary of $92,842 in a year with an entry-level salary of $70,000.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3332, '4', 'What is Global Teaching Assistance?', '<p>Our teaching assistants are a dedicated team of subject matter experts here to help you get certified as a data analyst on your first attempt. They engage students proactively to ensure the course path is followed and help you enrich your learning experience, from class onboarding to project mentoring and job assistance. Teaching Assistance is available during business hours.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3333, '4', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not affect your ability to complete the course. With our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can watch the recorded session of any missed class at your convenience. This allows you to stay up-to-date with the course content and meet the necessary requirements to progress and earn your certificate. Simply visit the Centuera learning platform, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance marked.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3334, '4', 'What is the review of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera continually receives positive reviews from its alumni for its Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training. Learners praise its practical, hands-on approach, industry-aligned curriculum, and expert instructors. Many users highlight the value of the globally recognized certificates and the flexible learning options that suit working professionals. You can check out the Centuera alumni review page to get a better understanding of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3335, '4', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)?', '<p>To be eligible for this&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), applicants should have a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant field. Centuera’s&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)&nbsp;can be taken up by newcomers and experienced professionals. Though prior knowledge of&nbsp;ScrumMaster&nbsp;is helpful, it is not compulsory. Additionally, there is no requirement for previous work experience.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-10 22:06:35', '2025-09-11 02:45:20'),
(3336, '5', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(3337, '5', 'What are the job opportunities/roles available after getting a CSPO certification?', '<p>Organizations are actively seeking skilled Agile professionals to manage their projects, indicating a strong demand for CSPO experts. Additionally, anyone can register for the CSPO certification program to become an agile professional. However, it is particularly beneficial for individuals in the following roles: Product Analyst, Release Engineer, Scrum or Agile Coach, Software Development Manager, Senior Software Project Manager, and Technical Program Manager. With adequate experience, one may also qualify for a C-level executive position.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(3338, '5', 'Who are the instructors for this Certified Scrum Product Owner training course, and how were they selected?', '<p>The trainers for this CSPO course are certified Scrum trainers who possess extensive professional and teaching experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(3339, '5', 'What is covered under the 24/7 support promise?', '<p>Our dedicated team is ready to support you via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums.<br>On-demand assistance is provided to help you navigate the CSPO certification course, ensuring an optimal experience during your educational journey.<br>After completing the CSPO certification training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(3340, '5', 'Which companies hire CSPO professionals?', '<p>Organizations are always on the lookout for Certified Scrum Product Owners to manage their Scrum and Agile initiatives. Notable companies such as Google, Apple, Facebook, Yahoo, Spotify, Adobe, Amazon, HSBC, Salesforce, Netflix, Lego, IBM, Deloitte, and Siemens actively recruit CSPO experts.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(3341, '5', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at a time that suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3342, '5', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(3343, '5', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a related discipline. Centuera\'s Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training is available for both beginners and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of scrum is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for prior work experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-10 22:10:14', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(3344, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for the LSSBB program. Please refer to our Refund Policy to review the eligibility criteria and submit refund requests (if eligible) through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3345, '7', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. For further details, please consult our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3346, '7', 'How long will it take for me to finish the LSSBB course?', '<p>The five-day training module for LSSBB will cover the essential concepts. By the conclusion of the five days, you will be equipped to apply these concepts and tools in real-life situations. Six Sigma emphasizes continuous learning and practical application.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3347, '7', 'What are the prerequisites for enrolling in the LSSBB course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam. However, it is advisable, though not mandatory, to have completed Lean Six Sigma training from a recognized institution, trainer, or corporate program. Additionally, while not required, it is beneficial for candidates to possess some level of real-world Lean Six Sigma experience and project application knowledge.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3348, '7', 'Why should I select Centuera for LSSBB instead of other courses?', '<p>Centuera is a leader in online training and certification, providing a blended delivery model that merges live online classroom instruction with self-paced e-learning. We have successfully trained over 12,000 professionals in 115 countries and offer a wide range of professional courses tailored to meet diverse needs. Our instructors are certified green belts and black belts with extensive knowledge of the Lean Six Sigma Methodology.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3349, '7', 'What is the purpose of the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt?', '<p>The Lean Six Sigma certification is beneficial for team leaders to assess, analyze, enhance, and manage critical processes that influence customer satisfaction and productivity improvement by adhering to the six sigma principles.</p><p>Individuals with Six Sigma training can also serve as internal consultants, working with various teams at the same time. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt training equips individuals with the essential skills and certification, which signifies their ability to apply these skills in a business setting for comprehensive process excellence responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3350, '7', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification?', '<p>After successfully achieving the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification, you can explore various job roles such as Operations Manager, Senior IT Project Manager, IT Project Lead, Business Process Analyst, Performance Excellence Analyst, Quality Analyst, Operations Head, Service &amp; Manufacturing Operations Head, Lean Six Sigma Consultant, Quality Auditor, Lead Manufacturing Engineer, Process Development Specialist, Compliance Structure Expert, and Quality Engineer.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3351, '7', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete the course will not be impacted by missing a live class. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your own convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3352, '7', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni speak highly of the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The flexibility of the programs enables professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-10 22:19:25', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(3353, '6', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee?', '<p>Yes. We provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.<br>Refund Process: If you do not pass the exam on your first attempt, Centuera will refund the entire course fee to you. To obtain a refund, you need to request it via the Help and Support Online. You must include a copy of your scorecard along with the date you completed your online classroom training. Centuera will issue the refund within 30 days of receiving all necessary documentation. The refund will be processed using the same payment method you used for the course.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3354, '6', 'Do you offer Minitab training?', '<p>Yes. We provide Minitab online training as a separate package.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3355, '6', 'What tools do I need to attend the training sessions?', '<p>To participate in six sigma green belt training, you will require the following tools:</p><ul><li>Windows: Windows XP SP3 or a later version</li><li>Mac: OSX 10.6 or a later version</li><li>Internet speed: Ideally 512 Kbps or faster</li><li>Headset, speakers, and microphone: It is essential to have headphones or speakers for clear audio instructions, along with a microphone for communication. You may opt for a headset that includes a microphone or use separate speakers and a microphone.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3356, '6', 'If I cancel my enrollment, will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3357, '6', 'What is the recommended learning path after completing Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification?', '<p>To enhance your career prospects, you might want to pursue a Post Graduate Program in Lean Six Sigma, which will help you become an expert in this area.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3358, '6', 'What are the job roles available after getting a Six Sigma certification?', '<p>An increasing number of organizations, regardless of their size, are employing Six Sigma professionals as either full-time staff or consultants. Upon obtaining our Six Sigma Certification, there are numerous lucrative career paths to explore. The specific job titles associated with Six Sigma vary based on the needs of the organization. Some potential positions include:</p><ul><li>Six Sigma Analyst</li><li>Business Process Manager</li><li>Six Sigma Consultant</li><li>Lead Analyst/Project Manager</li><li>Director of Operational Excellence</li><li>Senior Project Manager</li><li>Functional Project Lead</li><li>Six Sigma Projects Manager</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3359, '6', 'Which companies hire Six Sigma Experts?', '<p>Centuera\'s Six Sigma certification offers candidates an enhanced professional perspective. It\'s important to be inquisitive about the types of companies seeking Six Sigma professionals. Below is a curated list of the leading recruiters for Six Sigma in India and internationally:</p><ul><li>TCS</li><li>Accenture</li><li>UnitedHealth Group</li><li>HCL</li><li>McKesson Corporation</li><li>Genpact</li><li>Honeywell</li><li>IBM</li><li>Volkswagen</li><li>EMC Corporation</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3360, '6', 'What is the pay scale of Six Sigma Professional across the world?', '<p>The significance of Six Sigma levels is increasing across various industries. Consequently, our Six Sigma certification provides you with a competitive advantage in the market. Salaries for Six Sigma professionals vary globally based on factors such as location, industry, experience, and certifications. The average earnings of Six Sigma specialists around the world are:</p><ul><li>US: $107,500 (according to Salary.com)</li><li>India: 949k (according to PayScale.com)</li><li>Canada: $126,055 (according to Glassdoor)</li><li>UK: £42k (according to PayScale.com)</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3361, '6', 'Can I use the PDUs (Professional Development Units) earned from this course for other certifications?', '<p>Indeed, the 35 PDUs obtained from this course can contribute to the maintenance of other professional certifications, including the PMP.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3362, '6', 'Does Centuera have corporate training solutions?', '<p>Indeed, Centuera for Business provides educational solutions focused on the latest AI technologies and other digital competencies, including industry-recognized certifications. For talent development strategies, we collaborate with Fortune 500 companies as well as mid-sized enterprises, offering concise skill-based certification training and tailored role-specific learning paths. Additionally, we present a comprehensive learning library featuring unlimited live and interactive resources—Centuera Learning Hub+, which is available to your entire workforce. Our team of curriculum consultants partners with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that most effectively address their teams\' needs.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3363, '6', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed whenever it suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3364, '6', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from Centuera and reviews from alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-10 22:20:33', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(3365, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3366, '1', 'What is included in this PMP certification training course?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP certification course comprises:</p><ul><li>Instruction delivered by PMI-authorized trainers</li><li>A curriculum that is in alignment with PMBOK® 7th Edition</li><li>More than 12 simulation examinations</li><li>Study aids and planning resources</li><li>Access to official digital materials from PMI</li><li>Specialized support for exam applications</li></ul><p>Masterclasses concentrating on the utilization of GenAI in project management</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3367, '1', 'What career opportunities exist after earning a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can seek employment across various industries such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Common roles include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3368, '1', 'What are the key learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will develop the competencies to plan, execute, and complete projects efficiently using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course will enhance your skills in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, preparing you to lead projects confidently and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3369, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3370, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3371, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3372, '1', 'Can I retake the PMP exam if I fail on the first attempt?', '<p>Yes, you are permitted to retake the PMP exam if you do not succeed on your initial attempt. PMI allows a one-year eligibility window during which you can attempt the exam up to three times, with a fee applicable for each retake.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3373, '1', 'Is the PMP certification exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the fee for the PMP certification exam is not included in the course fee. You are required to pay it separately to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® when you apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3374, '1', 'Is this PMP course suitable for beginners or only for experienced professionals?', '<p>Yes, the Project Management Professional course is open to both beginners and seasoned professionals. However, it is essential to meet PMI’s experience and eligibility requirements to apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3375, '1', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training for PMP?', '<p>Yes, Centuera Learning Hub+ offers corporate training for PMP certification in India. Our programs are designed for teams or entire organizations, featuring flexible formats and customized content to assist professionals in enhancing their project management skills.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3376, '1', 'What is the validity and renewal process for the PMP certificate?', '<p>The PMP certificate remains valid for three years. To renew it, certified individuals must accumulate 60 Professional Development Units (PDUs) during this timeframe through activities such as training, webinars, and volunteering related to project management.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3377, '1', 'Can I pursue this PMP training without prior PM experience?', '<p>Yes, you are able to enroll in the PMP training without any prior project management experience. However, to be eligible for the PMP exam, you must fulfill PMI’s eligibility criteria.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3378, '1', 'How long will it take to finish this project management professional course?', '<p>The PMP course generally requires approximately 4 to 6 weeks for completion, contingent upon your learning speed and work commitments.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3379, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3380, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3381, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', '<p>The PMP certification delivers extensive knowledge of project management principles, empowering professionals with the insights, techniques, and tools needed to address real-world project challenges. Globally recognized, PMP is regarded as the gold standard for career advancement in project management. Earning a Project Management Professional certification unlocks new opportunities and career progression across various industries.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3382, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3383, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3384, '1', 'Is the PMP® exam fee included in the PMP certification fee?', '<p>No, the PMP certification exam fees are not encompassed within our PMP certification course. You are required to pay the exam fee directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® in order to take the exam. Should you require any assistance in completing the application form, please feel free to contact us via phone or chat.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3385, '1', 'How can I obtain the PMP certification?', '<p>Upon successfully passing the PMP certification exam, you will receive your certificate package within a timeframe of six to eight weeks. Additionally, you will be issued a digital badge through Credly, which you can share on social media to celebrate your accomplishment.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-10 23:49:03', '2025-09-13 01:59:49'),
(3386, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:<br>• IT professionals involved in software development projects<br>• Architects<br>• Business Analysts<br>• Developers<br>• QA testers<br>• Engineers<br>• Project/Product Managers</p>', '2025-09-11 02:24:32', '2025-09-11 02:23:31', '2025-09-11 02:24:32'),
(3387, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:25:32', '2025-09-11 02:24:32', '2025-09-11 02:25:32'),
(3388, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:25:32', '2025-09-11 02:24:32', '2025-09-11 02:25:32'),
(3389, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:25:32', '2025-09-11 02:26:31'),
(3390, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:25:32', '2025-09-11 02:26:31'),
(3391, '10', 'Is the course offered in an online or virtual format?', '<p>Yes, this course is available online through live, interactive sessions led by trainers certified by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:25:32', '2025-09-11 02:26:31'),
(3392, '10', 'How many PDUs will I qualify for?', '<p>By participating in our 2-day training program, you can earn 16 PDUs and SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:25:32', '2025-09-11 02:26:31'),
(3393, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3394, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3395, '10', 'Is the course offered in an online or virtual format?', '<p>Yes, this course is available online through live, interactive sessions led by trainers certified by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3396, '10', 'How many PDUs will I qualify for?', '<p>By participating in our 2-day training program, you can earn 16 PDUs and SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3397, '10', 'Where are PDUs and SEUs applicable?', '<p>PDUs and SEUs are credits granted by the Project Management Institute and the Scrum Alliance, respectively. They acknowledge your commitment to the fields of Project Management and Agile by awarding credits for each educational endeavor you undertake throughout your career. Currently, members of the Scrum Alliance who possess a Certified Scrum Professional®, Certified Enterprise Coach, and/or Certified Scrum Trainer credential are required to earn SEUs for recertification. Every PMI® certification, with the exception of the CAPM®, mandates that you accumulate a specific number of PDUs within a three-year certification cycle.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3398, '10', 'Should I pay separately for the certification fee?', '<p>No, the certification fee is included in the workshop fee.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3399, '10', 'How will the course benefit me?', '<p>Our extensive CSD training course enables you to obtain the Certified Scrum Developer® credential from Scrum Alliance, giving you a competitive advantage over your colleagues. The theoretical sessions provide real design and code examples, while the practical sessions and exercises will enhance your comprehension and knowledge of Scrum development, aligning it with industry standards. Additionally, as a holder of the CSD credential, you will have a dedicated profile page on the Scrum Alliance website and can utilize a specially crafted logo to showcase your credentials.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3400, '10', 'How do I earn a CSD credential?', '<p>To obtain a CSD credential, you must complete at least two days of formal training conducted by Scrum Alliance REAs. This includes:</p><p>A minimum of two days of formal training from a Scrum Alliance-approved CSD educator.• You are also required to demonstrate your understanding of Agile practices by successfully passing a CSD assessment/evaluation provided by the trainer.<br>• The trainer will subsequently upload and cover the certification fees for students.<br>• You will receive a notification to accept your CSD license.<br>• Upon acceptance, the CSD certification will be added to your profile.<br>• The certification remains valid for two years.<br>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:26:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31'),
(3401, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3402, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3403, '10', 'Is the course offered in an online or virtual format?', '<p>Yes, this course is available online through live, interactive sessions led by trainers certified by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3404, '10', 'How many PDUs will I qualify for?', '<p>By participating in our 2-day training program, you can earn 16 PDUs and SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3405, '10', 'Where are PDUs and SEUs applicable?', '<p>PDUs and SEUs are credits granted by the Project Management Institute and the Scrum Alliance, respectively. They acknowledge your commitment to the fields of Project Management and Agile by awarding credits for each educational endeavor you undertake throughout your career. Currently, members of the Scrum Alliance who possess a Certified Scrum Professional®, Certified Enterprise Coach, and/or Certified Scrum Trainer credential are required to earn SEUs for recertification. Every PMI® certification, with the exception of the CAPM®, mandates that you accumulate a specific number of PDUs within a three-year certification cycle.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3406, '10', 'Should I pay separately for the certification fee?', '<p>No, the certification fee is included in the workshop fee.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3407, '10', 'How will the course benefit me?', '<p>Our extensive CSD training course enables you to obtain the Certified Scrum Developer® credential from Scrum Alliance, giving you a competitive advantage over your colleagues. The theoretical sessions provide real design and code examples, while the practical sessions and exercises will enhance your comprehension and knowledge of Scrum development, aligning it with industry standards. Additionally, as a holder of the CSD credential, you will have a dedicated profile page on the Scrum Alliance website and can utilize a specially crafted logo to showcase your credentials.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3408, '10', 'How do I earn a CSD credential?', '<p>To obtain a CSD credential, you must complete at least two days of formal training conducted by Scrum Alliance REAs. This includes:</p><ul><li>A minimum of two days of formal training from a Scrum Alliance-approved CSD educator.</li><li>You are also required to demonstrate your understanding of Agile practices by successfully passing a CSD assessment/evaluation provided by the trainer.</li><li>The trainer will subsequently upload and cover the certification fees for students.</li><li>You will receive a notification to accept your CSD license.</li><li>Upon acceptance, the CSD certification will be added to your profile.</li><li>The certification remains valid for two years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3409, '10', 'I hold a CSM certification. Is it sufficient for me to complete the 3-day Technical Track training to qualify as a CSD?', '<p>All individuals aspiring to become a Certified Scrum Developer must now undergo a 2-day formal training session with an educator approved by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3410, '10', 'How long is the certification valid?', '<p>The CSD certification remains valid for a period of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:27:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31'),
(3411, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3412, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3413, '10', 'Is the course offered in an online or virtual format?', '<p>Yes, this course is available online through live, interactive sessions led by trainers certified by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3414, '10', 'How many PDUs will I qualify for?', '<p>By participating in our 2-day training program, you can earn 16 PDUs and SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3415, '10', 'Where are PDUs and SEUs applicable?', '<p>PDUs and SEUs are credits granted by the Project Management Institute and the Scrum Alliance, respectively. They acknowledge your commitment to the fields of Project Management and Agile by awarding credits for each educational endeavor you undertake throughout your career. Currently, members of the Scrum Alliance who possess a Certified Scrum Professional®, Certified Enterprise Coach, and/or Certified Scrum Trainer credential are required to earn SEUs for recertification. Every PMI® certification, with the exception of the CAPM®, mandates that you accumulate a specific number of PDUs within a three-year certification cycle.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3416, '10', 'Should I pay separately for the certification fee?', '<p>No, the certification fee is included in the workshop fee.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3417, '10', 'How will the course benefit me?', '<p>Our extensive CSD training course enables you to obtain the Certified Scrum Developer® credential from Scrum Alliance, giving you a competitive advantage over your colleagues. The theoretical sessions provide real design and code examples, while the practical sessions and exercises will enhance your comprehension and knowledge of Scrum development, aligning it with industry standards. Additionally, as a holder of the CSD credential, you will have a dedicated profile page on the Scrum Alliance website and can utilize a specially crafted logo to showcase your credentials.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3418, '10', 'How do I earn a CSD credential?', '<p>To obtain a CSD credential, you must complete at least two days of formal training conducted by Scrum Alliance REAs. This includes:</p><ul><li>A minimum of two days of formal training from a Scrum Alliance-approved CSD educator.</li><li>You are also required to demonstrate your understanding of Agile practices by successfully passing a CSD assessment/evaluation provided by the trainer.</li><li>The trainer will subsequently upload and cover the certification fees for students.</li><li>You will receive a notification to accept your CSD license.</li><li>Upon acceptance, the CSD certification will be added to your profile.</li><li>The certification remains valid for two years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3419, '10', 'I hold a CSM certification. Is it sufficient for me to complete the 3-day Technical Track training to qualify as a CSD?', '<p>All individuals aspiring to become a Certified Scrum Developer must now undergo a 2-day formal training session with an educator approved by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3420, '10', 'How long is the certification valid?', '<p>The CSD certification remains valid for a period of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3421, '10', 'In which global cities does Centuera offer CSD certification training?', '<p>Centuera is a prominent Registered Education Ally (REA) of Scrum Alliance, providing knowledge and expertise to corporate entities and professionals worldwide. It is the fastest-growing certification training organization, with a presence in over 70 countries. We regularly conduct CSD training in various cities around the world, and here are a few examples for your reference:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-bangalore\">Bangalore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-hyderabad\">Hyderabad</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-mumbai\">Mumbai</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-delhi\">Delhi</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kolkata\">Kolkata</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-gurgaon\">Gurgaon</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-noida\">Noida</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chennai\">Chennai</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-cochin\">Cochin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-pune\">Pune</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-newyork\">New York</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chicago\">Chicago</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanfrancisco\">San Francisco</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-atlanta\">Atlanta</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-washington\">Washington</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-houston\">Houston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training\">Austin</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-losangeles\">Los Angeles</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-dallas\">Dallas</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-boston\">Boston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-seattle\">Seattle</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanjose\">San Jose</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-singapore\">Singapore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kualalumpur\">Kuala Lumpur</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3422, '10', 'If I decide to cancel my enrollment, will I receive a refund?', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:28:31', '2025-09-11 02:30:31'),
(3423, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:31:30', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:31:30'),
(3424, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:31:30', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:31:30'),
(3425, '10', 'Is the course offered in an online or virtual format?', '<p>Yes, this course is available online through live, interactive sessions led by trainers certified by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:31:30', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:31:30'),
(3426, '10', 'How many PDUs will I qualify for?', '<p>By participating in our 2-day training program, you can earn 16 PDUs and SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:31:30', '2025-09-11 02:30:31', '2025-09-11 02:31:30'),
