(3523, '10', 'Where are PDUs and SEUs applicable?', '<p>PDUs and SEUs are credits granted by the Project Management Institute and the Scrum Alliance, respectively. They acknowledge your commitment to the fields of Project Management and Agile by awarding credits for each educational endeavor you undertake throughout your career. Currently, members of the Scrum Alliance who possess a Certified Scrum Professional®, Certified Enterprise Coach, and/or Certified Scrum Trainer credential are required to earn SEUs for recertification. Every PMI® certification, with the exception of the CAPM®, mandates that you accumulate a specific number of PDUs within a three-year certification cycle.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3524, '10', 'Should I pay separately for the certification fee?', '<p>No, the certification fee is included in the workshop fee.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3525, '10', 'How will the course benefit me?', '<p>Our extensive CSD training course enables you to obtain the Certified Scrum Developer® credential from Scrum Alliance, giving you a competitive advantage over your colleagues. The theoretical sessions provide real design and code examples, while the practical sessions and exercises will enhance your comprehension and knowledge of Scrum development, aligning it with industry standards. Additionally, as a holder of the CSD credential, you will have a dedicated profile page on the Scrum Alliance website and can utilize a specially crafted logo to showcase your credentials.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3526, '10', 'How do I earn a CSD credential?', '<p>To obtain a CSD credential, you must complete at least two days of formal training conducted by Scrum Alliance REAs. This includes:</p><ul><li>A minimum of two days of formal training from a Scrum Alliance-approved CSD educator.</li><li>You are also required to demonstrate your understanding of Agile practices by successfully passing a CSD assessment/evaluation provided by the trainer.</li><li>The trainer will subsequently upload and cover the certification fees for students.</li><li>You will receive a notification to accept your CSD license.</li><li>Upon acceptance, the CSD certification will be added to your profile.</li><li>The certification remains valid for two years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3527, '10', 'I hold a CSM certification. Is it sufficient for me to complete the 3-day Technical Track training to qualify as a CSD?', '<p>All individuals aspiring to become a Certified Scrum Developer must now undergo a 2-day formal training session with an educator approved by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3528, '10', 'How long is the certification valid?', '<p>The CSD certification remains valid for a period of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3529, '10', 'In which global cities does Centuera offer CSD certification training?', '<p>Centuera is a prominent Registered Education Ally (REA) of Scrum Alliance, providing knowledge and expertise to corporate entities and professionals worldwide. It is the fastest-growing certification training organization, with a presence in over 70 countries. We regularly conduct CSD training in various cities around the world, and here are a few examples for your reference:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-bangalore\">Bangalore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-hyderabad\">Hyderabad</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-mumbai\">Mumbai</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-delhi\">Delhi</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kolkata\">Kolkata</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-gurgaon\">Gurgaon</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-noida\">Noida</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chennai\">Chennai</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-cochin\">Cochin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-pune\">Pune</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-newyork\">New York</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chicago\">Chicago</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanfrancisco\">San Francisco</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-atlanta\">Atlanta</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-washington\">Washington</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-houston\">Houston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training\">Austin</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-losangeles\">Los Angeles</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-dallas\">Dallas</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-boston\">Boston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-seattle\">Seattle</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanjose\">San Jose</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-singapore\">Singapore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kualalumpur\">Kuala Lumpur</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3530, '10', 'If I decide to cancel my enrollment, will I receive a refund?', '<p>With our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee policy, you can be confident in the highest quality standards. At Centuera, we are committed to making your learning experience with us exemplary. However, if for any reason your expectations are not fulfilled, we will refund the course fee as per our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:39:32', '2025-09-11 02:40:33'),
(3531, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3532, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3533, '10', 'Is the course offered in an online or virtual format?', '<p>Yes, this course is available online through live, interactive sessions led by trainers certified by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3534, '10', 'How many PDUs will I qualify for?', '<p>By participating in our 2-day training program, you can earn 16 PDUs and SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3535, '10', 'Where are PDUs and SEUs applicable?', '<p>PDUs and SEUs are credits granted by the Project Management Institute and the Scrum Alliance, respectively. They acknowledge your commitment to the fields of Project Management and Agile by awarding credits for each educational endeavor you undertake throughout your career. Currently, members of the Scrum Alliance who possess a Certified Scrum Professional®, Certified Enterprise Coach, and/or Certified Scrum Trainer credential are required to earn SEUs for recertification. Every PMI® certification, with the exception of the CAPM®, mandates that you accumulate a specific number of PDUs within a three-year certification cycle.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3536, '10', 'Should I pay separately for the certification fee?', '<p>No, the certification fee is included in the workshop fee.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3537, '10', 'How will the course benefit me?', '<p>Our extensive CSD training course enables you to obtain the Certified Scrum Developer® credential from Scrum Alliance, giving you a competitive advantage over your colleagues. The theoretical sessions provide real design and code examples, while the practical sessions and exercises will enhance your comprehension and knowledge of Scrum development, aligning it with industry standards. Additionally, as a holder of the CSD credential, you will have a dedicated profile page on the Scrum Alliance website and can utilize a specially crafted logo to showcase your credentials.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3538, '10', 'How do I earn a CSD credential?', '<p>To obtain a CSD credential, you must complete at least two days of formal training conducted by Scrum Alliance REAs. This includes:</p><ul><li>A minimum of two days of formal training from a Scrum Alliance-approved CSD educator.</li><li>You are also required to demonstrate your understanding of Agile practices by successfully passing a CSD assessment/evaluation provided by the trainer.</li><li>The trainer will subsequently upload and cover the certification fees for students.</li><li>You will receive a notification to accept your CSD license.</li><li>Upon acceptance, the CSD certification will be added to your profile.</li><li>The certification remains valid for two years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3539, '10', 'I hold a CSM certification. Is it sufficient for me to complete the 3-day Technical Track training to qualify as a CSD?', '<p>All individuals aspiring to become a Certified Scrum Developer must now undergo a 2-day formal training session with an educator approved by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
(3540, '10', 'How long is the certification valid?', '<p>The CSD certification remains valid for a period of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:41:36', '2025-09-11 02:40:33', '2025-09-11 02:41:36'),
