(3559, '10', 'Where are PDUs and SEUs applicable?', '<p>PDUs and SEUs are credits granted by the Project Management Institute and the Scrum Alliance, respectively. They acknowledge your commitment to the fields of Project Management and Agile by awarding credits for each educational endeavor you undertake throughout your career. Currently, members of the Scrum Alliance who possess a Certified Scrum Professional®, Certified Enterprise Coach, and/or Certified Scrum Trainer credential are required to earn SEUs for recertification. Every PMI® certification, with the exception of the CAPM®, mandates that you accumulate a specific number of PDUs within a three-year certification cycle.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3560, '10', 'Should I pay separately for the certification fee?', '<p>No, the certification fee is included in the workshop fee.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3561, '10', 'How will the course benefit me?', '<p>Our extensive CSD training course enables you to obtain the Certified Scrum Developer® credential from Scrum Alliance, giving you a competitive advantage over your colleagues. The theoretical sessions provide real design and code examples, while the practical sessions and exercises will enhance your comprehension and knowledge of Scrum development, aligning it with industry standards. Additionally, as a holder of the CSD credential, you will have a dedicated profile page on the Scrum Alliance website and can utilize a specially crafted logo to showcase your credentials.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3562, '10', 'How do I earn a CSD credential?', '<p>To obtain a CSD credential, you must complete at least two days of formal training conducted by Scrum Alliance REAs. This includes:</p><ul><li>A minimum of two days of formal training from a Scrum Alliance-approved CSD educator.</li><li>You are also required to demonstrate your understanding of Agile practices by successfully passing a CSD assessment/evaluation provided by the trainer.</li><li>The trainer will subsequently upload and cover the certification fees for students.</li><li>You will receive a notification to accept your CSD license.</li><li>Upon acceptance, the CSD certification will be added to your profile.</li><li>The certification remains valid for two years.</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3563, '10', 'I hold a CSM certification. Is it sufficient for me to complete the 3-day Technical Track training to qualify as a CSD?', '<p>All individuals aspiring to become a Certified Scrum Developer must now undergo a 2-day formal training session with an educator approved by Scrum Alliance.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3564, '10', 'How long is the certification valid?', '<p>The CSD certification remains valid for a period of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3565, '10', 'In which global cities does Centuera offer CSD certification training?', '<p>Centuera is a prominent Registered Education Ally (REA) of Scrum Alliance, providing knowledge and expertise to corporate entities and professionals worldwide. It is the fastest-growing certification training organization, with a presence in over 70 countries. We regularly conduct CSD training in various cities around the world, and here are a few examples for your reference:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-bangalore\">Bangalore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-hyderabad\">Hyderabad</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-mumbai\">Mumbai</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-delhi\">Delhi</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kolkata\">Kolkata</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-gurgaon\">Gurgaon</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-noida\">Noida</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chennai\">Chennai</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-cochin\">Cochin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-pune\">Pune</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-newyork\">New York</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chicago\">Chicago</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanfrancisco\">San Francisco</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-atlanta\">Atlanta</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-washington\">Washington</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-houston\">Houston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training\">Austin</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-losangeles\">Los Angeles</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-dallas\">Dallas</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-boston\">Boston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-seattle\">Seattle</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanjose\">San Jose</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-singapore\">Singapore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kualalumpur\">Kuala Lumpur</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3566, '10', 'If I decide to cancel my enrollment, will I receive a refund?', '<p>With our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee policy, you can be confident in the highest quality standards. At Centuera, we are committed to making your learning experience with us exemplary. However, if for any reason your expectations are not fulfilled, we will refund the course fee as per our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:42:34', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3567, '10', 'Who should take this CSD course?', '<p>Our CSD Training and Certification is designed for individuals holding a CSD Credential who are:</p><p>IT professionals involved in software development projects</p><ul><li>Architects</li><li>Business Analysts</li><li>Developers</li><li>QA testers</li><li>Engineers</li><li>Project/Product Managers</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3568, '10', 'What is the significance of obtaining a CSD Certification?', '<p>Scrum is quickly becoming the preferred method for product development, and the Certified Scrum Developer (CSD) certification is awarded to individuals who have proven their understanding of Scrum principles through formal training and a technical evaluation. For teams to thrive with Scrum, they need to possess specific skills and competencies. They should be capable of deconstructing functionality into manageable segments that fit within sprints and creating high-quality software that can be easily modified.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3569, '10', 'Is the course offered in an online or virtual format?', '<p>Yes, this course is available online through live, interactive sessions led by trainers certified by Scrum Alliance.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3570, '10', 'How many PDUs will I qualify for?', '<p>By participating in our 2-day training program, you can earn 16 PDUs and SEUs.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3571, '10', 'Where are PDUs and SEUs applicable?', '<p>PDUs and SEUs are credits granted by the Project Management Institute and the Scrum Alliance, respectively. They acknowledge your commitment to the fields of Project Management and Agile by awarding credits for each educational endeavor you undertake throughout your career. Currently, members of the Scrum Alliance who possess a Certified Scrum Professional®, Certified Enterprise Coach, and/or Certified Scrum Trainer credential are required to earn SEUs for recertification. Every PMI® certification, with the exception of the CAPM®, mandates that you accumulate a specific number of PDUs within a three-year certification cycle.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3572, '10', 'Should I pay separately for the certification fee?', '<p>No, the certification fee is included in the workshop fee.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3573, '10', 'How will the course benefit me?', '<p>Our extensive CSD training course enables you to obtain the Certified Scrum Developer® credential from Scrum Alliance, giving you a competitive advantage over your colleagues. The theoretical sessions provide real design and code examples, while the practical sessions and exercises will enhance your comprehension and knowledge of Scrum development, aligning it with industry standards. Additionally, as a holder of the CSD credential, you will have a dedicated profile page on the Scrum Alliance website and can utilize a specially crafted logo to showcase your credentials.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3574, '10', 'How do I earn a CSD credential?', '<p>To obtain a CSD credential, you must complete at least two days of formal training conducted by Scrum Alliance REAs. This includes:</p><ul><li>A minimum of two days of formal training from a Scrum Alliance-approved CSD educator.</li><li>You are also required to demonstrate your understanding of Agile practices by successfully passing a CSD assessment/evaluation provided by the trainer.</li><li>The trainer will subsequently upload and cover the certification fees for students.</li><li>You will receive a notification to accept your CSD license.</li><li>Upon acceptance, the CSD certification will be added to your profile.</li><li>The certification remains valid for two years.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3575, '10', 'I hold a CSM certification. Is it sufficient for me to complete the 3-day Technical Track training to qualify as a CSD?', '<p>All individuals aspiring to become a Certified Scrum Developer must now undergo a 2-day formal training session with an educator approved by Scrum Alliance.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3576, '10', 'How long is the certification valid?', '<p>The CSD certification remains valid for a period of 2 years.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3577, '10', 'In which global cities does Centuera offer CSD certification training?', '<p>Centuera is a prominent Registered Education Ally (REA) of Scrum Alliance, providing knowledge and expertise to corporate entities and professionals worldwide. It is the fastest-growing certification training organization, with a presence in over 70 countries. We regularly conduct CSD training in various cities around the world, and here are a few examples for your reference:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-bangalore\">Bangalore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-hyderabad\">Hyderabad</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-mumbai\">Mumbai</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-delhi\">Delhi</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kolkata\">Kolkata</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-gurgaon\">Gurgaon</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-noida\">Noida</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chennai\">Chennai</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-cochin\">Cochin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-pune\">Pune</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-newyork\">New York</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-chicago\">Chicago</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanfrancisco\">San Francisco</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-atlanta\">Atlanta</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-washington\">Washington</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-houston\">Houston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training\">Austin</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-losangeles\">Los Angeles</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-dallas\">Dallas</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-boston\">Boston</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-seattle\">Seattle</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-sanjose\">San Jose</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-singapore\">Singapore</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.knowledgehut.com/agile-management/csd-certification-training-kualalumpur\">Kuala Lumpur</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3578, '10', 'If I decide to cancel my enrollment, will I receive a refund?', '<p>With our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee policy, you can be confident in the highest quality standards. At Centuera, we are committed to making your learning experience with us exemplary. However, if for any reason your expectations are not fulfilled, we will refund the course fee as per our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-11 02:43:30', '2025-09-11 02:43:30'),
(3579, '4', 'How do I enroll for this CSM certification training?', '<p>You can enroll for this CSM certification training on our website and make an online payment using any of the following options:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>Diner’s Club</li><li>PayPal&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Once payment is received, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access information about the scrum master certification exam via email.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3580, '4', 'Is the CSM certification fee included in my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The scrum master certification and evaluation fees are included in the cost of this course, along with the costs of course materials and learning aids.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3581, '4', 'Do you provide a CSM course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we offer a CSM course completion certificate after you successfully complete the training program to help you become a Scrum Alliance Certified CSM.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3582, '4', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment in our certified scrum master training course. We provide a complete refund after deducting an administration fee. To learn more,&nbsp;please review our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://demo.centuera.com/refund-policy\">Refund Policy.</a></p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3583, '4', 'What qualification does a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) hold?', '<p>A Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) is a senior scrum master within the Scrum Alliance community who has attained Certified Scrum Trainer status through the Scrum Alliance. Stringent certification requirements are imposed on a scrum master earning his or her CSTs; all must be active contributors in the Scrum alliance community, typically having co-trained with multiple other CSTs for knowledge transfer and demonstrating a keen understanding of Scrum through multiple years of successful application in professional environments. Centuera trainers go one step further; all of our Scrum Alliance Certified Scrum Masters have both technical and business backgrounds and derive successful training expertise from hundreds of client-site coaching engagements.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3584, '4', 'How do I complete the ScrumMaster evaluation and receive my certificate?', '<p>Applicants of the Scrum master certification will receive an email from the Scrum Alliance within five business days of the course. After logging in to the Scrum Alliance website:</p><p>A Professional Scrum Master aspirant will need to complete a free, non-graded, online evaluation based on scrum concepts and agile principles to become a certified scrum developer.</p><p>Once this has been submitted and the terms &amp; conditions have been agreed to, students may download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p><p>Product owner students will need to accept the terms &amp; conditions. Scrum master certification aspirants may then download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3585, '4', 'What are the objectives of this CSM Certification Training?', '<p>This CSM certification training is designed to help you get a clear understanding of the Scrum framework and manage agile teams. In this Scrum master course, you’ll learn about Scrum roles, artifacts, sprint planning, sprint backlog, burndown charts, product backlog, retrospectives, and more.</p><p>This CSM Scrum Master Certification Course covers what it takes to become a Certified ScrumMaster and how to apply the Scrum Framework to various project complexities and scales.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3586, '4', 'Who Should do this CSM certification training?', '<p>Professionals who wish to start their Agile career and aim to become a CSM and manage a scrum team can take up this Certified Scrum Master Certification training.<br>This scrum master course can also be taken up by professionals who wish to effect organizational changes using their scrum mastery and fulfill the business goals of managers, product owners, senior executives, and the like as certified scrum professionals.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3587, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3588, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3589, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3590, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3591, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3592, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3593, '4', 'What are the benefits of the \"2-year membership with Scrum Alliance\"?', '<p>Being a scrum master with a 2-year membership with Scrum Alliance means that you get access to local user groups, online social networks, and additional member-only resources.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3594, '4', 'What is the pay scale of CSM professionals across the world?', '<p>According to report, a scrum master with CSM certification earns an average salary of $92,842 in a year with an entry-level salary of $70,000.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3595, '4', 'What is Global Teaching Assistance?', '<p>Our teaching assistants are a dedicated team of subject matter experts here to help you get certified as a data analyst on your first attempt. They engage students proactively to ensure the course path is followed and help you enrich your learning experience, from class onboarding to project mentoring and job assistance. Teaching Assistance is available during business hours.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3596, '4', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not affect your ability to complete the course. With our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can watch the recorded session of any missed class at your convenience. This allows you to stay up-to-date with the course content and meet the necessary requirements to progress and earn your certificate. Simply visit the Centuera learning platform, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance marked.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3597, '4', 'What is the review of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera continually receives positive reviews from its alumni for its Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training. Learners praise its practical, hands-on approach, industry-aligned curriculum, and expert instructors. Many users highlight the value of the globally recognized certificates and the flexible learning options that suit working professionals. You can check out the Centuera alumni review page to get a better understanding of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3598, '4', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)?', '<p>To be eligible for this&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), applicants should have a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant field. Centuera’s&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)&nbsp;can be taken up by newcomers and experienced professionals. Though prior knowledge of&nbsp;ScrumMaster&nbsp;is helpful, it is not compulsory. Additionally, there is no requirement for previous work experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-11 02:45:20', '2025-09-13 02:26:33'),
(3599, '11', 'How can I register for the SAFe Agilist classroom training?', NULL, '2025-09-11 03:26:32', '2025-09-11 03:25:33', '2025-09-11 03:26:32'),
(3600, '11', 'How can I register for the SAFe Agilist classroom training?', '<p>You can register for this classroom training through our online platform. Payments can be made using any of the following methods, and a receipt will be automatically sent to the candidate via email.</p><ul><li>Visa Debit/Credit Card</li><li>American Express and Diners Club Card</li><li>Master Card</li><li>PayPal</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 03:27:33', '2025-09-11 03:26:32', '2025-09-11 03:27:33'),
(3601, '11', 'Is it possible to cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment. We offer a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:27:33', '2025-09-11 03:26:32', '2025-09-11 03:27:33'),
(3602, '11', 'How can I register for the SAFe Agilist classroom training?', '<p>You can register for this classroom training through our online platform. Payments can be made using any of the following methods, and a receipt will be automatically sent to the candidate via email.</p><ul><li>Visa Debit/Credit Card</li><li>American Express and Diners Club Card</li><li>Master Card</li><li>PayPal</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 03:28:31', '2025-09-11 03:27:33', '2025-09-11 03:28:31'),
(3603, '11', 'Is it possible to cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment. We offer a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:28:31', '2025-09-11 03:27:33', '2025-09-11 03:28:31'),
(3604, '11', 'Who is this SAFe Agile certification intended for?', '<p>The SAFe® Agilist certification is aimed at professionals who aspire to lead a Lean-Agile enterprise and acquire expertise in the framework at a strategic level. This certification is also appropriate for individuals working as project managers, team leads, portfolio managers, business analysts, change agents, and product managers.</p><p>Obtaining the SAFe Agilist certification enables IT professionals to lead agile teams and understand the continuous delivery pipeline to effectively manage and optimize Agile Release Trains.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:28:31', '2025-09-11 03:27:33', '2025-09-11 03:28:31'),
(3605, '11', 'What are the requirements for this SAFe Agile Certification course?', '<p>Candidates seeking to obtain the SAFe Agile certification should possess a minimum of five years of experience in software development, project management, testing, or business analysis. Some hands-on experience with Scrum is also beneficial.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:28:31', '2025-09-11 03:27:33', '2025-09-11 03:28:31'),
