(3610, '11', 'What is the purpose of SAFe Agile?', '<p>SAFe Agile is utilized for scaling Agile by integrating iterative development processes with Lean manufacturing. Additionally, it facilitates quicker product delivery to the market, improves productivity and quality, and fosters customer engagement. This SAFe course will cover all aspects of SAFe Agile and provide a comprehensive understanding of the applications of Agile.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:29:31', '2025-09-11 03:28:31', '2025-09-11 03:29:31'),
