(3645, '11', 'Why select Centuera as your Leading SAFe® Certification provider?', '<p>Choosing Centuera as your Leading Scaled Agile Framework or SAFe® training provider offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>Accreditation</li><li>Skilled trainers</li><li>Flexible learning options</li><li>Exam preparation that includes practice tests</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 03:34:33', '2025-09-11 03:33:31', '2025-09-11 03:34:33'),
(3646, '11', 'What are the various SAFe Certifications offered by Scaled Agile?', '<p>Scaled Agile provides a variety of certifications designed to enhance professionals\' understanding and expertise in the SAFe framework. Below are the available SAFe certifications:</p><ul><li>SAFe Agilist (SA)</li><li>SAFe for Teams (SP)</li><li>SAFe Scrum Master (SSM)</li><li>SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager (POPM)</li><li>SAFe Release Train Engineer (RTE)</li><li>SAFe DevOps Practitioner (SDP)</li><li>SAFe Agile Software Engineer (ASE)</li><li>SAFe Government Practitioner (SGP)</li></ul><p>In summary, SAFe 6 builds on the foundations and methodologies of SAFe 5, with a greater emphasis on Business Agility, Agile Product Delivery, Continuous Learning Culture, and Lean Portfolio Management. Additionally, SAFe 6 introduces a new Core Value and modifies the metrics used to assess progress in Agile initiatives.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:34:33', '2025-09-11 03:33:31', '2025-09-11 03:34:33'),
(3647, '11', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Centuera for Business collaborates with Fortune 500 and mid-sized enterprises to equip their workforce with digital skills solutions aimed at talent development. We offer a wide range of corporate training options, from brief skill-based certification courses to comprehensive role-based learning paths. Furthermore, we provide Centuera Learning Hub+ - a resource library featuring unlimited live and interactive solutions for the entire organization. Our curriculum consultants partner with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that best align with their teams\' needs and goals.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:34:33', '2025-09-11 03:33:31', '2025-09-11 03:34:33'),
(3648, '11', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to finish the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:34:33', '2025-09-11 03:33:31', '2025-09-11 03:34:33'),
(3649, '11', 'How can I register for the SAFe Agilist classroom training?', '<p>You can register for this classroom training through our online platform. Payments can be made using any of the following methods, and a receipt will be automatically sent to the candidate via email.</p><ul><li>Visa Debit/Credit Card</li><li>American Express and Diners Club Card</li><li>Master Card</li><li>PayPal</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 03:35:31', '2025-09-11 03:34:33', '2025-09-11 03:35:31'),
