(3854, '11', 'What are the various SAFe Certifications offered by Scaled Agile?', '<p>Scaled Agile provides a variety of certifications designed to enhance professionals\' understanding and expertise in the SAFe framework. Below are the available SAFe certifications:</p><ul><li>SAFe Agilist (SA)</li><li>SAFe for Teams (SP)</li><li>SAFe Scrum Master (SSM)</li><li>SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager (POPM)</li><li>SAFe Release Train Engineer (RTE)</li><li>SAFe DevOps Practitioner (SDP)</li><li>SAFe Agile Software Engineer (ASE)</li><li>SAFe Government Practitioner (SGP)</li></ul><p>In summary, SAFe 6 builds on the foundations and methodologies of SAFe 5, with a greater emphasis on Business Agility, Agile Product Delivery, Continuous Learning Culture, and Lean Portfolio Management. Additionally, SAFe 6 introduces a new Core Value and modifies the metrics used to assess progress in Agile initiatives.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:48:36', '2025-09-11 03:49:34'),
(3855, '11', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Centuera for Business collaborates with Fortune 500 and mid-sized enterprises to equip their workforce with digital skills solutions aimed at talent development. We offer a wide range of corporate training options, from brief skill-based certification courses to comprehensive role-based learning paths. Furthermore, we provide Centuera Learning Hub+ - a resource library featuring unlimited live and interactive solutions for the entire organization. Our curriculum consultants partner with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that best align with their teams\' needs and goals.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:48:36', '2025-09-11 03:49:34'),
(3856, '11', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to finish the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:48:36', '2025-09-11 03:49:34'),
(3857, '11', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification?', '<p>Centuera is highly regarded for offering valuable, career-boosting education. The Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification&gt; offers a well-structured and industry-relevant curriculum. Centuera testimonials and alumni reviews talk highly about the comprehensive course content, practical learning approach, and experienced instructors. The flexibility of the programs allows professionals to upskill while balancing work and personal commitments.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:48:36', '2025-09-11 03:49:34'),
(3858, '11', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification?', '<p>Centuera’s Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification is best suited for newcomers and experienced professionals. To be eligible to enroll in this course, applicants must have a bachelor\'s degree in any relevant field. A basic understanding of Scrum is preferred but is not mandatory. Prior working experience is not compulsory.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:48:36', '2025-09-11 03:49:34'),
(3859, '11', 'How can I register for the SAFe Agilist classroom training?', '<p>You can register for this classroom training through our online platform. Payments can be made using any of the following methods, and a receipt will be automatically sent to the candidate via email.</p><ul><li>Visa Debit/Credit Card</li><li>American Express and Diners Club Card</li><li>Master Card</li><li>PayPal</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3860, '11', 'Is it possible to cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment. We offer a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3861, '11', 'Who is this SAFe Agile certification intended for?', '<p>The SAFe® Agilist certification is aimed at professionals who aspire to lead a Lean-Agile enterprise and acquire expertise in the framework at a strategic level. This certification is also appropriate for individuals working as project managers, team leads, portfolio managers, business analysts, change agents, and product managers.</p><p>Obtaining the SAFe Agilist certification enables IT professionals to lead agile teams and understand the continuous delivery pipeline to effectively manage and optimize Agile Release Trains.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3862, '11', 'What are the requirements for this SAFe Agile Certification course?', '<p>Candidates seeking to obtain the SAFe Agile certification should possess a minimum of five years of experience in software development, project management, testing, or business analysis. Some hands-on experience with Scrum is also beneficial.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3863, '11', 'What is the purpose of SAFe Agile?', '<p>SAFe Agile is utilized for scaling Agile by integrating iterative development processes with Lean manufacturing. Additionally, it facilitates quicker product delivery to the market, improves productivity and quality, and fosters customer engagement. This SAFe course will cover all aspects of SAFe Agile and provide a comprehensive understanding of the applications of Agile.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3864, '11', 'What skills should a SAFe Agilist possess?', '<p>A SAFe Agilist should have the following skills:</p><ul><li>Lean-Agile Leadership capabilities</li><li>Team and Technical Agility</li><li>Implementation of DevOps principles and practices to deliver products on schedule according to customer needs</li><li>Capability to solve business challenges using Lean principles</li><li>Lean Portfolio Management</li></ul><p>Through this SAFe agile certification, you will gain the skills listed above and more.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3865, '11', 'Which companies are seeking SAFe Agilists?', '<p>Some prominent companies that hire certified SAFe® professionals include Capgemini, Comcast Cable, Inc., Accenture, and Federal Express Corporation.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3866, '11', 'What is the salary range for SAFe Agile certification professionals globally?', '<p>SAFe certified professionals are essential in facilitating the effective adoption of lean enterprise practices within their organizations. The salary for SAFe® Agilist certified professionals can vary based on several factors such as location, company, experience, and industry. According to Glassdoor data, the average salary for a SAFe® Agilist in the United States is approximately $110,000 annually. However, this can range from $75,000 to over $150,000 based on the aforementioned factors.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3867, '11', 'Why select Centuera as your Leading SAFe® Certification provider?', '<p>Choosing Centuera as your Leading Scaled Agile Framework or SAFe® training provider offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>Accreditation</li><li>Skilled trainers</li><li>Flexible learning options</li><li>Exam preparation that includes practice tests</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3868, '11', 'What are the various SAFe Certifications offered by Scaled Agile?', '<p>Scaled Agile provides a variety of certifications designed to enhance professionals\' understanding and expertise in the SAFe framework. Below are the available SAFe certifications:</p><ul><li>SAFe Agilist (SA)</li><li>SAFe for Teams (SP)</li><li>SAFe Scrum Master (SSM)</li><li>SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager (POPM)</li><li>SAFe Release Train Engineer (RTE)</li><li>SAFe DevOps Practitioner (SDP)</li><li>SAFe Agile Software Engineer (ASE)</li><li>SAFe Government Practitioner (SGP)</li></ul><p>In summary, SAFe 6 builds on the foundations and methodologies of SAFe 5, with a greater emphasis on Business Agility, Agile Product Delivery, Continuous Learning Culture, and Lean Portfolio Management. Additionally, SAFe 6 introduces a new Core Value and modifies the metrics used to assess progress in Agile initiatives.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3869, '11', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Centuera for Business collaborates with Fortune 500 and mid-sized enterprises to equip their workforce with digital skills solutions aimed at talent development. We offer a wide range of corporate training options, from brief skill-based certification courses to comprehensive role-based learning paths. Furthermore, we provide Centuera Learning Hub+ - a resource library featuring unlimited live and interactive solutions for the entire organization. Our curriculum consultants partner with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that best align with their teams\' needs and goals.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3870, '11', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to finish the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
(3871, '11', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification?', '<p>Centuera is highly regarded for offering valuable, career-boosting education. The Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification&gt; offers a well-structured and industry-relevant curriculum. Centuera testimonials and alumni reviews talk highly about the comprehensive course content, practical learning approach, and experienced instructors. The flexibility of the programs allows professionals to upskill while balancing work and personal commitments.</p>', '2025-09-11 03:49:50', '2025-09-11 03:49:34', '2025-09-11 03:49:50'),
