(3887, '12', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly skilled and certified instructors who possess over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:52:53', '2025-09-11 05:51:51', '2025-09-11 05:52:53'),
