(3890, '12', 'Where will the training be held?', '<p>The location will be confirmed a few weeks before the training, and you will receive notification via email. If you have any inquiries, feel free to reach out to us 24/7 using the form located on the right side of any page on the Centuera website, select the Live Chat option, or contact Help &amp; Support.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:53:51', '2025-09-11 05:52:53', '2025-09-11 05:53:51'),
