(3912, '12', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee for the training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do offer a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:55:50', '2025-09-11 05:56:52'),
(3913, '12', 'Do you provide a course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we provide a course completion certificate once you successfully finish the training program.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:55:50', '2025-09-11 05:56:52'),
(3914, '12', 'Is the certification fee part of my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The costs for certification and evaluation are included in the total course fee, which also covers the expenses for course materials and learning resources.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:55:50', '2025-09-11 05:56:52'),
(3915, '12', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly skilled and certified instructors who possess over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3916, '12', 'What is the duration of the course?', '<p>The SAFe Scrum Master certification course consists of an engaging two-day classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3917, '12', 'Where will the training be held?', '<p>The location will be confirmed a few weeks before the training, and you will receive notification via email. If you have any inquiries, feel free to reach out to us 24/7 using the form located on the right side of any page on the Centuera website, select the Live Chat option, or contact Help &amp; Support.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3918, '12', 'How do I enroll in this online training?', '<p>You can register for this training on our website and complete your payment online using any of the following methods:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>Diner’s Club</li><li>PayPal</li></ul><p>Upon receipt of your payment, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access details via email.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3919, '12', 'Do you provide transportation and refreshments with the training?', '<p>Transportation and refreshments are not included in the training package.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3920, '12', 'Can I change the city, place, and date after enrolling for the classroom training?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the city, venue, and date for the classroom training, although a rescheduling fee will apply. For further details, please consult our Rescheduling Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3921, '12', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. To find out more, please review our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3922, '12', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee for the training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do offer a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3923, '12', 'Do you provide a course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we provide a course completion certificate once you successfully finish the training program.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3924, '12', 'Is the certification fee part of my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The costs for certification and evaluation are included in the total course fee, which also covers the expenses for course materials and learning resources.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:56:52', '2025-09-11 05:57:51'),
(3925, '12', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly skilled and certified instructors who possess over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:58:50', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:58:50'),
(3926, '12', 'What is the duration of the course?', '<p>The SAFe Scrum Master certification course consists of an engaging two-day classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 05:58:50', '2025-09-11 05:57:51', '2025-09-11 05:58:50'),
