(3990, '12', 'Can I change the city, place, and date after enrolling for the classroom training?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the city, venue, and date for the classroom training, although a rescheduling fee will apply. For further details, please consult our Rescheduling Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:06:53', '2025-09-11 06:07:56'),
(3991, '12', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. To find out more, please review our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:06:53', '2025-09-11 06:07:56'),
(3992, '12', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee for the training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do offer a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:06:53', '2025-09-11 06:07:56'),
(3993, '12', 'Do you provide a course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we provide a course completion certificate once you successfully finish the training program.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:06:53', '2025-09-11 06:07:56'),
(3994, '12', 'Is the certification fee part of my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The costs for certification and evaluation are included in the total course fee, which also covers the expenses for course materials and learning resources.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:06:53', '2025-09-11 06:07:56'),
(3995, '12', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly skilled and certified instructors who possess over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:12:50', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:12:50'),
(3996, '12', 'What is the duration of the course?', '<p>The SAFe Scrum Master certification course consists of an engaging two-day classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:12:50', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:12:50'),
(3997, '12', 'Where will the training be held?', '<p>The location will be confirmed a few weeks before the training, and you will receive notification via email. If you have any inquiries, feel free to reach out to us 24/7 using the form located on the right side of any page on the Centuera website, select the Live Chat option, or contact Help &amp; Support.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:12:50', '2025-09-11 06:07:56', '2025-09-11 06:12:50'),
