(4067, '13', 'Can I change the city, place, and date after enrolling for the classroom training?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the city, place, and date for the classroom training, but a rescheduling fee will apply. For further details, please refer to our Rescheduling Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:37:32', '2025-09-11 06:36:31', '2025-09-11 06:37:32'),
(4068, '13', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course price after deducting an administration fee. To find out more, please review our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:37:32', '2025-09-11 06:36:31', '2025-09-11 06:37:32'),
(4069, '13', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:37:32', '2025-09-11 06:36:31', '2025-09-11 06:37:32'),
(4070, '13', 'Who issues the certification?', NULL, '2025-09-11 06:37:32', '2025-09-11 06:36:31', '2025-09-11 06:37:32'),
(4071, '13', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly qualified and certified instructors who have over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:38:33', '2025-09-11 06:37:32', '2025-09-11 06:38:33'),
(4072, '13', 'What is the duration of the course?', '<p>The SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager certification course consists of an interactive two-day classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:38:33', '2025-09-11 06:37:32', '2025-09-11 06:38:33'),
(4073, '13', 'Where will the training be held?', '<p>The venue will be confirmed a few weeks before the training, and you will be notified via email. If you have any inquiries, feel free to reach out to us 24/7 using the form on the right side of any page on the Centuera website, select the Live Chat link, or contact Help &amp; Support.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:38:33', '2025-09-11 06:37:32', '2025-09-11 06:38:33'),
