(4144, '13', 'How do I enroll in this online training?', '<p>You can register for this training on our website and complete your payment online using any of the following methods:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>PayPal</li></ul><p>Once your payment is processed, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access details via email.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:44:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35'),
(4145, '13', 'Do you provide transportation and refreshments with the training?', '<p>Transportation and refreshments are not included in the training package.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:44:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35'),
(4146, '13', 'Can I change the city, place, and date after enrolling for the classroom training?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the city, place, and date for the classroom training, but a rescheduling fee will apply. For further details, please refer to our Rescheduling Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:44:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35'),
(4147, '13', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course price after deducting an administration fee. To find out more, please review our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:44:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35'),
(4148, '13', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:44:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35'),
(4149, '13', 'Who issues the certification?', '<p>The certification is issued by the esteemed Scaled Agile.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:44:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35'),
(4150, '13', 'Is the certification fee part of my course fee?', '<p>Yes, the fees for certification and evaluation are included in the total cost of this course, which also covers the expenses for course materials and learning aids.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:44:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35'),
(4151, '13', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly qualified and certified instructors who have over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', '2025-09-11 06:48:33', '2025-09-11 06:45:35', '2025-09-11 06:48:33'),
