(4201, '14', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 22:20:06', '2025-09-11 22:14:56', '2025-09-11 22:20:06'),
(4202, '14', 'Will missing a live class impact my ability to finish the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to complete the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-11 22:20:06', '2025-09-11 22:14:56', '2025-09-11 22:20:06'),
(4203, '14', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM)?', '<p>Centuera consistently garners positive feedback from its graduates regarding its Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM). Participants commend its practical, hands-on methodology, industry-relevant curriculum, and knowledgeable instructors. Numerous users emphasize the worth of the globally acknowledged certificates and the adaptable learning options that cater to working professionals. You can visit the Centuera alumni review page to gain a clearer insight into Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM).</p>', '2025-09-11 22:20:06', '2025-09-11 22:14:56', '2025-09-11 22:20:06'),
(4204, '14', 'What are the eligibility requirements to register for the Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) program?', '<p>Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) is ideal for both beginners and seasoned professionals. To qualify for this course, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. While a fundamental understanding of Scrum is advantageous, it is not a strict requirement. Previous work experience is not necessary.</p>', '2025-09-11 22:20:06', '2025-09-11 22:14:56', '2025-09-11 22:20:06'),
(4205, '14', 'Does Centuera provide any additional online courses related to Agile and Scrum?', '<p>Yes, Centuera offers a variety of other online courses in the Agile and Scrum domains. These encompass specialized certifications, master\'s programs, and post-graduate courses designed for various skill levels. Centuera places a strong emphasis on upskilling and enhancing career prospects across different industry sectors, with each course crafted to assist learners in advancing their knowledge in Agile and Scrum.<br>Similar programs that we provide in the Agile and Scrum categories include:</p><ul><li>Scrum Master Certification</li><li>CSPO Certification</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>SAFe POPM</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>Introduction to SAFe</li><li>Agile Scrum Master Basics</li></ul>', '2025-09-11 22:20:06', '2025-09-11 22:14:56', '2025-09-11 22:20:06'),
(4206, '14', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-11 22:21:58', '2025-09-11 22:20:06', '2025-09-11 22:21:58'),
(4207, '14', 'Will missing a live class impact my ability to finish the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to complete the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-11 22:21:58', '2025-09-11 22:20:06', '2025-09-11 22:21:58'),
