(4212, '14', 'Will missing a live class impact my ability to finish the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to complete the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-11 22:21:58', '2025-09-13 01:58:26'),
(4213, '14', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM)?', '<p>Centuera consistently garners positive feedback from its graduates regarding its Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM). Participants commend its practical, hands-on methodology, industry-relevant curriculum, and knowledgeable instructors. Numerous users emphasize the worth of the globally acknowledged certificates and the adaptable learning options that cater to working professionals. You can visit the Centuera alumni review page to gain a clearer insight into Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM).</p>', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-11 22:21:58', '2025-09-13 01:58:26'),
(4214, '14', 'What are the eligibility requirements to register for the Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) program?', '<p>Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) is ideal for both beginners and seasoned professionals. To qualify for this course, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. While a fundamental understanding of Scrum is advantageous, it is not a strict requirement. Previous work experience is not necessary.</p>', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-11 22:21:58', '2025-09-13 01:58:26'),
(4215, '14', 'Does Centuera provide any additional online courses related to Agile and Scrum?', '<p>Yes, Centuera offers a variety of other online courses in the Agile and Scrum domains. These encompass specialized certifications, master\'s programs, and post-graduate courses designed for various skill levels. Centuera places a strong emphasis on upskilling and enhancing career prospects across different industry sectors, with each course crafted to assist learners in advancing their knowledge in Agile and Scrum.<br>Similar programs that we provide in the Agile and Scrum categories include:</p><ul><li>Scrum Master Certification</li><li>CSPO Certification</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>SAFe POPM</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>Introduction to SAFe</li><li>Agile Scrum Master Basics</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-11 22:21:58', '2025-09-13 01:58:26'),
(4216, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:02:14', '2025-09-12 01:00:23', '2025-09-12 01:02:14'),
(4217, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:02:14', '2025-09-12 01:00:23', '2025-09-12 01:02:14'),
(4218, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><p>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.<br>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.<br>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.<br>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.<br>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.<br>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.<br>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-12 01:02:14', '2025-09-12 01:00:23', '2025-09-12 01:02:14'),
(4219, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:02:14', '2025-09-12 01:05:21'),
(4220, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:02:14', '2025-09-12 01:05:21'),
(4221, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:02:14', '2025-09-12 01:05:21'),
(4222, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:02:14', '2025-09-12 01:05:21'),
(4223, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4224, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4225, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4226, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4227, '15', 'Who is eligible for A-CSPO Certification Training?', '<p>This certification is well-suited for Product Owners, Business Analysts, Project Managers, Product Managers, and Team Members who already hold a CSPO certification and wish to enhance their knowledge and skills in advanced product ownership through this program.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4228, '15', 'What skills are included in the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO Certification training encompasses advanced skills such as techniques for managing backlogs, strategies for stakeholder collaboration, refining product vision, developing product roadmaps, applying Agile principles in complex settings, scaling Agile practices, facilitating team collaboration, and methods for maximizing product value and return on investment (ROI).</p>', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4229, '15', 'Is there a test for the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>No, there is no test. However, participants are required to complete appropriate training from a recognized organization like Centuera and meet the Scrum Alliance’s experience criteria to obtain the certification.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4230, '15', 'How many PDUs and SEUs can I earn by participating in the A-CSPO training?', NULL, '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:05:21', '2025-09-12 01:06:21'),
(4231, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4232, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4233, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(4234, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4235, '15', 'Who is eligible for A-CSPO Certification Training?', '<p>This certification is well-suited for Product Owners, Business Analysts, Project Managers, Product Managers, and Team Members who already hold a CSPO certification and wish to enhance their knowledge and skills in advanced product ownership through this program.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4236, '15', 'What skills are included in the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO Certification training encompasses advanced skills such as techniques for managing backlogs, strategies for stakeholder collaboration, refining product vision, developing product roadmaps, applying Agile principles in complex settings, scaling Agile practices, facilitating team collaboration, and methods for maximizing product value and return on investment (ROI).</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4237, '15', 'Is there a test for the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>No, there is no test. However, participants are required to complete appropriate training from a recognized organization like Centuera and meet the Scrum Alliance’s experience criteria to obtain the certification.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4238, '15', 'How many PDUs and SEUs can I earn by participating in the A-CSPO training?', '<p>By attending the A-CSPO 16-hour training program, you can earn up to 16 PDUs and 16 SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4239, '15', 'What is the process for renewing the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>To renew the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification, you must submit 30 SEUs (Scrum Education Units) and pay a fee of $175 every two years.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4240, '15', 'What is the validity period of the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification remains valid for a duration of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4241, '15', 'Is there a specific currency preferred for payments, particularly for international students?', '<p>While we accept various currencies for payments, we suggest using the currency of the country where you intend to take the course.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
(4242, '15', 'Can I make payments online via your website, or is it necessary to go to a physical location?', NULL, '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:06:21', '2025-09-12 01:07:23'),
