(4254, '15', 'Can I make payments online via your website, or is it necessary to go to a physical location?', '<p>Payments can be easily processed through our secure online payment portal on our website. There is no need to visit a physical location for making payments.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:08:25'),
(4255, '15', 'Are there any discounts or promotions available for early payments?', '<p>Yes, we provide discounts and promotions for early payments or specific corporate training. Please check our website or reach out to us for exciting offers.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:08:25'),
(4256, '15', 'Is it possible to pay for the course in installments, or is full payment required at the start?', '<p>You can choose to pay for the course either in full at the beginning or in installments, based on your preference. For more information, please contact us.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:08:25'),
(4257, '15', 'Will I receive a refund if I decide to cancel my enrollment?', '<p>No, refunds are not available. However, you can reschedule your course. For more details on refunds, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:07:23', '2025-09-12 01:08:25'),
