(4270, '15', 'Are there any discounts or promotions available for early payments?', '<p>Yes, we provide discounts and promotions for early payments or specific corporate training. Please check our website or reach out to us for exciting offers.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:09:21'),
(4271, '15', 'Is it possible to pay for the course in installments, or is full payment required at the start?', '<p>You can choose to pay for the course either in full at the beginning or in installments, based on your preference. For more information, please contact us.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:09:21'),
(4272, '15', 'Will I receive a refund if I decide to cancel my enrollment?', '<p>No, refunds are not available. However, you can reschedule your course. For more details on refunds, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:09:21'),
(4273, '15', 'How will I receive my payment receipt?', '<p>After your payment is successfully processed, you will get a confirmation email along with your payment invoices.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:09:21'),
(4274, '15', 'Are there any transaction or processing fees?', '<p>No, there are no transaction processing fees.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:09:21'),
(4275, '15', 'Which cards do you accept?', NULL, '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:08:25', '2025-09-12 01:09:21'),
(4276, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4277, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4278, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4279, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4280, '15', 'Who is eligible for A-CSPO Certification Training?', '<p>This certification is well-suited for Product Owners, Business Analysts, Project Managers, Product Managers, and Team Members who already hold a CSPO certification and wish to enhance their knowledge and skills in advanced product ownership through this program.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4281, '15', 'What skills are included in the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO Certification training encompasses advanced skills such as techniques for managing backlogs, strategies for stakeholder collaboration, refining product vision, developing product roadmaps, applying Agile principles in complex settings, scaling Agile practices, facilitating team collaboration, and methods for maximizing product value and return on investment (ROI).</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4282, '15', 'Is there a test for the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>No, there is no test. However, participants are required to complete appropriate training from a recognized organization like Centuera and meet the Scrum Alliance’s experience criteria to obtain the certification.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4283, '15', 'How many PDUs and SEUs can I earn by participating in the A-CSPO training?', '<p>By attending the A-CSPO 16-hour training program, you can earn up to 16 PDUs and 16 SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4284, '15', 'What is the process for renewing the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>To renew the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification, you must submit 30 SEUs (Scrum Education Units) and pay a fee of $175 every two years.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4285, '15', 'What is the validity period of the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification remains valid for a duration of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4286, '15', 'Is there a specific currency preferred for payments, particularly for international students?', '<p>While we accept various currencies for payments, we suggest using the currency of the country where you intend to take the course.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4287, '15', 'Can I make payments online via your website, or is it necessary to go to a physical location?', '<p>Payments can be easily processed through our secure online payment portal on our website. There is no need to visit a physical location for making payments.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4288, '15', 'Are there any discounts or promotions available for early payments?', '<p>Yes, we provide discounts and promotions for early payments or specific corporate training. Please check our website or reach out to us for exciting offers.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4289, '15', 'Is it possible to pay for the course in installments, or is full payment required at the start?', '<p>You can choose to pay for the course either in full at the beginning or in installments, based on your preference. For more information, please contact us.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4290, '15', 'Will I receive a refund if I decide to cancel my enrollment?', '<p>No, refunds are not available. However, you can reschedule your course. For more details on refunds, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
