(4293, '15', 'Which cards do you accept?', '<p>We accept payments from VISA, MasterCard, Maestro, AMEX, and Discover.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4294, '15', 'What payment methods are available?', '<p>We offer a variety of payment options. You can pay online using Credit Cards, Debit Cards, and Net Banking, as well as through Direct Bank Transfer/Wire Transfer/Wallet to our account, among others. Additional payment options include Stripe, Splitit, and PayPal for US &amp; CA regions. PO Exam &amp; Certification</p>', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:09:21', '2025-09-12 01:10:21'),
(4295, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-12 01:11:20', '2025-09-12 01:10:21', '2025-09-12 01:11:20'),
