(4580, '16', 'What is a CBAP course?', '<p>The Certified Business Analysis Professional (CBAP®) course is a widely recognized certification in business analysis for seasoned professionals. This course encompasses essential concepts from the BABOK® Guide and improves your analytical, documentation, and solution development skills—equipping you for the CBAP certification exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:12:04', '2025-09-12 02:11:04', '2025-09-12 02:12:04'),
(4581, '16', 'What is a CBAP course?', '<p>The Certified Business Analysis Professional (CBAP®) course is a widely recognized certification in business analysis for seasoned professionals. This course encompasses essential concepts from the BABOK® Guide and improves your analytical, documentation, and solution development skills—equipping you for the CBAP certification exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:12:04', '2025-09-12 02:13:01'),
(4582, '16', 'Who should take the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP training is perfect for seasoned business analysts looking to advance into positions such as Senior Business Analyst, Business Analysis Manager, or Chief Analyst. It is also ideal for consultants, project managers, and individuals engaged in business processes or strategy. The CBAP certification holds significant value in data-centric industries.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:12:04', '2025-09-12 02:13:01'),
(4583, '16', 'What are the prerequisites for the CBAP course?', '<p>The requirements for the CBAP® certification include:</p><ul><li>7,500 hours of experience in business analysis</li><li>A minimum of 900 hours completed in four of the six BABOK® knowledge areas</li><li>35 hours of professional development in business analysis<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:12:04', '2025-09-12 02:13:01'),
(4584, '16', 'What is a CBAP course?', '<p>The Certified Business Analysis Professional (CBAP®) course is a widely recognized certification in business analysis for seasoned professionals. This course encompasses essential concepts from the BABOK® Guide and improves your analytical, documentation, and solution development skills—equipping you for the CBAP certification exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:00', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:00'),
(4585, '16', 'Who should take the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP training is perfect for seasoned business analysts looking to advance into positions such as Senior Business Analyst, Business Analysis Manager, or Chief Analyst. It is also ideal for consultants, project managers, and individuals engaged in business processes or strategy. The CBAP certification holds significant value in data-centric industries.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:00', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:00'),
(4586, '16', 'What are the prerequisites for the CBAP course?', '<p>The requirements for the CBAP® certification include:</p><ul><li>7,500 hours of experience in business analysis</li><li>A minimum of 900 hours completed in four of the six BABOK® knowledge areas</li><li>35 hours of professional development in business analysis<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 02:14:00', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:00'),
(4587, '16', 'Is the CBAP course recognized internationally?', '<p>Indeed, the CBAP certification is recognized globally across various industries. It enhances your professional credibility and affirms your leadership and analytical capabilities. Whether your goal is to advance locally or internationally, the certified business analysis professional certification paves the way for senior career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:00', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:00'),
(4588, '16', 'What is the duration of the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP course generally spans 3 to 6 months, depending on your availability and selected format. The online CBAP course provides flexibility for working professionals, including live sessions, practical case studies, and mock exams to help you prepare for the certification.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:00', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:00'),
(4589, '16', 'What career options can I pursue after finishing the CBAP course?', '<p>After completing the CBAP training, you may seek positions such as Business Analyst, Product Owner, Business Consultant, or Project Manager. The certified business analysis professional course is highly esteemed in the IT, banking, healthcare, and consulting industries.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:00', '2025-09-12 02:13:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:00'),
