(4596, '16', 'How can I register for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The CBAP exam can be taken online from your home or at a Pearson VUE testing center. To begin, ensure you fulfill the eligibility criteria, create an IIBA account, submit your application, and pay the required fee. Once your application is approved, you can schedule your exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:58', '2025-09-12 02:14:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:58'),
(4597, '16', 'What study resources are necessary for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The primary study resource for the CBAP exam is the BABOK® Guide. Additionally, you may utilize CBAP preparation books and take practice exams. Centuera’s CBAP course offers structured lessons and practice tests, providing comprehensive preparation to help you grasp the concepts and be ready for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:58', '2025-09-12 02:14:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:58'),
(4598, '16', 'What is the passing rate for CBAP exams?', '<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Although IIBA does not officially reveal the passing rate for the CBAP exam, it is estimated that the average passing score is around 70% or higher. Therefore, it is advisable to aim for a score between 80% and 90% to ensure a better chance of success. Practice tests will assist you in evaluating your knowledge and ensuring you are well-prepared for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:14:58', '2025-09-12 02:14:01', '2025-09-12 02:14:58'),
