(4633, '16', 'Who are the trainers for the CBAP training, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are meticulously chosen and possess over 15 years of training and professional experience. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a training demonstration before being certified to conduct training for us. We also ensure that only those trainers with a high alumni rating continue to provide training for us.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:17:59', '2025-09-12 02:16:59', '2025-09-12 02:17:59'),
(4634, '16', 'Is it possible to receive a refund if I need to cancel my CBAP course enrollment?', '<p>Yes. You are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please consult our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:17:59', '2025-09-12 02:16:59', '2025-09-12 02:17:59'),
(4635, '16', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Discover how Centuera for Business can empower your teams with the latest AI and other digital skills, including industry certifications. Our customized training and learning paths are specifically designed for Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies, focusing on targeted skill development for their workforce. Delve into our extensive learning library, Centuera Learning Hub+, which offers unlimited live interactive solutions accessible organization-wide. Our committed curriculum consultants work closely with each client to pinpoint and implement the most suitable learning solutions for their teams\' requirements.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:17:59', '2025-09-12 02:16:59', '2025-09-12 02:17:59'),
