(4901, '16', 'What is the passing rate for CBAP exams?', '<p>Although IIBA does not officially reveal the passing rate for the CBAP exam, it is estimated that the average passing score is around 70% or higher. Therefore, it is advisable to aim for a score between 80% and 90% to ensure a better chance of success. Practice tests will assist you in evaluating your knowledge and ensuring you are well-prepared for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4902, '16', 'What is the current demand for business analysts?', '<p>Today, organizations depend on data to make informed decisions. Consequently, there is a high demand for business analysts who can transform complex data into actionable business insights. On a global level, the big data analytics market is projected to expand from USD 348.21 billion in 2024 to USD 961.89 billion by 2032, with a CAGR of 13.5%. This underscores the growing demand for business analysts as well.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4903, '16', 'What is the typical salary for an individual holding a CBAP title?', '<p>The typical salary for a CBAP title holder can fluctuate depending on factors such as experience, geographical location, industry, and the size of the company. Below are the average yearly salaries for professionals at various experience levels:</p><ul><li>Entry-Level (0–2 years): ₹4L – ₹6L per annum</li><li>Mid-Level (3–6 years): ₹6L – ₹12L per annum</li><li>Senior-Level (7+ years): ₹12L – ₹20L+ per annum</li></ul><p>Possessing a CBAP certification can enable you to secure a higher salary in competitive job markets.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4904, '16', 'What responsibilities does a Certified Business Analysis Professional have?', '<p>Certified professionals engage in advanced analysis, pinpoint business requirements, and provide strategic solutions. Participating in a CBAP course prepares you to spearhead initiatives, enhance processes, and effectively convey business value.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4905, '16', 'Who are the trainers for the CBAP training, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are meticulously chosen and possess over 15 years of training and professional experience. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a training demonstration before being certified to conduct training for us. We also ensure that only those trainers with a high alumni rating continue to provide training for us.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4906, '16', 'Is it possible to receive a refund if I need to cancel my CBAP course enrollment?', '<p>Yes. You are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please consult our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4907, '16', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Discover how Centuera for Business can empower your teams with the latest AI and other digital skills, including industry certifications. Our customized training and learning paths are specifically designed for Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies, focusing on targeted skill development for their workforce. Delve into our extensive learning library, Centuera Learning Hub+, which offers unlimited live interactive solutions accessible organization-wide. Our committed curriculum consultants work closely with each client to pinpoint and implement the most suitable learning solutions for their teams\' requirements.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4908, '16', 'What does the 24/7 Support promise include?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to assist you through email, chat, calls, and community forums. We provide on-demand support to help you successfully complete the CBAP Certification Training. Once you finish the CBAP Certification Training course, you will enjoy lifetime access to the community forum.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:41:03', '2025-09-12 02:42:04'),
(4909, '16', 'What is a CBAP course?', '<p>The Certified Business Analysis Professional (CBAP®) course is a widely recognized certification in business analysis for seasoned professionals. This course encompasses essential concepts from the BABOK® Guide and improves your analytical, documentation, and solution development skills—equipping you for the CBAP certification exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4910, '16', 'Who should take the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP training is perfect for seasoned business analysts looking to advance into positions such as Senior Business Analyst, Business Analysis Manager, or Chief Analyst. It is also ideal for consultants, project managers, and individuals engaged in business processes or strategy. The CBAP certification holds significant value in data-centric industries.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4911, '16', 'What are the prerequisites for the CBAP course?', '<p>The requirements for the CBAP® certification include:</p><ul><li>7,500 hours of experience in business analysis</li><li>A minimum of 900 hours completed in four of the six BABOK® knowledge areas</li><li>35 hours of professional development in business analysis<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4912, '16', 'Is the CBAP course recognized internationally?', '<p>Indeed, the CBAP certification is recognized globally across various industries. It enhances your professional credibility and affirms your leadership and analytical capabilities. Whether your goal is to advance locally or internationally, the certified business analysis professional certification paves the way for senior career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4913, '16', 'What is the duration of the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP course generally spans 3 to 6 months, depending on your availability and selected format. The online CBAP course provides flexibility for working professionals, including live sessions, practical case studies, and mock exams to help you prepare for the certification.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4914, '16', 'What career options can I pursue after finishing the CBAP course?', '<p>After completing the CBAP training, you may seek positions such as Business Analyst, Product Owner, Business Consultant, or Project Manager. The certified business analysis professional course is highly esteemed in the IT, banking, healthcare, and consulting industries.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4915, '16', 'How can I register for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The CBAP exam can be taken online from your home or at a Pearson VUE testing center. To begin, ensure you fulfill the eligibility criteria, create an IIBA account, submit your application, and pay the required fee. Once your application is approved, you can schedule your exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(4916, '16', 'What study resources are necessary for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The primary study resource for the CBAP exam is the BABOK® Guide. Additionally, you may utilize CBAP preparation books and take practice exams. Centuera’s CBAP course offers structured lessons and practice tests, providing comprehensive preparation to help you grasp the concepts and be ready for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4917, '16', 'What is the passing rate for CBAP exams?', '<p>Although IIBA does not officially reveal the passing rate for the CBAP exam, it is estimated that the average passing score is around 70% or higher. Therefore, it is advisable to aim for a score between 80% and 90% to ensure a better chance of success. Practice tests will assist you in evaluating your knowledge and ensuring you are well-prepared for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
(4918, '16', 'What is the current demand for business analysts?', '<p>Today, organizations depend on data to make informed decisions. Consequently, there is a high demand for business analysts who can transform complex data into actionable business insights. On a global level, the big data analytics market is projected to expand from USD 348.21 billion in 2024 to USD 961.89 billion by 2032, with a CAGR of 13.5%. This underscores the growing demand for business analysts as well.</p>', '2025-09-12 02:43:04', '2025-09-12 02:42:04', '2025-09-12 02:43:04'),
