(4958, '16', 'Who should take the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP training is perfect for seasoned business analysts looking to advance into positions such as Senior Business Analyst, Business Analysis Manager, or Chief Analyst. It is also ideal for consultants, project managers, and individuals engaged in business processes or strategy. The CBAP certification holds significant value in data-centric industries.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4959, '16', 'What are the prerequisites for the CBAP course?', '<p>The requirements for the CBAP® certification include:</p><ul><li>7,500 hours of experience in business analysis</li><li>A minimum of 900 hours completed in four of the six BABOK® knowledge areas</li><li>35 hours of professional development in business analysis<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4960, '16', 'Is the CBAP course recognized internationally?', '<p>Indeed, the CBAP certification is recognized globally across various industries. It enhances your professional credibility and affirms your leadership and analytical capabilities. Whether your goal is to advance locally or internationally, the certified business analysis professional certification paves the way for senior career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4961, '16', 'What is the duration of the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP course generally spans 3 to 6 months, depending on your availability and selected format. The online CBAP course provides flexibility for working professionals, including live sessions, practical case studies, and mock exams to help you prepare for the certification.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4962, '16', 'What career options can I pursue after finishing the CBAP course?', '<p>After completing the CBAP training, you may seek positions such as Business Analyst, Product Owner, Business Consultant, or Project Manager. The certified business analysis professional course is highly esteemed in the IT, banking, healthcare, and consulting industries.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4963, '16', 'How can I register for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The CBAP exam can be taken online from your home or at a Pearson VUE testing center. To begin, ensure you fulfill the eligibility criteria, create an IIBA account, submit your application, and pay the required fee. Once your application is approved, you can schedule your exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4964, '16', 'What study resources are necessary for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The primary study resource for the CBAP exam is the BABOK® Guide. Additionally, you may utilize CBAP preparation books and take practice exams. Centuera’s CBAP course offers structured lessons and practice tests, providing comprehensive preparation to help you grasp the concepts and be ready for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4965, '16', 'What is the passing rate for CBAP exams?', '<p>Although IIBA does not officially reveal the passing rate for the CBAP exam, it is estimated that the average passing score is around 70% or higher. Therefore, it is advisable to aim for a score between 80% and 90% to ensure a better chance of success. Practice tests will assist you in evaluating your knowledge and ensuring you are well-prepared for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4966, '16', 'What is the current demand for business analysts?', '<p>Today, organizations depend on data to make informed decisions. Consequently, there is a high demand for business analysts who can transform complex data into actionable business insights. On a global level, the big data analytics market is projected to expand from USD 348.21 billion in 2024 to USD 961.89 billion by 2032, with a CAGR of 13.5%. This underscores the growing demand for business analysts as well.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4967, '16', 'What is the typical salary for an individual holding a CBAP title?', '<p>The typical salary for a CBAP title holder can fluctuate depending on factors such as experience, geographical location, industry, and the size of the company. Below are the average yearly salaries for professionals at various experience levels:</p><ul><li>Entry-Level (0–2 years): ₹4L – ₹6L per annum</li><li>Mid-Level (3–6 years): ₹6L – ₹12L per annum</li><li>Senior-Level (7+ years): ₹12L – ₹20L+ per annum</li></ul><p>Possessing a CBAP certification can enable you to secure a higher salary in competitive job markets.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4968, '16', 'What responsibilities does a Certified Business Analysis Professional have?', '<p>Certified professionals engage in advanced analysis, pinpoint business requirements, and provide strategic solutions. Participating in a CBAP course prepares you to spearhead initiatives, enhance processes, and effectively convey business value.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4969, '16', 'Who are the trainers for the CBAP training, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are meticulously chosen and possess over 15 years of training and professional experience. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a training demonstration before being certified to conduct training for us. We also ensure that only those trainers with a high alumni rating continue to provide training for us.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4970, '16', 'Is it possible to receive a refund if I need to cancel my CBAP course enrollment?', '<p>Yes. You are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please consult our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4971, '16', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Discover how Centuera for Business can empower your teams with the latest AI and other digital skills, including industry certifications. Our customized training and learning paths are specifically designed for Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies, focusing on targeted skill development for their workforce. Delve into our extensive learning library, Centuera Learning Hub+, which offers unlimited live interactive solutions accessible organization-wide. Our committed curriculum consultants work closely with each client to pinpoint and implement the most suitable learning solutions for their teams\' requirements.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4972, '16', 'What does the 24/7 Support promise include?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to assist you through email, chat, calls, and community forums. We provide on-demand support to help you successfully complete the CBAP Certification Training. Once you finish the CBAP Certification Training course, you will enjoy lifetime access to the community forum.</p>', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-12 02:46:20', '2025-09-12 18:29:40'),
(4973, '16', 'What is a CBAP course?', '<p>The Certified Business Analysis Professional (CBAP®) course is a widely recognized certification in business analysis for seasoned professionals. This course encompasses essential concepts from the BABOK® Guide and improves your analytical, documentation, and solution development skills—equipping you for the CBAP certification exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4974, '16', 'Who should take the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP training is perfect for seasoned business analysts looking to advance into positions such as Senior Business Analyst, Business Analysis Manager, or Chief Analyst. It is also ideal for consultants, project managers, and individuals engaged in business processes or strategy. The CBAP certification holds significant value in data-centric industries.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4975, '16', 'What are the prerequisites for the CBAP course?', '<p>The requirements for the CBAP® certification include:</p><ul><li>7,500 hours of experience in business analysis</li><li>A minimum of 900 hours completed in four of the six BABOK® knowledge areas</li><li>35 hours of professional development in business analysis<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4976, '16', 'Is the CBAP course recognized internationally?', '<p>Indeed, the CBAP certification is recognized globally across various industries. It enhances your professional credibility and affirms your leadership and analytical capabilities. Whether your goal is to advance locally or internationally, the certified business analysis professional certification paves the way for senior career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4977, '16', 'What is the duration of the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP course generally spans 3 to 6 months, depending on your availability and selected format. The online CBAP course provides flexibility for working professionals, including live sessions, practical case studies, and mock exams to help you prepare for the certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4978, '16', 'What career options can I pursue after finishing the CBAP course?', '<p>After completing the CBAP training, you may seek positions such as Business Analyst, Product Owner, Business Consultant, or Project Manager. The certified business analysis professional course is highly esteemed in the IT, banking, healthcare, and consulting industries.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4979, '16', 'How can I register for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The CBAP exam can be taken online from your home or at a Pearson VUE testing center. To begin, ensure you fulfill the eligibility criteria, create an IIBA account, submit your application, and pay the required fee. Once your application is approved, you can schedule your exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4980, '16', 'What study resources are necessary for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The primary study resource for the CBAP exam is the BABOK® Guide. Additionally, you may utilize CBAP preparation books and take practice exams. Centuera’s CBAP course offers structured lessons and practice tests, providing comprehensive preparation to help you grasp the concepts and be ready for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4981, '16', 'What is the passing rate for CBAP exams?', '<p>Although IIBA does not officially reveal the passing rate for the CBAP exam, it is estimated that the average passing score is around 70% or higher. Therefore, it is advisable to aim for a score between 80% and 90% to ensure a better chance of success. Practice tests will assist you in evaluating your knowledge and ensuring you are well-prepared for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4982, '16', 'What is the current demand for business analysts?', '<p>Today, organizations depend on data to make informed decisions. Consequently, there is a high demand for business analysts who can transform complex data into actionable business insights. On a global level, the big data analytics market is projected to expand from USD 348.21 billion in 2024 to USD 961.89 billion by 2032, with a CAGR of 13.5%. This underscores the growing demand for business analysts as well.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4983, '16', 'What is the typical salary for an individual holding a CBAP title?', '<p>The typical salary for a CBAP title holder can fluctuate depending on factors such as experience, geographical location, industry, and the size of the company. Below are the average yearly salaries for professionals at various experience levels:</p><ul><li>Entry-Level (0–2 years): ₹4L – ₹6L per annum</li><li>Mid-Level (3–6 years): ₹6L – ₹12L per annum</li><li>Senior-Level (7+ years): ₹12L – ₹20L+ per annum</li></ul><p>Possessing a CBAP certification can enable you to secure a higher salary in competitive job markets.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4984, '16', 'What responsibilities does a Certified Business Analysis Professional have?', '<p>Certified professionals engage in advanced analysis, pinpoint business requirements, and provide strategic solutions. Participating in a CBAP course prepares you to spearhead initiatives, enhance processes, and effectively convey business value.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4985, '16', 'Who are the trainers for the CBAP training, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are meticulously chosen and possess over 15 years of training and professional experience. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a training demonstration before being certified to conduct training for us. We also ensure that only those trainers with a high alumni rating continue to provide training for us.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4986, '16', 'Is it possible to receive a refund if I need to cancel my CBAP course enrollment?', '<p>Yes. You are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please consult our refund policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4987, '16', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Discover how Centuera for Business can empower your teams with the latest AI and other digital skills, including industry certifications. Our customized training and learning paths are specifically designed for Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies, focusing on targeted skill development for their workforce. Delve into our extensive learning library, Centuera Learning Hub+, which offers unlimited live interactive solutions accessible organization-wide. Our committed curriculum consultants work closely with each client to pinpoint and implement the most suitable learning solutions for their teams\' requirements.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4988, '16', 'What does the 24/7 Support promise include?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to assist you through email, chat, calls, and community forums. We provide on-demand support to help you successfully complete the CBAP Certification Training. Once you finish the CBAP Certification Training course, you will enjoy lifetime access to the community forum.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:40:40', '2025-09-12 18:29:40', '2025-09-13 02:40:40'),
(4989, '9', 'Why should you choose Centuera’s ITIL certification course?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals looking to enhance their IT organization\'s services. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training course provides numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus includes key ITIL 4 concepts*, offering you a comprehensive understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be taught by seasoned instructors who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your knowledge.</li><li>You will have access to high-quality self-paced materials, enabling you to learn at your own pace and according to your preferred learning style.</li><li>The ITIL certification course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your chances of passing on your first try.</li><li>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4990, '9', 'What is the required passing score for the ITIL certification exam?', '<p>The required passing score for the ITIL certification exam is 65%.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4991, '9', 'How can I renew my ITIL certification?', '<p>As of January 1, 2023, an ITIL certification is valid for three years unless renewed. If you wish to renew your ITIL certification, you can choose from the following options:</p><ul><li>Retake the ITIL certification exam before the expiration date.</li><li>Obtain new certifications before the renewal date to automatically extend the renewal date for all ITIL certifications within the certification suite.</li><li>Accumulate and record professional development points through the MyAxelos membership platform. You can earn 20 CDP (continuous professional development) points each year across various CDP categories for three consecutive years.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4992, '9', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the ITIL certification training? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, we offer a 7-day cancellation period for this ITIL certification course. If you apply within that timeframe, we will refund the course fee after deducting an administrative charge. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4993, '9', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of ITIL professionals?', '<p>ITIL professionals are tasked with the following responsibilities in their roles:</p><ol><li>Oversee the complete IT lifecycle</li><li>Establish strategies, policies, and standards</li><li>Ensure the quality of services provided meets the highest possible standards</li><li>Track key performance indicators</li><li>Ensure ongoing improvement in services</li></ol>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4994, '9', 'Where can I get practice questions for ITIL certifications?', '<p>Centuera offers a complimentary ITIL 4 Foundation practice test that includes questions pertinent to the ITIL certification exam to assist you in your preparation.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4995, '9', 'What are the ITIL certification paths according to the ITIL framework?', '<p>The ITIL® 4 framework provides practitioners with three distinct paths for professional growth, which include Managing Professional (MP), Strategic Leader (SL), and Practice Manager (PM). The initial step is to obtain the ITIL 4 Foundation certification. Your objectives will guide your choice of career path, whether you pursue hands-on experience through Practice Manager or develop comprehensive service expertise via Managing Professional and strategic leadership as a Strategic Leader. Individuals aiming for the ITIL Master certification must complete both the MP and SL certifications and have a minimum of five years of experience in IT service management.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4996, '9', 'What are the ITIL 4 Foundation certification requirements?', '<p>Candidates are required to complete the ITIL 4 Foundation training prior to taking the certification exam. To obtain the certification, they must successfully pass the one-hour ITIL 4 Foundation Certification exam with a score of at least 65% of the total marks. Results are typically available within 15 days of completing the exam. If you are registering for training courses, ensure that they are provided by accredited training organizations.<br>Likewise, for additional ITIL certifications, it is necessary to hold the ITIL 4 Foundation certification and pass the corresponding certification exams after completing the training courses.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4997, '9', 'Who are the instructors for this ITIL foundation certification, and what criteria were used for their selection?', '<p>Our ITIL foundation certification course employs instructors who adhere to the highest standards of qualification. At Centuera, we exclusively engage trainers who have received outstanding evaluations from their previous students. The evaluation process for instructional partnerships includes profile screening, technical assessments, and demonstration sessions of training.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4998, '9', 'How can I enroll in the ITIL 4 Foundation certification?', '<p>The enrollment procedure for this ITIL certification course involves three straightforward steps:</p><ul><li>All prospective candidates must submit an application via the online application form.</li><li>An admission panel will review and shortlist candidates based on their applications.</li><li>Candidates who are selected will receive an admission offer, which they can accept by remitting the course fee.</li><li>Upon confirmation of payment, candidates will receive a payment receipt along with information regarding LMS access.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(4999, '9', 'You provide an exam pass guarantee for ITIL certification training. What is the process?', '<p>This exam pass guarantee is applicable solely to Centuera’s ITIL 4 Foundation instructor-led training and does not extend to self-paced learning formats. It is specifically designated for trainees who have completed their payments for the entire course.<br>The guarantee becomes void if:</p><ul><li>The exam is not attempted within 45 days following the completion of the course.</li><li>100% attendance is not maintained during the live online sessions.</li><li>The e-learning content is not entirely completed.</li><li>A minimum score of 80% is not attained in both online practice exams.</li><li>A request for a retake is not submitted within 15 days of receiving the ITIL certification results.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(5000, '9', 'Why should I choose Centuera ITIL certification?', '<p>ITIL certification is perfect for IT professionals aiming to enhance their IT organization\'s service quality. Enrolling in our ITIL® 4 Certification Training offers numerous benefits:</p><ul><li>The course syllabus encompasses vital ITIL 4 concepts*, providing you with a thorough understanding of IT service management practices.</li><li>You will be instructed by seasoned professionals who share real-world insights and experiences to deepen your comprehension.</li><li><p>The course will equip you for the ITIL 4 Foundation exam, boosting your likelihood of passing on your first try.</p><p>*Centuera is an accredited training partner, guaranteeing high-quality and current course content.<br>&nbsp;</p></li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(5001, '9', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Through Centuera for Business, we partner with Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies to offer digital skills training as part of their talent development initiatives. Our corporate training solutions feature short skill-based certification programs, role-specific learning paths, and Centuera Learning Hub+, a comprehensive learning library with unlimited live and interactive resources available organization-wide.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(5002, '9', 'Will my ability to complete this course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete this course will not be impacted by missing a live class. At Centuera, we provide a \'Flexi-Learn\' feature that enables you to view the recording of the missed session at your convenience. This feature is designed to assist working professionals like yourself in staying current with the course material and fulfilling the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply access the portal, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(5003, '9', 'What is the general perception of Centuera’s ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for delivering valuable education that enhances career prospects. The flexibility of our program allows professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities. The ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from learners and reviews from alumni commend the thorough course content, practical learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(5004, '9', 'What are the requirements for enrolling in the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the ITIL® 4 Foundation Certification Training course, you should possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. This course is accessible to both newcomers and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of ITIL is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for work experience.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:55:36', '2025-09-13 01:55:36'),
(5005, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the PMI-ACP exam fee is not part of the course fee. You are required to pay it directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI) for both the application and the examination.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(5006, '8', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment. We will issue a refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(5007, '8', 'What is the certification process?', '<p>Centuera has a clearly defined certification process designed to help you tackle the challenges of the IT industry.&nbsp;</p><p>To qualify for the certificate, you must meet the following criteria:<br>You need to complete at least 95% of the course or attend an entire batch.<br>You must finish your course with the minimum passing score if it includes simulation exams.<br>You are required to submit a project and obtain approval from our panel of subject matter experts.<br>If your project is not approved, our subject matter experts will provide the necessary assistance to help you succeed in your next attempt.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(5008, '8', 'What is PMI-ACP used for?', '<p>The PMI-ACP is a widely recognized certification that showcases your comprehension of agile principles and your knowledge of agile techniques for leading agile projects. It enables Agile professionals to enhance their adaptability by incorporating various agile methodologies, including Lean, Scrum, extreme programming, Kanban, and test-driven development. Our PMI-ACP course is designed to prepare you for obtaining this esteemed credential.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(5009, '8', 'Is the PMI-ACP certification worth it?', '<p>Hiring professionals with PMI-ACP certification can enhance performance and provide companies with a competitive advantage. This certification is particularly beneficial for Agile practitioners looking to progress in their project management careers. Additionally, the PMI-ACP training helps newcomers acquire knowledge of contemporary project management methodologies, team dynamics, leadership skills, and the ability to allocate tasks, roles, and responsibilities among team members.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(5010, '8', 'Which industries predominantly utilize agile project management?', '<p>Agile project management is prevalent in numerous sectors, such as healthcare, aviation, services, finance, engineering, construction, and supply chain management. Our PMI-ACP course can assist you in entering any of these domains.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(5011, '8', 'What literature would you suggest for studying the PMI-ACP?', '<p>In addition to our PMI-ACP course, the following books are highly recommended to enhance, develop, and refine your agile skills:</p><ul><li>Agile Estimating and Planning by Mike Cohn</li><li>Agile Practice Guide by Project Management Institute, Inc.</li><li>Agile Project Management: Creating Innovative Products by Jim Highsmith</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23'),
(5012, '8', 'What is the salary range for agile project managers globally?', '<p>Based on PayScale data, project managers holding a PMI-ACP certification earn an average annual salary across different countries of&nbsp;</p><ul><li>India - INR 15 lakhs</li><li>US - $93K</li><li>UK - £43K</li><li>Singapore - S$98K</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:23', '2025-09-13 01:56:23');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(5013, '6', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee?', '<p>Yes. We provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.<br>Refund Process: If you do not pass the exam on your first attempt, Centuera will refund the entire course fee to you. To obtain a refund, you need to request it via the Help and Support Online. You must include a copy of your scorecard along with the date you completed your online classroom training. Centuera will issue the refund within 30 days of receiving all necessary documentation. The refund will be processed using the same payment method you used for the course.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5014, '6', 'Do you offer Minitab training?', '<p>Yes. We provide Minitab online training as a separate package.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5015, '6', 'What tools do I need to attend the training sessions?', '<p>To participate in six sigma green belt training, you will require the following tools:</p><ul><li>Windows: Windows XP SP3 or a later version</li><li>Mac: OSX 10.6 or a later version</li><li>Internet speed: Ideally 512 Kbps or faster</li><li>Headset, speakers, and microphone: It is essential to have headphones or speakers for clear audio instructions, along with a microphone for communication. You may opt for a headset that includes a microphone or use separate speakers and a microphone.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5016, '6', 'If I cancel my enrollment, will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5017, '6', 'What is the recommended learning path after completing Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification?', '<p>To enhance your career prospects, you might want to pursue a Post Graduate Program in Lean Six Sigma, which will help you become an expert in this area.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5018, '6', 'What are the job roles available after getting a Six Sigma certification?', '<p>An increasing number of organizations, regardless of their size, are employing Six Sigma professionals as either full-time staff or consultants. Upon obtaining our Six Sigma Certification, there are numerous lucrative career paths to explore. The specific job titles associated with Six Sigma vary based on the needs of the organization. Some potential positions include:</p><ul><li>Six Sigma Analyst</li><li>Business Process Manager</li><li>Six Sigma Consultant</li><li>Lead Analyst/Project Manager</li><li>Director of Operational Excellence</li><li>Senior Project Manager</li><li>Functional Project Lead</li><li>Six Sigma Projects Manager</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5019, '6', 'Which companies hire Six Sigma Experts?', '<p>Centuera\'s Six Sigma certification offers candidates an enhanced professional perspective. It\'s important to be inquisitive about the types of companies seeking Six Sigma professionals. Below is a curated list of the leading recruiters for Six Sigma in India and internationally:</p><ul><li>TCS</li><li>Accenture</li><li>UnitedHealth Group</li><li>HCL</li><li>McKesson Corporation</li><li>Genpact</li><li>Honeywell</li><li>IBM</li><li>Volkswagen</li><li>EMC Corporation</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5020, '6', 'What is the pay scale of Six Sigma Professional across the world?', '<p>The significance of Six Sigma levels is increasing across various industries. Consequently, our Six Sigma certification provides you with a competitive advantage in the market. Salaries for Six Sigma professionals vary globally based on factors such as location, industry, experience, and certifications. The average earnings of Six Sigma specialists around the world are:</p><ul><li>US: $107,500 (according to Salary.com)</li><li>India: 949k (according to PayScale.com)</li><li>Canada: $126,055 (according to Glassdoor)</li><li>UK: £42k (according to PayScale.com)</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5021, '6', 'Can I use the PDUs (Professional Development Units) earned from this course for other certifications?', '<p>Indeed, the 35 PDUs obtained from this course can contribute to the maintenance of other professional certifications, including the PMP.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5022, '6', 'Does Centuera have corporate training solutions?', '<p>Indeed, Centuera for Business provides educational solutions focused on the latest AI technologies and other digital competencies, including industry-recognized certifications. For talent development strategies, we collaborate with Fortune 500 companies as well as mid-sized enterprises, offering concise skill-based certification training and tailored role-specific learning paths. Additionally, we present a comprehensive learning library featuring unlimited live and interactive resources—Centuera Learning Hub+, which is available to your entire workforce. Our team of curriculum consultants partners with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that most effectively address their teams\' needs.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5023, '6', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed whenever it suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5024, '6', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Green Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials from Centuera and reviews from alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:56:59', '2025-09-13 01:56:59'),
(5025, '7', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for the LSSBB program. Please refer to our Refund Policy to review the eligibility criteria and submit refund requests (if eligible) through our Help and Support portal.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5026, '7', 'Can I cancel my enrollment in the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt course? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. For further details, please consult our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5027, '7', 'How long will it take for me to finish the LSSBB course?', '<p>The five-day training module for LSSBB will cover the essential concepts. By the conclusion of the five days, you will be equipped to apply these concepts and tools in real-life situations. Six Sigma emphasizes continuous learning and practical application.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5028, '7', 'What are the prerequisites for enrolling in the LSSBB course?', '<p>There are no prerequisites to take the IASSC Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Exam. However, it is advisable, though not mandatory, to have completed Lean Six Sigma training from a recognized institution, trainer, or corporate program. Additionally, while not required, it is beneficial for candidates to possess some level of real-world Lean Six Sigma experience and project application knowledge.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5029, '7', 'Why should I select Centuera for LSSBB instead of other courses?', '<p>Centuera is a leader in online training and certification, providing a blended delivery model that merges live online classroom instruction with self-paced e-learning. We have successfully trained over 12,000 professionals in 115 countries and offer a wide range of professional courses tailored to meet diverse needs. Our instructors are certified green belts and black belts with extensive knowledge of the Lean Six Sigma Methodology.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5030, '7', 'What is the purpose of the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt?', '<p>The Lean Six Sigma certification is beneficial for team leaders to assess, analyze, enhance, and manage critical processes that influence customer satisfaction and productivity improvement by adhering to the six sigma principles.</p><p>Individuals with Six Sigma training can also serve as internal consultants, working with various teams at the same time. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt training equips individuals with the essential skills and certification, which signifies their ability to apply these skills in a business setting for comprehensive process excellence responsibilities.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5031, '7', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification?', '<p>After successfully achieving the Lean Six Sigma Black Belt certification, you can explore various job roles such as Operations Manager, Senior IT Project Manager, IT Project Lead, Business Process Analyst, Performance Excellence Analyst, Quality Analyst, Operations Head, Service &amp; Manufacturing Operations Head, Lean Six Sigma Consultant, Quality Auditor, Lead Manufacturing Engineer, Process Development Specialist, Compliance Structure Expert, and Quality Engineer.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5032, '7', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, your ability to complete the course will not be impacted by missing a live class. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your own convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5033, '7', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is well-respected for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Lean Six Sigma Black Belt Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni speak highly of the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The flexibility of the programs enables professionals to enhance their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 01:57:44', '2025-09-13 01:57:44'),
(5034, '14', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-13 02:25:39'),
(5035, '14', 'Will missing a live class impact my ability to finish the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to complete the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-13 02:25:39'),
(5036, '14', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM)?', '<p>Centuera consistently garners positive feedback from its graduates regarding its Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM). Participants commend its practical, hands-on methodology, industry-relevant curriculum, and knowledgeable instructors. Numerous users emphasize the worth of the globally acknowledged certificates and the adaptable learning options that cater to working professionals. You can visit the Centuera alumni review page to gain a clearer insight into Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM).</p>', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-13 02:25:39'),
(5037, '14', 'What are the eligibility requirements to register for the Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) program?', '<p>Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) is ideal for both beginners and seasoned professionals. To qualify for this course, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. While a fundamental understanding of Scrum is advantageous, it is not a strict requirement. Previous work experience is not necessary.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-13 02:25:39'),
(5038, '14', 'Does Centuera provide any additional online courses related to Agile and Scrum?', '<p>Yes, Centuera offers a variety of other online courses in the Agile and Scrum domains. These encompass specialized certifications, master\'s programs, and post-graduate courses designed for various skill levels. Centuera places a strong emphasis on upskilling and enhancing career prospects across different industry sectors, with each course crafted to assist learners in advancing their knowledge in Agile and Scrum.<br>Similar programs that we provide in the Agile and Scrum categories include:</p><ul><li>Scrum Master Certification</li><li>CSPO Certification</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>SAFe POPM</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>Introduction to SAFe</li><li>Agile Scrum Master Basics</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 01:58:26', '2025-09-13 02:25:39'),
(5039, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5040, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5041, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5042, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5043, '15', 'Who is eligible for A-CSPO Certification Training?', '<p>This certification is well-suited for Product Owners, Business Analysts, Project Managers, Product Managers, and Team Members who already hold a CSPO certification and wish to enhance their knowledge and skills in advanced product ownership through this program.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5044, '15', 'What skills are included in the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO Certification training encompasses advanced skills such as techniques for managing backlogs, strategies for stakeholder collaboration, refining product vision, developing product roadmaps, applying Agile principles in complex settings, scaling Agile practices, facilitating team collaboration, and methods for maximizing product value and return on investment (ROI).</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5045, '15', 'Is there a test for the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>No, there is no test. However, participants are required to complete appropriate training from a recognized organization like Centuera and meet the Scrum Alliance’s experience criteria to obtain the certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5046, '15', 'How many PDUs and SEUs can I earn by participating in the A-CSPO training?', '<p>By attending the A-CSPO 16-hour training program, you can earn up to 16 PDUs and 16 SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5047, '15', 'What is the process for renewing the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>To renew the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification, you must submit 30 SEUs (Scrum Education Units) and pay a fee of $175 every two years.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5048, '15', 'What is the validity period of the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification remains valid for a duration of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5049, '15', 'Is there a specific currency preferred for payments, particularly for international students?', '<p>While we accept various currencies for payments, we suggest using the currency of the country where you intend to take the course.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5050, '15', 'Can I make payments online via your website, or is it necessary to go to a physical location?', '<p>Payments can be easily processed through our secure online payment portal on our website. There is no need to visit a physical location for making payments.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5051, '15', 'Are there any discounts or promotions available for early payments?', '<p>Yes, we provide discounts and promotions for early payments or specific corporate training. Please check our website or reach out to us for exciting offers.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5052, '15', 'Is it possible to pay for the course in installments, or is full payment required at the start?', '<p>You can choose to pay for the course either in full at the beginning or in installments, based on your preference. For more information, please contact us.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5053, '15', 'Will I receive a refund if I decide to cancel my enrollment?', '<p>No, refunds are not available. However, you can reschedule your course. For more details on refunds, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5054, '15', 'How will I receive my payment receipt?', '<p>After your payment is successfully processed, you will get a confirmation email along with your payment invoices.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5055, '15', 'Are there any transaction or processing fees?', '<p>No, there are no transaction processing fees.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5056, '15', 'Which cards do you accept?', '<p>We accept payments from VISA, MasterCard, Maestro, AMEX, and Discover.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5057, '15', 'What payment methods are available?', '<p>We offer a variety of payment options. You can pay online using Credit Cards, Debit Cards, and Net Banking, as well as through Direct Bank Transfer/Wire Transfer/Wallet to our account, among others. Additional payment options include Stripe, Splitit, and PayPal for US &amp; CA regions. PO Exam &amp; Certification</p>', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 01:58:58', '2025-09-13 02:21:53'),
(5058, '1', 'What is a Project Management Professional (PMP) certification?', '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) certification is a credential that is recognized worldwide and is provided by the Project Management Institute (PMI). It encompasses agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies, demonstrating your capabilities in project leadership and the management of intricate scenarios. Professionals who hold the PMP certification are regarded as proficient leaders who assist teams in enhancing their efficiency.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5059, '1', 'What is included in this PMP certification training course?', '<p>Centuera’s PMP certification course comprises:</p><ul><li>Instruction delivered by PMI-authorized trainers</li><li>A curriculum that is in alignment with PMBOK® 7th Edition</li><li>More than 12 simulation examinations</li><li>Study aids and planning resources</li><li>Access to official digital materials from PMI</li><li>Specialized support for exam applications</li></ul><p>Masterclasses concentrating on the utilization of GenAI in project management</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5060, '1', 'What career opportunities exist after earning a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can seek employment across various industries such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Common roles include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5061, '1', 'What are the key learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will develop the competencies to plan, execute, and complete projects efficiently using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course will enhance your skills in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, preparing you to lead projects confidently and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5062, '1', 'What is the average salary for a PMP-certified professional in India?', '<p>The salary of a PMP-certified professional in India is influenced by various factors including location, experience, company, and industry. Typically, PMP-certified professionals receive higher salaries than their non-certified peers. Below is the salary distribution based on experience level:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Experience Level</td><td>Average Salary (₹ per year)</td></tr><tr><td>Entry-Level (0–2 yrs)</td><td>6–8 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (3–6 yrs)</td><td>9–14 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Senior-Level (7–12 yrs)</td><td>15–22 LPA</td></tr><tr><td>Executive-Level (12+ yrs)</td><td>22–35+ LPA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5063, '1', 'What career opportunities are available after obtaining a PMP certificate in India?', '<p>With a PMP certificate in India, you can pursue employment in various sectors such as IT, construction, finance, healthcare, and consulting. Typical positions include:</p><ul><li>Project Manager</li><li>Program Manager</li><li>Project Analyst</li><li>Operations Manager</li><li>Product Manager</li><li>Business Analyst</li></ul>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5064, '1', 'What are the primary learning outcomes of this PMP course?', '<p>You will acquire the skills to plan, execute, and finalize projects effectively using agile, predictive, and hybrid methodologies. The course enhances your abilities in risk management, stakeholder communication, resource allocation, cost control, and leadership, equipping you to lead projects with confidence and successfully pass the PMP exam.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5065, '1', 'Can I retake the PMP exam if I fail on the first attempt?', '<p>Yes, you are permitted to retake the PMP exam if you do not succeed on your initial attempt. PMI allows a one-year eligibility window during which you can attempt the exam up to three times, with a fee applicable for each retake.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5066, '1', 'Is the PMP certification exam fee included in the course fee?', '<p>No, the fee for the PMP certification exam is not included in the course fee. You are required to pay it separately to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® when you apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5067, '1', 'Is this PMP course suitable for beginners or only for experienced professionals?', '<p>Yes, the Project Management Professional course is open to both beginners and seasoned professionals. However, it is essential to meet PMI’s experience and eligibility requirements to apply for the exam.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5068, '1', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training for PMP?', '<p>Yes, Centuera Learning Hub+ offers corporate training for PMP certification in India. Our programs are designed for teams or entire organizations, featuring flexible formats and customized content to assist professionals in enhancing their project management skills.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5069, '1', 'What is the validity and renewal process for the PMP certificate?', '<p>The PMP certificate remains valid for three years. To renew it, certified individuals must accumulate 60 Professional Development Units (PDUs) during this timeframe through activities such as training, webinars, and volunteering related to project management.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5070, '1', 'Can I pursue this PMP training without prior PM experience?', '<p>Yes, you are able to enroll in the PMP training without any prior project management experience. However, to be eligible for the PMP exam, you must fulfill PMI’s eligibility criteria.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5071, '1', 'How long will it take to finish this project management professional course?', '<p>The PMP course generally requires approximately 4 to 6 weeks for completion, contingent upon your learning speed and work commitments.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5072, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5073, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5074, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', '<p>The PMP certification delivers extensive knowledge of project management principles, empowering professionals with the insights, techniques, and tools needed to address real-world project challenges. Globally recognized, PMP is regarded as the gold standard for career advancement in project management. Earning a Project Management Professional certification unlocks new opportunities and career progression across various industries.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5075, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5076, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5077, '1', 'Is the PMP® exam fee included in the PMP certification fee?', '<p>No, the PMP certification exam fees are not encompassed within our PMP certification course. You are required to pay the exam fee directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® in order to take the exam. Should you require any assistance in completing the application form, please feel free to contact us via phone or chat.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5078, '1', 'How can I obtain the PMP certification?', '<p>Upon successfully passing the PMP certification exam, you will receive your certificate package within a timeframe of six to eight weeks. Additionally, you will be issued a digital badge through Credly, which you can share on social media to celebrate your accomplishment.</p>', '2025-09-14 14:09:56', '2025-09-13 01:59:49', '2025-09-14 14:09:56'),
(5079, '2', 'What is CAPM certification, and who should pursue?', '<p>The CAPM certification is a globally recognized credential offered by the Project Management Institute (PMI). In India, it is ideal for recent graduates, junior project managers, or professionals seeking structured CAPM training to advance in roles that require project coordination and planning.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5080, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for, and how is it relevant in project management?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. It is an entry-level credential offered by PMI that helps professionals gain foundational project management knowledge. It is ideal for those new to the field and looking to build a career in project-based roles.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5081, '2', 'What are the benefits of enrolling in a CAPM course professionals?', '<p>Enrolling in a CAPM course helps Indian professionals build a solid foundation in project management, improve job prospects, and earn global recognition from PMI. It also increases earning potential and prepares candidates for advanced certifications like PMP®.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5082, '2', 'How does the CAPM certification differ from the PMP in terms of scope and eligibility?', '<p>To understand which certification fits best, here’s a breakdown of CAPM and PMP in terms of scope and eligibility:<br><strong>CAPM</strong>:</p><ul><li>Scope: Basic project management knowledge for beginners.</li><li>Eligibility: Secondary degree and 23 hours of project management training.</li></ul><p><strong>PMP:</strong></p><ul><li>Scope: Advanced project management skills for experienced professionals.</li><li>Eligibility: Four-year degree with 3+ years of experience and 35 hours of training, or secondary degree with 5+ years of experience and 35 hours of training.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5083, '2', 'What is the average salary of a Certified Associate in Project Management?', '<p>Professionals who earn the Certified Associate in Project Management (CAPM) certification in India can expect competitive salaries based on their experience and role. Typical annual salary ranges include:</p><ul><li>Entry-level: $25,000 to $50,000</li><li>Mid-level (1–5 years): $35,000 to $80,000</li></ul><p>Senior roles: $10,00,000 or more<br>Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=Certified_Associate_in_Project_Management_(CAPM)/Salary\">Payscale</a></p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5084, '2', 'What job roles or designations are available after earning the CAPM certification?', '<p>After earning the CAPM certification in India, professionals can apply for roles such as:</p><ul><li>Project Coordinator</li><li>Project Associate</li><li>Junior Project Manager</li><li>PMO Analyst</li><li>Operations Associate</li><li>Business Analyst (Entry-level)</li><li>Project Scheduler</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5085, '2', 'Is the CAPM course suitable for freshers or only for professionals with experience?', '<p>The CAPM course is ideal for freshers and those new to project management. It does not require prior work experience and helps build foundational knowledge, making it a good starting point for:</p><ul><li>Recent graduates seeking a project management career</li><li>Entry-level professionals aiming to boost their qualifications</li><li>Individuals looking to transition into project-related roles</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5086, '2', 'Is the CAPM certification worth it for entry-level project management professionals?', '<p>Yes, completing the CAPM course and earning a certification is valuable for beginners. It enhances your resume, helps you qualify for entry-level project roles, and prepares you for advanced certifications, such as PMP.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5087, '2', 'What is the duration and question format of the CAPM certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM certification exam lasts three hours and includes 150 multiple-choice questions with no negative marking, designed to assess both theoretical knowledge and practical understanding.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5088, '2', 'Are there CAPM online courses available for working professionals?', '<p>Yes, many online CAPM courses are designed for working professionals. These courses offer flexible schedules, including self-paced learning and live weekend or evening sessions. They follow PMI guidelines and provide the required 23 hours of project management education, helping learners balance work and study.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5089, '2', 'What’s next after completing the CAPM certification course — should I go for PMP?', '<p>After completing the CAPM certification course, pursuing the PMP certification is recommended once you gain the required project management experience. PMP is suited for professionals managing more complex projects and offers advanced knowledge and better career prospects.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5090, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. In project management, CAPM validates foundational knowledge and skills in project management practices and methodologies.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5091, '2', 'What is the difference between CAPM® & PMP®?', '<p>The main difference between CAPM® (Certified Associate in Project Management) and PMP® (Project Management Professional) lies in their target audience and level of expertise. CAPM® is designed for entry-level project managers or those with limited experience, focusing on basic project management concepts. PMP®, offered by&nbsp;the Project Management Institute,&nbsp;on the other hand, is for experienced professionals, requiring a deeper understanding of advanced project management techniques and leadership skills. PMP® certification generally holds more value in the industry due to its higher level of difficulty and experience prerequisites.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5092, '2', 'How many questions are there in the CAPM® certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM® certification exam&nbsp;covers 150 questions, out of which 15 questions are considered as pre-test questions used for future tests and are not scored. You will not be communicated about these questions; they are randomly chosen. Therefore, you should answer all 150 questions with the same seriousness.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5093, '2', 'What\'s next after CAPM® Certification?', '<p>After completing the CAPM®&nbsp;certification&nbsp;training&nbsp;program, you can take the PMP® certification training, Digital Project Manager, or PMP® Plus program. At the next level, you have Prince2® certification training, MSP® Foundation and Practitioner, Prince2® Agile Foundation and Practitioner and best of all, you can get the Project Management Certification (PGP in Project Management) program.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5094, '2', 'Is the CAPM® course difficult to learn?', '<p>The CAPM® course can be challenging, especially if you\'re new to project management concepts, as it covers a broad range of topics like processes, terminology, and frameworks from the PMBOK® guide. Centuera has selected industry experts who have rich teaching experience as instructors for this CAPM® course. They have a background in project management and offer a structured learning approach. They are aware of the varying learning needs of students and explain the concepts in an easy-to-understand way. So, you will not find the course difficult to follow.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:11', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5095, '2', 'What is CAPM certification, and who should pursue?', '<p>The CAPM certification is a globally recognized credential offered by the Project Management Institute (PMI). In India, it is ideal for recent graduates, junior project managers, or professionals seeking structured CAPM training to advance in roles that require project coordination and planning.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5096, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for, and how is it relevant in project management?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. It is an entry-level credential offered by PMI that helps professionals gain foundational project management knowledge. It is ideal for those new to the field and looking to build a career in project-based roles.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5097, '2', 'What are the benefits of enrolling in a CAPM course professionals?', '<p>Enrolling in a CAPM course helps Indian professionals build a solid foundation in project management, improve job prospects, and earn global recognition from PMI. It also increases earning potential and prepares candidates for advanced certifications like PMP®.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5098, '2', 'How does the CAPM certification differ from the PMP in terms of scope and eligibility?', '<p>To understand which certification fits best, here’s a breakdown of CAPM and PMP in terms of scope and eligibility:<br><strong>CAPM</strong>:</p><ul><li>Scope: Basic project management knowledge for beginners.</li><li>Eligibility: Secondary degree and 23 hours of project management training.</li></ul><p><strong>PMP:</strong></p><ul><li>Scope: Advanced project management skills for experienced professionals.</li><li>Eligibility: Four-year degree with 3+ years of experience and 35 hours of training, or secondary degree with 5+ years of experience and 35 hours of training.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5099, '2', 'What is the average salary of a Certified Associate in Project Management?', '<p>Professionals who earn the Certified Associate in Project Management (CAPM) certification in India can expect competitive salaries based on their experience and role. Typical annual salary ranges include:</p><ul><li>Entry-level: $25,000 to $50,000</li><li>Mid-level (1–5 years): $35,000 to $80,000</li></ul><p>Senior roles: $10,00,000 or more<br>Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/IN/Certification=Certified_Associate_in_Project_Management_(CAPM)/Salary\">Payscale</a></p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5100, '2', 'What job roles or designations are available after earning the CAPM certification?', '<p>After earning the CAPM certification in India, professionals can apply for roles such as:</p><ul><li>Project Coordinator</li><li>Project Associate</li><li>Junior Project Manager</li><li>PMO Analyst</li><li>Operations Associate</li><li>Business Analyst (Entry-level)</li><li>Project Scheduler</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5101, '2', 'Is the CAPM course suitable for freshers or only for professionals with experience?', '<p>The CAPM course is ideal for freshers and those new to project management. It does not require prior work experience and helps build foundational knowledge, making it a good starting point for:</p><ul><li>Recent graduates seeking a project management career</li><li>Entry-level professionals aiming to boost their qualifications</li><li>Individuals looking to transition into project-related roles</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5102, '2', 'Is the CAPM certification worth it for entry-level project management professionals?', '<p>Yes, completing the CAPM course and earning a certification is valuable for beginners. It enhances your resume, helps you qualify for entry-level project roles, and prepares you for advanced certifications, such as PMP.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5103, '2', 'What is the duration and question format of the CAPM certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM certification exam lasts three hours and includes 150 multiple-choice questions with no negative marking, designed to assess both theoretical knowledge and practical understanding.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5104, '2', 'Are there CAPM online courses available for working professionals?', '<p>Yes, many online CAPM courses are designed for working professionals. These courses offer flexible schedules, including self-paced learning and live weekend or evening sessions. They follow PMI guidelines and provide the required 23 hours of project management education, helping learners balance work and study.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5105, '2', 'What’s next after completing the CAPM certification course — should I go for PMP?', '<p>After completing the CAPM certification course, pursuing the PMP certification is recommended once you gain the required project management experience. PMP is suited for professionals managing more complex projects and offers advanced knowledge and better career prospects.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5106, '2', 'What does CAPM stand for?', '<p>CAPM stands for Certified Associate in Project Management. In project management, CAPM validates foundational knowledge and skills in project management practices and methodologies.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5107, '2', 'What is the difference between CAPM® & PMP®?', '<p>The main difference between CAPM® (Certified Associate in Project Management) and PMP® (Project Management Professional) lies in their target audience and level of expertise. CAPM® is designed for entry-level project managers or those with limited experience, focusing on basic project management concepts. PMP®, offered by&nbsp;the Project Management Institute,&nbsp;on the other hand, is for experienced professionals, requiring a deeper understanding of advanced project management techniques and leadership skills. PMP® certification generally holds more value in the industry due to its higher level of difficulty and experience prerequisites.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5108, '2', 'How many questions are there in the CAPM® certification exam?', '<p>The CAPM® certification exam&nbsp;covers 150 questions, out of which 15 questions are considered as pre-test questions used for future tests and are not scored. You will not be communicated about these questions; they are randomly chosen. Therefore, you should answer all 150 questions with the same seriousness.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5109, '2', 'What\'s next after CAPM® Certification?', '<p>After completing the CAPM®&nbsp;certification&nbsp;training&nbsp;program, you can take the PMP® certification training, Digital Project Manager, or PMP® Plus program. At the next level, you have Prince2® certification training, MSP® Foundation and Practitioner, Prince2® Agile Foundation and Practitioner and best of all, you can get the Project Management Certification (PGP in Project Management) program.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5110, '2', 'Is the CAPM® course difficult to learn?', '<p>The CAPM® course can be challenging, especially if you\'re new to project management concepts, as it covers a broad range of topics like processes, terminology, and frameworks from the PMBOK® guide. Centuera has selected industry experts who have rich teaching experience as instructors for this CAPM® course. They have a background in project management and offer a structured learning approach. They are aware of the varying learning needs of students and explain the concepts in an easy-to-understand way. So, you will not find the course difficult to follow.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:01:56', '2025-09-13 02:01:56'),
(5111, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(5112, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5113, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5114, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5115, '15', 'Who is eligible for A-CSPO Certification Training?', '<p>This certification is well-suited for Product Owners, Business Analysts, Project Managers, Product Managers, and Team Members who already hold a CSPO certification and wish to enhance their knowledge and skills in advanced product ownership through this program.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5116, '15', 'What skills are included in the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO Certification training encompasses advanced skills such as techniques for managing backlogs, strategies for stakeholder collaboration, refining product vision, developing product roadmaps, applying Agile principles in complex settings, scaling Agile practices, facilitating team collaboration, and methods for maximizing product value and return on investment (ROI).</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5117, '15', 'Is there a test for the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>No, there is no test. However, participants are required to complete appropriate training from a recognized organization like Centuera and meet the Scrum Alliance’s experience criteria to obtain the certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5118, '15', 'How many PDUs and SEUs can I earn by participating in the A-CSPO training?', '<p>By attending the A-CSPO 16-hour training program, you can earn up to 16 PDUs and 16 SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5119, '15', 'What is the process for renewing the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>To renew the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification, you must submit 30 SEUs (Scrum Education Units) and pay a fee of $175 every two years.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5120, '15', 'What is the validity period of the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification remains valid for a duration of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5121, '15', 'Is there a specific currency preferred for payments, particularly for international students?', '<p>While we accept various currencies for payments, we suggest using the currency of the country where you intend to take the course.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5122, '15', 'Can I make payments online via your website, or is it necessary to go to a physical location?', '<p>Payments can be easily processed through our secure online payment portal on our website. There is no need to visit a physical location for making payments.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5123, '15', 'Are there any discounts or promotions available for early payments?', '<p>Yes, we provide discounts and promotions for early payments or specific corporate training. Please check our website or reach out to us for exciting offers.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5124, '15', 'Is it possible to pay for the course in installments, or is full payment required at the start?', '<p>You can choose to pay for the course either in full at the beginning or in installments, based on your preference. For more information, please contact us.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5125, '15', 'Will I receive a refund if I decide to cancel my enrollment?', '<p>No, refunds are not available. However, you can reschedule your course. For more details on refunds, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5126, '15', 'How will I receive my payment receipt?', '<p>After your payment is successfully processed, you will get a confirmation email along with your payment invoices.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5127, '15', 'Are there any transaction or processing fees?', '<p>No, there are no transaction processing fees.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5128, '15', 'Which cards do you accept?', '<p>We accept payments from VISA, MasterCard, Maestro, AMEX, and Discover.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5129, '15', 'What payment methods are available?', '<p>We offer a variety of payment options. You can pay online using Credit Cards, Debit Cards, and Net Banking, as well as through Direct Bank Transfer/Wire Transfer/Wallet to our account, among others. Additional payment options include Stripe, Splitit, and PayPal for US &amp; CA regions. PO Exam &amp; Certification</p>', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 02:21:53', '2025-09-13 02:23:22'),
(5130, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5131, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5132, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5133, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5134, '15', 'Who is eligible for A-CSPO Certification Training?', '<p>This certification is well-suited for Product Owners, Business Analysts, Project Managers, Product Managers, and Team Members who already hold a CSPO certification and wish to enhance their knowledge and skills in advanced product ownership through this program.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5135, '15', 'What skills are included in the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO Certification training encompasses advanced skills such as techniques for managing backlogs, strategies for stakeholder collaboration, refining product vision, developing product roadmaps, applying Agile principles in complex settings, scaling Agile practices, facilitating team collaboration, and methods for maximizing product value and return on investment (ROI).</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5136, '15', 'Is there a test for the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>No, there is no test. However, participants are required to complete appropriate training from a recognized organization like Centuera and meet the Scrum Alliance’s experience criteria to obtain the certification.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5137, '15', 'How many PDUs and SEUs can I earn by participating in the A-CSPO training?', '<p>By attending the A-CSPO 16-hour training program, you can earn up to 16 PDUs and 16 SEUs.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5138, '15', 'What is the process for renewing the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>To renew the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification, you must submit 30 SEUs (Scrum Education Units) and pay a fee of $175 every two years.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5139, '15', 'What is the validity period of the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification remains valid for a duration of 2 years.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5140, '15', 'Is there a specific currency preferred for payments, particularly for international students?', '<p>While we accept various currencies for payments, we suggest using the currency of the country where you intend to take the course.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5141, '15', 'Can I make payments online via your website, or is it necessary to go to a physical location?', '<p>Payments can be easily processed through our secure online payment portal on our website. There is no need to visit a physical location for making payments.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5142, '15', 'Are there any discounts or promotions available for early payments?', '<p>Yes, we provide discounts and promotions for early payments or specific corporate training. Please check our website or reach out to us for exciting offers.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5143, '15', 'Is it possible to pay for the course in installments, or is full payment required at the start?', '<p>You can choose to pay for the course either in full at the beginning or in installments, based on your preference. For more information, please contact us.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5144, '15', 'Will I receive a refund if I decide to cancel my enrollment?', '<p>No, refunds are not available. However, you can reschedule your course. For more details on refunds, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5145, '15', 'How will I receive my payment receipt?', '<p>After your payment is successfully processed, you will get a confirmation email along with your payment invoices.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5146, '15', 'Are there any transaction or processing fees?', '<p>No, there are no transaction processing fees.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5147, '15', 'Which cards do you accept?', '<p>We accept payments from VISA, MasterCard, Maestro, AMEX, and Discover.</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5148, '15', 'What payment methods are available?', '<p>We offer a variety of payment options. You can pay online using Credit Cards, Debit Cards, and Net Banking, as well as through Direct Bank Transfer/Wire Transfer/Wallet to our account, among others. Additional payment options include Stripe, Splitit, and PayPal for US &amp; CA regions. PO Exam &amp; Certification</p>', '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 02:23:22', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5149, '5', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will process a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5150, '5', 'What are the job opportunities/roles available after getting a CSPO certification?', '<p>Organizations are actively seeking skilled Agile professionals to manage their projects, indicating a strong demand for CSPO experts. Additionally, anyone can register for the CSPO certification program to become an agile professional. However, it is particularly beneficial for individuals in the following roles: Product Analyst, Release Engineer, Scrum or Agile Coach, Software Development Manager, Senior Software Project Manager, and Technical Program Manager. With adequate experience, one may also qualify for a C-level executive position.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5151, '5', 'Who are the instructors for this Certified Scrum Product Owner training course, and how were they selected?', '<p>The trainers for this CSPO course are certified Scrum trainers who possess extensive professional and teaching experience.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5152, '5', 'What is covered under the 24/7 support promise?', '<p>Our dedicated team is ready to support you via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums.<br>On-demand assistance is provided to help you navigate the CSPO certification course, ensuring an optimal experience during your educational journey.<br>After completing the CSPO certification training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5153, '5', 'Which companies hire CSPO professionals?', '<p>Organizations are always on the lookout for Certified Scrum Product Owners to manage their Scrum and Agile initiatives. Notable companies such as Google, Apple, Facebook, Yahoo, Spotify, Adobe, Amazon, HSBC, Salesforce, Netflix, Lego, IBM, Deloitte, and Siemens actively recruit CSPO experts.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5154, '5', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, not attending a live class will not hinder your progress in completing the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at a time that suits you. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the requirements needed to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5155, '5', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera is esteemed for providing valuable education that enhances careers. The Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training features a well-organized and industry-relevant curriculum. Testimonials and reviews from Centuera alumni praise the thorough course content, hands-on learning methods, and knowledgeable instructors. The programs\' flexibility enables professionals to improve their skills while managing work and personal responsibilities.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5156, '5', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training?', '<p>To qualify for the Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a related discipline. Centuera\'s Certified Scrum Product Owner (CSPO) Certification Training is available for both beginners and seasoned professionals. While having prior knowledge of scrum is advantageous, it is not mandatory. Furthermore, there is no prerequisite for prior work experience.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 02:24:26', '2025-09-13 02:24:26'),
(5157, '14', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:42:19', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 02:42:19'),
(5158, '14', 'Will missing a live class impact my ability to finish the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to complete the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:42:19', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 02:42:19'),
(5159, '14', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM)?', '<p>Centuera consistently garners positive feedback from its graduates regarding its Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM). Participants commend its practical, hands-on methodology, industry-relevant curriculum, and knowledgeable instructors. Numerous users emphasize the worth of the globally acknowledged certificates and the adaptable learning options that cater to working professionals. You can visit the Centuera alumni review page to gain a clearer insight into Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM).</p>', '2025-09-13 02:42:19', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 02:42:19'),
(5160, '14', 'What are the eligibility requirements to register for the Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) program?', '<p>Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) is ideal for both beginners and seasoned professionals. To qualify for this course, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. While a fundamental understanding of Scrum is advantageous, it is not a strict requirement. Previous work experience is not necessary.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:42:19', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 02:42:19'),
(5161, '14', 'Does Centuera provide any additional online courses related to Agile and Scrum?', '<p>Yes, Centuera offers a variety of other online courses in the Agile and Scrum domains. These encompass specialized certifications, master\'s programs, and post-graduate courses designed for various skill levels. Centuera places a strong emphasis on upskilling and enhancing career prospects across different industry sectors, with each course crafted to assist learners in advancing their knowledge in Agile and Scrum.<br>Similar programs that we provide in the Agile and Scrum categories include:</p><ul><li>Scrum Master Certification</li><li>CSPO Certification</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>SAFe POPM</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>Introduction to SAFe</li><li>Agile Scrum Master Basics</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:42:19', '2025-09-13 02:25:39', '2025-09-13 02:42:19'),
(5162, '4', 'How do I enroll for this CSM certification training?', '<p>You can enroll for this CSM certification training on our website and make an online payment using any of the following options:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>Diner’s Club</li><li>PayPal&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Once payment is received, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access information about the scrum master certification exam via email.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5163, '4', 'Is the CSM certification fee included in my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The scrum master certification and evaluation fees are included in the cost of this course, along with the costs of course materials and learning aids.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5164, '4', 'Do you provide a CSM course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we offer a CSM course completion certificate after you successfully complete the training program to help you become a Scrum Alliance Certified CSM.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5165, '4', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment in our certified scrum master training course. We provide a complete refund after deducting an administration fee. To learn more,&nbsp;please review our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://demo.centuera.com/refund-policy\">Refund Policy.</a></p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5166, '4', 'What qualification does a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) hold?', '<p>A Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) is a senior scrum master within the Scrum Alliance community who has attained Certified Scrum Trainer status through the Scrum Alliance. Stringent certification requirements are imposed on a scrum master earning his or her CSTs; all must be active contributors in the Scrum alliance community, typically having co-trained with multiple other CSTs for knowledge transfer and demonstrating a keen understanding of Scrum through multiple years of successful application in professional environments. Centuera trainers go one step further; all of our Scrum Alliance Certified Scrum Masters have both technical and business backgrounds and derive successful training expertise from hundreds of client-site coaching engagements.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5167, '4', 'How do I complete the ScrumMaster evaluation and receive my certificate?', '<p>Applicants of the Scrum master certification will receive an email from the Scrum Alliance within five business days of the course. After logging in to the Scrum Alliance website:</p><p>A Professional Scrum Master aspirant will need to complete a free, non-graded, online evaluation based on scrum concepts and agile principles to become a certified scrum developer.</p><p>Once this has been submitted and the terms &amp; conditions have been agreed to, students may download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p><p>Product owner students will need to accept the terms &amp; conditions. Scrum master certification aspirants may then download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5168, '4', 'What are the objectives of this CSM Certification Training?', '<p>This CSM certification training is designed to help you get a clear understanding of the Scrum framework and manage agile teams. In this Scrum master course, you’ll learn about Scrum roles, artifacts, sprint planning, sprint backlog, burndown charts, product backlog, retrospectives, and more.</p><p>This CSM Scrum Master Certification Course covers what it takes to become a Certified ScrumMaster and how to apply the Scrum Framework to various project complexities and scales.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5169, '4', 'Who Should do this CSM certification training?', '<p>Professionals who wish to start their Agile career and aim to become a CSM and manage a scrum team can take up this Certified Scrum Master Certification training.<br>This scrum master course can also be taken up by professionals who wish to effect organizational changes using their scrum mastery and fulfill the business goals of managers, product owners, senior executives, and the like as certified scrum professionals.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5170, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5171, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5172, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5173, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5174, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5175, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5176, '4', 'What are the benefits of the \"2-year membership with Scrum Alliance\"?', '<p>Being a scrum master with a 2-year membership with Scrum Alliance means that you get access to local user groups, online social networks, and additional member-only resources.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5177, '4', 'What is the pay scale of CSM professionals across the world?', '<p>According to report, a scrum master with CSM certification earns an average salary of $92,842 in a year with an entry-level salary of $70,000.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5178, '4', 'What is Global Teaching Assistance?', '<p>Our teaching assistants are a dedicated team of subject matter experts here to help you get certified as a data analyst on your first attempt. They engage students proactively to ensure the course path is followed and help you enrich your learning experience, from class onboarding to project mentoring and job assistance. Teaching Assistance is available during business hours.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5179, '4', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not affect your ability to complete the course. With our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can watch the recorded session of any missed class at your convenience. This allows you to stay up-to-date with the course content and meet the necessary requirements to progress and earn your certificate. Simply visit the Centuera learning platform, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance marked.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5180, '4', 'What is the review of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera continually receives positive reviews from its alumni for its Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training. Learners praise its practical, hands-on approach, industry-aligned curriculum, and expert instructors. Many users highlight the value of the globally recognized certificates and the flexible learning options that suit working professionals. You can check out the Centuera alumni review page to get a better understanding of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5181, '4', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)?', '<p>To be eligible for this&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), applicants should have a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant field. Centuera’s&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)&nbsp;can be taken up by newcomers and experienced professionals. Though prior knowledge of&nbsp;ScrumMaster&nbsp;is helpful, it is not compulsory. Additionally, there is no requirement for previous work experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:26:33', '2025-09-13 02:29:34'),
(5182, '4', 'How do I enroll for this CSM certification training?', '<p>You can enroll for this CSM certification training on our website and make an online payment using any of the following options:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>Diner’s Club</li><li>PayPal&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Once payment is received, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access information about the scrum master certification exam via email.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5183, '4', 'Is the CSM certification fee included in my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The scrum master certification and evaluation fees are included in the cost of this course, along with the costs of course materials and learning aids.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5184, '4', 'Do you provide a CSM course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we offer a CSM course completion certificate after you successfully complete the training program to help you become a Scrum Alliance Certified CSM.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5185, '4', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment in our certified scrum master training course. We provide a complete refund after deducting an administration fee. To learn more,&nbsp;please review our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://demo.centuera.com/refund-policy\">Refund Policy.</a></p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5186, '4', 'What qualification does a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) hold?', '<p>A Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) is a senior scrum master within the Scrum Alliance community who has attained Certified Scrum Trainer status through the Scrum Alliance. Stringent certification requirements are imposed on a scrum master earning his or her CSTs; all must be active contributors in the Scrum alliance community, typically having co-trained with multiple other CSTs for knowledge transfer and demonstrating a keen understanding of Scrum through multiple years of successful application in professional environments. Centuera trainers go one step further; all of our Scrum Alliance Certified Scrum Masters have both technical and business backgrounds and derive successful training expertise from hundreds of client-site coaching engagements.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5187, '4', 'How do I complete the ScrumMaster evaluation and receive my certificate?', '<p>Applicants of the Scrum master certification will receive an email from the Scrum Alliance within five business days of the course. After logging in to the Scrum Alliance website:</p><p>A Professional Scrum Master aspirant will need to complete a free, non-graded, online evaluation based on scrum concepts and agile principles to become a certified scrum developer.</p><p>Once this has been submitted and the terms &amp; conditions have been agreed to, students may download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p><p>Product owner students will need to accept the terms &amp; conditions. Scrum master certification aspirants may then download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5188, '4', 'What are the objectives of this CSM Certification Training?', '<p>This CSM certification training is designed to help you get a clear understanding of the Scrum framework and manage agile teams. In this Scrum master course, you’ll learn about Scrum roles, artifacts, sprint planning, sprint backlog, burndown charts, product backlog, retrospectives, and more.</p><p>This CSM Scrum Master Certification Course covers what it takes to become a Certified ScrumMaster and how to apply the Scrum Framework to various project complexities and scales.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5189, '4', 'Who Should do this CSM certification training?', '<p>Professionals who wish to start their Agile career and aim to become a CSM and manage a scrum team can take up this Certified Scrum Master Certification training.<br>This scrum master course can also be taken up by professionals who wish to effect organizational changes using their scrum mastery and fulfill the business goals of managers, product owners, senior executives, and the like as certified scrum professionals.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5190, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5191, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5192, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5193, '4', 'What are the roles and responsibilities of a Certified ScrumMaster®?', '<p>Certified Scrum Masters are basically responsible for conducting the daily scrum meetings held to take updates regarding the work done and to provide resolutions if the team is facing issues.</p><ul><li>Professionals with certified Scrum Master certification work towards building a pleasant relationship between the Scrum team and the product owner to ensure smooth workflow.</li><li>A scrum master also assists the team members in understanding their assignments and guides them on how to execute each task.</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5194, '4', 'What are the most important skills that a Scrum Master should have?', '<ul><li>A Certified Scrum Professional must have an in-depth understanding of the terms, phrases, practices, and systems used to safely incorporate the agile methodologies.</li><li>Moreover, those who completed a scrum master course should have strong training skills so as to guide the team on their work and help them work on their strengths and weaknesses.</li><li>Knowledge of popular tools like Jira and Asana is also recommended by organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5195, '4', 'Does Scrum Alliance offer an online/virtual CSM course adhering to the Scrum framework?', '<p>Scrum Alliance offers both online virtual and in-person CSM or certified scrum master certification training across the world. You can enter the scrum master certification name and the location where you want to take the CSM certification training, and the website will show you the options available.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5196, '4', 'What are the benefits of the \"2-year membership with Scrum Alliance\"?', '<p>Being a scrum master with a 2-year membership with Scrum Alliance means that you get access to local user groups, online social networks, and additional member-only resources.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5197, '4', 'What is the pay scale of CSM professionals across the world?', '<p>According to report, a scrum master with CSM certification earns an average salary of $92,842 in a year with an entry-level salary of $70,000.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5198, '4', 'What is Global Teaching Assistance?', '<p>Our teaching assistants are a dedicated team of subject matter experts here to help you get certified as a data analyst on your first attempt. They engage students proactively to ensure the course path is followed and help you enrich your learning experience, from class onboarding to project mentoring and job assistance. Teaching Assistance is available during business hours.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5199, '4', 'Will missing a live class affect my ability to complete the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not affect your ability to complete the course. With our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can watch the recorded session of any missed class at your convenience. This allows you to stay up-to-date with the course content and meet the necessary requirements to progress and earn your certificate. Simply visit the Centuera learning platform, select the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance marked.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5200, '4', 'What is the review of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training?', '<p>Centuera continually receives positive reviews from its alumni for its Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training. Learners praise its practical, hands-on approach, industry-aligned curriculum, and expert instructors. Many users highlight the value of the globally recognized certificates and the flexible learning options that suit working professionals. You can check out the Centuera alumni review page to get a better understanding of Centuera’s Certified ScrumMaster (CSM) Certification Training.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5201, '4', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)?', '<p>To be eligible for this&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), applicants should have a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant field. Centuera’s&nbsp;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)&nbsp;can be taken up by newcomers and experienced professionals. Though prior knowledge of&nbsp;ScrumMaster&nbsp;is helpful, it is not compulsory. Additionally, there is no requirement for previous work experience.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:29:34', '2025-09-13 02:31:13'),
(5202, '4', 'How do I enroll for this CSM certification training?', '<p>You can enroll for this CSM certification training on our website and make an online payment using any of the following options:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>Diner’s Club</li><li>PayPal&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Once payment is received, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access information about the scrum master certification exam via email.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(5203, '4', 'Is the CSM certification fee included in my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The scrum master certification and evaluation fees are included in the cost of this course, along with the costs of course materials and learning aids.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(5204, '4', 'Do you provide a CSM course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we offer a CSM course completion certificate after you successfully complete the training program to help you become a Scrum Alliance Certified CSM.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(5205, '4', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Do I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment in our certified scrum master training course. We provide a complete refund after deducting an administration fee. To learn more,&nbsp;please review our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://demo.centuera.com/refund-policy\">Refund Policy.</a></p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(5206, '4', 'What qualification does a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) hold?', '<p>A Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) is a senior scrum master within the Scrum Alliance community who has attained Certified Scrum Trainer status through the Scrum Alliance. Stringent certification requirements are imposed on a scrum master earning his or her CSTs; all must be active contributors in the Scrum alliance community, typically having co-trained with multiple other CSTs for knowledge transfer and demonstrating a keen understanding of Scrum through multiple years of successful application in professional environments. Centuera trainers go one step further; all of our Scrum Alliance Certified Scrum Masters have both technical and business backgrounds and derive successful training expertise from hundreds of client-site coaching engagements.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
(5207, '4', 'How do I complete the ScrumMaster evaluation and receive my certificate?', '<p>Applicants of the Scrum master certification will receive an email from the Scrum Alliance within five business days of the course. After logging in to the Scrum Alliance website:</p><p>A Professional Scrum Master aspirant will need to complete a free, non-graded, online evaluation based on scrum concepts and agile principles to become a certified scrum developer.</p><p>Once this has been submitted and the terms &amp; conditions have been agreed to, students may download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p><p>Product owner students will need to accept the terms &amp; conditions. Scrum master certification aspirants may then download and print their certification directly from the Scrum Alliance website.</p>', '2025-09-13 02:32:40', '2025-09-13 02:31:13', '2025-09-13 02:32:40'),
