(5285, '16', 'What are the prerequisites for the CBAP course?', '<p>The requirements for the CBAP® certification include:</p><ul><li>7,500 hours of experience in business analysis</li><li>A minimum of 900 hours completed in four of the six BABOK® knowledge areas</li><li>35 hours of professional development in business analysis<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5286, '16', 'Is the CBAP course recognized internationally?', '<p>Indeed, the CBAP certification is recognized globally across various industries. It enhances your professional credibility and affirms your leadership and analytical capabilities. Whether your goal is to advance locally or internationally, the certified business analysis professional certification paves the way for senior career prospects.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5287, '16', 'What is the duration of the CBAP course?', '<p>The CBAP course generally spans 3 to 6 months, depending on your availability and selected format. The online CBAP course provides flexibility for working professionals, including live sessions, practical case studies, and mock exams to help you prepare for the certification.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5288, '16', 'What career options can I pursue after finishing the CBAP course?', '<p>After completing the CBAP training, you may seek positions such as Business Analyst, Product Owner, Business Consultant, or Project Manager. The certified business analysis professional course is highly esteemed in the IT, banking, healthcare, and consulting industries.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5289, '16', 'How can I register for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The CBAP exam can be taken online from your home or at a Pearson VUE testing center. To begin, ensure you fulfill the eligibility criteria, create an IIBA account, submit your application, and pay the required fee. Once your application is approved, you can schedule your exam.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5290, '16', 'What study resources are necessary for the CBAP exam?', '<p>The primary study resource for the CBAP exam is the BABOK® Guide. Additionally, you may utilize CBAP preparation books and take practice exams. Centuera’s CBAP course offers structured lessons and practice tests, providing comprehensive preparation to help you grasp the concepts and be ready for the exam.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5291, '16', 'What is the passing rate for CBAP exams?', '<p>Although IIBA does not officially reveal the passing rate for the CBAP exam, it is estimated that the average passing score is around 70% or higher. Therefore, it is advisable to aim for a score between 80% and 90% to ensure a better chance of success. Practice tests will assist you in evaluating your knowledge and ensuring you are well-prepared for the exam.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5292, '16', 'What is the current demand for business analysts?', '<p>Today, organizations depend on data to make informed decisions. Consequently, there is a high demand for business analysts who can transform complex data into actionable business insights. On a global level, the big data analytics market is projected to expand from USD 348.21 billion in 2024 to USD 961.89 billion by 2032, with a CAGR of 13.5%. This underscores the growing demand for business analysts as well.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5293, '16', 'What is the typical salary for an individual holding a CBAP title?', '<p>The typical salary for a CBAP title holder can fluctuate depending on factors such as experience, geographical location, industry, and the size of the company. Below are the average yearly salaries for professionals at various experience levels:</p><ul><li>Entry-Level (0–2 years): ₹4L – ₹6L per annum</li><li>Mid-Level (3–6 years): ₹6L – ₹12L per annum</li><li>Senior-Level (7+ years): ₹12L – ₹20L+ per annum</li></ul><p>Possessing a CBAP certification can enable you to secure a higher salary in competitive job markets.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5294, '16', 'What responsibilities does a Certified Business Analysis Professional have?', '<p>Certified professionals engage in advanced analysis, pinpoint business requirements, and provide strategic solutions. Participating in a CBAP course prepares you to spearhead initiatives, enhance processes, and effectively convey business value.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5295, '16', 'Who are the trainers for the CBAP training, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are meticulously chosen and possess over 15 years of training and professional experience. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a training demonstration before being certified to conduct training for us. We also ensure that only those trainers with a high alumni rating continue to provide training for us.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5296, '16', 'Is it possible to receive a refund if I need to cancel my CBAP course enrollment?', '<p>Yes. You are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For further details, please consult our refund policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5297, '16', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Discover how Centuera for Business can empower your teams with the latest AI and other digital skills, including industry certifications. Our customized training and learning paths are specifically designed for Fortune 500 and mid-sized companies, focusing on targeted skill development for their workforce. Delve into our extensive learning library, Centuera Learning Hub+, which offers unlimited live interactive solutions accessible organization-wide. Our committed curriculum consultants work closely with each client to pinpoint and implement the most suitable learning solutions for their teams\' requirements.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5298, '16', 'What does the 24/7 Support promise include?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to assist you through email, chat, calls, and community forums. We provide on-demand support to help you successfully complete the CBAP Certification Training. Once you finish the CBAP Certification Training course, you will enjoy lifetime access to the community forum.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 17:58:17', '2025-09-13 17:58:17'),
(5299, '11', 'How can I register for the SAFe Agilist classroom training?', '<p>You can register for this classroom training through our online platform. Payments can be made using any of the following methods, and a receipt will be automatically sent to the candidate via email.</p><ul><li>Visa Debit/Credit Card</li><li>American Express and Diners Club Card</li><li>Master Card</li><li>PayPal</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5300, '11', 'Is it possible to cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment. We offer a full refund after deducting the administration fee. For more details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5301, '11', 'Who is this SAFe Agile certification intended for?', '<p>The SAFe® Agilist certification is aimed at professionals who aspire to lead a Lean-Agile enterprise and acquire expertise in the framework at a strategic level. This certification is also appropriate for individuals working as project managers, team leads, portfolio managers, business analysts, change agents, and product managers.</p><p>Obtaining the SAFe Agilist certification enables IT professionals to lead agile teams and understand the continuous delivery pipeline to effectively manage and optimize Agile Release Trains.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5302, '11', 'What are the requirements for this SAFe Agile Certification course?', '<p>Candidates seeking to obtain the SAFe Agile certification should possess a minimum of five years of experience in software development, project management, testing, or business analysis. Some hands-on experience with Scrum is also beneficial.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5303, '11', 'What is the purpose of SAFe Agile?', '<p>SAFe Agile is utilized for scaling Agile by integrating iterative development processes with Lean manufacturing. Additionally, it facilitates quicker product delivery to the market, improves productivity and quality, and fosters customer engagement. This SAFe course will cover all aspects of SAFe Agile and provide a comprehensive understanding of the applications of Agile.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5304, '11', 'What skills should a SAFe Agilist possess?', '<p>A SAFe Agilist should have the following skills:</p><ul><li>Lean-Agile Leadership capabilities</li><li>Team and Technical Agility</li><li>Implementation of DevOps principles and practices to deliver products on schedule according to customer needs</li><li>Capability to solve business challenges using Lean principles</li><li>Lean Portfolio Management</li></ul><p>Through this SAFe agile certification, you will gain the skills listed above and more.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5305, '11', 'Which companies are seeking SAFe Agilists?', '<p>Some prominent companies that hire certified SAFe® professionals include Capgemini, Comcast Cable, Inc., Accenture, and Federal Express Corporation.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5306, '11', 'What is the salary range for SAFe Agile certification professionals globally?', '<p>SAFe certified professionals are essential in facilitating the effective adoption of lean enterprise practices within their organizations. The salary for SAFe® Agilist certified professionals can vary based on several factors such as location, company, experience, and industry. According to Glassdoor data, the average salary for a SAFe® Agilist in the United States is approximately $110,000 annually. However, this can range from $75,000 to over $150,000 based on the aforementioned factors.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5307, '11', 'Why select Centuera as your Leading SAFe® Certification provider?', '<p>Choosing Centuera as your Leading Scaled Agile Framework or SAFe® training provider offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>Accreditation</li><li>Skilled trainers</li><li>Flexible learning options</li><li>Exam preparation that includes practice tests</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5308, '11', 'What are the various SAFe Certifications offered by Scaled Agile?', '<p>Scaled Agile provides a variety of certifications designed to enhance professionals\' understanding and expertise in the SAFe framework. Below are the available SAFe certifications:</p><ul><li>SAFe Agilist (SA)</li><li>SAFe for Teams (SP)</li><li>SAFe Scrum Master (SSM)</li><li>SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager (POPM)</li><li>SAFe Release Train Engineer (RTE)</li><li>SAFe DevOps Practitioner (SDP)</li><li>SAFe Agile Software Engineer (ASE)</li><li>SAFe Government Practitioner (SGP)</li></ul><p>In summary, SAFe 6 builds on the foundations and methodologies of SAFe 5, with a greater emphasis on Business Agility, Agile Product Delivery, Continuous Learning Culture, and Lean Portfolio Management. Additionally, SAFe 6 introduces a new Core Value and modifies the metrics used to assess progress in Agile initiatives.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5309, '11', 'Does Centuera provide corporate training solutions?', '<p>Centuera for Business collaborates with Fortune 500 and mid-sized enterprises to equip their workforce with digital skills solutions aimed at talent development. We offer a wide range of corporate training options, from brief skill-based certification courses to comprehensive role-based learning paths. Furthermore, we provide Centuera Learning Hub+ - a resource library featuring unlimited live and interactive solutions for the entire organization. Our curriculum consultants partner with each client to identify and implement the learning solutions that best align with their teams\' needs and goals.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5310, '11', 'Will my ability to complete the course be impacted if I miss a live class?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to finish the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary requirements to advance and obtain your certificate. Simply log into the Centuera learning platform, choose the missed class, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5311, '11', 'What do people think about Centuera’s Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification?', '<p>Centuera is highly regarded for offering valuable, career-boosting education. The Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification&gt; offers a well-structured and industry-relevant curriculum. Centuera testimonials and alumni reviews talk highly about the comprehensive course content, practical learning approach, and experienced instructors. The flexibility of the programs allows professionals to upskill while balancing work and personal commitments.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5312, '11', 'What are the eligibility criteria to enroll in this Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification?', '<p>Centuera’s Leading SAFe® 6.0 Training with SAFe Agile Certification is best suited for newcomers and experienced professionals. To be eligible to enroll in this course, applicants must have a bachelor\'s degree in any relevant field. A basic understanding of Scrum is preferred but is not mandatory. Prior working experience is not compulsory.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:00:59', '2025-09-13 18:00:59'),
(5313, '15', 'What is an Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner (A-CSPO) certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO is a higher-level certification recognized by Scrum Alliance, designed for seasoned Product Owners. It expands on the Certified Scrum Product Owner certification training, emphasizing the enhancement of skills in backlog management, collaboration with stakeholders, and Agile methodologies. Participants engage in rigorous training led by a Certified Scrum Trainer (CST) and demonstrate their advanced knowledge through coursework and hands-on experience.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5314, '15', 'What are the prerequisites to attend the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner training?', '<p>There are no prerequisites for enrolling in the A-CSPO training. However, to obtain the A-CSPO certification, candidates must possess a current CSPO certification from Scrum Alliance and provide proof of at least one year of experience in the role and responsibilities of a Certified Scrum Product Owner.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27');
INSERT INTO `faqs` (`id`, `course_id`, `title`, `description`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(5315, '15', 'What are the benefits of Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO certification is highly esteemed and offers numerous advantages, including:</p><ul><li>It confirms your capabilities as a Scrum Product Owner, a crucial position in driving organizational success.</li><li>Achieving an A-CSPO certification can enhance your earning potential.</li><li>It contributes to successful project outcomes while increasing the business value within the organization by effectively leading Scrum teams.</li><li>The A-CSPO certification allows you to demonstrate your expertise in Agile and Scrum, making a significant impact within the global Scrum community.</li><li>It affirms your knowledge as a specialist in Scrum processes, values, and techniques.</li><li>Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner training cultivates skills for effective team collaboration and management.</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5316, '15', 'Does the Advanced Scrum product owner certification have an expiration date?', '<p>Yes, the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification does expire, requiring renewal every two years to accumulate Scrum Education Units® (SEUs). This process ensures that Scrum professionals stay informed about the latest practices and advancements in the industry.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5317, '15', 'Who is eligible for A-CSPO Certification Training?', '<p>This certification is well-suited for Product Owners, Business Analysts, Project Managers, Product Managers, and Team Members who already hold a CSPO certification and wish to enhance their knowledge and skills in advanced product ownership through this program.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5318, '15', 'What skills are included in the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>The A-CSPO Certification training encompasses advanced skills such as techniques for managing backlogs, strategies for stakeholder collaboration, refining product vision, developing product roadmaps, applying Agile principles in complex settings, scaling Agile practices, facilitating team collaboration, and methods for maximizing product value and return on investment (ROI).</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5319, '15', 'Is there a test for the A-CSPO Certification?', '<p>No, there is no test. However, participants are required to complete appropriate training from a recognized organization like Centuera and meet the Scrum Alliance’s experience criteria to obtain the certification.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5320, '15', 'How many PDUs and SEUs can I earn by participating in the A-CSPO training?', '<p>By attending the A-CSPO 16-hour training program, you can earn up to 16 PDUs and 16 SEUs.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5321, '15', 'What is the process for renewing the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>To renew the Advanced Certified Scrum Product Owner certification, you must submit 30 SEUs (Scrum Education Units) and pay a fee of $175 every two years.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5322, '15', 'What is the validity period of the Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification?', '<p>The Advanced Scrum Certified Product Owner certification remains valid for a duration of 2 years.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5323, '15', 'Is there a specific currency preferred for payments, particularly for international students?', '<p>While we accept various currencies for payments, we suggest using the currency of the country where you intend to take the course.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5324, '15', 'Can I make payments online via your website, or is it necessary to go to a physical location?', '<p>Payments can be easily processed through our secure online payment portal on our website. There is no need to visit a physical location for making payments.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5325, '15', 'Are there any discounts or promotions available for early payments?', '<p>Yes, we provide discounts and promotions for early payments or specific corporate training. Please check our website or reach out to us for exciting offers.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5326, '15', 'Is it possible to pay for the course in installments, or is full payment required at the start?', '<p>You can choose to pay for the course either in full at the beginning or in installments, based on your preference. For more information, please contact us.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5327, '15', 'Will I receive a refund if I decide to cancel my enrollment?', '<p>No, refunds are not available. However, you can reschedule your course. For more details on refunds, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5328, '15', 'How will I receive my payment receipt?', '<p>After your payment is successfully processed, you will get a confirmation email along with your payment invoices.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5329, '15', 'Are there any transaction or processing fees?', '<p>No, there are no transaction processing fees.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5330, '15', 'Which cards do you accept?', '<p>We accept payments from VISA, MasterCard, Maestro, AMEX, and Discover.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5331, '15', 'What payment methods are available?', '<p>We offer a variety of payment options. You can pay online using Credit Cards, Debit Cards, and Net Banking, as well as through Direct Bank Transfer/Wire Transfer/Wallet to our account, among others. Additional payment options include Stripe, Splitit, and PayPal for US &amp; CA regions. PO Exam &amp; Certification</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:02:27', '2025-09-13 18:02:27'),
(5332, '14', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I receive a refund?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after subtracting an administration charge. For further details, please refer to our Refund Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(5333, '14', 'Will missing a live class impact my ability to finish the course?', '<p>No, missing a live class will not hinder your ability to complete the course. Thanks to our \'flexi-learn\' feature, you can view the recorded session of any class you missed at your convenience. This ensures you remain current with the course material and fulfill the necessary criteria to advance and obtain your certificate. Just go to the Centuera learning platform, choose the class you missed, and watch the recording to have your attendance recorded.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(5334, '14', 'What are people\'s opinions on Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM)?', '<p>Centuera consistently garners positive feedback from its graduates regarding its Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM). Participants commend its practical, hands-on methodology, industry-relevant curriculum, and knowledgeable instructors. Numerous users emphasize the worth of the globally acknowledged certificates and the adaptable learning options that cater to working professionals. You can visit the Centuera alumni review page to gain a clearer insight into Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM).</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(5335, '14', 'What are the eligibility requirements to register for the Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) program?', '<p>Centuera’s Advanced Certified ScrumMaster® (A-CSM) is ideal for both beginners and seasoned professionals. To qualify for this course, candidates must possess a bachelor\'s degree in a relevant discipline. While a fundamental understanding of Scrum is advantageous, it is not a strict requirement. Previous work experience is not necessary.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(5336, '14', 'Does Centuera provide any additional online courses related to Agile and Scrum?', '<p>Yes, Centuera offers a variety of other online courses in the Agile and Scrum domains. These encompass specialized certifications, master\'s programs, and post-graduate courses designed for various skill levels. Centuera places a strong emphasis on upskilling and enhancing career prospects across different industry sectors, with each course crafted to assist learners in advancing their knowledge in Agile and Scrum.<br>Similar programs that we provide in the Agile and Scrum categories include:</p><ul><li>Scrum Master Certification</li><li>CSPO Certification</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>SAFe POPM</li><li>SAFe Certification</li><li>Introduction to SAFe</li><li>Agile Scrum Master Basics</li></ul>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:04:10', '2025-09-13 18:04:10'),
(5337, '13', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly qualified and certified instructors who have over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5338, '13', 'What is the duration of the course?', '<p>The SAFe Product Owner/Product Manager certification course consists of an interactive two-day classroom training.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5339, '13', 'Where will the training be held?', '<p>The venue will be confirmed a few weeks before the training, and you will be notified via email. If you have any inquiries, feel free to reach out to us 24/7 using the form on the right side of any page on the Centuera website, select the Live Chat link, or contact Help &amp; Support.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5340, '13', 'How do I enroll in this online training?', '<p>You can register for this training on our website and complete your payment online using any of the following methods:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>PayPal</li></ul><p>Once your payment is processed, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access details via email.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5341, '13', 'Do you provide transportation and refreshments with the training?', '<p>Transportation and refreshments are not included in the training package.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5342, '13', 'Can I change the city, place, and date after enrolling for the classroom training?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the city, place, and date for the classroom training, but a rescheduling fee will apply. For further details, please refer to our Rescheduling Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5343, '13', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you can cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course price after deducting an administration fee. To find out more, please review our refund policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5344, '13', 'Do you offer a money-back guarantee for the training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do provide a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5345, '13', 'Who issues the certification?', '<p>The certification is issued by the esteemed Scaled Agile.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5346, '13', 'Is the certification fee part of my course fee?', '<p>Yes, the fees for certification and evaluation are included in the total cost of this course, which also covers the expenses for course materials and learning aids.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:05:40', '2025-09-13 18:05:40'),
(5347, '12', 'Who is the instructor for the classroom training?', '<p>This course is led by highly skilled and certified instructors who possess over 20 years of experience in delivering classroom training.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5348, '12', 'What is the duration of the course?', '<p>The SAFe Scrum Master certification course consists of an engaging two-day classroom training.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5349, '12', 'Where will the training be held?', '<p>The location will be confirmed a few weeks before the training, and you will receive notification via email. If you have any inquiries, feel free to reach out to us 24/7 using the form located on the right side of any page on the Centuera website, select the Live Chat option, or contact Help &amp; Support.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5350, '12', 'How do I enroll in this online training?', '<p>You can register for this training on our website and complete your payment online using any of the following methods:</p><ul><li>Visa Credit or Debit Card</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>American Express</li><li>Diner’s Club</li><li>PayPal</li></ul><p>Upon receipt of your payment, you will automatically receive a payment receipt and access details via email.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5351, '12', 'Do you provide transportation and refreshments with the training?', '<p>Transportation and refreshments are not included in the training package.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5352, '12', 'Can I change the city, place, and date after enrolling for the classroom training?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the city, venue, and date for the classroom training, although a rescheduling fee will apply. For further details, please consult our Rescheduling Policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5353, '12', 'Can I cancel my enrollment? Will I get a refund?', '<p>Yes, you have the option to cancel your enrollment if needed. We will issue a refund for the course fee after deducting an administration charge. To find out more, please review our refund policy.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5354, '12', 'Do you provide a money back guarantee for the training programs?', '<p>Yes, we do offer a money-back guarantee for several of our training programs. Please refer to our Refund Policy and submit refund requests through our Help and Support portal.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5355, '12', 'Do you provide a course completion certificate?', '<p>Yes, we provide a course completion certificate once you successfully finish the training program.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5356, '12', 'Is the certification fee part of my course fee?', '<p>Yes. The costs for certification and evaluation are included in the total course fee, which also covers the expenses for course materials and learning resources.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-13 18:07:03', '2025-09-13 18:07:03'),
(5357, '17', 'What happens if I miss a class? Are there any refund options available?', '<p>No, refunds are not provided. However, we can reschedule your training at no additional cost for your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:04:27', '2025-09-14 01:03:29', '2025-09-14 01:04:27'),
(5358, '17', 'Who should I contact if I want more information about the Training?', NULL, '2025-09-14 01:04:27', '2025-09-14 01:03:29', '2025-09-14 01:04:27'),
(5359, '17', 'What happens if I miss a class? Are there any refund options available?', '<p>No, refunds are not provided. However, we can reschedule your training at no additional cost for your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:04:27', '2025-09-14 01:05:26'),
(5360, '17', 'Who should I contact if I want more information about the Training?', '<p>For further details about the course, you can reach out to us via email at support@Centuera.com or give us a call.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:04:27', '2025-09-14 01:05:26'),
(5361, '17', 'Is it possible to complete the Training in a participant\'s native language?', '<p>The training is primarily conducted in English. For corporate Training, if you require a language other than English, it must be requested as a custom service. This may incur extra charges and depends on the availability of a trainer fluent in the requested language. Please be aware that only official languages will be accepted for this request.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:04:27', '2025-09-14 01:05:26'),
(5362, '17', 'Can I get personalized Training at my preferred time?', '<p>Yes, we will be offering multiple schedules each week for all courses. You can choose a training schedule that fits your availability. Additionally, we provide E-Learning programs for popular courses, allowing you to enroll and access the training modules at your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:04:27', '2025-09-14 01:05:26'),
(5363, '17', 'What happens if I miss a class? Are there any refund options available?', '<p>No, refunds are not provided. However, we can reschedule your training at no additional cost for your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5364, '17', 'Who should I contact if I want more information about the Training?', '<p>For further details about the course, you can reach out to us via email at support@Centuera.com or give us a call.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5365, '17', 'Is it possible to complete the Training in a participant\'s native language?', '<p>The training is primarily conducted in English. For corporate Training, if you require a language other than English, it must be requested as a custom service. This may incur extra charges and depends on the availability of a trainer fluent in the requested language. Please be aware that only official languages will be accepted for this request.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5366, '17', 'Can I get personalized Training at my preferred time?', '<p>Yes, we will be offering multiple schedules each week for all courses. You can choose a training schedule that fits your availability. Additionally, we provide E-Learning programs for popular courses, allowing you to enroll and access the training modules at your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5367, '17', 'How can I find the upcoming schedules for my course?', '<p>Visit our website, select the course you are interested in, and view all the upcoming workshop schedules. You can choose your course from www.centuera.com.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5368, '17', 'After I enroll, can I change the date of my training class?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the date, but you must notify us 3-4 days prior to the scheduled date.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5369, '17', 'Will I receive a certificate after completing the course?', '<p>Yes, a certificate will be awarded upon successful completion of the training course.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5370, '17', 'What is the process to enroll in the training course?', NULL, '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:05:26', '2025-09-14 01:06:28'),
(5371, '17', 'What happens if I miss a class? Are there any refund options available?', '<p>No, refunds are not provided. However, we can reschedule your training at no additional cost for your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5372, '17', 'Who should I contact if I want more information about the Training?', '<p>For further details about the course, you can reach out to us via email at support@Centuera.com or give us a call.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5373, '17', 'Is it possible to complete the Training in a participant\'s native language?', '<p>The training is primarily conducted in English. For corporate Training, if you require a language other than English, it must be requested as a custom service. This may incur extra charges and depends on the availability of a trainer fluent in the requested language. Please be aware that only official languages will be accepted for this request.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5374, '17', 'Can I get personalized Training at my preferred time?', '<p>Yes, we will be offering multiple schedules each week for all courses. You can choose a training schedule that fits your availability. Additionally, we provide E-Learning programs for popular courses, allowing you to enroll and access the training modules at your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5375, '17', 'How can I find the upcoming schedules for my course?', '<p>Visit our website, select the course you are interested in, and view all the upcoming workshop schedules. You can choose your course from www.centuera.com.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5376, '17', 'After I enroll, can I change the date of my training class?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the date, but you must notify us 3-4 days prior to the scheduled date.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5377, '17', 'Will I receive a certificate after completing the course?', '<p>Yes, a certificate will be awarded upon successful completion of the training course.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5378, '17', 'What is the process to enroll in the training course?', '<p>Select the course you are interested in, choose a convenient schedule from our upcoming list, and register by submitting your details. After making the payment, you will receive a confirmation email regarding your course enrollment. Alternatively, you can consult with our career advisors to help you choose your course.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5379, '17', 'What courses does Centuera offer?', '<p>At Centuera, we offer training in a variety of in-demand technologies. You can select from courses in Project Management, Agile, IT, DevOps, Business, IT Service Management, Quality Management, and more, depending on your interests. For further details, please visit www.centuera.com</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5380, '17', 'What training modes are available for Centuera courses?', '<p>We offer various training modes: In-person Classro Training, virtual Online Training, Live Virtual Training, Corporate Training, and E-learning.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:06:28', '2025-09-14 01:07:27'),
(5381, '17', 'What happens if I miss a class? Are there any refund options available?', '<p>No, refunds are not provided. However, we can reschedule your training at no additional cost for your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:08:30', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:08:30'),
(5382, '17', 'Who should I contact if I want more information about the Training?', '<p>For further details about the course, you can reach out to us via email at support@Centuera.com or give us a call.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:08:30', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:08:30'),
(5383, '17', 'Is it possible to complete the Training in a participant\'s native language?', '<p>The training is primarily conducted in English. For corporate Training, if you require a language other than English, it must be requested as a custom service. This may incur extra charges and depends on the availability of a trainer fluent in the requested language. Please be aware that only official languages will be accepted for this request.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:08:30', '2025-09-14 01:07:27', '2025-09-14 01:08:30'),
