(5441, '17', 'What makes Centuera a good choice?', '<p>Centuera provides tailored corporate training programs aimed at enterprise teams looking to enhance their employees\' skills across different job functions or roles, whether through face-to-face sessions or live online instruction. Guided by our expert and certified trainers, these certification programs not only accelerate learning but also enable teams to effectively utilize their newly acquired skills to achieve industry standards. With more than 40 certification programs available, the results are significant, reflected in an impressive 45% increase in employee retention rates. On average, there has been a substantial 30% improvement in both job satisfaction and skills, highlighting the concrete advantages of our training programs.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:11:30', '2025-09-14 01:10:31', '2025-09-14 01:11:30'),
(5442, '17', 'What is Centuera\'s mission?', '<p>To deliver top-notch training and assist our professional participants and clients in developing a high-performing workforce.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:11:30', '2025-09-14 01:10:31', '2025-09-14 01:11:30'),
(5443, '17', 'What happens if I miss a class? Are there any refund options available?', '<p>No, refunds are not provided. However, we can reschedule your training at no additional cost for your convenience.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:12:27', '2025-09-14 01:11:30', '2025-09-14 01:12:27'),
