(5626, '17', 'Are your courses reasonably priced?', '<p>Yes, the fees for all technology courses are affordable, and we also provide discounts on various courses.</p>', '2025-09-14 01:20:30', '2025-09-14 01:19:29', '2025-09-14 01:20:30'),
