(5814, '1', 'What does the 24/7 support promise entail?', '<p>Our dedicated team is available to address your inquiries via email, chat, phone calls, and community forums. On-demand assistance is provided to support you throughout the PMP® Certification Training. Upon completing the PMP® Certification Training, you will receive lifelong access to our community forum.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(5815, '1', 'What career paths are available for professionals with PMP certification?', '<p>Upon achieving PMP certification, you may be eligible for a variety of positions, such as project manager, program manager, portfolio manager, PMO lead, and others. Centuera’s Project Management Professional certification training equips you with the skills and experience necessary to qualify for these positions.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(5816, '1', 'What advantages does obtaining a PMP certification offer?', '<p>The PMP certification delivers extensive knowledge of project management principles, empowering professionals with the insights, techniques, and tools needed to address real-world project challenges. Globally recognized, PMP is regarded as the gold standard for career advancement in project management. Earning a Project Management Professional certification unlocks new opportunities and career progression across various industries.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(5817, '1', 'Who are the trainers for the PMP Certification, and what is their selection process?', '<p>Our trainers are seasoned project management professionals and industry specialists with over a decade of pertinent experience in teaching the PMP certification course. Each trainer undergoes a stringent selection process that includes profile assessment, technical evaluation, and a PMP certification demonstration before being authorized to train for us. We also ensure that only trainers with high alumni ratings are permitted to continue training for us.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(5818, '1', 'If I do not succeed in the PMP® Exam after finishing the PMP Certification, how soon am I allowed to retake it?', '<p>After completing the PMP exam training, you are granted a one-year eligibility window to pass the examination. You are permitted to take the PMP certification exam up to three times during this eligibility period. Should you fail the examination three times within your eligibility timeframe, you will need to wait one year from the date of your last examination before you can reapply for the certification. Nevertheless, you are allowed to apply for any other PMI certifications after failing a certification examination three times. When seeking revaluation, you may submit a written request to the PMI® certification department for a review of their decision.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(5819, '1', 'Is the PMP® exam fee included in the PMP certification fee?', '<p>No, the PMP certification exam fees are not encompassed within our PMP certification course. You are required to pay the exam fee directly to the Project Management Institute (PMI)® in order to take the exam. Should you require any assistance in completing the application form, please feel free to contact us via phone or chat.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(5820, '1', 'How can I obtain the PMP certification?', '<p>Upon successfully passing the PMP certification exam, you will receive your certificate package within a timeframe of six to eight weeks. Additionally, you will be issued a digital badge through Credly, which you can share on social media to celebrate your accomplishment.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 12:54:17', '2025-09-18 12:54:17'),
(5821, '17', 'What happens if I miss a class? Are there any refund options available?', '<p>No, refunds are not provided. However, we can reschedule your training at no additional cost for your convenience.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5822, '17', 'Who should I contact if I want more information about the Training?', '<p>For further details about the course, you can reach out to us via email at support@Centuera.com or give us a call.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5823, '17', 'Is it possible to complete the Training in a participant\'s native language?', '<p>The training is primarily conducted in English. For corporate Training, if you require a language other than English, it must be requested as a custom service. This may incur extra charges and depends on the availability of a trainer fluent in the requested language. Please be aware that only official languages will be accepted for this request.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5824, '17', 'Can I get personalized Training at my preferred time?', '<p>Yes, we will be offering multiple schedules each week for all courses. You can choose a training schedule that fits your availability. Additionally, we provide E-Learning programs for popular courses, allowing you to enroll and access the training modules at your convenience.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5825, '17', 'How can I find the upcoming schedules for my course?', '<p>Visit our website, select the course you are interested in, and view all the upcoming workshop schedules. You can choose your course from www.centuera.com.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5826, '17', 'After I enroll, can I change the date of my training class?', '<p>Yes, you are allowed to change the date, but you must notify us 3-4 days prior to the scheduled date.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5827, '17', 'Will I receive a certificate after completing the course?', '<p>Yes, a certificate will be awarded upon successful completion of the training course.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5828, '17', 'What is the process to enroll in the training course?', '<p>Select the course you are interested in, choose a convenient schedule from our upcoming list, and register by submitting your details. After making the payment, you will receive a confirmation email regarding your course enrollment. Alternatively, you can consult with our career advisors to help you choose your course.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5829, '17', 'What courses does Centuera offer?', '<p>At Centuera, we offer training in a variety of in-demand technologies. You can select from courses in Project Management, Agile, IT, DevOps, Business, IT Service Management, Quality Management, and more, depending on your interests. For further details, please visit www.centuera.com</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5830, '17', 'What training modes are available for Centuera courses?', '<p>We offer various training modes: In-person Classroom Training, Online Live Virtual Training, Corporate Training, E-learning, On-site Training</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5831, '17', 'Is online training available?', '<p>Yes, online training is offered for every course.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5832, '17', 'Do you provide corporate training?', '<p>Yes, we offer corporate training tailored to meet our clients\' specific needs.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5833, '17', 'Who will be my course instructors?', '<p>All our trainers are highly qualified and certified, with extensive experience in the training industry. You have the option to select your instructors for your course.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5834, '17', 'Are there any discounts for Centuera courses?', '<p>Yes, we offer discounts on multiple courses. Please check the schedules page for available discounts.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5835, '17', 'Who should I contact for more questions about my course?', '<p>15. Who should I contact for more questions about my course?<br>You can contact our experienced career counselor, email us at support@centuera.com, reach out via any of our phone numbers, chat with us anytime, or visit our contact page at www.centuera.com</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5836, '17', 'Are your courses reasonably priced?', '<p>Yes, the fees for all technology courses are affordable, and we also provide discounts on various courses.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5837, '17', 'Who should I contact if I have additional questions about my course?', '<p>You can get in touch with our knowledgeable career counselor<br>or send us an email at support@centuera.com<br>or call any of our listed phone numbers<br>or you can chat with us at any time<br>or visit our contact us page at www.centuera.com</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5838, '17', 'Are your courses reasonably priced?', '<p>Yes, the fees for all courses are budget-friendly. Additionally, we offer discounts on a variety of courses.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5839, '17', 'What makes Centuera a good choice?', '<p>Centuera provides tailored corporate training programs aimed at enterprise teams looking to enhance their employees\' skills across different job functions or roles, whether through face-to-face sessions or live online instruction. Guided by our expert and certified trainers, these certification programs not only accelerate learning but also enable teams to effectively utilize their newly acquired skills to achieve industry standards. With more than 40 certification programs available, the results are significant, reflected in an impressive 45% increase in employee retention rates. On average, there has been a substantial 30% improvement in both job satisfaction and skills, highlighting the concrete advantages of our training programs.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5840, '17', 'What is Centuera\'s mission?', '<p>To deliver top-notch training and assist our professional participants and clients in developing a high-performing workforce.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52'),
(5841, '17', 'What discount can I expect if I sign up for the Training?', '<p>It entirely depends on the specific course. Please visit our website frequently for updates on new offers and discounts throughout the year. You can also chat with one of our career consultants to find out if any discounts are currently available.</p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 17:01:52', '2025-09-18 17:01:52');
