INSERT INTO `testimonials` (`id`, `title`, `description`, `rating`, `image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(6, 'Alona Thompson', '<p>My Centuera PMP certification was outstanding. The course was well-organized and addressed essential domains, thereby enhancing my project management abilities. I acquired proficiency in Agile, Waterfall, and Hybrid methodologies, which improved processes and stakeholder involvement. Although I am relatively new, this certification has garnered me recognition at PwC, thereby increasing efficiency and opportunities for career advancement.</p>', '5', '20250917_1711905090.jpg', '2025-09-18 01:28:23', '2025-09-18 01:28:23'),
(7, 'Avi Moscowitz', '<p>Engaging in the PMP certification course conducted by Mr. David proved to be extremely beneficial. His knowledge and perspectives on the topic were greatly appreciated. Furthermore, the incorporation of illustrations facilitated a clear and comprehensible understanding of the concepts. I am completely pleased with both Centuera\'s PMP course and the support provided by Mr. David. Thank you.</p>', '4', '20250917_152528677.jpg', '2025-09-18 01:31:13', '2025-09-18 01:31:13'),
(8, 'David Osadjan', '<p>Victor is an outstanding teacher for the PMP certification course.<br>He breaks down intricate subjects, making them accessible.<br>Additionally, he provides excellent assistance during the PMP course.</p>', '5', '20250917_436971015.jpg', '2025-09-18 01:32:59', '2025-09-18 01:32:59'),
(9, 'Elvin Hamzali', '<p>I sincerely thank Namita Chaudhuri, the instructor, for providing an exceptional PMP certification training session. I would also like to express my gratitude to the Centuera team for arranging this thorough PMP course.</p>', '5', '20250917_1660084999.jpg', '2025-09-18 01:35:11', '2025-09-18 01:35:11'),
(10, 'Madiha Mukhtar', '<p>I selected Centuera due to its extensive curriculum and blended learning approach. It provided an excellent learning experience, merging self-paced study with in-person training. The online resources were incredibly beneficial, and as a result, I advanced to the position of Senior Project Manager at Bosch Global Software Technologies, receiving a 30% increase in my salary.</p>', '5', '20250917_1079810446.jpg', '2025-09-18 01:37:15', '2025-09-18 01:37:15'),
(11, 'Nicole Dukes', '<p>My educational journey was outstanding. I successfully passed the exam on my initial try. Following the certification, I secured a position as an Assistant Manager in Quality Assurance at Solv, a branch of Standard Chartered, with a 35% increase in salary.</p>', '5', '20250917_1596849493.jpg', '2025-09-18 01:38:32', '2025-09-18 01:38:32');
